rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Other effects can prevent a permanent from untapping during an untap step. You do need to look carefully, however, as many effects say that the permanent does not untap during its controller\'s untap step, and this card\'s ability occurs during other players\' untap steps. If a card does say this, then Seedborn Muse can untap it. But some other abilities are not written this way and can still prevent a card from untapping."}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "All your permanents untap during each other player\'s untap step. You have no choice about what untaps."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "You can choose to put zero tokens or all the tokens onto the battlefield. You can\'t choose a number in between."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Three Visits allows you to search your library for any card with the land type Forest, not just a card with the name Forest.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional mana is not an ability of the land and is not something the land can produce.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The bringing of the creature onto the battlefield and then putting Necromancy on it is all done as part of the resolution.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'When putting a card onto the battlefield that requires a definition for its value or some other choice, you do what is needed to define the value or make the choice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2005-08-01\', \'text\': \'Necromancy enters the battlefield as an enchantment and then becomes an Enchant Creature Aura as a triggered ability upon entering the battlefield. It follows all the rules for Auras from then on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': "If the creature card put onto the battlefield has protection from black (or anything that prevents this from legally being attached), this won\'t be able to attach to it. Then this will go to the graveyard as a state-based action, causing the creature to be sacrificed."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The sacrifice occurs only if you cast it using its own ability. If you cast it using some other effect (for example, if another effect allowed you to cast it as though it had flash), then it won\'t be sacrificed."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The trigger occurs when you use the Morph ability to turn the card face up, or when an effect turns it face up. It will not trigger on being revealed or on leaving the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not have to find a Dragon card if you do not want to, even if you have one in your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The trigger occurs when you use the Morph ability to turn the card face up, or when an effect turns it face up. It will not trigger on being revealed or on leaving the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You only gain the life when the triggered ability resolves. If you are reduced to zero life before the ability resolves, you will lose before gaining the life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2005-08-01\', \'text\': \'A creature is "enchanted" if it has any Auras attached to it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': "If you give double strike to a creature after either first-strike or normal combat damage has been dealt, it won\'t help that creature deal any additional combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': \'If you give double strike to a creature with first strike after first-strike combat damage has been dealt, that creature will also deal damage during the normal combat damage step.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "As the ability resolves, you can\'t put the Ogre token onto the battlefield without explicitly giving the attacking player the option to pay {3}, even if the attacking player has forgotten about this ability."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'If an attacking creature has a "Whenever this creature attacks" ability, that ability is put on the stack first, then Kazuul\\\'s ability is put on the stack. Although Kazuul\\\'s ability will resolve first, and potentially create an Ogre token, any target of the other ability will already have been chosen at this point, and thus could not have been the new Ogre token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re the defending player, Kazuul\'s ability triggers once for each creature that attacks, not just once per combat. The attacking player chooses whether to pay {3} or let you have an Ogre token each time one of those abilities resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, the ability checks whether you\'re the defending player for each individual attacking creature. For example, if one creature attacks you and two creatures attack another player, Kazuul\'s ability triggers just once."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'The ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step. If you put an Ogre token onto the battlefield as a result, you may block with it during that combat phase.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "You\'re the defending player if a creature is attacking you, a planeswalker you control, or a battle you protect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Steel Hellkite\'s third ability is activated with X equal to 0, it will destroy each nonland permanent with mana value 0 the appropriate players control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a nonland permanent has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a token that\'s not copying of something else, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent is copying something else, its mana value is the mana value of whatever it\'s copying."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'In all cases, ignore any alternative costs or additional costs (such as kicker) paid when the permanent was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled those permanents at the time Steel Hellkite dealt combat damage, or if those permanents were even on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Steel Hellkite\'s last ability destroys only nonland permanents whose mana value is exactly equal to X, and only those controlled by players who have been dealt combat damage by Steel Hellkite this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The mana value of a permanent is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner, unless it\'s copying something else (see below). The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may activate the last ability even if Steel Hellkite hasn\'t dealt combat damage to any players that turn. If you do, the ability won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If this spell doesn\'t resolve, none of its effects occur. In particular, it will go to the graveyard rather than to its owner\'s library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'A card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its mana cost is each color that appears in that mana cost, regardless of how that cost may have been paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when Phyrexian Metamorph enters the battlefield. Any "as [this] enters the battlefield" or "[this] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'As you cast a spell or activate an activated ability with one or more Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, you choose how to pay for each Phyrexian mana symbol at the same time you would choose modes or choose a value for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Except for also being an artifact, Phyrexian Metamorph copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing more (unless that creature is itself copying something or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'If Phyrexian Metamorph copies a noncreature artifact, it is no longer a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If Phyrexian Metamorph somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another permanent (due to Mass Polymorph or Liliana Vess\'s third ability, for example), Phyrexian Metamorph can\'t become a copy of that permanent. You may choose only a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is a Clone), then your Phyrexian Metamorph enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied, except it\'s also an artifact."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'If the chosen permanent has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the chosen permanent is a token, Phyrexian Metamorph copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield, except it\'s also an artifact. Phyrexian Metamorph is not a token."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re at 1 life or less, you can\'t pay 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Phyrexian mana is not a new color. Players can\'t add Phyrexian mana to their mana pools."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'To calculate the mana value of a card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, count each Phyrexian mana symbol as 1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Phyrexian Metamorph simply enters the battlefield as a 0/0 artifact creature and is put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action (unless something else is raising its toughness)."}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes you to draw multiple cards, Psychosis Crawler will trigger that many times.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Except in some very rare cases, the card each player draws will be the card revealed from the top of their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If you activate Selvala\'s ability while casting a spell, and you discover you can\'t produce enough mana to pay that spell\'s costs, the spell is reversed. The spell returns to whatever zone you were casting it from. You may reverse other mana abilities you activated while casting the spell, but Selvala\'s ability can\'t be reversed. Whatever mana that ability produced will be in your mana pool and each player will have drawn a card."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Selvala\'s parley ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, dethrone will trigger if the creature attacks either player on the team with the most life or tied for the most life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Once dethrone triggers, it doesn\'t matter what happens to the players\' life totals before the ability resolves. You\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature even if the defending player doesn\'t have the most life as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Scourge of the Throne\\\'s ability has an intervening "if" clause. It must be attacking the player with the most life or tied with the most life both when it\\\'s declared as an attacker and as it starts to resolve for it to have any effect. If, at either time, the player isn\\\'t the one with the most life or tied for the most life, the ability will have no effect. Notably, this is different than how dethrone works. (Dethrone checks only once to see if the ability triggers.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Dethrone doesn\'t trigger if the creature attacks a planeswalker, even if its controller has the most life. The same is true if the creature attacks a battle, even if its protector has the most life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Hooded Hydra\'s last ability isn\'t a triggered ability. It\'s a replacement ability that modifies how Hooded Hydra is turned face up. Players can\'t respond to Hooded Hydra being turned face up and having five +1/+1 counters put on it."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "If Hooded Hydra is face down and it\'s turned face up some other way than by having its morph cost paid, the last ability will still apply."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Use the number of +1/+1 counters that were on Hooded Hydra the last time it was on the battlefield to determine how many Snake tokens to create.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "If Ashcloud Phoenix is face down, you can turn it face up for its morph cost, even if you didn\'t cast Ashcloud Phoenix face down using its morph ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If Ashcloud Phoenix leaves the graveyard before its "dies" ability resolves, it won\\\'t return to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Once Ashcloud Phoenix returns to the battlefield face down, each player will know which face-down creature it is. You can\'t mix up the positions of your face-down permanents to disguise this."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Deflecting Palm doesn\'t target any permanent or player. You choose a source of damage as Deflecting Palm resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If multiple prevention and/or replacement effects are trying to apply to the same damage, the player who would be dealt damage chooses the order in which to apply them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Comeuppance\'s effect is not a redirection effect. If it prevents damage, Comeuppance (not the original source) deals damage to the permanent or player as part of that prevention effect. Comeuppance is the source of the new damage, so the characteristics of the original source (such as its color, or whether it had lifelink or deathtouch) don\'t affect the new damage. The new damage is not combat damage, even if the prevented damage was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Fell the Mighty won\'t destroy the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Fell the Mighty tries to resolve, Fell the Mighty won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creatures will be destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Use the power of the target creature as Fell the Mighty resolves to determine which creatures are destroyed. Fell the Mighty doesn\'t target any of those creatures, so a creature with hexproof or protection from white will be destroyed if its power is high enough."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it\'s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down permanents you don\'t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because face-down creatures don\'t have names, they can\'t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can\'t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The last ability grants that ability to face-up nontoken creatures you control as that ability resolves. Creatures that come under your control later in the turn won\'t have that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it\'s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won\'t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn\'t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it\'s a creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it\'s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down permanents you don\'t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because face-down creatures don\'t have names, they can\'t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can\'t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it\'s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won\'t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn\'t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it\'s a creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Deathmist Raptor\'s second ability triggers only if Deathmist Raptor is in the graveyard when a permanent you control is turned face up."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If a face-down creature with megamorph is turned face up some other way (for example, if you manifest a card with megamorph and then pay its mana cost to turn it face up), you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Megamorph is a variant of the morph ability. You can find more information on morph on cards with morph from the Khans of Tarkir set.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Turning a face-down creature with megamorph face up and putting a +1/+1 counter on it is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'You choose whether Deathmist Raptor will enter the battlefield face up or face down as the ability resolves. You may also choose to leave it in the graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If a face-down creature with megamorph is turned face up some other way (for example, if you manifest a card with megamorph and then pay its mana cost to turn it face up), you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Megamorph is a variant of the morph ability. You can find more information on morph on cards with morph from the Khans of Tarkir set.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "The face-down permanent must be a creature both before it\'s turned face up and when the triggered ability resolves to have +1/+1 counters placed on it."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Turning a face-down creature with megamorph face up and putting a +1/+1 counter on it is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If a face-down creature with megamorph is turned face up some other way (for example, if you manifest a card with megamorph and then pay its mana cost to turn it face up), you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Megamorph is a variant of the morph ability. You can find more information on morph on cards with morph from the Khans of Tarkir set.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Turning a face-down creature with megamorph face up and putting a +1/+1 counter on it is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "You compare Den Protector\'s power to the power of any creature trying to block it only as blockers are assigned. Once Den Protector has been legally blocked by a creature, changing the power of either creature won\'t change or undo the block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If a face-down creature with megamorph is turned face up some other way (for example, if you manifest a card with megamorph and then pay its mana cost to turn it face up), you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Megamorph is a variant of the morph ability. You can find more information on morph on cards with morph from the Khans of Tarkir set.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Turning a face-down creature with megamorph face up and putting a +1/+1 counter on it is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Note that Obscuring Aether doesn\'t have a morph cost. Once it\'s turned face down, it doesn\'t have a way to turn itself face up."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Obscuring Aether has no effect on spells that instruct you to manifest cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Damage dealt to Anya is tracked even if Anya has indestructible. For example, if Anya is dealt what would be lethal damage and Anya loses indestructible (perhaps because each opponent\'s life total is too high), it will be destroyed the next time state-based actions are performed. However, the check for whether a creature dealt damage by a source with deathtouch is destroyed happens only the first time that state-based actions are performed after that damage-dealing event."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If a player\'s starting life total is odd (Commander Vanguard? Sweet.), half that player\'s life total will be a fraction, and that\'s okay. For example, if an opponent\'s starting life total is 41, half that number is 20 ½. If that player\'s life total is 20 or less, Anya will have indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If damage is dealt to Anya and to your opponents at the same time, Anya may gain indestructible and/or extra toughness before state-based actions are checked. Similarly, if damage is dealt to Anya by a source with lifelink controlled by an opponent, Anya may lose indestructible and/or toughness before state-based actions are checked.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If Rite of the Raging Storm leaves the battlefield before attackers are declared, creatures named Lightning Rager can attack you or planeswalkers you control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "The tokens aren\'t named Elemental. They are named only Lightning Rager. The rule that says a token\'s name is its creature types applies only if the tokens aren\'t given a name by the effect that creates them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'A land that becomes a creature may be affected by "summoning sickness." You can\\\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature nor when it entered the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of a spell with awaken), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Needle Spires has been made a 0/0 creature with three +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 5/4 creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'This land is colorless until the last ability gives it colors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a Clue for another card\'s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo\'s Journal, you can\'t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, if you control more than one creature that can attack, you may have them attack different opponents so that Ongoing Investigation\'s first ability triggers twice."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue Token and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a Clue for another card\'s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo\'s Journal, you can\'t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue Token and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast a spell without choosing legal targets. If all of those targets become illegal, the spell doesn\'t resolve and you won\'t investigate."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a Clue for another card\'s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo\'s Journal, you can\'t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue Token and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Forest or Plains is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Fortified Village, you may reveal the other land to have Fortified Village enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Fortified Village onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Fortified Village itself is neither a Forest nor a Plains, even though it produces green and white mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Fortified Village."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Mountain or Forest is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Game Trail, you may reveal the other land to have Game Trail enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Game Trail onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Game Trail itself is neither a Mountain nor a Forest, even though it produces red and green mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Canopy Vista from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Game Trail."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an Island or Swamp is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Choked Estuary, you may reveal the other land to have Choked Estuary enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Choked Estuary onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Choked Estuary itself is neither an Island nor a Swamp, even though it produces blue and black mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Choked Estuary."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Abilities such as shroud and protection function only on the battlefield unless otherwise specified. A creature card with shroud may be targeted by Animate Dead, and Animate Dead will become attached to the creature that enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Animate Dead is an Aura, albeit with an unusual enchant ability. You target a creature card in a graveyard when you cast it. It enters the battlefield attached to that card. Then it returns that card to the battlefield, and attaches itself to the card again (since the card is a new object on the battlefield). Animate Dead itself never moves into a graveyard during this process.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "If Animate Dead isn\'t on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, none of its effects happen. The creature card won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "If the creature put onto the battlefield has protection from black—or if the creature can\'t legally be enchanted by Animate Dead for another reason—Animate Dead won\'t be able to attach to it. It will be put into the graveyard as a state-based action, causing its delayed triggered ability to trigger. When the trigger resolves, if the creature\'s still on the battlefield, its controller will sacrifice it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Once the creature is returned to the battlefield, Animate Dead can\'t be attached to anything other than it (unless Animate Dead somehow manages to put a different creature onto the battlefield). Attempting to move Animate Dead to another creature won\'t work."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger whenever you "become the monarch" trigger only if you aren\\\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures destroyed this way count toward the life gained even if they\'re put into a zone other than a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures with indestructible aren\'t destroyed this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Selfless Squire\'s first triggered ability prevents all damage that would be dealt to you this turn after the triggered ability resolves, even if Selfless Squire leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'Selfless Squire\\\'s second triggered ability doesn\\\'t trigger only when damage is prevented by its first triggered ability\\\'s effect. Any effect that uses the word "prevent" will cause it to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "The ability of Duelist\'s Heritage triggers whenever any player attacks with one or more creatures, not just when you do. You know which players and planeswalkers the creatures are attacking before you choose the target creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "All eight of the permanents sharing a name must be artifacts. If you control only seven artifacts with the same name and a nonartifact permanent with that same name, you won\'t win the game."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Any abilities that trigger on the token being created won\'t resolve until after Mechanized Production\'s triggered ability has finished resolving entirely and performed its check for eight artifacts with the same name."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact trigger when the artifact token enters the battlefield. The artifact token also has any "this enters the battlefield with" or "as this enters the battlefield" abilities that the copied artifact has.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Mechanized Production and the enchanted artifact leave the battlefield simultaneously in response to the triggered ability, then the effect creates a token that\'s a copy of the artifact as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the copied artifact is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is copying something else (for example, if the copied artifact is a Sculpting Steel), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the enchanted artifact leaves the battlefield in response to Mechanized Production\'s triggered ability but Mechanized Production does not, Mechanized Production is put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action with no enchanted artifact. The triggered ability creates no token, but you can still win the game if you control enough artifacts with the same name."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you control eight or more artifacts that share a name while you control Mechanized Production, you won\'t win the game yet. You\'ll win the game while resolving its triggered ability during your upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The eight artifacts with the same name don\'t have to have the same name as the enchanted artifact. For example, you win the game if you control eight Thopter artifact creature tokens as Mechanized Production\'s ability resolves, even if Mechanized Production isn\'t attached to a Thopter."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that artifact is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, or so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Because improvise isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you cast a nonartifact spell that requires you to sacrifice a permanent as an additional cost, you may tap that permanent (if it\'s an artifact) for the spell\'s improvise ability before you sacrifice it to pay that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Improvise can\\\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\\\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of improvise are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Whir of Invention (a spell with improvise and mana cost {X}{U}{U}{U}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{U}{U}{U}. If you tap two artifacts, you\'ll have to pay {1}{U}{U}{U}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Lifecrafter\'s Bestiary\'s second triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The draw step is after the upkeep step, so you\'ll scry 1 before you draw for the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While resolving Lifecrafter\'s Bestiary\'s second triggered ability, you can\'t pay {G} multiple times to draw multiple cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Boros Reckoner\'s first ability will trigger even if it is dealt lethal damage. For example, if it blocks a 7/7 creature, its ability will trigger and Boros Reckoner will deal 7 damage to the target."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Damage dealt by Boros Reckoner due to its first ability isn\'t combat damage, even if it was combat damage that caused that ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'If Boros Reckoner is dealt damage by multiple sources at once, such as by two creatures blocking it, its ability triggers once and one target is dealt that much damage.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Hostile Desert becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or tap it for mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The sacrificed Desert will be in your graveyard to be exiled by the last ability of Scavenger Grounds.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Vizier of Many Faces enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If Vizier of Many Faces somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Vizier of Many Faces can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the card copied by the token had any "when [this permanent] enters the battlefield" abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it\\\'s created. Similarly, any "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield" or "[this permanent] enters the battlefield with" abilities that the token has copied will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If the chosen creature is a token, Vizier of Many Faces copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Vizier of Many Faces is not a token in this case unless it\'s embalmed."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Vizier of Many Faces), then Vizier of Many Faces enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The characteristics Vizier of Many Faces gains as part of its copy effect are copiable values that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Vizier of Many Faces copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you\'ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card\'s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it\'s not damage or combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won\'t deal combat damage in time to save that player."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Because it triggers at the beginning of a phase, Neheb\'s last ability isn\'t a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be countered by effects that interact with triggered abilities, such as that of Nimble Obstructionist."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life and subsequently loses the game before your postcombat main phase, Neheb\'s last ability counts that loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life but Neheb leaves the battlefield before your postcombat main phase begins, its last ability doesn\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow have more than two main phases in a turn, each main phase after your first one is a postcombat main phase, and Neheb\'s last ability triggers at the beginning of each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Neheb\'s ability checks only how much life opponents lost during the turn, not by how much their life total decreased compared to the start of the turn. For example, if an opponent lost 2 life and then gained 8 life before your postcombat main phase, you\'ll add {R}{R} to your mana pool."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "You get a postcombat main phase even if no creatures attacked during a turn. Neheb\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker\'s controller is the defending player. If a creature is attacking a battle, that battle\'s protector is the defending player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "A player is attacking another player if they control a creature that\'s attacking that player. If no creatures are attacking the enchanted player as a Curse\'s ability resolves (most likely because they\'ve left the battlefield), only the Curse\'s controller performs its actions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Curse of Opulence\'s triggered ability resolves after attackers have been declared. Any costs to attack must have already been paid before the attacking player creates the Gold."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Each Curse\'s ability triggers only once, no matter how many creatures are attacking the enchanted player."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you enchant yourself with one of these Curses, you\'ll get its effects whenever another player attacks you."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of these Curses won\'t trigger if only a planeswalker controlled by the enchanted player is attacked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Creatures that enter the battlefield after Disrupt Decorum resolves won\'t be goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If Stalking Leonin leaves the battlefield and returns, it\'s considered a new object. You may choose a new opponent and you may activate its last ability again."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If a creature is attacking a planeswalker you control, it\'s not attacking you. Stalking Leonin\'s last ability can\'t target it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you didn\'t choose an opponent when Stalking Leonin entered the battlefield, you can\'t pay the cost to activate its last ability. This will usually happen because you gained control of another player\'s Stalking Leonin or because a creature already on the battlefield became a copy of Stalking Leonin."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If you have multiple Stalking Leonins, you may choose a different opponent for each one. Be careful to keep track of which opponent is chosen for each Stalking Leonin.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "There are several ways to secretly choose an opponent, including writing that player\'s name on a piece of paper that\'s kept with Stalking Leonin."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "River of Tears produces {B} only after you\'ve played a land, not after you\'ve put a land onto the battlefield (such as with Evolving Wilds)."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'The turn you play River of Tears, it will produce {B} when tapped for mana.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "A permanent is any object on the battlefield, including tokens and lands. Spells and emblems aren\'t permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Ascend on a permanent isn\'t a triggered ability and doesn\'t use the stack. Players can respond to a spell that will give you your tenth permanent, but they can\'t respond to getting the city\'s blessing once you control that tenth permanent. This means that if your tenth permanent is a land you play, players can\'t respond before you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of the revealed card includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If the revealed card doesn\'t have a mana cost (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing until it resolves. Players may respond to that spell by trying to change whether you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you control ten permanents but don\'t control a permanent or resolving spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing. For example, if you control ten permanents, lose control of one, then cast Golden Demise, you won\'t have the city\'s blessing and the spell will affect creatures you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If your tenth permanent enters the battlefield and then a permanent leaves the battlefield immediately afterwards (most likely due to the "Legend Rule" or due to being a creature with 0 toughness), you get the city\\\'s blessing before it leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Twilight Prophet\'s last ability causes the opposing team to lose twice X life and you gain X life."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Once you have the city\'s blessing, you have it for the rest of the game, even if you lose control of some or all of your permanents. The city\'s blessing isn\'t a permanent itself and can\'t be removed by any effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'Some cards have triggered abilities with an intervening "if" clause that checks whether you have the city\\\'s blessing. These are worded "[Trigger condition], if you have the city\\\'s blessing, [effect]." You must already have the city\\\'s blessing in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there\\\'s no way to have the ability trigger if you don\\\'t have the city\\\'s blessing, even if you intend to get it in response to the triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card, such as cards with aftermath from the Amonkhet block, is based on the combined mana cost of its two halves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If Blood Moon is on the battlefield and a player controls a face-down Zoetic Cavern, it can\'t be turned face up since it won\'t have a morph cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "When Zoetic Cavern is turned face up, any Auras on it that can\'t legally enchant it will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on it will remain on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If you\'re dealt damage that causes your life total to become 0 or less, you lose the game before the tokens can be created."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'Gisela doubles damage dealt to opponents and permanents your opponents control from any source, including sources controlled by those opponents.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If damage dealt by a source you control is being divided or assigned among multiple permanents an opponent controls or among an opponent and one or more permanents they control simultaneously, divide the original amount and double the results. For example, if you attack with a 5/5 creature with trample and your opponent blocks with a 2/2 creature, you can assign 2 damage to the blocker and 3 damage to the defending player. These amounts are then doubled to 4 and 6 damage, respectively. You can\'t double the damage to 10 first and then assign 2 to the creature and 8 to the player."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If multiple replacement effects would modify how damage would be dealt, the player being dealt damage (or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage) chooses the order in which to apply those effects.\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'You draw three cards and put two cards back all while Brainstorm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Ancient Stone Idol\'s cost is reduced for each attacking creature, not just creatures attacking you. It even counts your attacking creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If there are enough attacking creatures, Ancient Stone Idol\'s cost can be reduced to {0}."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast a spell is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control five attacking creatures, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, Ancient Stone Idol costs {5} to cast. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost, and it still costs only {5} to cast.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Any effects that applied to Lazav before it becomes a copy of another card will continue to apply once it\'s become a copy. The same is true of any counters that are on Lazav."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'Because Lazav isn\\\'t entering the battlefield when it becomes a copy of a card, any "When this enters the battlefield" or "This enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied card won\\\'t apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If the copied card has an ability that can be activated only once each turn, copying that card a second time will allow you to activate the new instance of that ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lazav copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Disinformation Campaign\'s last ability triggers only if it\'s on the battlefield. It won\'t return from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you surveil" triggers after you\\\'re done surveilling, even if you have fewer cards in your library than the number of cards you\\\'re instructed to surveil. It even triggers if you have no cards in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Dream Eater\'s reflexive triggered ability triggers even if you have fewer than four cards in your library to surveil."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'Dream Eater\\\'s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, after you\\\'ve surveilled, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target nonland permanent to be returned to its owner\\\'s hand. This is different from effects that say "If you do . . ." in that you choose the target after having surveilled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Enhanced Surveillance\'s last ability can be activated only while it\'s on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If you control a second Enhanced Surveillance, their effects both apply and you may look at an additional four cards. If you control a third, may look at an additional six cards, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "The additional cards you look at due to Enhanced Surveillance\'s ability are part of what you surveil. You may put those cards into your graveyard or back on top in any order along with the others."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell this way and that card is exiled, it\'s considered a new object in the zone it\'s put into. It won\'t be exiled if it\'s put into your graveyard later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Mission Briefing doesn\'t change when you can cast the chosen card. For example, if you choose a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Mission Briefing is still on the stack while you choose an instant or sorcery card in your graveyard. Your Mission Briefing can\'t be to give yourself that same Mission Briefing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'The instant or sorcery card you choose may be one that you just surveilled into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If you surveil before Whispering Snitch enters the battlefield, surveilling again during that turn won\'t cause its ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Whispering Snitch\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you surveil" triggers after you\\\'re done surveilling, even if you have fewer cards in your library than the number of cards you\\\'re instructed to surveil. It even triggers if you have no cards in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Once Thoughtbound Phantasm has attacked, removing +1/+1 counters from it won\'t remove it from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'You put only one +1/+1 counter on Thoughtbound Phantasm each time you surveil, no matter how many cards you looked at when you surveilled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you surveil" triggers after you\\\'re done surveilling, even if you have fewer cards in your library than the number of cards you\\\'re instructed to surveil. It even triggers if you have no cards in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Price of Fame can target a creature that\'s indestructible. It won\'t be destroyed, but you\'ll surveil."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Price of Fame\'s mana value is 4, even if it costs {2} less to cast."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You\'ll surveil before resolving any abilities that trigger on the target creature dying."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Some spells that instruct you to surveil require targets. You can\'t cast a spell without choosing legal targets. If all of those targets become illegal, the spell doesn\'t resolve and you won\'t surveil."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'As Dispersal resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a nonland permanent they control with the highest mana cost among those permanents, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen permanents are returned at the same time. Next, each opponent in the same order chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If an opponent controls only lands as Dispersal resolves, that player won’t return any permanent to their hand. They’ll still discard a card.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you’ll surveil last. For others, you’ll surveil and then perform other actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Connive’s effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn’t expire if the creature’s power becomes greater after Connive has resolved.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'No player may take actions between the time you surveil and the time you return a creature card to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The creature card you return with Concoct may be one that you just surveilled into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you’ll surveil last. For others, you’ll surveil and then perform other actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'You put only one +1/+1 counter on Dimir Spybug each time you surveil, no matter how many cards you looked at when you surveilled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you surveil" triggers after you\\\'re done surveilling, even if you have fewer cards in your library than the number of cards you\\\'re instructed to surveil. It even triggers if you have no cards in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If any abilities trigger on the creature entering the battlefield, those abilities resolve after you lose life. If losing life results in you losing the game, those abilities won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the creature you control from Reanimate is exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the mana value of the card in your graveyard, not the creature once it\'s on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'You lose life after the creature is already on the battlefield. Any abilities it has that interact with loss of life, such as that of Platinum Emperion, apply to that loss of life.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Hydroid Krasis\'s first ability triggers as you cast it, and that ability resolves before the spell itself. It resolves even if Hydroid Krasis is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Gideon\'s Sacrifice doesn\'t change the source of the damage or whether the damage is combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Gideon\'s Sacrifice has no effect on damage already dealt earlier in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the chosen creature or planeswalker isn\'t on the battlefield or isn\'t a creature or planeswalker at the time damage would be dealt, the damage won\'t be redirected."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you cast more than one Gideon\'s Sacrifice in one turn, all damage that would be dealt at once to you and/or permanents you control is dealt to one of the chosen permanents of your choice. It\'s not dealt to all of them, and you can\'t split the damage between them. The next time damage would be dealt to you, you may choose a different one of those permanents to be dealt that damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you control no creatures or planeswalkers as Gideon\'s Sacrifice resolves, nothing happens. The damage redirection effect won\'t be able to be applied to any damage events."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'More damage can be redirected to the chosen creature than it has toughness or to the chosen planeswalker than it has loyalty, as long as that damage is all dealt at once (like combat damage is) or is all dealt while a single spell or ability is resolving.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Bloodthirsty Blade has no equip ability. There\'s normally no way to have it attached to your own creature, although certain combinations of other cards make this possible."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You still control Bloodthirsty Blade while it\'s equipped to an opponent\'s creature. You can move it any time you could cast a sorcery; the equipped creature\'s controller can\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Idol of Oblivion\'s first ability even if the token you\'ve created was created before Idol of Oblivion entered the battlefield or if the token has left the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target by the time Sevinne\'s Reclamation tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t copy it if you cast it from a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If you cast Sevinne\'s Reclamation from your graveyard, any abilities that trigger as the permanent card returns to the battlefield will resolve before the copy of Sevinne\'s Reclamation resolves but after new targets for the copy have been chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'The copy that Sevinne\\\'s Reclamation creates is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger. The copy wasn\\\'t cast from a graveyard, so it won\\\'t make another copy of itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'If one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to players at the same time that lethal damage is dealt to Ohran Frostfang, its ability triggers for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but other cards and abilities may refer to it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Although the common lands have basic land types, they aren\'t basic lands."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once the common lands (such as Mystic Sanctuary) enter the battlefield tapped, there\'s no way to untap them with a spell or ability to make their last ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As these lands are entering the battlefield, they check for lands that are already on the battlefield. They won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Scapeshift, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If another effect puts these lands onto the battlefield tapped, they enter tapped, even if you control enough lands with the appropriate basic land type.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Chulane\'s triggered ability doesn\'t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you\'ve already played your land for the turn, and even if it\'s not your turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Chulane\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you control another player\'s commander, you won\'t put a page counter on Tome of Legends when you attack with that creature. Similarly, if another player controls your commander, you\'ll still put a page counter on Tome of Legends if it attacks. (Perhaps the page is about your commander\'s shocking betrayal.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If one or more creatures die at the same time as Syr Konrad, its first ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Syr Konrad\'s first ability causes it to deal 1 damage twice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If Nadir Kraken leaves the battlefield after its ability has triggered, you can still pay {1} and get a Tentacle, even though you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on Nadir Kraken."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "While resolving Nadir Kraken\'s ability, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to create multiple Tentacles or to give it multiple +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You choose whether to pay {1} after drawing the card and seeing what it is. If you draw multiple cards, you see them all before deciding how many of the resulting triggers you\'ll pay {1} for."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A creature removed from combat by Labyrinth of Skophos remains tapped if it was tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a blocking creature is removed from combat, the creature it blocked remains blocked. Unless that creature has trample, it won\'t deal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Once creatures attack or block, they remain attacking or blocking creatures through the end of combat step unless removed from combat (by Labyrinth of Skophos or a similar effect).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "As Agitator Ant\'s ability resolves, first you choose which creature you control, if any, to put two +1/+1 counters on, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then each chosen creature receives its +1/+1 counters and becomes goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature can\'t have +1/+1 counters put on it, its controller can\'t choose it just to have it become goaded. If it can have counters put on it but replacement effects cause it not to receive +1/+1 counters, it doesn\'t become goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Creatures your opponents control attacking one of your opponents will cause Frontier Warmonger\'s ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Shiny Impetus causes you to create a Treasure token, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because Teferi\'s Ageless Insight is legendary, it\'s unlikely that one player will control two. However, if that happens, each card that player would draw after the first will result in four cards being drawn. If they control three, they draw eight cards, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," it\\\'s not a card drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If two or more replacement effects would apply to a card-drawing event, the player drawing the card chooses the order in which to apply them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature an opponent controls dies at the same time as Massacre Wurm, Massacre Wurm\'s last ability triggers for that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that a creature an opponent controls is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before Massacre Wurm\'s last ability goes on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s first ability affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s triggered ability triggers if a creature an opponent controls dies for any reason, including from its first ability reducing its toughness to 0, as long as Massacre Wurm remains on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'A creature can be dealt an amount of damage greater than its toughness. For example, if Brash Taunter is dealt 3 damage, its middle ability deals 3 damage, not 1, to the target opponent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Brash Taunter\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. If Brash Taunter is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won\'t deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Brash Taunter is dealt damage, you lose the game before its middle ability goes on the stack.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'All creatures on the battlefield when Toxic Deluge resolves are affected. Ones that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn are not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you cast Toxic Deluge without paying its mana cost, you\'ll still choose a value for X and pay X life. This is because it doesn\'t have {X} in its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a nontoken creature dies at the same time as Ulvenwald Mysteries, the first ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you sacrifice a Clue as part of casting a spell or activating an ability, the last ability will resolve before that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The last ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice a Clue whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing it, such as the activated ability that Clue tokens have."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Any of the exiled cards you don\'t play will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Even though the card is named after a specific character, controlling any commander will satisfy its condition.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Jeska\'s Will isn\'t a mana ability, even if you select the first mode (or both modes). It uses the stack and can be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve announced that you\'re casting a spell, players can\'t take any actions until you\'ve finished doing so. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove your commander to change how many modes you may choose."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve chosen both modes for the spell, it doesn\'t matter whether you continue to control a commander. This is true even if you somehow no longer control a commander as you finish casting the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The commander you control doesn\'t have to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "There\'s no extra bonus if you control more than one commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Use the number of cards in the target opponent\'s hand as Jeska\'s Will resolves to determine how much {R} to add."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled cards. You can\'t play lands this way unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Color identity is set before the game begins and doesn\'t change during the game, even if your commander is in a hidden zone (like the hand or library) or an effect changes your commander\'s color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, you can\'t activate War Room\'s last ability at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no colors in its color identity, you pay no life to activate War Room\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a player chooses to accept Orzhov Advokist\'s gift, that player can\'t attack you or a planeswalker you control with any creatures during their next turn, even creatures that weren\'t on the battlefield as Orzhov Advokist\'s ability resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Orzhov Advokist\'s ability doesn\'t target the creatures that receive +1/+1 counters. Their controllers choose them as the ability resolves. Players can\'t take actions between making their choices and the +1/+1 counters being placed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Orzhov Advokist\'s effect keeps creatures from attacking you even if Orzhov Advokist leaves the battlefield, if the creature that received counters is no longer on the battlefield, or if an effect has moved those counters off of the creature that received them and put them onto another creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "While resolving Orzhov Advokist\'s ability, you choose a creature you control or choose not to put any counters on a creature, then each other player in turn order does the same. Each player will know the choices made by players who chose before them. Then simultaneously each player who chose a creature puts two +1/+1 counters on the creature they chose."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'After the additional beginning phase, the game proceeds to the ending phase (unless something has added even more phases; see below.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Even if you don\'t attack with any creatures during combat, you\'ll still get a postcombat main phase and Sphinx of the Second Sun\'s ability will still trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If multiple phases are added to the same point in your turn, the most recently created phase happens first. For example, say you control Sphinx of the Second Sun and its ability triggers during your postcombat main phase. Later during that same main phase, another effect gives you an additional combat phase after this main phase. The additional combat will happen first, followed by the additional beginning phase.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you somehow have more than two main phases in a turn, each main phase other than the first one is a postcombat main phase, and Sphinx of the Second Sun\'s ability triggers at the beginning of each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The additional beginning phase all happens during the current turn. Any effects that last "until your next turn" or similar won\\\'t expire just because you\\\'ll go through an additional beginning phase.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The additional beginning phase will be a lot like your normal beginning phase. During the untap step, permanents will phase in or out as appropriate and you\\\'ll untap your tapped permanents. Anything that triggers "at the beginning of your upkeep" or similar will trigger during the upkeep step, and you\\\'ll eventually draw a card for your draw step.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an attacking creature has been blocked by a creature without flying or reach, reducing its power to 2 or less won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Sidar Kondo\'s blocking restriction applies to creatures your opponents control even when an opponent is being attacked by a player other than you."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both triggered abilities trigger at the same time. You may put them on the stack in either order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the opponent doesn\'t control more creatures than you as their end step begins, the first ability won\'t trigger. The same is true for lands and the second ability. Each of those abilities will check again when it tries to resolve. If the opponent no longer controls more creatures (or lands) than you, the ability won\'t resolve and will have no effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each of the chosen modes happens sequentially. If a permanent has an ability that triggers whenever it or another permanent is destroyed, it will see permanents destroyed at the same time as it or before it, but not permanents destroyed by later modes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a card is exiled "until" another permanent leaves the battlefield, the exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after that permanent leaves the battlefield during Austere Command\\\'s resolution, and it may be destroyed by a later mode.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the first and last modes are chosen, an artifact creature with mana value 4 or greater will have to be regenerated twice to survive. This is because the modes happen sequentially, and the regeneration "shield" is used up by the first one. The same is true with any other combination of modes that covers one permanent twice.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each token must attack the appropriate player if able.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Exiling the card with encore is a cost to activate the ability. Once you announce that you\'re activating it, no player may take actions until you\'ve finished. They can\'t try to remove the card from your graveyard to stop you from paying the cost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the tokens can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the tokens somehow is under another player\'s control as the delayed triggered ability resolves, you can\'t sacrifice that token. It remains on the battlefield indefinitely, even if you regain control of it later."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target non-Salamander creature is an illegal target by the time Amphin Mutineer\'s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. No player creates a Salamander Warrior token."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted when determining how many tokens to create."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The tokens copy only what\'s on the original card. Effects that modified that creature when it was previously on the battlefield won\'t be copied."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If an effect stops a token from attacking a specific player, that token can attack any player, planeswalker, or battle, or not attack at all. If the effect stops the token from attacking a specific player unless a cost is paid, you don\'t have to pay that cost unless you want to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Koma, Cosmos Serpent. When that spell or ability resolves, Koma won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon and appear in the form "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords such as equip are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts. Loyalty abilities of planeswalkers are also activated abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If you choose the first mode of Koma\'s activated ability, you can choose a permanent that\'s already tapped as the target. The effect stopping its activated abilities will still apply."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "The first mode of Koma\'s activated ability doesn\'t stop static abilities from affecting the game, and it doesn\'t stop triggered abilities from triggering. Unlike similar effects, it does stop mana abilities from being activated. Most activated abilities that produce mana as they resolve are mana abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice Koma itself to activate its last ability, but you can sacrifice any other Serpent you control, including Koma\'s Coil."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Toski. When that spell or ability resolves, Toski won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If Toski can\'t attack for some reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "The last activated ability doesn\'t target any creature cards in graveyards. You may return a creature card that was just milled or one that was already there."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Akroma. When that spell or ability resolves, Akroma won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If Akroma, Angel of Fury is cast face down, it can be countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'In a Commander game where Akroma is your commander, you may cast it face down from the command zone by paying {3} plus {2} for each time it has been cast from your command zone. The cost to turn it face up is unaffected. While face down, the combat damage it deals is still counted as damage dealt by your commander.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Any cards not cast, including land cards, remain in exile. They can\'t be cast on later turns, even if Etali attacks again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because all attacking creatures are chosen at once, a creature cast this way can\'t attack during the same combat as Etali, even if it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast any of the exiled cards, you do so as part of the resolution of the triggered ability. You can\'t wait to cast them later in the turn. Timing permissions based on a card\'s type are ignored, and the spells resolve before blockers are declared."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast more than one of the exiled cards, you choose the order in which to cast them. A spell you cast this way can be the target of a later spell you cast this way. However, permanent spells cast this way won\'t resolve until you\'re done casting spells, so the permanents they become can\'t be the target of spells cast this way. For example, if you exile Twincast and Lightning Strike, you can cast Lightning Strike and then cast Twincast targeting it; but if you exile a creature card and an Aura card, you can\'t cast that Aura targeting that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control from Etali\'s ability are exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Path to Exile tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. The creature\'s controller won\'t search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The controller of the exiled creature isn\'t required to search their library for a basic land. If that player doesn\'t, the player won\'t shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Mulldrifter\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Mulldrifter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Shriekmaw\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Shriekmaw."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can cast Everflowing Chalice without kicking it at all if you wish. However, if Everflowing Chalice has no charge counters on it, activating its last ability won\'t produce any mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Activating the ability with X = 0 will cause all creatures you control to become 0/0 and be put into the graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Changeling applies in all zones, not just the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Mirror Entity\'s ability overwrites any effects that previously set a creature\'s base power and/or toughness. Any existing effects or counters that raise or lower a creature\'s power and/or toughness continue to apply to the creature\'s newly-set power and toughness."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Saproling may become lethal if Thelonite Hermit leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Each player, including you, must put a vow counter on a creature they control if able. They can\'t choose to opt out and sacrifice all of their creatures. The creature you put a vow counter on will remember its promise if another player gains control of it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the vow counter is moved to another creature, it won\'t prevent the second creature from attacking normally."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the vow counter is removed from the creature, it can attack as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Everything that is specified by the effect creating the original token or tokens will also be true about the additional token or tokens created by Adrix and Nev\\\'s replacement effect. For example, if an effect tells you to create a token "tapped and attacking" the additional tokens will also be tapped and attacking. Similarly, if an effect creates a token and puts counters on it (such as a Fractal token) the additional token will also get those counters.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than 3 as Access Tunnel\'s second ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. However, if instead the creature\'s power is raised above 3 after the ability resolves, it still can\'t be blocked that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or less has been blocked, Access Tunnel\'s second ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you choose a legendary creature, the copies will also be legendary. If this results in you controlling more than one legendary permanent with the same name, you\'ll put all but one of them into their owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you choose not to apply the replacement effect, you will not get the choice to apply it again until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you create one or more tokens during your turn, and then Esix comes under your control, the replacement effect won\'t apply to any tokens you create the rest of the turn. You\'ll have to wait until your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'This effect applies before anything that modifies how those tokens enter the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'This effect can apply to any token, not just creature tokens. For example, you could replace creating a Treasure token with creating a copy of the chosen creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If one of these Forests is turned face up, the effect making it a Forest land will expire. The face-up permanent will again have its printed name, type line, mana cost, abilities, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the face-down card has morph, you can pay its morph cost to turn it face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The face-down card has no name or colors. Its only type is land, its only subtype is Forest, and its only ability is "{T}: Add {G}."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Creating a Clue token this way isn\'t the same thing as investigating. Notably, an ability that triggers whenever you investigate won\'t trigger because you created a Clue token due to this replacement effect. If the original token creation was because you investigated once, those abilities will still each trigger once, no matter how many Clue tokens you end up creating."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you control eighteen Academy Manufactors (I don\'t know, you figure it out) and would create some number of Clue, Food, or Treasure tokens, you will instead create 129,140,163 times that many Clue tokens, 129,140,163 times that many Food tokens, and 129,140,163 times that many Treasure tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you control one Academy Manufactor and would create some number of Clue, Food, or Treasure tokens, you will instead create that many Clue tokens, that many Food tokens, and that many Treasure tokens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you control two Academy Manufactors and would create some number of Clue, Food, or Treasure tokens, you will instead create three times that many Clue tokens, three times that many Food tokens, and three times that many Treasure tokens.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If Soul Snare\'s ability targets a creature that\'s attacking a planeswalker you control, but that planeswalker is no longer on the battlefield as the ability tries to resolve, the attacking creature will be an illegal target and Soul Snare\'s ability won\'t exile that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Sacrificing Soul Snare is part of the cost to activate the ability. Once you activate the ability, no player can do anything to Soul Snare to stop you from activating it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Sacrificing Seal of Cleansing is the cost to activate its ability. Once you activate the ability, no player can do anything to Seal of Cleansing to stop you from activating it. Notably, if you cast Seal of Cleansing during your turn, you\'ll have priority to activate its ability before anyone can respond to stop you."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue Token and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, one can be sacrificed to activate the ability of Breya\'s Apprentice and one can be the target of Break Ties."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Clue to activate its own ability and also to activate another ability that requires sacrificing a Clue (or any artifact) as a cost, such as that of Lonis, Cryptozoologist."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue Token and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, one can be sacrificed to activate the ability of Breya\'s Apprentice and one can be the target of Break Ties."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Clue to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Lonis, Cryptozoologist."}]', "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is both an artifact and an enchantment, count it only once when determining the bonus from an equipped Nettlecyst.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the Phyrexian Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the living weapon trigger causes two Phyrexian Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Phyrexian Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The Phyrexian Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The living weapon ability has been updated so that the triggered ability creates Phyrexian Germ tokens rather than Germ tokens. This update applies to all cards with living weapon.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Saryth\'s first ability doesn\'t care whether Saryth is tapped or untapped. The same is true for the second ability. Both abilities apply as long as Saryth is on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' "Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "If creatures enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters or a continuous effect such as that of Wedding Festivity will apply to the creatures on the battlefield, those effects apply when checking to see if Welcoming Vampire\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "Welcoming Vampire\'s ability checks the power of the other creatures only as they enter the battlefield. If one of those creatures has power 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature\'s power above 2 won\'t affect that ability. Similarly, reducing a creature\'s power to 2 or less after it enters the battlefield won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'If Tezzeret\\\'s second loyalty ability causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature, it doesn\\\'t count as "crewing" that Vehicle for any ability that would trigger off of a Vehicle becoming crewed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "If you activate Tezzeret\'s second loyalty ability targeting a Vehicle, it will have its printed power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "If you begin to activate an ability that costs mana before activating any mana abilities you need to pay for it, that ability will be the one to get Tezzeret\'s discount. The total cost for that ability becomes locked in, and then you can activate mana abilities to pay for it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "Tezzeret, Betrayer of Flesh\'s first ability reduces the cost of the first activated ability of an artifact that you begin to activate each turn. The second ability (and any subsequent abilities) of an artifact you activate that turn won\'t cost {2} less to activate, even if the first ability you activated didn\'t cost any mana to begin with. Notably, this does not exclude mana abilities."}]', "[{'date': '2022-02-18', 'text': 'If you choose more than one mode for Farewell, you perform the actions in the order written.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "As Killer Service\'s second ability resolves, you may sacrifice any token, not just a Food token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Dogged Detective doesn\'t need to be in the graveyard when the first card is drawn for its last ability to trigger. As long as it is in the graveyard when an opponent draws their second card in a turn, it will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-02\', \'text\': "The first triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether Alandra, Sky Dreamer was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-02\', \'text\': \'The same is true for the last ability and the fifth card drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-02\', \'text\': "The value of X is locked in as the last ability resolves. The bonus it grants won\'t change after that point, even if the number of cards in your hand does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Effects that modify an affected creature\'s power and/or toughness without setting them to specific values will apply no matter when those effects began. The same is true for counters that change the creature\'s power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Jolrael\'s last ability overwrites all previous effects that set the affected creatures\' power and/or toughness to specific values. If other effects that set these characteristics to specific values start to apply after Jolrael\'s ability resolves, they will overwrite that part of the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter if Jolrael was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn: if it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Jolrael\'s last ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of cards in your hand changes."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Creatures may still attack planeswalkers you control without their controller paying a cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You may find a basic Forest or any land card with the land type Forest.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You must choose a legal target for each target required by Decimate. However, if a permanent has multiple card types, it may be chosen as the target for more than one instance of the word "target." For example, you could cast Decimate targeting an artifact creature, an enchantment, and a land.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability of Ephara\'s Dispersal doesn\'t affect its mana cost or mana value. It affects only the total cost you pay. Specifically, its mana value is always 3."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it\'s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Because face-down creatures don\'t have names, they can\'t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If a double-faced\\xa0card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, a transforming double-faced card can\'t transform or convert. If the front face of a face down double-faced card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it\'s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won\'t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn\'t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it\'s a creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "You can look at a face-down permanent you control any time. You can\'t look at face-down permanents you don\'t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell with overload, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because convoke isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature\'s colors."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping an untapped creature that\'s attacking or blocking to convoke a spell won\'t cause that creature to stop attacking or blocking."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because convoke isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature\'s colors."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping an untapped creature that\'s attacking or blocking to convoke a spell won\'t cause that creature to stop attacking or blocking."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2024-01-12', 'text': 'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with gravestorm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Gravestorm counts all permanents put into graveyards from the battlefield this turn. It doesn’t matter who controlled those permanents, who owns them, or whether or not they were tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The copies of Follow the Bodies created by its gravestorm ability are created on the stack, so they’re not cast and won’t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell to trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'A creature attacks alone if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step (including creatures controlled by your teammates, if applicable). For example, exalted won’t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat. Similarly, creatures that enter the battlefield attacking later in combat won’t affect exalted abilities that have already triggered or resolved.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If Merchant of Truth dies at the same time as one or more other nontoken creatures you control, its second ability will trigger for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If you control multiple Merchants of Truth, Clues you control will have multiple instances of exalted.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'A disguise ability lets you cast a card face down by paying {3} and announcing that you are using a disguise ability. Any time you have priority, you can turn a face-down permanent with disguise face up by paying its disguise cost.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent and Auras and Equipment that were attached to that permanent aren’t affected unless the new characteristics of the object change the legality of those targets or attachments.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its disguise cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents or spells you don’t control unless an effect instructs or allows you to do so.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a face-down creature loses its abilities, it can’t be turned face up with a disguise ability because it will no longer have a disguise ability (or a disguise cost) once face up.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a face-down spell leaves the stack and goes to any zone other than the battlefield (if it was countered, for example), you must reveal it. Similarly, if a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or the game ends.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a spell or ability has a variable number of targets, you can’t change how many targets it has.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a spell or ability has damage divided, the division can’t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells and abilities that distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If you choose new targets for a spell or ability, those new targets must be legal.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The creature spell is a 2/2 creature spell with ward {2} that has no name, mana cost, or creature types. The resulting creature is a 2/2 creature with ward {2} that has no name, mana cost, or creature types. Both the spell and the resulting creature are colorless and have a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the spell or creature can still grant it any characteristics it doesn’t have or change the characteristics it does have.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3} to cast it. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can be easily differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order in which they entered the battlefield should remain clear, as well as what ability caused them to be face down. (This includes disguise, cloak, and in games involving older cards, morph and manifest, as well as a few other effects that turn cards face down.) Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'A disguise ability lets you cast a card face down by paying {3} and announcing that you are using a disguise ability. Any time you have priority, you can turn a face-down permanent with disguise face up by paying its disguise cost.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent and Auras and Equipment that were attached to that permanent aren’t affected unless the new characteristics of the object change the legality of those targets or attachments.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its disguise cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents or spells you don’t control unless an effect instructs or allows you to do so.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a face-down creature loses its abilities, it can’t be turned face up with a disguise ability because it will no longer have a disguise ability (or a disguise cost) once face up.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a face-down spell leaves the stack and goes to any zone other than the battlefield (if it was countered, for example), you must reveal it. Similarly, if a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or the game ends.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The creature spell is a 2/2 creature spell with ward {2} that has no name, mana cost, or creature types. The resulting creature is a 2/2 creature with ward {2} that has no name, mana cost, or creature types. Both the spell and the resulting creature are colorless and have a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the spell or creature can still grant it any characteristics it doesn’t have or change the characteristics it does have.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3} to cast it. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can be easily differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order in which they entered the battlefield should remain clear, as well as what ability caused them to be face down. (This includes disguise, cloak, and in games involving older cards, morph and manifest, as well as a few other effects that turn cards face down.) Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'A permanent is any object on the battlefield, including tokens and lands. Spells and emblems aren’t permanents.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Ascend on a permanent isn’t a triggered ability and doesn’t use the stack. Players can respond to a spell that will give you your tenth permanent, but they can’t respond to you getting the city’s blessing once you control that tenth permanent. This means that if your tenth permanent is a land you play, players can’t respond before you get the city’s blessing.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Gaining the city’s blessing after a Detective you control has become blocked won’t cause that Detective to become unblocked.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city’s blessing until it resolves. Players may respond to that spell by trying to change whether you get the city’s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If you control ten permanents but don’t control a permanent or resolving spell with ascend, you don’t get the city’s blessing. For example, if you control ten permanents, lose control of two, then cast Detective of the Month, you won’t have the city’s blessing.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If your tenth permanent enters the battlefield and then a permanent leaves the battlefield immediately afterwards (most likely due to the “legend rule” or due to being a creature with 0 toughness), you get the city’s blessing before it leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Once you have the city’s blessing, you have it for the rest of the game, even if you lose control of some or all your permanents. The city’s blessing isn’t a permanent itself and can’t be removed by any effect.\'}]', "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent and Auras and Equipment that were attached to that permanent aren’t affected unless the new characteristics of the object change the legality of those targets or attachments.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you can turn a cloaked permanent you control face-up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents or spells you don’t control unless an effect instructs or allows you to do so.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a cloaked creature would have disguise (or morph) if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its disguise (or morph) cost.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a double-faced card is cloaked, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a face-down creature loses its abilities, it can’t be turned face up with a disguise ability because it will no longer have a disguise ability (or a disguise cost) once face up.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a face-down spell leaves the stack and goes to any zone other than the battlefield (if it was countered, for example), you must reveal it. Similarly, if a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or the game ends.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'To cloak a card, put it onto the battlefield face down. It becomes a 2/2 face-down creature card with ward {2} and no name, mana cost, or creature types. It’s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant it any characteristics it doesn’t have or change the characteristics it does have.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using a disguise or morph ability, a cloaked creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can be easily differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order in which they entered the battlefield should remain clear, as well as what ability caused them to be face down. (This includes disguise, cloak, and in games involving older cards, morph and manifest, as well as a few other effects that turn cards face down.) Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Abilities that trigger “whenever players finish voting” trigger once all players have voted or once all secret votes are revealed, but they won’t go on the stack until the current spell or ability finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Before secret votes are revealed, players may announce how they intend to vote, but they can’t reveal what they actually wrote down until all votes are simultaneously revealed. Players can lie about how they intend to vote before the votes are revealed.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Each player must vote for another player. They can’t abstain.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'To secretly vote, each player writes down their chosen option without showing it to anyone else. Each player then keeps their vote secret until all players simultaneously reveal their votes.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Votes are cast during the resolution of Mob Verdict, so any responses to Mob Verdict must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Alternatively, if the target spell is still a legal target but can’t be countered, Counterpoint will still resolve and allow you to cast a spell from your graveyard with mana value less than or equal to the target spell’s mana value.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If the target spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X when determining that spell’s mana value.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If the target spell is an illegal target as Counterpoint tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You cast the card from your graveyard as Counterpoint resolves. You can’t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing restrictions based on the card’s types are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'An Equipment without reconfigure that’s also a creature can’t be attached to anything. You can activate its equip ability, but it won’t become attached. For example, if you control both Red Herring and Armed with Proof, Red Herring will be an Artifact Creature – Clue Equipment Fish with “Equipped creature gets +2/+0” and equip {2}, but activating its equip ability won’t result in it becoming attached to the target creature.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clues stop being Equipment if Armed with Proof leaves the battlefield. If any of them are attached to creatures at that time, they become unattached.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If you control more than one Armed with Proof, creatures equipped with Clue Equipment will get +2/+0 for each Armed with Proof you control. The equip cost is still {2}.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you surveil” triggers after you’re done surveilling, even if you have fewer cards in your library than the number of cards you’re instructed to surveil. It even triggers if you have no cards in your library.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Finality counters aren’t keyword counters, and a finality counter doesn’t give any abilities to the permanent it’s on. If that permanent loses its abilities and then would go to a graveyard, it will still be exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Finality counters don’t stop permanents from going to zones other than the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, if a permanent with a finality counter on it would be put into its owner’s hand from the battlefield, it does so normally.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Finality counters work on any permanent, not only creatures. If a permanent with a finality counter on it would go to a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it instead.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Multiple finality counters on a single permanent are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you surveil” triggers after you’re done surveilling, even if you have fewer cards in your library than the number of cards you’re instructed to surveil. It triggers even if you have no cards in your library.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If Copy Catchers leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the token will still enter the battlefield as a copy of Copy Catchers, using Copy Catchers’s copiable values from when it was last on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'In the unusual case where Copy Catchers becomes a copy of something else while its triggered ability is on the stack but before it resolves, the token will enter the battlefield as a copy of whatever Copy Catchers is copying. (Do you copy? Over.)'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The token copy will have Copy Catchers’s abilities and will be able to create copies of itself.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The token doesn’t copy whether Copy Catchers is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'An “extra turn” is any turn created by a spell or ability. Notably, it doesn’t include additional turns taken in tournaments after time expires for a round.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Extra turns can still be created while Trouble in Pairs is on the battlefield. They’re not skipped until they would begin, so if Trouble in Pairs leaves the battlefield before that happens, the extra turns will be unaffected.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an opponent attacks you with two or more creatures more than once in a turn (probably because they’ve generated extra combat phases), Trouble in Pairs’s last ability will trigger each time that happens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Trouble in Pairs counts spells that were cast even if they didn’t resolve. This means it still counts spells that were countered.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Trouble in Pairs doesn’t have to be on the battlefield to see the first card an opponent draws in a turn or the first spell they cast in a turn. As long as it’s already on the battlefield when they draw their second card or cast their second spell in a turn, its last ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Trouble in Pairs’s last ability can trigger multiple times per opponent per turn. For example, if an opponent draws a second card, casts a second spell, and attacks you with two or more creatures in a single turn, Trouble in Pairs’s last ability will trigger once when each of those events occurs, for a total of three times.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Any choices made when the spell resolves won’t have been made yet when it’s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Being solved is not part of a permanent’s copiable values. A permanent that becomes a copy of a solved Case is not solved. A solved Case that somehow becomes a copy of a different Case stays solved.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Cases don’t lose their other abilities when they become solved.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Each Case has two special keyword abilities: to solve and solved.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a permanent spell is copied, it’s put onto the battlefield as a token as the spell resolves rather than putting the copy of the spell onto the battlefield. The rules that apply to a permanent spell becoming a permanent apply to a copy of a spell becoming a token.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Once a Case becomes solved, it stays solved until it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Creating the copy won’t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell to trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The meaning of “solved” differs based on what type of ability follows it. “Solved — [activated ability]” means “[Activated ability]. Activate only if this Case is solved.” Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” '}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The token that a resolving copy of a permanent spell becomes isn’t “created” and won’t interact with abilities that care about tokens being created, such as that of Case of the Pilfered Proof.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The triggered ability Case of the Shifting Visage has when it’s solved and the copy it creates will resolve before the spell that caused the ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for a copied spell. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': '“Solved — [Triggered ability]” means “[Triggered ability]. This ability triggers only if this Case is solved.” Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].”'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': '“Solved — [static ability]” means “As long as this Case is solved, [static ability].” Static abilities are written as statements, such as “Creatures you control get +1/+1” or “Instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.”'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': '“To Solve — [condition]” means “At the beginning of your end step, if [condition] and this Case is not solved, it becomes solved.”'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': '“To solve” abilities will check for their condition twice: once when the ability would trigger, and once when it resolves. If the condition isn’t true at the beginning of your end step, the ability won’t trigger at all. If the condition isn’t true when the ability resolves, the Case won’t become solved.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Any choices made when the spell resolves won’t have been made yet when it’s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Feather, Radiant Arbiter’s ability triggers whenever you cast a noncreature spell that targets only Feather and no other object or player.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a permanent spell is copied, the copies are put onto the battlefield as a token as the spell resolves rather than putting the copy of the spell onto the battlefield. The rules that apply to a permanent spell becoming a permanent apply to a copy of a spell becoming a token.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copies have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copies will have the same mode. You can’t choose different modes.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If you cast a noncreature spell that has multiple targets, but it’s targeting Feather, Radiant Arbiter with all of them, Feather’s last ability will trigger. In that case, each of those copies will also only target one of the chosen creatures.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The copies created by Feather, Radiant Arbiter’s last ability are created on the stack, so they’re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (like Feather’s own ability) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The token that a resolving copy of a permanent spell becomes isn’t “created” and won’t interact with abilities that care about tokens being created, such as that of Case of the Pilfered Proof.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copies. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You control all the copies, and you choose the order the copies are put on the stack. The original spell will be on the stack beneath those copies and will resolve last.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Being suspected isn’t a copiable value. If a permanent becomes a copy of a suspected creature, it won’t be suspected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Hot Pursuit’s second triggered ability causes you to gain control of all creatures that are goaded, suspected, or both. You don’t have to make any choices.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If Hot Pursuit leaves the battlefield before its first triggered ability resolves, the target creature will become suspected, but it won’t become goaded at all.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If a creature is already suspected, suspecting it again won’t have any effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If a suspected creature loses all abilities, it will lose menace and "This creature can\\\'t block", but it won’t stop being suspected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'There’s no limit to the number of creatures that can be suspected simultaneously. Suspecting a new creature doesn’t cause other creatures to stop being suspected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'When an effect suspects a creature, it becomes suspected. It gains menace and "This creature can\\\'t block" for as long as it’s suspected. It stays suspected until it leaves the battlefield or another effect causes it to no longer be suspected.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Being suspected isn’t a copiable value. If a permanent becomes a copy of a suspected creature, it won’t be suspected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If a creature is already suspected, suspecting it again won’t have any effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If a suspected creature loses all abilities, it will lose menace and "This creature can\\\'t block", but it won’t stop being suspected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'There’s no limit to the number of creatures that can be suspected simultaneously. Suspecting a new creature doesn’t cause other creatures to stop being suspected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'When an effect suspects a creature, it becomes suspected. It gains menace and "This creature can\\\'t block" for as long as it’s suspected. It stays suspected until it leaves the battlefield or another effect causes it to no longer be suspected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'You can target a creature that’s already suspected with Nelly Borca, Impulsive Accuser’s second ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Due to a recent rules change to suspend, you are no longer required to cast the suspended card as the second triggered ability of suspend resolves. Instead, as the second triggered ability resolves, you may cast the card. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored. If you don’t cast the card, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Finality counters aren’t keyword counters, and a finality counter doesn’t give any abilities to the permanent it’s on. If that permanent loses its abilities and then would go to a graveyard, it will still be exiled instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Finality counters don’t stop permanents from going to zones other than the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, if a permanent with a finality counter on it would be put into its owner’s hand from the battlefield, it does so normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Finality counters work on any permanent, not only creatures. If a permanent with a finality counter on it would go to a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Multiple finality counters on a single permanent are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that gives you the option to cast the card when the last time counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'The creature card you choose doesn’t need to be a card you put in your graveyard with surveil. You may choose a creature card that was already in your graveyard before you surveilled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Due to a recent rules change to suspend, you are no longer required to cast the suspended card as the second triggered ability of suspend resolves. Instead, as the second triggered ability resolves, you may cast the card. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored. If you don’t cast the card, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that gives you the option to cast the card when the last time counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clues you control will keep any abilities they previously had while they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If a Clue you control is already a creature when Tangletrove Kelp’s second ability resolves, Tangletrove Kelp’s second ability will overwrite any previous effects that set that creature’s power and toughness to specific numbers. Effects that otherwise modify its power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Except in some very unusual cases, the card each player reveals is the one they’ll draw.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'There’s no window for you to cast spells after untapping all lands you control but before the “you can’t cast spells” portion of Innocuous Researcher’s last ability takes effect. Once that ability resolves, it doesn’t matter whether Innocuous Researcher stays on the battlefield; you’ll still be unable to cast spells until your next turn begins.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If Foreboding Steamboat leaves the battlefield before its first triggered ability resolves, the chosen creatures won’t be exiled at all.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Starting with the player whose turn it is, each player in turn order chooses two nontoken, non-Vehicle creatures they control, then all the creatures chosen by all players are exiled at the same time. Players get to know the choices made by players who chose before them.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect puts multiple cards from a library into a graveyard, all of those cards move at the same time. For example, when Aftermath Analyst’s enters the battlefield triggered ability resolves, you’ll mill three cards at once. If one or more of those cards are creature cards, Unshakable Tail’s second ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Clue is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some cards with other permanent types, it’s never a creature type, a land type, or anything but an artifact type.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Clue, it means any Clue artifact, not just a Clue artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Wrench to pay for Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you sacrifice a Clue”. Those abilities trigger whenever you sacrifice a Clue for any reason, not just to activate a Clue’s activated ability.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that investigate may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Clue to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Clue token to activate its own ability and also to activate Alquist Proft, Master Sleuth’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Final-Word Phantom’s last ability applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can be activated “only as a sorcery.”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If a creature has a characteristic-defining ability that sets its power and toughness, indicated with a */* or similar in the power and toughness box, that ability is taken into account when determining its base power and toughness.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "Normally, a creature’s base power and toughness are the power and toughness printed on the card or, for a token, the power and toughness set by the effect that created it. If another effect sets a creature\'s power and toughness to specific numbers or values, those become its base power and toughness. If an effect modifies a creature’s power and/or toughness without setting them, that is not included when determining its base power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Some creatures have base power and toughness 0/0 and an ability that gives them a bonus based on some criteria. Those are not characteristic-defining abilities, and that ability doesn’t change its base power and toughness.\'}]', "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If the target creature is a face-down creature that can’t be turned face up for any reason, it will remain face down on the battlefield and still deal damage equal to its power (which is very likely to be 2) to each other creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost this way, the only legal choice for X is 0.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'You may only cast spells this way by paying the appropriate amount of life. You may not pay their normal costs and may not pay any other alternative costs. You may still pay for additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': '“Cards in your graveyard you’ve surveilled this turn” includes cards you put into your graveyard while surveilling. It does not include cards you saw while surveilling, left on top of your library, and then put into your graveyard later that turn by other means.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'If you control two copies of Panoptic Projektor, a face-down permanent turning face up causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Panoptic Projektor causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Panoptic Projektor’s last ability affects a permanent’s own abilities that trigger when it turns face up as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that permanent turns face up. Such triggered abilities start with “when” or “whenever”.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Panoptic Projektor’s last ability doesn’t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger twice. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Replacement effects are unaffected by Panoptic Projektor’s last ability. For example, abilities that apply “as [this permanent] is turned face up,” such as that of Crowd-Control Warden, are unaffected.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Take the Bait doesn’t give the opponent whose turn it is an additional main phase. They will move directly from the end of combat step of one combat phase to the beginning of combat step of the next one.'}, {'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'Untapping and goading the attacking creatures won’t remove them from combat, even if they’re attacking you.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-02-02', 'text': 'The creature must have been turned face up before dealing combat damage to a player for Kaust, Eyes of the Glade’s first ability to trigger.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abgeklärte Detektivin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Abgeklärte Detektivin ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug stellst du für jede angestachelte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, Nachforschungen an. Danach sind Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, nicht mehr angestachelt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04f1dede-5f70-4572-aca5-76d95f7c98d3\', \'multiverseId\': 649992}, \'multiverseid\': 649992}, {\'name\': \'Détective sereine\', \'text\': "Quand la Détective sereine arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, enquêtez pour chaque créature incitée que vous contrôlez. Puis chaque créature que vous contrôlez n\'est plus incitée.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650032&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e1fe6dd-9381-4b04-a477-bdc9e59333eb\', \'multiverseId\': 650032}, \'multiverseid\': 650032}, {\'name\': \'Investigatrice Placida\', \'text\': \'Quando l\\\'Investigatrice Placida entra nel campo di battaglia, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nAll\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, indaga per ogni creatura spronata che controlli. Poi ogni creatura che controlli non è più spronata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Detective Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f82ba65-3b86-4a11-a6e3-d89cd8ed6580\', \'multiverseId\': 650072}, \'multiverseid\': 650072}, {\'name\': \'物静かな捜索者\', \'text\': \'物静かな捜索者が戦場に出たとき、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていて使嗾されているクリーチャー１体につき１回調査を行う。その後、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、使嗾されていない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819602db-f0fd-4c45-9669-d6d854c3c610\', \'multiverseId\': 650112}, \'multiverseid\': 650112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgeklärte Detektivin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Abgeklärte Detektivin ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug stellst du für jede angestachelte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, Nachforschungen an. Danach sind Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, nicht mehr angestachelt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bee1759a-a7ea-4ff3-8812-f3d8a3222691\', \'multiverseId\': 651526}, \'multiverseid\': 651526}, {\'name\': \'Détective sereine\', \'text\': "Quand la Détective sereine arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, enquêtez pour chaque créature incitée que vous contrôlez. Puis chaque créature que vous contrôlez n\'est plus incitée.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651565&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f601f46-5f6d-4d0e-8b98-664f589db880\', \'multiverseId\': 651565}, \'multiverseid\': 651565}, {\'name\': \'物静かな捜索者\', \'text\': \'物静かな捜索者が戦場に出たとき、調査を行う。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていて使嗾されているクリーチャー１体につき１回調査を行う。その後、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、使嗾されていない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04aabdd8-1707-4a1a-a82a-9a24a8ec2682\', \'multiverseId\': 651604}, \'multiverseid\': 651604}, {\'name\': \'安详侦员\', \'text\': \'当安详侦员进战场时，探查。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，你每操控一个已煽惑的生物，便探查一次。然后所有由你操控的生物不再被煽惑。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b28fa2-74cf-4fde-9cbd-87a6a0bd015c\', \'multiverseId\': 651643}, \'multiverseid\': 651643}]', "[{'name': 'Abgelegene Steppe', 'text': 'Die Abgelegene Steppe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650642&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '900fa5ae-bccc-4e94-b7d2-a635fffacc0f', 'multiverseId': 650642}, 'multiverseid': 650642}, {'name': 'Steppes retirées', 'text': 'Les Steppes retirées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650901&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db08f5cc-42fa-4029-b82a-0ec8f42cebd0', 'multiverseId': 650901}, 'multiverseid': 650901}, {'name': 'Steppa Isolata', 'text': 'La Steppa Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651160&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa258a89-ed7b-48e9-b0ca-4c437276a763', 'multiverseId': 651160}, 'multiverseid': 651160}, {'name': '隔離されたステップ', 'text': '隔離されたステップはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651419&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca00274c-97d3-4918-aa4e-5b132f70d1ba', 'multiverseId': 651419}, 'multiverseid': 651419}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Vergessenheit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast.\\n{8}, {T}, opfere den Abgott der Vergessenheit: Erzeuge einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erwache, Großartiger, und säubere die Welt von unseren Feinden!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650582&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb6f515-0890-47b7-98c0-8ee2b40b1024\', \'multiverseId\': 650582}, \'multiverseid\': 650582}, {\'name\': "Idole de l\'oubli", \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous avez créé un jeton ce tour-ci.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Idole de l\'oubli : Créez un jeton de créature 10/10 incolore Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Lève-toi, glorieux élu, et purifie le monde de nos ennemis ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b4f237-152b-47f1-8ac7-6a4d79102ead\', \'multiverseId\': 650841}, \'multiverseid\': 650841}, {\'name\': "Idolo dell\'Oblio", \'text\': "{T}: Pesca una carta. Attiva solo se hai creato una pedina in questo turno.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Idolo dell\'Oblio: Crea una pedina creatura Eldrazi 10/10 incolore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Risvegliati, essere supremo, e purifica il mondo dai nostri nemici!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'230a1c47-bf60-49d1-b062-64bd380b08f3\', \'multiverseId\': 651100}, \'multiverseid\': 651100}, {\'name\': \'忘却の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引く。このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していなければ起動できない。\\n{8}, {T}, 忘却の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるものよ、立ち上がり、そして我らの敵たるこの世界を浄化したまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d783a91-c362-45f3-b1b3-98524c69fa81\', \'multiverseId\': 651359}, \'multiverseid\': 651359}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abschied\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder mehrere —\\n• Schicke alle Artefakte ins Exil.\\n• Schicke alle Kreaturen ins Exil.\\n• Schicke alle Verzauberungen ins Exil.\\n• Schicke alle Friedhöfe ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650417&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc0d4b0b-4edb-45e9-9b4f-410b22d5f9b2\', \'multiverseId\': 650417}, \'multiverseid\': 650417}, {\'name\': \'Adieu\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou plus —\\n• Exilez tous les artefacts.\\n• Exilez toutes les créatures.\\n• Exilez tous les enchantements.\\n• Exilez tous les cimetières.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650676&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b867b5a-260f-4437-b618-2e755482958f\', \'multiverseId\': 650676}, \'multiverseid\': 650676}, {\'name\': \'Addio\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o più —\\n• Esilia tutti gli artefatti.\\n• Esilia tutte le creature.\\n• Esilia tutti gli incantesimi.\\n• Esilia tutti i cimiteri.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d094bdb-be0f-4667-b335-97372ecefa1a\', \'multiverseId\': 650935}, \'multiverseid\': 650935}, {\'name\': \'告別\', \'text\': \'以下から１つ以上を選ぶ。\\n・すべてのアーティファクトを追放する。\\n・すべてのクリーチャーを追放する。\\n・すべてのエンチャントを追放する。\\n・すべての墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041cf02b-16c8-4a64-af5c-452f1ef0685c\', \'multiverseId\': 651194}, \'multiverseid\': 651194}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwehrende Hand\', \'text\': \'Das nächste Mal, dass dir eine Quelle, die du bestimmst, in diesem Zug Schaden zufügen würde, verhindere den Schaden. Falls auf diese Weise Schaden verhindert wurde, fügt die Abwehrende Hand dem Beherrscher der Quelle entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90fb73ab-8e07-429e-ae10-663f7a447487\', \'multiverseId\': 650558}, \'multiverseid\': 650558}, {\'name\': \'Paume déflectrice\', \'text\': "La prochaine fois qu\'une source de votre choix devrait vous infliger des blessures ce tour-ci, prévenez ces blessures. Si des blessures sont prévenues de cette manière, la Paume déflectrice inflige autant de blessures au contrôleur de cette source.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f02c385-8ce4-4add-82f4-a873215668ca\', \'multiverseId\': 650817}, \'multiverseid\': 650817}, {\'name\': \'Palmo della Deviazione\', \'text\': \'La prossima volta che una fonte a tua scelta ti sta per infliggere danno in questo turno, previeni quel danno. Se viene prevenuto danno in questo modo, il Palmo della Deviazione infligge altrettanti danni al controllore di quella fonte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2ae44a-3b67-4255-b22c-4f24b20a7711\', \'multiverseId\': 651076}, \'multiverseid\': 651076}, {\'name\': \'跳ね返す掌\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたが選んだ発生源１つが次にあなたに与えるダメージを軽減する。これによりダメージが軽減されたなら、跳ね返す掌はその発生源のコントローラーに同じ点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d967593e-a358-448b-b5be-9b594d62202c\', \'multiverseId\': 651335}, \'multiverseid\': 651335}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adrix und Nev, Zwillingszauberer\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {2} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\\nFalls ein oder mehrere Spielsteine unter deiner Kontrolle erzeugt würden, werden stattdessen doppelt so viele solcher Spielsteine erzeugt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0a6c1c-efd6-48c8-a9d8-57ac4f58af63\', \'multiverseId\': 650551}, \'multiverseid\': 650551}, {\'name\': \'Adrix et Nev, jumemages\', \'text\': "Parade {2} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)\\nSi au moins un jeton devait être créé sous votre contrôle, deux fois ce nombre de jetons sont créés à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aa05968-bcb6-48aa-bec6-33a70d39f9f4\', \'multiverseId\': 650810}, \'multiverseid\': 650810}, {\'name\': \'Adrix e Nev, Incantatori Gemelli\', \'text\': \'Egida {2} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\\nSe una o più pedine stanno per essere create sotto il tuo controllo, invece ne vengono create il doppio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771fc230-0b6e-4308-b727-092d3b1ab643\', \'multiverseId\': 651069}, \'multiverseid\': 651069}, {\'name\': \'双子唱者、アドリックスとネヴ\', \'text\': \'護法{2}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\nあなたのコントロール下で１つ以上のトークンが生成されるなら、代わりにその２倍の数のそのトークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222cc65e-2690-4e2a-a453-eed419e92072\', \'multiverseId\': 651328}, \'multiverseid\': 651328}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ainok-Überlebenskünstler\', \'text\': \'Megamorph {1}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Megamorph-Kosten auf und lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nWenn der Ainok-Überlebenskünstler aufgedeckt wird, zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'273a3cce-24f3-4c4e-8260-6ea705f2880f\', \'multiverseId\': 650518}, \'multiverseid\': 650518}, {\'name\': \'Survivaliste aïnok\', \'text\': "Mégamue {1}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mégamue et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nQuand le Survivaliste aïnok est retourné face visible, détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement, qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature — chien et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650777&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'736894f1-60ae-4346-9529-df74aea24b13\', \'multiverseId\': 650777}, \'multiverseid\': 650777}, {\'name\': \'Survivalista Ainok\', \'text\': \'Megamorfosi {1}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di megamorfosi e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nQuando il Survivalista Ainok viene girato a faccia in su, distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio controllato da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Canide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f44d923-463e-4676-90a3-684a1055cd26\', \'multiverseId\': 651036}, \'multiverseid\': 651036}, {\'name\': \'アイノクの生き残り\', \'text\': \'大変異{1}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの大変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。そうしたなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\nアイノクの生き残りが表向きになったとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていてアーティファクトやエンチャントである１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 犬・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3501ac89-2641-4522-a4d6-2ca5ea4c9401\', \'multiverseId\': 651295}, \'multiverseid\': 651295}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akademie-Monteur\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Hinweis-, Speise- oder Schatz-Spielstein erzeugen würdest, erzeuge stattdessen einen von jedem Typ.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'Automatisierte Systeme an der Akademie von Tolaria sortieren Neuanschaffungen im Hinblick auf eine optimale Nutzung und bestimmen, welche studiert, gegessen oder verkauft werden sollten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb3e577-3443-4631-9254-817e0972f5eb\', \'multiverseId\': 650574}, \'multiverseid\': 650574}, {\'name\': "Fabricateur de l\'académie", \'text\': \'Si vous deviez créer un jeton Indice, Nourriture ou Trésor, à la place créez un jeton de chaque.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': "Les systèmes automatisés de l\'Académie tolariane trient les nouvelles acquisitions selon leur usage optimal et déterminent si elles doivent être étudiées, mangées ou vendues.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650833&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b913c5-b0de-40e7-8ac9-1cb3912b057b\', \'multiverseId\': 650833}, \'multiverseid\': 650833}, {\'name\': "Manufattore dell\'Accademia", \'text\': \'Se stai per creare una pedina Cibo, Indizio o Tesoro, invece ne crei una di ognuno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': "I sistemi automatizzati dell\'Accademia di Tolaria suddividono le nuove acquisizioni per un utilizzo ottimale, determinando quali vadano studiate, mangiate o vendute.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d635b8c8-0f80-4639-aa9c-70d45348058c\', \'multiverseId\': 651092}, \'multiverseid\': 651092}, {\'name\': \'アカデミーの整備士\', \'text\': \'あなたが食物や手掛かりや宝物であるトークン１つを生成するなら、代わりに食物・トークン１つと手がかり・トークン１つと宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'トレイリアのアカデミーでは自動機械が新たな入手物を最適な用途に分類する。食べるか調べるか売るかを決定するのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dac3f001-9444-4c3c-bfe5-276da1ac47ca\', \'multiverseId\': 651351}, \'multiverseid\': 651351}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akroma, Engel der Wut\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nFliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden, Schutz vor Weiß und vor Blau\\n{R}: Akroma, Engel der Wut, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nMorph {3}{R}{R}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b644a540-b757-486f-92a7-03a492c8a3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 650499}, \'multiverseid\': 650499}, {\'name\': \'Akroma, ange de la Fureur\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nVol, piétinement, protection contre le blanc et contre le bleu\\n{R} : Akroma, ange de la Fureur gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nMue {3}{R}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650758&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'883dc791-8c84-4372-ab11-f3b0b7fe4156\', \'multiverseId\': 650758}, \'multiverseid\': 650758}, {\'name\': \'Akroma, Angelo della Furia\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nVolare, travolgere, protezione dal bianco e dal blu\\n{R}: Akroma, Angelo della Furia prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nMetamorfosi {3}{R}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff72d32-c568-470f-9702-c3abad94db55\', \'multiverseId\': 651017}, \'multiverseid\': 651017}, {\'name\': \'憤怒の天使アクローマ\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\n飛行、トランプル、プロテクション（白）、プロテクション（青）\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、憤怒の天使アクローマは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n変異{3}{R}{R}{R}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f23a854-ae36-42c1-be5a-13bae64917da\', \'multiverseId\': 651276}, \'multiverseid\': 651276}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alandra, Himmelsträumerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 blauen Sceada-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn du deine fünfte Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erhalten Alandra, Himmelsträumerin, und Sceadas, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges jeweils +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650447&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5536255-6f30-46c3-be46-cbd3059e0b0f\', \'multiverseId\': 650447}, \'multiverseid\': 650447}, {\'name\': \'Alandra, rêveuse céleste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Drakôn avec le vol.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre cinquième carte à chaque tour, Alandra, rêveuse céleste et les drakôns que vous contrôlez gagnent chacun +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8776b7bd-c1e9-43db-8ba4-faf1b308af30\', \'multiverseId\': 650706}, \'multiverseid\': 650706}, {\'name\': \'Alandra, Sognatrice del Cielo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Draghetto 2/2 blu con volare.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua quinta carta in ogni turno, Alandra, Sognatrice del Cielo e i Draghetti che controlli prendono +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di carte nella tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41980914-adc7-4ae5-84b1-042f03253cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 650965}, \'multiverseid\': 650965}, {\'name\': \'空夢想士、アランドラ\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの５枚目のカードを引くたび、ターン終了時まで、空夢想士、アランドラとあなたがコントロールしているすべてのドレイクは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは、あなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5e9c30e-01f9-42aa-ad64-bbde74f7956c\', \'multiverseId\': 651224}, \'multiverseid\': 651224}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amphin-Meuterer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Amphin-Meuterer ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu eine Nicht-Salamander-Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Der Beherrscher der Kreatur erzeugt einen 4/3 blauen Salamander-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nZugabe {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge für jeden Gegner eine Spielstein-Kopie, die ihn in diesem Zug angreift, falls möglich. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments. Aktiviere Zugabe wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Salamander, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650448&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57e2e2fa-4e14-4c8f-9a8c-bdb4a6127e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 650448}, \'multiverseid\': 650448}, {\'name\': \'Mutin amphin\', \'text\': "Quand le Mutin amphin arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à une créature non-Salamandre ciblée. Le contrôleur de cette créature crée un jeton de créature 4/3 bleue Salamandre et Guerrier.\\nEncore {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Pour chaque adversaire, créez une copie jeton qui attaque cet adversaire ce tour-ci si possible. Elle acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature — salamandre et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f55a441-3ebb-45bc-9e3b-f264fb96b783\', \'multiverseId\': 650707}, \'multiverseid\': 650707}, {\'name\': \'Amphin Ammutinato\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Amphin Ammutinato entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a una creatura non Salamandra bersaglio. Il controllore di quella creatura crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Salamandra 4/3 blu.\\nBis {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Per ogni avversario, crea una pedina che è una sua copia e che attacca quell\'avversario in questo turno, se può farlo. Queste pedine hanno rapidità. Sacrificale all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Salamandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bcfbf05-4ebf-4c3e-8895-c434ac080c55\', \'multiverseId\': 650966}, \'multiverseid\': 650966}, {\'name\': \'アンフィンの反逆者\', \'text\': \'アンフィンの反逆者が戦場に出たとき、サラマンダーでないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それを追放する。そのクリーチャーのコントローラーは、青の４/３のサラマンダー・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n再演{4}{U}{U}（{4}{U}{U}, あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを追放する：各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、このカードのコピーであり、このターン可能ならそのプレイヤーを攻撃するトークン１つを生成する。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを生け贄に捧げる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サラマンダー・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6a18aea-665a-4f4a-832f-5756d5d7332d\', \'multiverseId\': 651225}, \'multiverseid\': 651225}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anstachler-Ameise\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments kann jeder Spieler zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur legen, die er kontrolliert. Stachle jede Kreatur an, auf die auf diese Weise Marken gelegt wurden. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen jene Kreaturen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greifen einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650498&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'072014bb-b3bc-4ff2-9af3-bac4dfd8a723\', \'multiverseId\': 650498}, \'multiverseid\': 650498}, {\'name\': \'Fourmi agitatrice\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, chaque joueur peut mettre deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature qu\'il contrôle. Incitez chaque créature sur laquelle des marqueurs ont été mis de cette manière. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible et attaquent un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Créature — insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650757&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d98033c7-fc90-4fea-95b5-3f2de6d9c11f\', \'multiverseId\': 650757}, \'multiverseid\': 650757}, {\'name\': \'Formica Sobillatrice\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, ogni giocatore può mettere due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura che controlla. Sprona ogni creatura che ha ricevuto segnalini in questo modo. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature attaccano in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se possono farlo.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72965e2a-bc68-441f-8266-4e75f553f2e8\', \'multiverseId\': 651016}, \'multiverseid\': 651016}, {\'name\': \'扇動する蟻\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置いてもよい。これによりカウンターが置かれたすべてのクリーチャーを使嗾する。（次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーは、可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5fc2f47-bad1-424d-9469-95276502f4cd\', \'multiverseId\': 651275}, \'multiverseid\': 651275}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anteil an der Beute\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments ziehst du für jeden Gegner, der in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Karten gezogen hat, eine Karte und erzeugst dann für jeden Gegner, unter dessen Kontrolle in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Länder ins Spiel gekommen sind, einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Auf die eine oder andere Weise bekommt jeder, was ihm zusteht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db9907d4-a316-4beb-8e9f-6fbc8f1a6ced\', \'multiverseId\': 650437}, \'multiverseid\': 650437}, {\'name\': \'Part du contrebandier\', \'text\': \'Au début de chaque étape de fin, piochez une carte pour chaque adversaire qui a pioché au moins deux cartes ce tour-ci, puis créez un jeton Trésor pour chaque adversaire qui a fait arriver sur le champ de bataille, sous son contrôle, au moins deux terrains ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "D\'une manière ou d\'une autre, chacun se fait payer ce qui lui est dû.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650696&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cfeed51-8056-4f17-be26-ac3a82c2568b\', \'multiverseId\': 650696}, \'multiverseid\': 650696}, {\'name\': \'Quota del Contrabbandiere\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, pesca una carta per ogni avversario che ha pescato due o più carte in questo turno, poi crea una pedina Tesoro per ogni avversario che ha fatto entrare nel campo di battaglia sotto il proprio controllo due o più terre in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "In un modo o nell\'altro, ognuno riceve ciò che gli è dovuto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26672306-0fff-4223-a5cc-1f891f8c16d0\', \'multiverseId\': 650955}, \'multiverseid\': 650955}, {\'name\': \'密輸人の分け前\', \'text\': \'各終了ステップの開始時に、あなたは、このターンに２枚以上のカードを引いた対戦相手１人につき１枚のカードを引き、その後、このターンに２つ以上の土地を自分のコントロール下で戦場に出した対戦相手１人につき１つの宝物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'どういうわけか、借りは支払われるものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07bbfc00-29ed-42e3-8614-48f5977a283c\', \'multiverseId\': 651214}, \'multiverseid\': 651214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anya, Engel ohne Gnade\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nAnya, Engel ohne Gnade, erhält +3/+3 für jeden Gegner, dessen Lebenspunktestand weniger als die Hälfte seiner Startlebenspunktezahl beträgt.\\nSolange der Lebenspunktestand eines Gegners weniger als die Hälfte seiner Startlebenspunktezahl beträgt, hat Anya Unzerstörbarkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d99dc6c-9277-46ef-9542-80557d87c1d7\', \'multiverseId\': 650552}, \'multiverseid\': 650552}, {\'name\': \'Anya, ange impitoyable\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAnya, ange impitoyable gagne +3/+3 pour chaque adversaire dont le total de points de vie est inférieur à la moitié de son total de points de vie de départ.\\nTant que le total de points de vie d\'un adversaire est inférieur à la moitié de son total de points de vie de départ, Anya a l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28357896-d3be-4cee-b18a-e7702ddf77be\', \'multiverseId\': 650811}, \'multiverseid\': 650811}, {\'name\': \'Anya, Angelo Spietato\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nAnya, Angelo Spietato prende +3/+3 per ogni avversario i cui punti vita sono minori della metà dei propri punti vita iniziali.\\nFintanto che i punti vita di un avversario sono minori della metà dei suoi punti vita iniziali, Anya ha indistruttibile.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b40e437-8115-4ba2-ad3b-9864da0f070c\', \'multiverseId\': 651070}, \'multiverseid\': 651070}, {\'name\': \'無慈悲なる天使、アンヤ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n無慈悲なる天使、アンヤは、ライフ総量が初期ライフ総量の半分未満である対戦相手１人につき＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\n対戦相手１人のライフ総量が初期ライフ総量の半分未満であるかぎり、無慈悲なる天使、アンヤは破壊不能を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15177248-6e14-4b23-bf5f-66851c6ccd13\', \'multiverseId\': 651329}, \'multiverseid\': 651329}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Commanders.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2600a6-dbcd-4719-b2f2-30376211bdaf\', \'multiverseId\': 650576}, \'multiverseid\': 650576}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb026c60-c37a-4753-b2db-b412398b97d0\', \'multiverseId\': 650835}, \'multiverseid\': 650835}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Al principio era una semplice goccia d\'acqua. Lo Specchio Magico la cristallizzò in qualcosa di molto più grande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'890c229a-2589-4d7e-8698-6f7b7b223a44\', \'multiverseId\': 651094}, \'multiverseid\': 651094}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d271ae5-0f13-40a5-a4e8-1eb0d7a9bfcd\', \'multiverseId\': 651353}, \'multiverseid\': 651353}]', "[{'name': 'Aschenödnis', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650601&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18c1ab2f-41d5-4608-bd02-5ef3d59402a7', 'multiverseId': 650601}, 'multiverseid': 650601}, {'name': 'Landes cendreuses', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650860&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1f12100-807e-4638-80d0-842a908ca585', 'multiverseId': 650860}, 'multiverseid': 650860}, {'name': 'Distese di Polvere', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\nCicloterra base {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651119&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f2cf7f4-e7d4-4c3f-b704-2670052aab86', 'multiverseId': 651119}, 'multiverseid': 651119}, {'name': '灰のやせ地', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651378&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e09ee6f7-3898-492d-a29e-a9fb5c35d3dd', 'multiverseId': 651378}, 'multiverseid': 651378}]", "[{'name': 'Aschewolkenphoenix', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aschewolkenphoenix stirbt, bringe ihn unter deiner Kontrolle verdeckt ins Spiel zurück.\\nMorph {4}{R}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Aschewolkenphoenix aufgedeckt wird, fügt er jedem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Phoenix', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650500&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b411c493-366c-40d5-97dc-62f7462258ff', 'multiverseId': 650500}, 'multiverseid': 650500}, {'name': 'Phénix des nuées cendreuses', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Phénix des nuées cendreuses meurt, renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille face cachée sous votre contrôle.\\nMue {4}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Phénix des nuées cendreuses est retourné face visible, il inflige 2 blessures à chaque joueur.', 'type': 'Créature — phénix', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650759&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6440bcb8-d8ca-43f3-9f71-13d0d151b27e', 'multiverseId': 650759}, 'multiverseid': 650759}, {'name': 'Fenice della Nube Cinerea', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando la Fenice della Nube Cinerea muore, rimettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù sotto il tuo controllo.\\nMetamorfosi {4}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando la Fenice della Nube Cinerea viene girata a faccia in su, infligge 2 danni a ogni giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Fenice', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651018&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9778c77-ad34-4349-ae0f-49fdc3dc6c0c', 'multiverseId': 651018}, 'multiverseid': 651018}, {'name': '灰雲のフェニックス', 'text': '飛行\\n灰雲のフェニックスが死亡したとき、これをあなたのコントロール下で裏向きで戦場に戻す。\\n変異{4}{R}{R}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\\n灰雲のフェニックスが表向きになったとき、これは各プレイヤーにそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — フェニックス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651277&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b76d937c-371e-4908-a928-9fe44348887c', 'multiverseId': 651277}, 'multiverseid': 651277}]", '[{\'name\': \'Auf der Spur\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Wo die Reise des Opfers endet, beginnt die Reise des Ermittlers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401784c7-3f3f-42d9-88ff-8e36be835a94\', \'multiverseId\': 650017}, \'multiverseid\': 650017}, {\'name\': \'Sur la piste\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le parcours d\'un enquêteur commence là où se termine celui d\'une victime.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650057&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87a133a5-0e96-49f8-830b-7333a4f28451\', \'multiverseId\': 650057}, \'multiverseid\': 650057}, {\'name\': \'Seguire la Pista\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta terra dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Lì, dove il viaggio della vittima si conclude, inizia quello dell\'investigatore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad4cace6-ae19-43b5-a056-b4c54beeb5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 650097}, \'multiverseid\': 650097}, {\'name\': \'追跡調査\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'犠牲者の足取りの果てこそが、探偵の道のりの始まり。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1fa471a-f0f8-419c-b9bb-7c79ad7ae94a\', \'multiverseId\': 650137}, \'multiverseid\': 650137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf der Spur\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Wo die Reise des Opfers endet, beginnt die Reise des Ermittlers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76536b1f-c70a-4b12-aa72-4b9b41f40b08\', \'multiverseId\': 651550}, \'multiverseid\': 651550}, {\'name\': \'Sur la piste\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le parcours d\'un enquêteur commence là où se termine celui d\'une victime.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4571c663-4311-48c9-b34a-27e7d83498ee\', \'multiverseId\': 651589}, \'multiverseid\': 651589}, {\'name\': \'追跡調査\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'犠牲者の終点が、探偵の出発点。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b9161e-01f8-40ea-8407-b116ab1ca6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 651628}, \'multiverseid\': 651628}, {\'name\': \'追寻痕迹\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，你可以将一张地牌从你手上横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'被害人的旅途终点，便是探员的事务起点。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3760293-ce94-42ee-b7cb-9bf95c99eaeb\', \'multiverseId\': 651667}, \'multiverseid\': 651667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufseher der Verdammten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aufseher der Verdammten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl zerstören.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, erzeuge einen getappten 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb31d7f3-f134-4643-98a2-f1241986c6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 650485}, \'multiverseid\': 650485}, {\'name\': \'Brigadier des damnés\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Brigadier des damnés arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez détruire une créature ciblée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, créez, engagé, un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature — démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650744&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aafb2cd1-57c8-4133-8a53-b8204d9529dd\', \'multiverseId\': 650744}, \'multiverseid\': 650744}, {\'name\': \'Sorvegliante dei Dannati\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Sorvegliante dei Dannati entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi distruggere una creatura bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina controllata da un avversario muore, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa73bc5-b8c6-47d7-b062-10ed4d9ed96e\', \'multiverseId\': 651003}, \'multiverseid\': 651003}, {\'name\': \'忌むべき者の監視者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n忌むべき者の監視者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊してもよい。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96995e4b-b542-49c4-a938-ffef7e2373d8\', \'multiverseId\': 651262}, \'multiverseid\': 651262}]', "[{'name': 'Auge der Dämmerhülle', 'text': 'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nDu kannst von den Karten in deinem Friedhof, die du in diesem Zug überwacht hast, Länder spielen und Zaubersprüche wirken. Falls du auf diese Weise einen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags, statt seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Auge', 'flavor': 'Die meisten glaubten, die Dimir seien ausgelöscht worden. Das kam den Dimir sehr gelegen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650005&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '443a358e-a7f2-4a48-884c-1b94bac90246', 'multiverseId': 650005}, 'multiverseid': 650005}, {'name': 'Œil de Manteaubrune', 'text': 'Vol, lien de vie\\nVous pouvez jouer des terrains et lancer des sorts parmi les cartes dans votre cimetière que vous avez surveillées ce tour-ci. Si vous lancez un sort de cette manière, vous payez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana à la place de payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Créature — œil', 'flavor': 'La plupart croyaient les Dimir anéantis. Ce qui leur convenait parfaitement.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650045&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c32ead6-1314-48fc-8570-01cbc337ad30', 'multiverseId': 650045}, 'multiverseid': 650045}, {'name': 'Occhio di Mantoscuro', 'text': 'Volare, legame vitale\\nPuoi giocare terre e lanciare magie scelte tra le carte nel tuo cimitero che hai sorvegliato in questo turno. Se lanci una magia in questo modo, paghi punti vita pari al suo valore di mana invece di pagare il suo costo di mana.', 'type': 'Creatura — Occhio', 'flavor': 'In molti credevano che i Dimir fossero stati sconfitti. Nulla di più appropriato per i Dimir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650085&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c99ca393-1e6c-4b1d-97ea-215a5673b915', 'multiverseId': 650085}, 'multiverseid': 650085}, {'name': 'ダスクマントルの目', 'text': '飛行、絆魂\\nあなたが諜報したターンの間、その諜報であなたの墓地に置かれてそこにあるカードの中から、望む数の土地をプレイしたり望む数の呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。あなたがこれにより呪文を唱えるなら、マナ・コストを支払うのではなく、それのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 眼', 'flavor': '大方はディミーアが消されたと思っていた。ディミーアにとってはこの上なく好都合だった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650125&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33152572-ed38-4b4b-b347-313570453c6f', 'multiverseId': 650125}, 'multiverseid': 650125}]", "[{'name': 'Auge der Dämmerhülle', 'text': 'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nDu kannst von den Karten in deinem Friedhof, die du in diesem Zug überwacht hast, Länder spielen und Zaubersprüche wirken. Falls du auf diese Weise einen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags, statt seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Auge', 'flavor': 'Die meisten glaubten, die Dimir seien ausgelöscht worden. Das kam den Dimir sehr gelegen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651538&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f17991fa-3e2f-4162-ab49-c8d8fa5d236e', 'multiverseId': 651538}, 'multiverseid': 651538}, {'name': 'Œil de Manteaubrune', 'text': 'Vol, lien de vie\\nVous pouvez jouer des terrains et lancer des sorts parmi les cartes dans votre cimetière que vous avez surveillées ce tour-ci. Si vous lancez un sort de cette manière, vous payez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana à la place de payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Créature — œil', 'flavor': 'La plupart croyaient les Dimir anéantis. Ce qui leur convenait parfaitement.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651577&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22a6d584-c736-4240-b581-fdf90db31a92', 'multiverseId': 651577}, 'multiverseid': 651577}, {'name': 'ダスクマントルの目', 'text': '飛行、絆魂\\nあなたが諜報したターンの間、その諜報であなたの墓地に置かれてそこにあるカードの中から、望む数の土地をプレイしたり望む数の呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。あなたがこれにより呪文を唱えるなら、マナ・コストを支払うのではなく、それのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 眼', 'flavor': '大方はディミーアが壊滅したと思っていた。ディミーアにとってはこの上なく好都合だった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651616&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37ffaa6c-8448-4db9-8617-5a7ac8e55d7b', 'multiverseId': 651616}, 'multiverseid': 651616}, {'name': '暮篷之眼', 'text': '飞行，系命\\n你可以从你坟墓场内本回合刺探过的牌之中使用地和施放咒语。如果你以此法施放咒语，则你支付等同于其法术力值的生命，而不支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '生物 — 眼', 'flavor': '许多人以为底密尔惨遭灭门。这正合底密尔的意。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651655&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ad65fd6-c8c2-4f14-bb1a-9e54d4e3d929', 'multiverseId': 651655}, 'multiverseid': 651655}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungerter Chupacabra\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ausgehungerte Chupacabra ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'Durch die Entdeckung Orazcas kamen noch mehr Schrecken als nur die Immerwährende Sonne ans Licht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'432cffc1-8183-4c5c-8996-06877e550095\', \'multiverseId\': 650489}, \'multiverseid\': 650489}, {\'name\': \'Chupacabra vorace\', \'text\': "Quand le Chupacabra vorace arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature — bête et horreur\', \'flavor\': "L\'ouverture d\'Orazca a libéré bien plus d\'horreurs que le Soleil immortel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73033b13-5dc7-4b30-b79e-71fdd122765e\', \'multiverseId\': 650748}, \'multiverseid\': 650748}, {\'name\': \'Chupacabra Famelico\', \'text\': \'Quando il Chupacabra Famelico entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Bestia\', \'flavor\': "L\'apertura di Orazca ha liberato ben altri orrori oltre al Sole Immortale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'491fc85d-d4dc-4a2b-aa36-404744c7cc28\', \'multiverseId\': 651007}, \'multiverseid\': 651007}, {\'name\': \'貪欲なチュパカブラ\', \'text\': \'貪欲なチュパカブラが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'オラーズカが開くと、不滅の太陽以外にも多数の恐怖が解放された。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a2e69a6-853d-423e-967c-17830a9343f4\', \'multiverseId\': 651266}, \'multiverseid\': 651266}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausräuchern\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Du erhältst für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte Kreatur 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ghirapurs Gremlin-Population stellt eine Gefahr für die Infrastruktur des Messeplatzes dar. Gefahren müssen eliminiert werden."\\n—Sram, leitender Konstrukteur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650419&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a5e34c-5183-4f1d-95b2-c7612515a61e\', \'multiverseId\': 650419}, \'multiverseid\': 650419}, {\'name\': \'Fumigation\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« La population de gremlins de Ghirapur menace les infrastructures de la foire. Et les menaces doivent être éliminées. »\\n—Sram, chef édificateur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2a64f2d-9f99-40eb-966f-7c0b91c1dcbd\', \'multiverseId\': 650678}, \'multiverseid\': 650678}, {\'name\': \'Fumigare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature. Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La popolazione di gremlin di Ghirapur costituisce un fattore di rischio per le infrastrutture della Fiera. Ogni rischio deve essere eliminato."\\n—Sram, edificatore capo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'925e5301-f865-4d0a-b954-f7ad58a2d5af\', \'multiverseId\': 650937}, \'multiverseid\': 650937}, {\'name\': \'燻蒸\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。あなたは、これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ギラプールのグレムリン個体数は博覧会場の基盤に対する脅威となる。脅威は取り除くべきだ。」\\n――上級建設官、スラム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba1bc92a-412f-4e04-9d73-88b1ac2dd067\', \'multiverseId\': 651196}, \'multiverseid\': 651196}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Kanzlei\', \'text\': \'Die Azorius-Kanzlei kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Azorius-Kanzlei ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650602&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ec36463-1f26-4634-879c-6741594ba77b\', \'multiverseId\': 650602}, \'multiverseid\': 650602}, {\'name\': "Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f5ef393-a61c-43ad-a826-a4bf2315c15f\', \'multiverseId\': 650861}, \'multiverseid\': 650861}, {\'name\': \'Cancelleria Azorius\', \'text\': \'La Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3f5dfa-c37d-433d-a86c-3e60b833e0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 651120}, \'multiverseid\': 651120}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアゾリウスの大法官庁が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0467b0d-37a6-4c7d-a73c-a5ad03e050c4\', \'multiverseId\': 651379}, \'multiverseid\': 651379}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist wie ein Labyrinth gestaltet und verkörpert damit die Rechtsprechung der Azorius — eine feste Struktur, die viel aushalten kann und Veränderungen verhindern soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff90fd6f-f20f-4493-aec7-eb34261536c7\', \'multiverseId\': 650577}, \'multiverseid\': 650577}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Azorius", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le motif labyrinthique représente la base de la loi d\'Azorius — une structure stricte conçue pour briser les volontés et nuire à l\'évolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650836&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d2c3968-1085-458e-a777-ec877fd15ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 650836}, \'multiverseid\': 650836}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Lo stile labirintico rappresenta l\'essenza della legge Azorius: una rigida struttura progettata per mettere alla prova la determinazione e per impedire i cambiamenti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a776fd4-7733-4b71-8d9d-ed9f3e223850\', \'multiverseId\': 651095}, \'multiverseid\': 651095}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'迷路のような文様は、アゾリウスの法の中核を具現化している。意志を試し、変化を止める厳格な構造だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f63048b7-1a7b-4c66-875c-d6e1f2442355\', \'multiverseId\': 651354}, \'multiverseid\': 651354}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Commanders.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7922a7-bd27-4a30-837f-100fd23e4e96\', \'multiverseId\': 650609}, \'multiverseid\': 650609}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la défaite est proche et que les ordres viennent à manquer, tous les yeux se portent dans la même direction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65315347-4fa0-4725-aab1-5fd84c38e80d\', \'multiverseId\': 650868}, \'multiverseid\': 650868}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la sconfitta si avvicina e manca la guida, tutti gli occhi guardano in una sola direzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f0ef23b-9e8a-44d3-9e34-ce6cc5887424\', \'multiverseId\': 651127}, \'multiverseid\': 651127}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c96be69-54d1-4994-a733-9a5a7083a9da\', \'multiverseId\': 651386}, \'multiverseid\': 651386}]', "[{'name': 'Befestigtes Dorf', 'text': 'Sowie das Befestigte Dorf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Wald- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt das Befestigte Dorf getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650615&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a6904f1-3332-406b-9094-c1a1e98da1ab', 'multiverseId': 650615}, 'multiverseid': 650615}, {'name': 'Village fortifié', 'text': 'Au moment où le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de forêt ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650874&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '974aaf8c-3207-4e08-bb2a-9f4129d1d7dd', 'multiverseId': 650874}, 'multiverseid': 650874}, {'name': 'Villaggio Fortificato', 'text': 'Mentre il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Foresta o Pianura dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651133&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07b4f419-8c90-4f18-b4d4-6bacb557051a', 'multiverseId': 651133}, 'multiverseid': 651133}, {'name': '要塞化した村', 'text': '要塞化した村が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの手札にあり森や平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、要塞化した村はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651392&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2df6ec6e-bf21-4d38-b8af-57c90390b563', 'multiverseId': 651392}, 'multiverseid': 651392}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beherrschung des Unsichtbaren\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Permanent, das du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, erhältst du für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{3}{W}: Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650427&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ee0a54-f068-41de-ab71-ae86052fb111\', \'multiverseId\': 650427}, \'multiverseid\': 650427}, {\'name\': "Maîtrise de l\'inapparence", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\n{3}{W} : Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650686&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9329ab-6b33-487d-a9db-a595116d4ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 650686}, \'multiverseid\': 650686}, {\'name\': "Dominio dell\'Invisibile", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un permanente che controlli viene girato a faccia in su, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura che controlli.\\n{3}{W}: Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'357f1606-5542-46dc-adea-fbe2d40f956a\', \'multiverseId\': 650945}, \'multiverseid\': 650945}, {\'name\': \'見えざるものの熟達\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つが表向きになるたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\\n{3}{W}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。（それを裏向きで２/２のクリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edf880e-d5e0-47ef-958d-de9d9b043762\', \'multiverseId\': 651204}, \'multiverseid\': 651204}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belebung der Toten\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreaturenkarte in einem Friedhof\\nWenn die Belebung der Toten ins Spiel kommt und falls sie im Spiel ist, verliert sie „Verzaubert eine Kreaturenkarte in einem Friedhof" und erhält „Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die mit der Belebung der Toten ins Spiel gebracht wurde." Bringe die verzauberte Kreaturenkarte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel und lege die Belebung der Toten an sie an. Wenn die Belebung der Toten das Spiel verlässt, opfert der Beherrscher jener Kreatur sie.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c05dcf-f46d-4b11-b6dd-66e65dfa7100\', \'multiverseId\': 650478}, \'multiverseid\': 650478}, {\'name\': \'Animation des morts\', \'text\': "Enchanter : carte de créature dans un cimetière\\nQuand l\'Animation des morts arrive sur le champ de bataille, si elle est sur le champ de bataille, elle perd « Enchanter : carte de créature dans un cimetière » et acquiert « Enchanter : créature mise sur le champ de bataille avec l\'Animation des morts ». Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, la carte de créature enchantée et attachez-lui l\'Animation des morts. Quand l\'Animation des morts quitte le champ de bataille, le contrôleur de cette créature la sacrifie.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne -1/-0.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b175a47-5bc8-49e1-8150-48f1ee20b472\', \'multiverseId\': 650737}, \'multiverseid\': 650737}, {\'name\': \'Animare i Morti\', \'text\': \'Incanta carta creatura in un cimitero\\nQuando Animare i Morti entra nel campo di battaglia, se è sul campo di battaglia, perde "incanta carta creatura in un cimitero" e guadagna "incanta creatura messa sul campo di battaglia con Animare i Morti". Rimetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo la carta creatura incantata e assegna ad essa Animare i Morti. Quando Animare i Morti lascia il campo di battaglia, il controllore di quella creatura la sacrifica.\\nLa creatura incantata prende -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'905e6f1d-9e52-4f67-bb47-05767879f04e\', \'multiverseId\': 650996}, \'multiverseid\': 650996}, {\'name\': \'動く死体\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード）\\n動く死体が戦場に出たとき、それが戦場にある場合、これは「エンチャント（墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード）」を失い「エンチャント（動く死体によって戦場に出されたクリーチャー）」を得る。エンチャントしているクリーチャー・カードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻し、動く死体をそれにつける。動く死体が戦場を離れたとき、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーはそれを生け贄に捧げる。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90cc9572-a3ab-4426-aed9-f30b3d5d75a3\', \'multiverseId\': 651255}, \'multiverseid\': 651255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bennie Bracks, der Zoologe\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nZu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Seine enthusiastische Neugier beruhigt selbst die furchteinflößendsten Bestien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d5a8ce-bbf4-4b30-a35e-5b9c8c1dada9\', \'multiverseId\': 650410}, \'multiverseid\': 650410}, {\'name\': \'Bennie Bracks, zoologiste\', \'text\': \'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nAu début de chaque étape de fin, si vous avez créé un jeton ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'Sa curiosité enthousiaste calme même les bêtes les plus effrayantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650669&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0c2ded-354c-4a4f-9fbf-0090b40bd6a5\', \'multiverseId\': 650669}, \'multiverseid\': 650669}, {\'name\': \'Bennie Bracks, Zoologo\', \'text\': "Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nAll\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se hai creato una pedina in questo turno, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'La sua inguaribile curiosità mette a proprio agio anche le creature più spaventose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e10e8bd0-a7c5-43f6-9833-5fa09c88f879\', \'multiverseId\': 650928}, \'multiverseid\': 650928}, {\'name\': \'動物学者、ベニー・ブラックス\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\n各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していた場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'彼の熱狂的な好奇心は最も狂暴な獣をも落ち着かせる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a85754-024e-4f8f-802c-c7c1aee05a20\', \'multiverseId\': 651187}, \'multiverseid\': 651187}]', "[{'name': 'Beschützerin des Baus', 'text': 'Kreaturen, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die der Beschützerin des Baus, können sie nicht blocken.\\nMegamorph {1}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Megamorph-Kosten auf und lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nWenn die Beschützerin des Baus aufgedeckt wird, bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650522&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a722b440-397b-4df2-9713-c63f03064a18', 'multiverseId': 650522}, 'multiverseid': 650522}, {'name': 'Protectrice de la tanière', 'text': 'Les créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle de la Protectrice de la tanière ne peuvent pas la bloquer.\\nMégamue {1}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mégamue et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nQuand la Protectrice de la tanière est retournée face visible, renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Créature — humain et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650781&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0caefee8-6747-4de4-97e7-82a2e8fae842', 'multiverseId': 650781}, 'multiverseid': 650781}, {'name': 'Protettrice del Rifugio', 'text': 'Le creature con forza inferiore a quella della Protettrice del Rifugio non possono bloccarla.\\nMegamorfosi {1}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di megamorfosi e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nQuando la Protettrice del Rifugio viene girata a faccia in su, riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651040&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f36f48c3-e528-46c8-a1e3-b9bb99fcf8ff', 'multiverseId': 651040}, 'multiverseid': 651040}, {'name': '棲み家の防御者', 'text': '棲み家の防御者よりパワーが小さいクリーチャーでは、これをブロックできない。\\n大変異{1}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの大変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。そうしたなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n棲み家の防御者が表向きになったとき、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651299&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f0aa978-2621-4070-be67-be811133d8b3', 'multiverseId': 651299}, 'multiverseid': 651299}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bestienflüsterer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verstehe die kleinste Maus deutlicher als all die Stimmen der Massen auf der Zinnstraße."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b75300-d420-4b8b-b0be-2ffb8af3c104\', \'multiverseId\': 650519}, \'multiverseid\': 650519}, {\'name\': \'Chuchoteur de bête\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Pour moi, la plus petite souris s\'exprime plus clairement que tous les badauds du festival de la Rue d\'étain. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6a25fe1-132c-4766-bd63-f497a46c9fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 650778}, \'multiverseid\': 650778}, {\'name\': \'Sussurratore delle Bestie\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Alle mie orecchie, il topolino più minuscolo risuona più chiaro delle folle alla fiera di Via Latta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d84e6f6c-9ac0-41a4-a22e-140bd0c11b19\', \'multiverseId\': 651037}, \'multiverseid\': 651037}, {\'name\': \'獣に囁く者\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「ちっぽけなネズミでも、その声はブリキ通りの祭騒ぎよりも大きく聞こえる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0f66508-f1a9-40de-86b0-7a09d6819c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 651296}, \'multiverseid\': 651296}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestätigter Verdacht\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\\nStelle dreimal Nachforschungen an. (Um Nachforschungen anzustellen, erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder hat irgendetwas zu verbergen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650450&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee2e4d7-9f4b-41a9-af15-b2114a66910a\', \'multiverseId\': 650450}, \'multiverseid\': 650450}, {\'name\': \'Confirmation des soupçons\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort ciblé.\\nEnquêtez trois fois. (Pour enquêter, créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Tout le monde a quelque chose à cacher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650709&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc239c3-801e-4771-befc-f08dcd69e74f\', \'multiverseId\': 650709}, \'multiverseid\': 650709}, {\'name\': \'Confermare i Sospetti\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\\nIndaga tre volte. (Per indagare, crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Tutti hanno qualcosa da nascondere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1087a1e-2f1a-45c7-ba39-752683e940cd\', \'multiverseId\': 650968}, \'multiverseid\': 650968}, {\'name\': \'疑惑の裏付け\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\\n３回調査を行う。（調査を行うとは、手掛かり・トークン１つを生成することである。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'誰にでも秘密がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e8527d7-301d-43bf-92b4-56659ffa6af3\', \'multiverseId\': 651227}, \'multiverseid\': 651227}]', "[{'name': 'Bewässertes Ackerland', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDas Bewässerte Ackerland kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650620&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9038b06-18c9-4797-b0bb-cb28473a7683', 'multiverseId': 650620}, 'multiverseid': 650620}, {'name': 'Terres arables irriguées', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLes Terres arables irriguées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain — plaine et île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650879&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '451385e6-0b68-4c52-8b3f-f1f4af15419e', 'multiverseId': 650879}, 'multiverseid': 650879}, {'name': 'Colture Irrigate', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nLe Colture Irrigate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651138&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f17224ab-1db1-4d85-9d5d-2383ca47637d', 'multiverseId': 651138}, 'multiverseid': 651138}, {'name': '灌漑農地', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\n灌漑農地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651397&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a2ee481-ef97-4b0e-9970-38766f6b71b7', 'multiverseId': 651397}, 'multiverseid': 651397}]", '[{\'name\': \'Biotronisches Bestiarium\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wendest du Hellsicht 1 an.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, kannst du {G} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Inspiration findet man, wenn man nach außen sieht."\\n—Oviya Pashiri, weise Biotronikerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94c1fb7-e354-4023-8807-c54a97c93e4c\', \'multiverseId\': 650584}, \'multiverseid\': 650584}, {\'name\': \'Bestiaire du façonneur de vie\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, regard 1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, vous pouvez payer {G}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'inspiration se trouve à l\'extérieur. »\\n—Oviya Pashiri, sage façonneuse de vie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24da041a-4c47-4079-99e0-e6fea6d01f05\', \'multiverseId\': 650843}, \'multiverseid\': 650843}, {\'name\': \'Bestiario del Forgiavita\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, profetizza 1.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, puoi pagare {G}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ispirazione si trova guardando ciò che si ha di fronte."\\n—Oviya Pashiri, saggia forgiavita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b063687-0b23-45be-b196-b6e1a501e956\', \'multiverseId\': 651102}, \'multiverseid\': 651102}, {\'name\': \'造命師の動物記\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、占術１を行う。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたは{G}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「発想というものは外部を見つめることから得られるのです。」\\n――造命の賢者、オビア・パースリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bedfd7c-875e-4c72-9146-93437695e4db\', \'multiverseId\': 651361}, \'multiverseid\': 651361}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blick aus einer anderen Welt\', \'text\': \'Überwachen 3. (Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\\nRückblende {1}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e4b1c9-0c54-4e28-aa20-a9e33761232c\', \'multiverseId\': 650468}, \'multiverseid\': 650468}, {\'name\': \'Regard fantasmagorique\', \'text\': "Surveillez 3. (Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)\\nFlashback {1}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650727&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76462873-29c3-475e-b116-44457de7546c\', \'multiverseId\': 650727}, \'multiverseid\': 650727}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo Soprannaturale\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 3. (Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\\nFlashback {1}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f6e8ccc-37df-48ab-b437-6dfd3b867102\', \'multiverseId\': 650986}, \'multiverseid\': 650986}, {\'name\': \'異世界の凝視\', \'text\': \'諜報３を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード３枚を見て、そのうち望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\\nフラッシュバック{1}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee71f7a-4613-4097-8556-4aa607ed8f70\', \'multiverseId\': 651245}, \'multiverseid\': 651245}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzbeugerin\', \'text\': \'Verkleidung {1}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur mit Abwehr {2} wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Verkleidungskosten auf.)\\nWenn die Blitzbeugerin aufgedeckt wird, kannst du neue Ziele für eine beliebige Anzahl an anderen Zaubersprüchen und/oder Fähigkeiten bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Du solltest wirklich besser zielen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b453c76f-4c3a-483a-8dac-9ac52e38c055\', \'multiverseId\': 650008}, \'multiverseid\': 650008}, {\'name\': "Plie-l\'éclair", \'text\': "Déguisement {1}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée pour {3} comme une créature 2/2 avec parade {2}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de déguisement.)\\nQuand la Plie-l\'éclair est retournée face visible, vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour n\'importe quel nombre d\'autres sorts et/ou capacités.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous devriez vraiment apprendre à viser. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70961c2e-4002-4f56-9132-ef339fd4ac34\', \'multiverseId\': 650048}, \'multiverseid\': 650048}, {\'name\': \'Piegasaette\', \'text\': \'Camuffare {1}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 con egida {2} pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di camuffare.)\\nQuando la Piegasaette viene girata a faccia in su, puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per un qualsiasi numero di altre magie e/o abilità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Dovresti davvero imparare a prendere la mira."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a59d05d-a318-4ef8-8cdb-62f18a43a68d\', \'multiverseId\': 650088}, \'multiverseid\': 650088}, {\'name\': \'稲妻を曲げる者\', \'text\': \'変装{1}{R}（このカードを、{3}で護法{2}を持つ２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変装コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\\n稲妻を曲げる者が表向きになったとき、これでない望む数の呪文や能力の新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「そんなのじゃ当たらないよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa4133e-47df-4b40-960c-ddc90fa2a210\', \'multiverseId\': 650128}, \'multiverseid\': 650128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzbeugerin\', \'text\': \'Verkleidung {1}{R}\\nWenn die Blitzbeugerin aufgedeckt wird, kannst du neue Ziele für eine beliebige Anzahl an anderen Zaubersprüchen und/oder Fähigkeiten bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Du solltest wirklich besser zielen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa42cf41-cc04-4b22-a229-ee9bedeeaefa\', \'multiverseId\': 651541}, \'multiverseid\': 651541}, {\'name\': "Plie-l\'éclair", \'text\': "Déguisement {1}{R}\\nQuand la Plie-l\'éclair est retournée face visible, vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour n\'importe quel nombre d\'autres sorts et/ou capacités.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous devriez vraiment apprendre à viser. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd94b358-6bea-4f47-8dc6-1e747723cb6c\', \'multiverseId\': 651580}, \'multiverseid\': 651580}, {\'name\': \'稲妻を曲げる者\', \'text\': \'変装{1}{R}\\n稲妻を曲げる者が表向きになったとき、この能力でない望む数の呪文や能力の新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「そんなのじゃ当たらないよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46770fa1-b255-4cde-8018-91412b5aab33\', \'multiverseId\': 651619}, \'multiverseid\': 651619}, {\'name\': \'曲电师\', \'text\': \'伪装{1}{R}\\n当曲电师翻回正面时，你可以为任意数量的其他咒语和／或异能选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你真该练练你的准头。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db471591-3955-4cd9-981b-a4eb682fbcb9\', \'multiverseId\': 651658}, \'multiverseid\': 651658}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdürstige Klinge\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\n{1}: Lege die Blutdürstige Klinge an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Diese Waffe führt die Hand, die sie umklammert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650578&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2db1954-7384-4078-bb20-19d625986a45\', \'multiverseId\': 650578}, \'multiverseid\': 650578}, {\'name\': \'Lame assoiffée de sang\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\n{1} : Attachez la Lame assoiffée de sang à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': "C\'est l\'arme qui manie la main.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650837&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b00cbc6-0c72-4ec1-8f08-12eee61137eb\', \'multiverseId\': 650837}, \'multiverseid\': 650837}, {\'name\': \'Lama Assetata di Sangue\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\n{1}: Assegna la Lama Assetata di Sangue a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "È l\'arma a brandire la mano che la impugna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4335a25-5330-4d74-a219-47917187908c\', \'multiverseId\': 651096}, \'multiverseid\': 651096}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受け、使嗾されている。（それは各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\n{1}：対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。血に飢えた刃をそれにつける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'その武器は持つ者の手を利用する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e42783ae-ad04-484c-a983-f164fff62797\', \'multiverseId\': 651355}, \'multiverseid\': 651355}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Panorama\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDas Blätterdach-Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kontinent Murasa liegt unter einem dichten Blätterdach verborgen, die Vegetation so verwachsen, dass seine Einwohner niemals den Boden erblicken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb5ac46f-ba25-483a-a552-7878b1ba0c84\', \'multiverseId\': 650605}, \'multiverseid\': 650605}, {\'name\': \'Vue de la canopée\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLa Vue de la canopée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "Le continent de Murasa est protégé par une épaisse couche de végétation, dont les énormes branches s\'enchevêtrent si étroitement que certains habitants ne voient jamais le sol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4100abaf-3729-4634-b82f-05b905dc44fb\', \'multiverseId\': 650864}, \'multiverseid\': 650864}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Fronde\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.)\\nIl Panorama di Fronde entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Pianura\', \'flavor\': \'Il continente di Murasa giace sotto una coltre di fitta vegetazione, dagli enormi rami aggrovigliati così strettamente che alcuni dei suoi abitanti non vedono mai il suolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b92d99-03e8-43b5-a322-28e09125ff2e\', \'multiverseId\': 651123}, \'multiverseid\': 651123}, {\'name\': \'梢の眺望\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、梢の眺望はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'ムラーサ大陸は密生する植生に覆われている。巨大な木々の曲がりくねった枝が稠密に重なっており、ここに住む人々の中には、地面を見たことのない者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b74178b-86ba-407e-8a35-e82c6329cc9f\', \'multiverseId\': 651382}, \'multiverseid\': 651382}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568d60cc-309f-45e1-844e-35a02af1f044\', \'multiverseId\': 650603}, \'multiverseid\': 650603}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': "Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f63329f5-25b4-46af-bb09-fb94129d82ea\', \'multiverseId\': 650862}, \'multiverseid\': 650862}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a463e4f-d9e5-413d-bc59-21ae80e9e845\', \'multiverseId\': 651121}, \'multiverseid\': 651121}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615057b3-4944-4e5c-9c2c-2961b52e8422\', \'multiverseId\': 651380}, \'multiverseid\': 651380}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Abwäger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn dem Boros-Abwäger Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{R/W}: Der Boros-Abwäger erhält Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Stell dir ein Gewitter vor, das gleichzeitig ein taktisches Genie ist. Das ist er."\\n—Dars Gostok, Feuerfaust-Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0540e462-f1db-498c-bde7-dd9c43bd3bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 650554}, \'multiverseid\': 650554}, {\'name\': \'Héliaste de Boros\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Héliaste de Boros subit des blessures, il inflige autant de blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n{R/W} : L\'Héliaste de Boros acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — minotaure et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Imaginez un orage violent doublé d\'un fin tacticien. C\'est lui. »\\n—Dars Gostok, capitaine Poingdefeu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed186973-e855-44e5-a7b7-70017a54dc0c\', \'multiverseId\': 650813}, \'multiverseid\': 650813}, {\'name\': \'Censore Boros\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno al Censore Boros, esso infligge altrettanti danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n{R/W}: Il Censore Boros ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Immagina una tempesta che sia anche un genio militare. Ecco, è lui."\\n—Dars Gostok, capitano del Pugno Infuocato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9eb6f3b-e829-481c-803f-567f77285dd3\', \'multiverseId\': 651072}, \'multiverseid\': 651072}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの反攻者\', \'text\': \'ボロスの反攻者がダメージを受けるたび、１つを対象とする。ボロスの反攻者はそれに、その点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n{R/W}：ターン終了時まで、ボロスの反攻者は先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「天才的な戦術眼を持ち合わせた雷雨を想像してくれ。それがあいつだ。」\\n――火拳の隊長、ダース・ゴストク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7b90ba-b547-41b6-8eb1-9eaeee870c79\', \'multiverseId\': 651331}, \'multiverseid\': 651331}]', "[{'name': 'Boros-Garnison', 'text': 'Die Boros-Garnison kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Boros-Garnison ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650604&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee5fa590-dc5c-4f11-861c-4786d11e7787', 'multiverseId': 650604}, 'multiverseid': 650604}, {'name': 'Garnison de Boros', 'text': 'La Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650863&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd9f3c02-8f12-479d-b878-ced19018074e', 'multiverseId': 650863}, 'multiverseid': 650863}, {'name': 'Presidio Boros', 'text': 'Il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651122&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7730d76-2714-4522-9206-0c2a9ae86450', 'multiverseId': 651122}, 'multiverseid': 651122}, {'name': 'ボロスの駐屯地', 'text': 'ボロスの駐屯地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボロスの駐屯地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651381&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '669ed6e7-4b9a-4b5b-8418-a4610a016e22', 'multiverseId': 651381}, 'multiverseid': 651381}]", "[{'name': 'Brutpflegender Nantuko', 'text': 'Immer wenn dem Brutpflegenden Nantuko Schaden zugefügt wird, kannst du entsprechend viele 1/1 grüne Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine erzeugen.\\nMorph {2}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650520&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e3c6ecc-7299-4b8c-b4d1-c9c10bf37058', 'multiverseId': 650520}, 'multiverseid': 650520}, {'name': 'Nantuko de la couvée', 'text': 'À chaque fois que le Nantuko de la couvée subit des blessures, vous pouvez créer autant de jetons de créature 1/1 verte Insecte.\\nMue {2}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)', 'type': 'Créature — insecte et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650779&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f972a956-7a38-450c-81dc-3e8ebb73e9bf', 'multiverseId': 650779}, 'multiverseid': 650779}, {'name': 'Nantuko Covanidiata', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno al Nantuko Covanidiata, puoi creare altrettante pedine creatura Insetto 1/1 verdi.\\nMetamorfosi {2}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651038&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '596c7260-ac6d-4b2b-96b8-23f1749b23da', 'multiverseId': 651038}, 'multiverseid': 651038}, {'name': '大群を産むナントゥーコ', 'text': '大群を産むナントゥーコがダメージを受けるたび、その点数に等しい数の、緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを生成してもよい。\\n変異{2}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651297&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67c1dd25-6e84-40a4-9b2b-5f7e4d3dacd4', 'multiverseId': 651297}, 'multiverseid': 651297}]", "[{'name': 'Buch der Legenden', 'text': 'Das Buch der Legenden kommt mit einer Seitenmarke ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn dein Commander ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, lege eine Seitenmarke auf das Buch der Legenden.\\n{1}, {T}, entferne eine Seitenmarke vom Buch der Legenden: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650599&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84a56eb6-902c-4850-821d-f9f0394200b2', 'multiverseId': 650599}, 'multiverseid': 650599}, {'name': 'Grimoire des légendes', 'text': 'Le Grimoire des légendes arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « page » sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois que votre commandant arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire des légendes.\\n{1}, {T}, retirez un marqueur « page » du Grimoire des légendes : Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650858&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a02123b-c161-4113-afcc-e06185b26731', 'multiverseId': 650858}, 'multiverseid': 650858}, {'name': 'Tomo delle Leggende', 'text': 'Il Tomo delle Leggende entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino pagina.\\nOgniqualvolta il tuo comandante entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, metti un segnalino pagina sul Tomo delle Leggende.\\n{1}, {T}, Rimuovi un segnalino pagina dal Tomo delle Leggende: Pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651117&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '437259f6-c281-454b-a144-85b624d9c31f', 'multiverseId': 651117}, 'multiverseid': 651117}, {'name': '伝説たちの秘本', 'text': '伝説たちの秘本はページ・カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたの統率者が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、伝説たちの秘本の上にページ・カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}, {T}, 伝説たちの秘本の上からページ・カウンター１個を取り除く：カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651376&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee07394a-c7ee-4c8f-b14f-fc2b73f4ea9e', 'multiverseId': 651376}, 'multiverseid': 651376}]", '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer eines Permanents deiner Wahl mischt es in seine Bibliothek und deckt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Permanent-Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e371f5b-57d2-41f2-9898-0df15cb4e7bb\', \'multiverseId\': 650502}, \'multiverseid\': 650502}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire d\'un permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f283ec-add8-4b18-af05-a475be6497d3\', \'multiverseId\': 650761}, \'multiverseid\': 650761}, {\'name\': \'Distorsione Caotica\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi rivela la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, la mette sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6bce336-5d9f-4bdb-8041-292a81f09f60\', \'multiverseId\': 651020}, \'multiverseid\': 651020}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後、自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それがパーマネント・カードなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5927b00e-f02f-4868-8418-4ddc9dd1b5ec\', \'multiverseId\': 651279}, \'multiverseid\': 651279}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosverschlinger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Chaosverschlinger ins Spiel kommt, stachle für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die jener Gegner kontrolliert. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf den Chaosverschlinger, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der Kreaturen ist, die auf diese Weise angestachelt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650009&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'993ae8b1-860c-4988-a955-8f97fd99cc1d\', \'multiverseId\': 650009}, \'multiverseid\': 650009}, {\'name\': \'Dévoreur de ravages\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Dévoreur de ravages arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, incitez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que cet adversaire contrôle. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Dévoreur de ravages, X étant la force totale des créatures incitées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650049&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb906bfc-f73a-4ab7-8c03-1fd2d8060f86\', \'multiverseId\': 650049}, \'multiverseid\': 650049}, {\'name\': \'Divoracaos\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Divoracaos entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni avversario, sprona fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quell\'avversario. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 sul Divoracaos, dove X è la forza totale delle creature spronate in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'635f03a6-83aa-4d18-988b-7a874cd98703\', \'multiverseId\': 650089}, \'multiverseid\': 650089}, {\'name\': \'騒乱喰い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n騒乱喰いが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それらを使嗾する。騒乱喰いの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘは、これにより使嗾されたクリーチャーのパワーの合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de07b156-b543-4879-9445-2c8afbd23ca4\', \'multiverseId\': 650129}, \'multiverseid\': 650129}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosverschlinger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Chaosverschlinger ins Spiel kommt, stachle für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die jener Gegner kontrolliert. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf den Chaosverschlinger, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der Kreaturen ist, die auf diese Weise angestachelt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac5304e7-95cb-49ca-93fd-e42146127aba\', \'multiverseId\': 651542}, \'multiverseid\': 651542}, {\'name\': \'Dévoreur de ravages\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Dévoreur de ravages arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, incitez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que cet adversaire contrôle. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Dévoreur de ravages, X étant la force totale des créatures incitées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5abce4c3-da3b-4934-b308-a8c260608010\', \'multiverseId\': 651581}, \'multiverseid\': 651581}, {\'name\': \'騒乱喰い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n騒乱喰いが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それらを使嗾する。騒乱喰いの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘは、これにより使嗾されたクリーチャーのパワーの合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af723669-baf8-40bd-abc1-bea90e673aa0\', \'multiverseId\': 651620}, \'multiverseid\': 651620}, {\'name\': \'噬荒灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当噬荒灵进战场时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～煽惑至多一个目标由其操控的生物。在噬荒灵上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为以此法煽惑之生物的力量总和。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21387701-9fc6-43e2-b22c-01be148b5c68\', \'multiverseId\': 651659}, \'multiverseid\': 651659}]', "[{'name': 'Chulane der Geschichtenerzähler', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, ziehst du eine Karte, dann kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\\n{3}, {T}: Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650555&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1530a145-fe92-42d2-a013-bb0b60710538', 'multiverseId': 650555}, 'multiverseid': 650555}, {'name': 'Chulane, conteur de fables', 'text': 'Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, piochez une carte, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.\\n{3}, {T} : Renvoyez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — humain et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650814&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5df58f07-ecc3-40fc-addc-a193f99da95c', 'multiverseId': 650814}, 'multiverseid': 650814}, {'name': 'Chulene, Narratore di Racconti', 'text': 'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, pesca una carta, poi puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.\\n{3}, {T}: Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651073&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dbcc708-aad3-4643-9270-543f8b495167', 'multiverseId': 651073}, 'multiverseid': 651073}, {'name': '伝承の語り部、チュレイン', 'text': '警戒\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\\n{3}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651332&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a6e192c-1a6f-4dc1-9547-561924813c5b', 'multiverseId': 651332}, 'multiverseid': 651332}]", '[{\'name\': \'Connive // Concoct // Connive // Concoct\', \'text\': \'Übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 2 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei // Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Connive // Concoct\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3714f9-d81f-41b5-9289-41a22153abbb\', \'multiverseId\': 650556}, \'multiverseid\': 650556}, {\'name\': \'Connive // Concoct // Connive // Concoct\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée avec une force inférieure ou égale à 2.", \'type\': \'Rituel // Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Connive // Concoct\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5341a5f5-351e-4804-b587-75bb41201f95\', \'multiverseId\': 650815}, \'multiverseid\': 650815}, {\'name\': \'Connive // Concoct // Connive // Concoct\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria // Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Connive // Concoct\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b05c2a-09a2-450a-a696-02612b1d0f59\', \'multiverseId\': 651074}, \'multiverseid\': 651074}, {\'name\': \'Connive // Concoct // Connive // Concoct\', \'text\': \'パワーが２以下であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー // ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Connive // Concoct\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'234754d1-7f3f-4e79-9a19-41db2378f92f\', \'multiverseId\': 651333}, \'multiverseid\': 651333}]', '[{\'name\': \'Darien, König von Kjeldor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn dir Schaden zugefügt wird, kannst du entsprechend viele 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Nachdem sein Traum von der Einheit erfüllt worden war, wurde Darien zum letzten König von Kjeldor. Seine Nachfolger dienten als Könige des neuen vereinigten Argivia."\\n—Kjeldor: Eiszivilisation\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650412&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23cae77a-1947-451e-9073-1fcfb3840df2\', \'multiverseId\': 650412}, \'multiverseid\': 650412}, {\'name\': \'Darien, roi du Kjeldor\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous subissez des blessures, vous pouvez créer autant de jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Ayant concrétisé son rêve de réunification, Darien devint le dernier roi du Kjeldor. Ses successeurs furent les rois de la Nouvelle Argive. »\\n—Kjeldor : Civilisation glaciaire\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650671&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87fbe7e1-b3ed-48fa-a0cd-8ab4689425e0\', \'multiverseId\': 650671}, \'multiverseid\': 650671}, {\'name\': \'Darien, Re di Kjeldor\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta ti viene inflitto danno, puoi creare altrettante pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Dopo aver soddisfatto il proprio sogno di unificazione, Darien divenne l\\\'ultimo re di Kjeldor. Coloro che gli fecero seguito furono chiamati re di Nuova Argivia."\\n—Kjeldor: Civiltà dei Ghiacci\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6715da61-7599-4997-beed-65b20480a2d9\', \'multiverseId\': 650930}, \'multiverseid\': 650930}, {\'name\': \'キイェルドーの王、ダリアン\', \'text\': \'あなたがダメージを受けるたび、その点数に等しい数の、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ダリアンは統一の夢を達成したことで、キイェルドーの最後の王になった。その後を継ぐ王達は新アルガイヴの王として知られている。」\\n――「キイェルドー：氷の文明」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e44105-fd25-4a57-b118-736fa1a63856\', \'multiverseId\': 651189}, \'multiverseid\': 651189}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Köder schlucken\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur während des Zuges eines Gegners und nur während des Kampfes.\\nVerhindere allen Kampfschaden, der dir und Planeswalkern, die du kontrollierst, in diesem Zug zugefügt würde. Enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen und stachle sie an. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df9e093-0982-4210-91ee-b1fb1ee31e31\', \'multiverseId\': 650021}, \'multiverseid\': 650021}, {\'name\': "Mordre à l\'hameçon", \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort que pendant le tour d\'un adversaire et que pendant le combat.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées à vous et aux planeswalkers que vous contrôlez ce tour-ci. Dégagez toutes les créatures attaquantes et incitez-les. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650061&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'250654b8-99c4-4f6a-8868-22da28bec904\', \'multiverseId\': 650061}, \'multiverseid\': 650061}, {\'name\': \'Abboccare\', \'text\': "Lancia questa magia solo durante il turno di un avversario e solo durante il combattimento.\\nPrevieni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto a te e ai planeswalker che controlli in questo turno. STAPpa tutte le creature attaccanti e spronale. Dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a9d8f0-ec28-4b78-a6fe-21db89caf931\', \'multiverseId\': 650101}, \'multiverseid\': 650101}, {\'name\': \'売られた喧嘩\', \'text\': \'この呪文は、対戦相手のターンの戦闘中にしか唱えられない。\\nこのターン、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーが受けるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップし、それらを使嗾する。このフェイズの後に、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f573c294-d2b0-4456-8238-5debf5d1435e\', \'multiverseId\': 650141}, \'multiverseid\': 650141}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Köder schlucken\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur während des Zuges eines Gegners und nur während des Kampfes.\\nVerhindere allen Kampfschaden, der dir und Planeswalkern, die du kontrollierst, in diesem Zug zugefügt würde. Enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen und stachle sie an. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ffa221-3565-4d40-a70e-0cb4d3fc375a\', \'multiverseId\': 651554}, \'multiverseid\': 651554}, {\'name\': "Mordre à l\'hameçon", \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort que pendant le tour d\'un adversaire et que pendant le combat.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées à vous et aux planeswalkers que vous contrôlez ce tour-ci. Dégagez toutes les créatures attaquantes et incitez-les. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651593&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b58dc8-25ab-45ac-b052-031878093a09\', \'multiverseId\': 651593}, \'multiverseid\': 651593}, {\'name\': \'売られた喧嘩\', \'text\': \'この呪文は、対戦相手のターンの戦闘中にしか唱えられない。\\nこのターン、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーが受けるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップし、それらを使嗾する。このフェイズの後に、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c984d537-07aa-4289-bef6-5af0457ce157\', \'multiverseId\': 651632}, \'multiverseid\': 651632}, {\'name\': \'吞饵上钩\', \'text\': \'只能于对手的回合中施放此咒语，且仅限战斗中。\\n于本回合中，防止将对你和由你操控之鹏洛客造成的所有战斗伤害。重置所有进行攻击的生物并煽惑它们。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a58f8c4-83e0-485b-a284-6b977b8e0d26\', \'multiverseId\': 651671}, \'multiverseid\': 651671}]', '[{\'name\': \'Desinformationskampagne\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Desinformationskampagne ins Spiel kommt, ziehst du eine Karte und jeder Gegner wirft eine Karte ab.\\nImmer wenn du Überwachen anwendest, bringe die Desinformationskampagne auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Leute werden schon bald die süßen Lügen der bitteren Wahrheit vorziehen."\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ee8036-692b-4da4-a88b-e39916167d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 650561}, \'multiverseid\': 650561}, {\'name\': \'Campagne de désinformation\', \'text\': "Quand la Campagne de désinformation arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous piochez une carte et chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surveillez, renvoyez la Campagne de désinformation dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Les gens préfèrent avaler de doux mensonges plutôt que mâcher la vérité crue. »\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c542cba8-17af-4218-8445-7cb71eb61063\', \'multiverseId\': 650820}, \'multiverseid\': 650820}, {\'name\': \'Campagna di Disinformazione\', \'text\': \'Quando la Campagna di Disinformazione entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta e ogni avversario scarta una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta sorvegli, fai tornare la Campagna di Disinformazione in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La gente preferisce assaporare dolci menzogne che digerire l\\\'amara verità."\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad6c588e-2d64-4a76-80c7-75538a2ed1c4\', \'multiverseId\': 651079}, \'multiverseid\': 651079}, {\'name\': \'虚報活動\', \'text\': \'虚報活動が戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を引き、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\\nあなたが諜報を行うたび、虚報活動をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「人々は味気のない真実を噛むことよりも甘い嘘を味わうことを好む。」\\n――ラザーヴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056c3f09-c5ff-4637-8aff-602d78ac71b1\', \'multiverseId\': 651338}, \'multiverseid\': 651338}]', '[{\'name\': \'Detektivin des Monats\', \'text\': \'Aufstieg (Falls du zehn oder mehr Permanente kontrollierst, erhältst du für den Rest der Partie den Segen der Stadt.)\\nSolange du den Segen der Stadt hast, können Detektive, die du kontrollierst, nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen und blauen Detektiv-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'822bdf4b-8986-4c14-8e17-cfb86ff4eefc\', \'multiverseId\': 649999}, \'multiverseid\': 649999}, {\'name\': \'Meilleure détective du mois\', \'text\': "Ascension (Si vous contrôlez au moins dix permanents, vous gagnez l\'agrément de la cité pour le reste de la partie.)\\nTant que vous avez l\'agrément de la cité, les détectives que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être bloqués.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche et bleue Détective.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650039&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d100250-a3f6-4d1d-bf66-6c7b41e1743e\', \'multiverseId\': 650039}, \'multiverseid\': 650039}, {\'name\': \'Detective del Mese\', \'text\': \'Ascesa (Se controlli dieci o più permanenti, ottieni la benedizione della città per il resto della partita.)\\nFintanto che hai la benedizione della città, i Detective che controlli non possono essere bloccati.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Detective 2/2 bianca e blu.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Detective Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac00d95-76f7-4f95-b55a-dcbf8f51fad6\', \'multiverseId\': 650079}, \'multiverseid\': 650079}, {\'name\': \'月間最優秀探偵\', \'text\': \'昇殿（あなたが10個以上のパーマネントをコントロールしているなら、このゲームの間、あなたは都市の承認を得る。）\\nあなたが都市の承認を持っているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしている探偵はブロックされない。\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、白青の２/２の探偵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1151ce32-2d74-42ec-a3ec-50f972d79c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 650119}, \'multiverseid\': 650119}]', '[{\'name\': \'Detektivin des Monats\', \'text\': \'Aufstieg\\nSolange du den Segen der Stadt hast, können Detektive, die du kontrollierst, nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen und blauen Detektiv-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132d6acf-0021-4168-abc6-b5df80add81f\', \'multiverseId\': 651532}, \'multiverseid\': 651532}, {\'name\': \'Meilleure détective du mois\', \'text\': "ascension\\nTant que vous avez l\'agrément de la cité, les détectives que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être bloqués.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche et bleue Détective.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2d6f13b-3c56-4e04-b4e6-b6a381485a8f\', \'multiverseId\': 651571}, \'multiverseid\': 651571}, {\'name\': \'月間最優秀探偵\', \'text\': \'昇殿\\nあなたが都市の承認を持っているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしている探偵はブロックされない。\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、白青の２/２の探偵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0694872-e912-4fae-a0a1-6589e344354d\', \'multiverseId\': 651610}, \'multiverseid\': 651610}, {\'name\': \'月度侦探\', \'text\': \'登殿\\n只要你有黄金城祝福，由你操控的侦探便不能被阻挡。\\n每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，派出一个2/2，白蓝双色的侦探衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2569c171-f5c0-47a6-8463-b42bbb55bc67\', \'multiverseId\': 651649}, \'multiverseid\': 651649}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dezimieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl. (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch nur wirken, falls du legale Wahlmöglichkeiten für alle seine Ziele hast.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt viele Arten von Anarchie: sozial, individuell, Gruul …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ec6738c-1303-4941-b086-0af0670a3ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 650557}, \'multiverseid\': 650557}, {\'name\': \'Décimation\', \'text\': "Détruisez un artefact ciblé, une créature ciblée, un enchantement ciblé et un terrain ciblé. (Vous ne pouvez pas lancer ce sort à moins que vous n\'ayez des choix légaux pour toutes ses cibles.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchie se présente sous bien des formes : sociale, individuelle, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650816&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede2b760-545b-4d7e-ae86-baf08e9ed927\', \'multiverseId\': 650816}, \'multiverseid\': 650816}, {\'name\': \'Decimare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio, una creatura bersaglio, un incantesimo bersaglio e una terra bersaglio. (Non puoi lanciare questa magia a meno che tu non possa compiere scelte legali per tutti i suoi bersagli.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchia può assumere diverse forme: sociale, individuale, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe521fd-94bc-4e2c-9988-3b5522af3a99\', \'multiverseId\': 651075}, \'multiverseid\': 651075}, {\'name\': \'大量破壊\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、エンチャント１つを対象とし、土地１つを対象とする。それらを破壊する。（すべての対象を適正に選択しないかぎり、この呪文を唱えられない。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'無秩序とはさまざまな形態で存在する――社会、個人、グルール……。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b6491b5-3e5d-4f68-815d-b3aa69bb1023\', \'multiverseId\': 651334}, \'multiverseid\': 651334}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Mächtigen stürzen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke größer ist als die Stärke einer Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es hat die Richtigen getroffen."\\n—Junkerin Imalia, Retterin von Thiswick\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650418&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c78db9c-b1a3-4307-ba10-efbba4864340\', \'multiverseId\': 650418}, \'multiverseid\': 650418}, {\'name\': \'Anéantir les puissants\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure à la force d\'une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ils ne l\'ont pas volé. »\\n—Écuyère Imalia, libératrice de Thiswick", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650677&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'881da72a-37de-40a7-99f4-f1c69cdfa81f\', \'multiverseId\': 650677}, \'multiverseid\': 650677}, {\'name\': \'Distruggere i Potenti\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature con forza superiore alla forza di una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se la sono cercata."\\n—Scudiera Imalia, salvatrice di Thiswick\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd6b940e-aba5-4489-84e6-8668d5f8e51b\', \'multiverseId\': 650936}, \'multiverseid\': 650936}, {\'name\': \'強者破り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのパワーより大きいパワーを持つすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「当然の報いよ。」\\n――ティースウィークの救世主、従者イマリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f720ada-6718-454d-9b8b-abab12ce23e3\', \'multiverseId\': 651195}, \'multiverseid\': 651195}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Abhörwanze\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nImmer wenn du Überwachen anwendest, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Dimir-Abhörwanze.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Geh einfach davon aus, dass jedes Gespräch aufgezeichnet wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd7c593-505f-407e-9de2-3f3749968c15\', \'multiverseId\': 650559}, \'multiverseid\': 650559}, {\'name\': \'Insecte-espion de Dimir\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMenace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surveillez, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Insecte-espion de Dimir.", \'type\': \'Créature — insecte\', \'flavor\': \'Partez du principe que toutes les conversations sont enregistrées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e7d20a3-3db2-418f-b3ef-9e70ad7a4aea\', \'multiverseId\': 650818}, \'multiverseid\': 650818}, {\'name\': \'Spiottero Dimir\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nMinacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nOgniqualvolta sorvegli, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sullo Spiottero Dimir.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Meglio dare per scontato che qualsiasi conversazione sia di pubblico dominio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7f3d8c2-184e-4fd9-af5b-3d7362e93ae8\', \'multiverseId\': 651077}, \'multiverseid\': 651077}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの偵察虫\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\nあなたが諜報を行うたび、ディミーアの偵察虫の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'すべての会話は記録されていると思え。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'162833ae-0be7-4255-823b-3f5ad5bf3165\', \'multiverseId\': 651336}, \'multiverseid\': 651336}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eddd48d-960e-41f0-bc2f-6189300d5a72\', \'multiverseId\': 650611}, \'multiverseid\': 650611}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b419c3-a8c3-4bff-897d-51e7928caf1e\', \'multiverseId\': 650870}, \'multiverseid\': 650870}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543178ff-6995-4048-b32c-5d49a1713a02\', \'multiverseId\': 651129}, \'multiverseid\': 651129}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc9189c6-5739-4500-8012-08c6ca940e97\', \'multiverseId\': 651388}, \'multiverseid\': 651388}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Symbol der Dimir bekommen nur die eigenen Mitglieder als Erkennungszeichen der geheimen Gilde zu sehen — und die Verdammten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'595a1079-925d-4b07-b24a-31bb97f66646\', \'multiverseId\': 650579}, \'multiverseid\': 650579}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'insigne de Dimir est l\'emblème d\'une guilde secrète, et seuls ses membres le voient — ses membres, mais aussi ses victimes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908881bb-c108-45a8-ad11-b18b77036729\', \'multiverseId\': 650838}, \'multiverseid\': 650838}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema di una gilda segreta, le insegne dei Dimir possono essere viste solo dai suoi membri e da coloro che sono condannati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d17c42-d51d-4d39-83ea-93e178ee62db\', \'multiverseId\': 651097}, \'multiverseid\': 651097}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの印は秘密のギルドの紋章であり、それを見ることのできるのは自分たちの仲間たち、そして消し去られる運命の者だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8f75c58-7822-4cd3-b3a7-1a4d2ecad89f\', \'multiverseId\': 651356}, \'multiverseid\': 651356}]', '[{\'name\': \'Discovery // Dispersal // Discovery // Dispersal\', \'text\': \'Überwachen 2, ziehe dann eine Karte. (Um Überwachen 2 anzuwenden, schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei // Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Discovery // Dispersal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f889b0-4732-45c6-820a-a095b7bdc15c\', \'multiverseId\': 650560}, \'multiverseid\': 650560}, {\'name\': \'Discovery // Dispersal // Discovery // Dispersal\', \'text\': "Surveillez 2, puis piochez une carte. (Pour surveiller 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel // Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Discovery // Dispersal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edb0908-ca32-4f75-a072-900558e4d446\', \'multiverseId\': 650819}, \'multiverseid\': 650819}, {\'name\': \'Discovery // Dispersal // Discovery // Dispersal\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 2, poi pesca una carta. (Per sorvegliare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria // Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Discovery // Dispersal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8e25294-71b9-44c7-a26a-9848800d0e52\', \'multiverseId\': 651078}, \'multiverseid\': 651078}, {\'name\': \'Discovery // Dispersal // Discovery // Dispersal\', \'text\': \'諜報２を行う。その後、カード１枚を引く。（諜報２を行うとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー // インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Discovery // Dispersal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db0676b2-2954-4385-b1b5-757f17b11557\', \'multiverseId\': 651337}, \'multiverseid\': 651337}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drei Besuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die den Wald lieben, wollen nur seine majestätische Schönheit vergrößern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3897f985-d890-46b6-96f7-160fc579801f\', \'multiverseId\': 650542}, \'multiverseid\': 650542}, {\'name\': \'Trois visites\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui aiment la forêt ne souhaitent qu\'étendre sa majesté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db4a1fe2-55eb-4e2b-9dfc-be1b1431ca18\', \'multiverseId\': 650801}, \'multiverseid\': 650801}, {\'name\': \'Tre Visite\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che amano i boschi non desiderano altro che diffonderne la maestosità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1803a95-2a3e-4529-86dc-0e9db5a5c985\', \'multiverseId\': 651060}, \'multiverseid\': 651060}, {\'name\': \'三顧の礼\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'木々を愛する者たちは、単にその威厳を広めたいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55020199-5d09-424f-993e-af5f7abb7412\', \'multiverseId\': 651319}, \'multiverseid\': 651319}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dschungelschrein\', \'text\': \'Der Dschungelschrein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}, {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Naya sind Ehrgeiz und Verrat selten geworden, fast ausgerottet von der Ehrfurcht, die dort den irdischen Göttern entgegengebracht wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e994cdc6-eb1f-4bfc-8311-52c1fb0076de\', \'multiverseId\': 650621}, \'multiverseid\': 650621}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire de la jungle\', \'text\': \'Le Reliquaire de la jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sur Naya, l\'ambition et la traîtrise sont rares. La dévotion aux divinités terrestres les a presque portées à l\'extinction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650880&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0e8fab9-89c6-45c0-b0d5-91f6d8296569\', \'multiverseId\': 650880}, \'multiverseid\': 650880}, {\'name\': \'Santuario nella Giungla\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}, {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "In Naya, l\'ambizione e il tradimento sono rari, cacciati quasi fino all\'estinzione dal timore reverenziale dimostrato verso gli dei terreni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78dfe868-6542-4a46-8779-f95494afaf39\', \'multiverseId\': 651139}, \'multiverseid\': 651139}, {\'name\': \'ジャングルの祭殿\', \'text\': \'ジャングルの祭殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤでは、地上の神への畏怖から、野心や裏切りは絶滅に近いほど狩りつくされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef7b6f2-3681-4991-bd4f-becdc713f46b\', \'multiverseId\': 651398}, \'multiverseid\': 651398}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Katakomben\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Schlammige Wellen an der Küste Otarias verbergen die vergessenen Überreste des Krieges mit den Phyrexianern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64338511-b9c1-4ef6-8a0f-c115150f6be3\', \'multiverseId\': 650610}, \'multiverseid\': 650610}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes de Sombreau\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les boueuses vagues d\'Otaria cachent les horreurs oubliées de la guerre phyrexiane.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b0e48d3-8ba2-454e-aa62-87032373052a\', \'multiverseId\': 650869}, \'multiverseid\': 650869}, {\'name\': \'Catacombe di Acquascura\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le fosche maree di Otaria celano allo sguardo i tradimenti dimenticati della guerra di Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d21bf68-a8a3-4450-800b-158fb17a242e\', \'multiverseId\': 651128}, \'multiverseid\': 651128}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの地下墓地\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアの濁った潮流が、ファイレクシア戦の古い裏切り行為を覆い隠している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51de8d5d-7606-40ec-9c57-476beb04fa2d\', \'multiverseId\': 651387}, \'multiverseid\': 651387}]', "[{'name': 'Dusk // Dawn // Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Stärke 3 oder mehr.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650414&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d5fb5f3-4017-4a8b-bf86-6666c0d80aa1', 'multiverseId': 650414}, 'multiverseid': 650414}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn // Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 3.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650673&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfabf64f-32d2-4dc3-aa1c-1d4e99f73b99', 'multiverseId': 650673}, 'multiverseid': 650673}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn // Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Distruggi tutte le creature con forza pari o superiore a 3.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650932&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b0bf695-9bf0-4488-916b-a14b201cd518', 'multiverseId': 650932}, 'multiverseid': 650932}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn // Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'パワーが３以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651191&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ab89059-848e-4675-a236-c71dfdc4be2e', 'multiverseId': 651191}, 'multiverseid': 651191}]", '[{\'name\': \'Duskana, Mutter der Wut\', \'text\': \'Wenn Duskana, Mutter der Wut, ins Spiel kommt, ziehe für jede Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 2/2, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 2/2, die du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält sie +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein bleicher Bär wird vom Aufstieg der alten Götter künden."\\n—Gruul-Prophezeiung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0859806f-bc2b-41bf-86cd-8c06dcc7a4f5\', \'multiverseId\': 649931}, \'multiverseid\': 649931}, {\'name\': \'Duskana, la Mère de la rage\', \'text\': "Quand Duskana, la Mère de la rage arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec une force et une endurance de base de 2/2.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez avec une force et une endurance de base de 2/2 attaque, elle gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ours\', \'flavor\': "« Un ours pâle annonce l\'ascension des dieux anciens. »\\n—Prophétie gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649935&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b3e15b-00bc-4d1b-a7f9-0db034633d65\', \'multiverseId\': 649935}, \'multiverseid\': 649935}, {\'name\': \'Duskana, Madre della Furia\', \'text\': \'Quando Duskana, Madre della Furia entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta per ogni creatura che controlli con forza e costituzione base 2/2.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli con forza e costituzione base 2/2 attacca, prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orso\', \'flavor\': \'"Un orso pallido si farà araldo della rinascita degli antichi dei."\\n—profezia Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93a8937-c6b1-4015-8688-ef30a0dd8990\', \'multiverseId\': 649939}, \'multiverseid\': 649939}, {\'name\': \'怒りの母、ダスカナ\', \'text\': \'怒りの母、ダスカナが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて基本のパワーとタフネスが２/２であるクリーチャー１体につき１枚のカードを引く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて基本のパワーとタフネスが２/２であるクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'「蒼白の熊は古き神々の出現を告げる。」\\n――グルールの予言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e8a21f-b9b9-4d6c-bf64-04ac3c947f81\', \'multiverseId\': 649943}, \'multiverseid\': 649943}]', '[{\'name\': \'Duskana, Mutter der Wut\', \'text\': \'Wenn Duskana, Mutter der Wut, ins Spiel kommt, ziehe für jede Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 2/2, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 2/2, die du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält sie +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein bleicher Bär wird vom Aufstieg der alten Götter künden."\\n—Gruul-Prophezeiung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651450&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aee534c-b144-48b3-acc5-43ba72a7a561\', \'multiverseId\': 651450}, \'multiverseid\': 651450}, {\'name\': \'Duskana, la Mère de la rage\', \'text\': "Quand Duskana, la Mère de la rage arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec une force et une endurance de base de 2/2.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez avec une force et une endurance de base de 2/2 attaque, elle gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ours\', \'flavor\': "« Un ours pâle annonce l\'ascension des dieux anciens. »\\n—Prophétie gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec429639-e033-4090-b70b-412d220f3e67\', \'multiverseId\': 651458}, \'multiverseid\': 651458}, {\'name\': \'怒りの母、ダスカナ\', \'text\': \'怒りの母、ダスカナが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて基本のパワーとタフネスが２/２であるクリーチャー１体につき１枚のカードを引く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて基本のパワーとタフネスが２/２であるクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'「蒼白の熊は古き神々の出現を告げる。」\\n――グルールの予言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f3fc944-9028-4479-b35d-483a26d7c9aa\', \'multiverseId\': 651466}, \'multiverseid\': 651466}, {\'name\': \'狂怒熊母杜卡娜\', \'text\': \'当狂怒熊母杜卡娜进战场时，你每操控一个基础力量与防御力为2/2的生物，便抓一张牌。\\n每当一个由你操控且基础力量与防御力为2/2的生物攻击时，它得+3/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'「白熊现世，预示古神崛起。」\\n～古鲁预言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab17c3fc-5d6a-4e5b-a81d-c8d9b2163831\', \'multiverseId\': 651474}, \'multiverseid\': 651474}]', "[{'name': 'Einsame Sandbank', 'text': 'Die Einsame Sandbank kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650626&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da890ddd-55db-474c-ba26-6d70771787e5', 'multiverseId': 650626}, 'multiverseid': 650626}, {'name': 'Banc de sable isolé', 'text': 'Le Banc de sable isolé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650885&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e50fd5da-b565-41cc-ae5e-358fb7ab89d9', 'multiverseId': 650885}, 'multiverseid': 650885}, {'name': 'Secca Solitaria', 'text': 'La Secca Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651144&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41e3202f-6cb4-4bdb-aff1-966162170021', 'multiverseId': 651144}, 'multiverseid': 651144}, {'name': '孤立した砂州', 'text': '孤立した砂州はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング {U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651403&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12f5ffae-380c-440d-a664-8a9ea9bd7016', 'multiverseId': 651403}, 'multiverseid': 651403}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elspeth, Auserwählte der Sonne\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge drei 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n−3: Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Stärke 4 oder mehr.\\n−7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und haben Flugfähigkeit."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650415&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93c25480-9a9b-41df-bc80-c012d54b9c21\', \'multiverseId\': 650415}, \'multiverseid\': 650415}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, championne du Soleil\', \'text\': \'+1: Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\\n-3: Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\\n-7: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et ont le vol. »\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650674&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53da34bb-b66a-4568-9383-331ed9988be1\', \'multiverseId\': 650674}, \'multiverseid\': 650674}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, Campionessa del Sole\', \'text\': \'+1: Crea tre pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.\\n−3: Distruggi tutte le creature con forza pari o superiore a 4.\\n−7: Ottieni un emblema con "Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno volare".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8014f3f-28bc-4ba0-a5e4-89cfb9445acc\', \'multiverseId\': 650933}, \'multiverseid\': 650933}, {\'name\': \'太陽の勇者、エルズペス\', \'text\': \'+1：白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\\n-3：パワーが４以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n-7：あなたは「あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け飛行を持つ。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — エルズペス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11feaa29-8d52-4262-aec6-e1b604cf5508\', \'multiverseId\': 651192}, \'multiverseid\': 651192}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Ruinen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Ruinen ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu zwei Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650408&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e8209f-df4e-48de-a3f7-517b59a4c9fa\', \'multiverseId\': 650408}, \'multiverseid\': 650408}, {\'name\': \'Ange des ruines\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange des ruines arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à deux cibles, artefacts et/ou enchantements.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650667&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a6dc91-9dad-4521-9dd1-3c82dad1a93a\', \'multiverseId\': 650667}, \'multiverseid\': 650667}, {\'name\': \'Angelo delle Rovine\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo delle Rovine entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a due artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\\nCiclopianura {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343671ae-0513-481c-8f48-216b09e1a7ee\', \'multiverseId\': 650926}, \'multiverseid\': 650926}, {\'name\': \'遺跡の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n遺跡の天使が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントである最大２つを対象とする。それらを追放する。\\n平地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2225ae07-7048-4532-ab14-71ad14919f89\', \'multiverseId\': 651185}, \'multiverseid\': 651185}]', '[{\'name\': \'Epharas Zerstreuung\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls er eine angreifende Kreatur als Ziel hat.\\nBringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Überwachen 2. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650456&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c86b7e06-52f7-4859-abea-d59f88cee8e9\', \'multiverseId\': 650456}, \'multiverseid\': 650456}, {\'name\': "Dispersion d\'Éphara", \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer s\'il cible une créature attaquante.\\nRenvoyez une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire. Surveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650715&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f433be-ed64-470f-b340-919d2b5fec23\', \'multiverseId\': 650715}, \'multiverseid\': 650715}, {\'name\': \'Dispersione di Efara\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se bersaglia una creatura attaccante.\\nFai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario. Sorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'823bf97f-e6f3-4eaa-bc79-18a781a397a4\', \'multiverseId\': 650974}, \'multiverseid\': 650974}, {\'name\': \'エファラの分散\', \'text\': \'この呪文が攻撃クリーチャーを対象とするなら、これを唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'403c3995-3d90-4de0-9d33-3fb88aa16325\', \'multiverseId\': 651233}, \'multiverseid\': 651233}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erbe des Duellanten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen angreifen, kannst du eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges Doppelschlag erhalten lassen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die besten Techniken überdauern ihre Erfinder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650413&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'087dd874-9897-435c-a7a4-0dc0bac5b3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 650413}, \'multiverseid\': 650413}, {\'name\': \'Héritage de duelliste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque, vous pouvez faire qu\'une créature attaquante ciblée acquière la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les meilleures techniques survivent à leurs créateurs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b8c739-e04e-4c1d-aee2-9fc8052e421e\', \'multiverseId\': 650672}, \'multiverseid\': 650672}, {\'name\': \'Eredità del Duellante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature attaccano, puoi far guadagnare doppio attacco a una creatura attaccante bersaglio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le tecniche migliori sopravvivono ai loro inventori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d032ba65-fd28-41cc-b9d6-18311c1b14bb\', \'multiverseId\': 650931}, \'multiverseid\': 650931}, {\'name\': \'決闘者の遺産\', \'text\': \'１体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。「ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'最高の技は、作り手亡き後も遺る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02f6db27-04ea-41f7-90c3-f09e1cac889f\', \'multiverseId\': 651190}, \'multiverseid\': 651190}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erhabener Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Erhabene Engel Schaden zufügt, erhältst du entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nMorph {2}{W}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf60d8e-a78c-49c1-a50d-94d568854b1e\', \'multiverseId\': 650416}, \'multiverseid\': 650416}, {\'name\': \'Ange exalté\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ange exalté inflige des blessures, vous gagnez autant de points de vie.\\nMue {2}{W}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)", \'type\': \'Créature — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f95488bb-0283-40da-a495-da0a5e20631c\', \'multiverseId\': 650675}, \'multiverseid\': 650675}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Eminente\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Angelo Eminente infligge danno, guadagni altrettanti punti vita.\\nMetamorfosi {2}{W}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ccfd16-eb2f-49f2-bff7-afb955be6cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 650934}, \'multiverseid\': 650934}, {\'name\': \'賛美されし天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n賛美されし天使がダメージを与えるたび、あなたはそれに等しい点数のライフを得る。\\n変異{2}{W}{W}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c14a1770-12cd-46fc-bdce-e3e35cef1af7\', \'multiverseId\': 651193}, \'multiverseid\': 651193}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650591&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bea3158-8806-4357-80f5-25c74abe7078', 'multiverseId': 650591}, 'multiverseid': 650591}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact — golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650850&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85cf0c5c-2153-49b4-b54a-ed59fe8aeee3', 'multiverseId': 650850}, 'multiverseid': 650850}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651109&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18d06923-b322-42ac-ad5a-6035afddedf6', 'multiverseId': 651109}, 'multiverseid': 651109}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、カード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651368&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82e2dcdf-d7d4-4dc7-bfb2-a7e25d4ac085', 'multiverseId': 651368}, 'multiverseid': 651368}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erhebung des Dunkelreichs\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Kreaturenkarten aus allen Friedhöfen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf jeden Lebenden kommen Generationen von Toten. Über welches Reich würdest du lieber herrschen?"\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650491&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f150f37-066e-43e2-b69a-eab80cc61ec4\', \'multiverseId\': 650491}, \'multiverseid\': 650491}, {\'name\': \'Ascension des Royaumes obscurs\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, toutes les cartes de créature de tous les cimetières.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour un vivant, il existe maintes générations de défunts. À ce compte, qui a envie de régner sur les vivants ? »\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650750&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b75aca-a2cd-48e4-b500-2f5cb5b61d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 650750}, \'multiverseid\': 650750}, {\'name\': \'Ascesa dei Reami Oscuri\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo tutte le carte creatura da tutti i cimiteri.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Per ogni vivente ci sono generazioni di morti. Quale reame preferiresti governare?"\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c032948b-0751-4fed-8e3b-abc4551166e5\', \'multiverseId\': 651009}, \'multiverseid\': 651009}, {\'name\': \'闇の領域の隆盛\', \'text\': \'すべての墓地にあるすべてのクリーチャー・カードを、あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「生きた人間ひとりにつき、何世代もの死者がいるのよ。あなたなら、どの領域を統治する？」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cefc67b8-518c-46a1-a457-5d2d7d60492d\', \'multiverseId\': 651268}, \'multiverseid\': 651268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erheller der Erdgänge\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug Nachforschungen anstellst, stelle ein weiteres Mal Nachforschungen an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du nicht mehr weiterweißt, folge dem Laternengeist."\\n—Vallon, Inspektorin aus Thraben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650457&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'217e42af-45ff-49a2-a02b-fa6567e8e825\', \'multiverseId\': 650457}, \'multiverseid\': 650457}, {\'name\': "Illuminateur de l\'Erdwal", \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous enquêtez pour la première fois à chaque tour, enquêtez une fois de plus.\', \'type\': \'Créature — esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Dans les ténèbres les plus noires, suivez la lanterne du geist. »\\n—Vellon, inspecteur de Thraben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650716&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0797fea0-7a3d-46b5-9b82-ec8237194276\', \'multiverseId\': 650716}, \'multiverseid\': 650716}, {\'name\': \'Illuminatore di Erdwal\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta indaghi per la prima volta in ogni turno, indaga una volta in più.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando tutto il resto non funziona, segui la lanterna del geist."\\n—Vallon, ispettore di Thraben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a6c058-6f96-46f7-bcb8-76da97c0171d\', \'multiverseId\': 650975}, \'multiverseid\': 650975}, {\'name\': \'エルドワルの照光\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの１回目の調査を行うたび、追加で１回調査を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「すべて失敗したときは、霊のランタンを追いたまえ。」\\n――スレイベンの検査官、ヴァリョン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bd1307f-5ae9-4ce2-828e-128ad84b15e5\', \'multiverseId\': 651234}, \'multiverseid\': 651234}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce6422f6-c9f4-43ed-a3df-07ed6908dcf6\', \'multiverseId\': 650023}, \'multiverseid\': 650023}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650063&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7527fd34-4d28-48f1-84bc-321dabbcca12\', \'multiverseId\': 650063}, \'multiverseid\': 650063}, {\'name\': \'Richiesta di Riscatto\', \'text\': \'Quando la Richiesta di Riscatto entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 1.\\n{2}, Sacrifica la Richiesta di Riscatto: Scegli uno —\\n• Cela la prima carta del tuo grimorio.\\n• Sprona una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Indizio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dde4a1c3-f55d-4d79-a662-82a84c7202ed\', \'multiverseId\': 650103}, \'multiverseid\': 650103}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57bf4877-c6f6-4a2a-8404-551945cb3ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 650143}, \'multiverseid\': 650143}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650024&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01353f18-5c31-43ca-a342-3b6d81553af7\', \'multiverseId\': 650024}, \'multiverseid\': 650024}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650064&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03e4de2-aeaa-467f-80a7-5202c396b7ae\', \'multiverseId\': 650064}, \'multiverseid\': 650064}, {\'name\': \'Richiesta di Riscatto\', \'text\': \'Quando la Richiesta di Riscatto entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 1.\\n{2}, Sacrifica la Richiesta di Riscatto: Scegli uno —\\n• Cela la prima carta del tuo grimorio.\\n• Sprona una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Indizio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d4ec83-671a-4fc5-aae2-cb4119827614\', \'multiverseId\': 650104}, \'multiverseid\': 650104}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50ad32a-7f52-4154-a516-4be5c47a838f\', \'multiverseId\': 650144}, \'multiverseid\': 650144}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650025&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e7d0282-17f1-4c7d-9533-e9b179af954e\', \'multiverseId\': 650025}, \'multiverseid\': 650025}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650065&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95454fef-2295-4776-921d-ace39d031c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 650065}, \'multiverseid\': 650065}, {\'name\': \'Richiesta di Riscatto\', \'text\': \'Quando la Richiesta di Riscatto entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 1.\\n{2}, Sacrifica la Richiesta di Riscatto: Scegli uno —\\n• Cela la prima carta del tuo grimorio.\\n• Sprona una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Indizio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa7e9f9c-b3f3-49c2-b33a-d45da290a281\', \'multiverseId\': 650105}, \'multiverseid\': 650105}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・ クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87b66c23-4ac6-4669-bd19-422638b16059\', \'multiverseId\': 650145}, \'multiverseid\': 650145}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe7431d-75e4-4cb0-879d-9a35b890f899\', \'multiverseId\': 650026}, \'multiverseid\': 650026}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650066&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c09ee6b-1c89-47d9-9449-19c06e27f4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 650066}, \'multiverseid\': 650066}, {\'name\': \'Richiesta di Riscatto\', \'text\': \'Quando la Richiesta di Riscatto entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 1.\\n{2}, Sacrifica la Richiesta di Riscatto: Scegli uno —\\n• Cela la prima carta del tuo grimorio.\\n• Sprona una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Indizio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78523567-40c2-4893-89ce-331461d6bbed\', \'multiverseId\': 650106}, \'multiverseid\': 650106}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc61acb-f2b9-451a-b321-3248786ddaf2\', \'multiverseId\': 650146}, \'multiverseid\': 650146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f58f3f38-e2c6-4134-ba61-8e4002117085\', \'multiverseId\': 651556}, \'multiverseid\': 651556}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651595&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be6c74c5-0805-4cf9-96de-2bf8bd78c652\', \'multiverseId\': 651595}, \'multiverseid\': 651595}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d29ff29-3c1f-4afb-b5dd-205457d8fb1c\', \'multiverseId\': 651634}, \'multiverseid\': 651634}, {\'name\': \'勒索信\', \'text\': \'当勒索信进战场时，刺探1。\\n{2}，牺牲勒索信：选择一项～\\n•匿伏你的牌库顶牌。\\n•煽惑目标生物。\\n•抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器 — 线索\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03360637-8076-494b-9c05-208a4fb8f798\', \'multiverseId\': 651673}, \'multiverseid\': 651673}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7171e775-72cc-47b5-8511-ae1bd9e7b139\', \'multiverseId\': 651557}, \'multiverseid\': 651557}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651596&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a8b5aa-2db6-482c-a5c8-6623cf98e24b\', \'multiverseId\': 651596}, \'multiverseid\': 651596}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f59904d-05c3-4e46-95ff-170c8d416d16\', \'multiverseId\': 651635}, \'multiverseid\': 651635}, {\'name\': \'勒索信\', \'text\': \'当勒索信进战场时，刺探1。\\n{2}，牺牲勒索信：选择一项～\\n•匿伏你的牌库顶牌。\\n•煽惑目标生物。\\n•抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器 — 线索\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a53599a-ac3f-4b43-8777-cac3a1840378\', \'multiverseId\': 651674}, \'multiverseid\': 651674}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba76149-71ec-47f0-bd56-883da9d71f20\', \'multiverseId\': 651558}, \'multiverseid\': 651558}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651597&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3395508a-195f-470e-9525-cd4285e6c3c7\', \'multiverseId\': 651597}, \'multiverseid\': 651597}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b172eb12-1345-4fd7-8492-5749011d2f88\', \'multiverseId\': 651636}, \'multiverseid\': 651636}, {\'name\': \'勒索信\', \'text\': \'当勒索信进战场时，刺探1。\\n{2}，牺牲勒索信：选择一项～\\n•匿伏你的牌库顶牌。\\n•煽惑目标生物。\\n•抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器 — 线索\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6d92f3-2386-4273-9bdd-75474d5931b8\', \'multiverseId\': 651675}, \'multiverseid\': 651675}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erpresserschreiben\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Erpresserschreiben ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\n{2}, opfere das Erpresserschreiben: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tarne die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Hinweis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c19e236-03e9-4a93-8931-524b66765899\', \'multiverseId\': 651559}, \'multiverseid\': 651559}, {\'name\': \'Note de rançon\', \'text\': "Quand la Note de rançon arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1.\\n{2}, sacrifiez la Note de rançon : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Voilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — indice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91cbf166-f84f-4ffb-9a25-9dcc03e2de62\', \'multiverseId\': 651598}, \'multiverseid\': 651598}, {\'name\': \'身代金要求\', \'text\': \'身代金要求が戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。\\n{2}, 身代金要求を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 手掛かり\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff54ba5-f2e7-487d-8fcd-083ff2e21f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 651637}, \'multiverseid\': 651637}, {\'name\': \'勒索信\', \'text\': \'当勒索信进战场时，刺探1。\\n{2}，牺牲勒索信：选择一项～\\n•匿伏你的牌库顶牌。\\n•煽惑目标生物。\\n•抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器 — 线索\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29133d09-f7fa-4f1f-87bb-7971ef7b24e5\', \'multiverseId\': 651676}, \'multiverseid\': 651676}]', '[{\'name\': \'Esix die Fraktalblüte\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDas erste Mal, dass du in deinem Zug einen oder mehrere Spielsteine erzeugen würdest, kannst du stattdessen eine andere Kreatur als Esix die Fraktalblüte bestimmen und entsprechend viele Spielsteine erzeugen, die Kopien jener Kreatur sind.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Fraktalwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4be235-99ff-48b2-b19f-4b472bb16a23\', \'multiverseId\': 650563}, \'multiverseid\': 650563}, {\'name\': \'Ésix, efflorescence fractale\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa première fois que vous devriez créer au moins un jeton pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez à la place choisir une créature autre qu\'Ésix, efflorescence fractale et créer autant de jetons qui sont des copies de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — fractale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25207366-61a9-403b-a07b-96579e1e582c\', \'multiverseId\': 650822}, \'multiverseid\': 650822}, {\'name\': \'Esix, Germoglio dei Frattali\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa prima volta che stai per creare una o più pedine durante ogni tuo turno, puoi invece scegliere una creatura diversa da Esix, Germoglio dei Frattali e creare altrettante pedine che sono copie di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Frattale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95be94e5-c6b1-4293-b203-b53297e4d978\', \'multiverseId\': 651081}, \'multiverseid\': 651081}, {\'name\': \'フラクタルの花、エシックス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの各ターン内であなたが１回目に１つ以上のトークンを生成するなら、「代わりにフラクタルの花、エシックスでないクリーチャー１体を選び、同じ数の、そのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークンを生成する。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フラクタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ea17f7b-9e30-4c6d-8cd8-720e8ebff896\', \'multiverseId\': 651340}, \'multiverseid\': 651340}]', '[{\'name\': \'Etali der Ursturm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Etali der Ursturm angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil. Dann kannst du davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Der Sturm tobt und das Erdreich bricht auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650505&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077ad90e-37d7-4d2d-8013-da88dd0c7148\', \'multiverseId\': 650505}, \'multiverseid\': 650505}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempête primordiale\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'Etali, Tempête primordiale attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur, puis vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts parmi ces cartes sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ancêtre et dinosaure\', \'flavor\': \'La tempête fait rage et la terre se brise.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650764&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27cc69f6-6fa7-49ce-8bc5-1cf008db8f18\', \'multiverseId\': 650764}, \'multiverseid\': 650764}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempesta Primordiale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Etali, Tempesta Primordiale attacca, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore, poi puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie scelte tra quelle carte senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'La tempesta infuria e la terra si sgretola.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3cbd771-4f0e-408d-8f30-3fb7bbaefd4b\', \'multiverseId\': 651023}, \'multiverseid\': 651023}, {\'name\': \'原初の嵐、エターリ\', \'text\': \'原初の嵐、エターリが攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚をそれぞれ追放する。その後、あなたは、それらのカードの中から望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'嵐が怒り大地が裂ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa201e7c-5ad6-40b8-a740-83163adbb046\', \'multiverseId\': 651282}, \'multiverseid\': 651282}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650613&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c813838-cd61-462f-a704-90a9157bb64d\', \'multiverseId\': 650613}, \'multiverseid\': 650613}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34dcdc30-efe5-4cca-8cc2-7250c5b65ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 650872}, \'multiverseid\': 650872}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli."\\n—Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ff6569d-8c04-4e1a-9032-46504d7595fb\', \'multiverseId\': 651131}, \'multiverseid\': 651131}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13766b67-14f0-414b-a1ac-34752cdc8008\', \'multiverseId\': 651390}, \'multiverseid\': 651390}]', '[{\'name\': \'Experiment Zwölf\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn Experiment Zwölf oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf jene Kreatur, wie deren Stärke beträgt.\\nVerkleidung {4}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur mit Abwehr {2} wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Verkleidungskosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Eidechse, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'893e438f-9719-46cd-b7ec-06f539cdccde\', \'multiverseId\': 650015}, \'multiverseid\': 650015}, {\'name\': \'Expérience Douze\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Expérience Douze ou qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez est retournée face visible, mettez sur cette créature un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à sa force.\\nDéguisement {4}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée pour {3} comme une créature 2/2 avec parade {2}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de déguisement.)", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et lézard et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddb1904f-43c0-4427-8f8d-04a600364bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 650055}, \'multiverseid\': 650055}, {\'name\': \'Esperimento Dodici\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Esperimento Dodici o un\'altra creatura che controlli viene girata a faccia in su, metti su quella creatura segnalini +1/+1 pari alla sua forza.\\nCamuffare {4}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 con egida {2} pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di camuffare.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Lucertola Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ec2d65e-7d9a-4e35-9f0d-e710bef025f9\', \'multiverseId\': 650095}, \'multiverseid\': 650095}, {\'name\': \'実験体12号\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n実験体12号、またはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が表向きになるたび、そのクリーチャーの上にそれのパワーに等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\\n変装{4}{G}（このカードを、{3}で護法{2}を持つ２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変装コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・トカゲ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b825ea6b-ebe3-49b9-aa29-2d4d4d5c7dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 650135}, \'multiverseid\': 650135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Experiment Zwölf\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn Experiment Zwölf oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf jene Kreatur, wie deren Stärke beträgt.\\nVerkleidung {4}{G}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Eidechse, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8637f211-a59a-4fa8-adc4-1cd8369c29e1\', \'multiverseId\': 651548}, \'multiverseid\': 651548}, {\'name\': \'Expérience Douze\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Expérience Douze ou qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez est retournée face visible, mettez sur cette créature un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à sa force.\\nDéguisement {4}{G}", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et lézard et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6171d5d8-206e-4baa-b2f7-be53d95eb418\', \'multiverseId\': 651587}, \'multiverseid\': 651587}, {\'name\': \'実験体12号\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n実験体12号、またはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が表向きになるたび、そのクリーチャーの上にそれのパワーに等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\\n変装{4}{G}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・トカゲ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19abb786-30f5-4275-86c8-bc4b4e09ba3f\', \'multiverseId\': 651626}, \'multiverseid\': 651626}, {\'name\': \'十二号实验体\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当十二号实验体或另一个由你操控的生物翻回正面时，在该生物上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于其力量。\\n伪装{4}{G}\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／蜥蜴／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bbb21ef-1f54-40f4-a744-1ce13bbcba4c\', \'multiverseId\': 651665}, \'multiverseid\': 651665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fall des veränderlichen Antlitzes\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wendest du Überwachen 1 an.\\nLösen — Dein Friedhof enthält fünfzehn oder mehr Karten. (Falls ungelöst, löse den Fall zu Beginn deines Endsegments.)\\nGelöst — Immer wenn du einen nichtlegendären Kreaturenzauber wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch. (Die Kopie wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Fall\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a4aaec2-6a42-4c75-af28-a2b500bcc189\', \'multiverseId\': 649997}, \'multiverseid\': 649997}, {\'name\': \'Affaire du visage changeant\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, surveillez 1.\\nÀ résoudre — Il y a au moins quinze cartes dans votre cimetière. (Si l\'affaire n\'est pas résolue, résolvez-la au début de votre étape de fin.)\\nRésolue — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature non-légendaire, copiez ce sort. (La copie devient un jeton.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement — affaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650037&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a33fdff1-0c4f-4b4f-9e5d-4004989a2fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 650037}, \'multiverseid\': 650037}, {\'name\': \'Caso del Volto Mutevole\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sorveglia 1.\\nRisolvere — Ci sono quindici o più carte nel tuo cimitero. (Se irrisolto, risolvilo all\'inizio della tua sottofase finale.)\\nRisolto — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura non leggendaria, copia quella magia. (La copia diventa una pedina.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Caso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe6b4c74-3a1b-42d1-b315-6015817b8cca\', \'multiverseId\': 650077}, \'multiverseid\': 650077}, {\'name\': \'うつろう貌の事件\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、諜報１を行う。\\n解明条件 — あなたの墓地に15枚以上のカードがある。（未解明なら、あなたの終了ステップの開始時に解明する。）\\n解明完了 — あなたが伝説でないクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、その呪文をコピーする。（そのコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 事件\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8e91d00-053c-40aa-be0c-d4ea4e71f01e\', \'multiverseId\': 650117}, \'multiverseid\': 650117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feder, strahlende Schlichterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, der nur Feder, strahlende Schlichterin, als Ziel hat, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl anderer Kreaturen bestimmen, die jener Zauberspruch als Ziel haben könnte, und für jede davon {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch für jede jener Kreaturen. Die Kopie hat jene Kreatur als Ziel. (Kopien von Permanent-Zaubersprüchen werden zu Spielsteinen.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e5f76e-2006-4cf5-80c3-322a42990404\', \'multiverseId\': 649932}, \'multiverseid\': 649932}, {\'name\': \'Plume, arbitre radieuse\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature qui cible uniquement Plume, arbitre radieuse, vous pouvez choisir n\'importe quel nombre d\'autres créatures que ce sort pourrait cibler et payer {2} pour chacune de ces créatures. Si vous faites ainsi, pour chacune de ces créatures, copiez ce sort. La copie cible cette créature. (Les copies de sorts de permanent deviennent des jetons.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649936&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad497dc-1c67-4b22-b0b6-59f63d81b097\', \'multiverseId\': 649936}, \'multiverseid\': 649936}, {\'name\': \'Feather, Giudice Radiosa\', \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura che bersaglia solo Feather, Giudice Radiosa, puoi scegliere un qualsiasi numero di altre creature che quella magia potrebbe bersagliare e pagare {2} per ognuna di quelle creature. Se lo fai, per ognuna di quelle creature, copia quella magia. La copia bersaglia quella creatura. (Le copie delle magie permanente diventano pedine.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de679adf-9a09-42a7-ba31-9475694e5a09\', \'multiverseId\': 649940}, \'multiverseid\': 649940}, {\'name\': \'光輝の調停者、フェザー\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nあなたが光輝の調停者、フェザーのみを対象としてクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、「その呪文が対象にできてこれでない望む数のクリーチャーを選び、それらのクリーチャー１体につき{2}を支払う。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、それらのクリーチャー１体につき１回、その呪文をコピーする。そのコピーはそのクリーチャーを対象とする。（パーマネント・呪文のコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e44da405-2b7c-446f-8971-aa860290a4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 649944}, \'multiverseid\': 649944}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feder, strahlende Schlichterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, der nur Feder, strahlende Schlichterin, als Ziel hat, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl anderer Kreaturen bestimmen, die jener Zauberspruch als Ziel haben könnte, und für jede davon {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch für jede jener Kreaturen. Die Kopie hat jene Kreatur als Ziel.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651451&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'773ccf48-a6b5-4e53-bf94-6c1c596b9761\', \'multiverseId\': 651451}, \'multiverseid\': 651451}, {\'name\': \'Plume, arbitre radieuse\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature qui cible uniquement Plume, arbitre radieuse, vous pouvez choisir n\'importe quel nombre d\'autres créatures que ce sort pourrait cibler et payer {2} pour chacune de ces créatures. Si vous faites ainsi, pour chacune de ces créatures, copiez ce sort. La copie cible cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e7798a-9d66-4c40-93d5-009fa9952e80\', \'multiverseId\': 651459}, \'multiverseid\': 651459}, {\'name\': \'光輝の調停者、フェザー\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nあなたが光輝の調停者、フェザーのみを対象としてクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、「その呪文が対象にできてこれでない望む数のクリーチャーを選び、それらのクリーチャー１体につき{2}を支払う。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、それらのクリーチャー１体につき１回、その呪文をコピーする。そのコピーはそのクリーチャーを対象とする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f77ee166-2752-4e69-8efd-2d3dc635c9b2\', \'multiverseId\': 651467}, \'multiverseid\': 651467}, {\'name\': \'辉光仲裁使飞羽\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n每当你施放仅以辉光仲裁使飞羽为目标的非生物咒语时，你可以选择任意数量该咒语能指定为目标的其他生物并为每个此类生物各支付{2}。若你如此作，则每有一个此类生物，便复制一次该咒语，此复制品以该生物为目标。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8733f7cd-33c2-412b-b34b-f902918f7103\', \'multiverseId\': 651475}, \'multiverseid\': 651475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feindliche Wüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, schicke eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Die Feindliche Wüste wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/4 Elementarwesen-Kreatur. Sie ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Amonkhets Wüsten dürstet es nach Blut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f526837c-a773-41be-8d0c-b552f6533503\', \'multiverseId\': 650619}, \'multiverseid\': 650619}, {\'name\': \'Désert hostile\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, exilez une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière : Le Désert hostile devient une créature 3/4 Élémental jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': "La terre desséchée d\'Amonkhet a soif de sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70a78328-704d-4336-8cfc-57bc7e6847c1\', \'multiverseId\': 650878}, \'multiverseid\': 650878}, {\'name\': \'Deserto Ostile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, Esilia una carta terra dal tuo cimitero: Il Deserto Ostile diventa una creatura Elementale 3/4 fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'La terra riarsa di Amonkhet ha sete di sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecd2f191-b147-49f6-8e77-4a528c836b8d\', \'multiverseId\': 651137}, \'multiverseid\': 651137}, {\'name\': \'敵意ある砂漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚を追放する：ターン終了時まで、敵意ある砂漠は３/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'アモンケットの乾いた大地は血に飢えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d51d367-e1e5-48fe-9481-23d16cef6296\', \'multiverseId\': 651396}, \'multiverseid\': 651396}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was besitzt du, das ich nicht erlangen kann?"\\n—Mairsil der Täuscher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650581&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe248b1c-169b-4b7a-8859-9eee0ef74a2f\', \'multiverseId\': 650581}, \'multiverseid\': 650581}, {\'name\': \'Pierre de Guermont\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'avez-vous que je ne puisse obtenir ? »\\n—Mairsil, le prétendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4957f8ef-653a-40ad-9080-37e9d5c15bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 650840}, \'multiverseid\': 650840}, {\'name\': \'Pietra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'hai tu che io non posso ottenere?"\\n—Mairsil, il Pretendente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7a64ab7-ae20-49fd-a048-e253f42dede4\', \'multiverseId\': 651099}, \'multiverseid\': 651099}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は、私が手に入れられない何を持っているのだ？」\\n――偽善者、メアシル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'129ea1fa-b349-42a9-b08d-583aadf80c53\', \'multiverseId\': 651358}, \'multiverseid\': 651358}]', '[{\'name\': \'Festung der Monstertöter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0, Wachsamkeit und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Hof ist zu jeder Stunde des Tages beleuchtet, damit die Nacht niemals in ihren Mauern Einzug hält.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f93cddf-29de-4a82-92a0-729bddb47291\', \'multiverseId\': 650648}, \'multiverseid\': 650648}, {\'name\': \'Forteresse des tueurs\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T} : Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert la vigilance et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Ses cours intérieures sont éclairées à toute heure, de façon que la nuit ne tombe jamais entre ses murs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4544346a-67fb-4aad-9fca-55cc7d6fc566\', \'multiverseId\': 650907}, \'multiverseid\': 650907}, {\'name\': \'Fortezza degli Assassini\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha cautela e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi cortili sono illuminati a ogni ora del giorno, affinché la notte non possa mai penetrare le sue mura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0071743-0ee4-42b5-a84f-a212f3677dcd\', \'multiverseId\': 651166}, \'multiverseid\': 651166}, {\'name\': \'処刑者の要塞\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{R}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け警戒と速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'壁の隙間にすら夜を忍び込ませまいと、その庭は常に灯りに照らされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0be2a4-216b-4dd7-be01-84c7bade8559\', \'multiverseId\': 651425}, \'multiverseid\': 651425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Finale der Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Ziehe X Karten. Falls X gleich 10 oder mehr ist, mische stattdessen deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek, ziehe X Karten, enttappe bis zu fünf Länder, und du hast für den Rest der Partie keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\nSchicke das Finale der Offenbarung ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ugin erkannte das Juwel, das Bolas mit seinem Meditationsreich verband, als Schlüssel zu dessen Untergang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650459&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96c407de-18c7-43cd-b255-a9aedb581710\', \'multiverseId\': 650459}, \'multiverseid\': 650459}, {\'name\': \'Summum de la révélation\', \'text\': "Piochez X cartes. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 10, à la place mélangez votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque, piochez X cartes, dégagez jusqu\'à cinq terrains, et vous n\'avez pas de taille de main maximale pour le restant de la partie.\\nExilez le Summum de la révélation.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Pour Ugin, la gemme qui connectait Bolas à son Royaume de méditation était la clé qui conduirait son frère à sa perte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650718&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33010e70-397f-4e10-bd4d-91334f7f1420\', \'multiverseId\': 650718}, \'multiverseid\': 650718}, {\'name\': \'Finale di Rivelazione\', \'text\': \'Pesca X carte. Se X è pari o superiore a 10, rimescola invece il tuo cimitero nel tuo grimorio, pesca X carte, STAPpa fino a cinque terre e non hai un limite massimo di carte nella mano per il resto della partita.\\nEsilia il Finale di Rivelazione.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Per Ugin, la gemma che legava Bolas al suo Reame della Meditazione era la chiave per la rovina di suo fratello.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79aac7ab-fc98-414a-a0d0-07757794cff5\', \'multiverseId\': 650977}, \'multiverseid\': 650977}, {\'name\': \'啓示の終焉\', \'text\': \'カードＸ枚を引く。Ｘが10以上なら、代わりに、あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直し、カードＸ枚を引き、土地最大５つをアンタップし、このゲームの残りの間あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n啓示の終焉を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンは、ボーラスと瞑想領土を繋ぐその宝石が、彼を滅ぼす鍵になると目星をつけた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3ea7096-278b-4032-ae79-f2d7b295b16f\', \'multiverseId\': 651236}, \'multiverseid\': 651236}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fingerabdruck-Schlammwesen\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn das Fingerabdruck-Schlammwesen oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen Schlammwesen-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht. Der Spielstein kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an anderen Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nVerkleidung {3}{G}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650018&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d75bb0-da80-4e85-896b-269982491308\', \'multiverseId\': 650018}, \'multiverseid\': 650018}, {\'name\': "Limon preneur d\'empreinte", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que le Limon preneur d\'empreinte ou qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez est retournée face visible, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte Limon avec le piétinement. Le jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant le nombre d\'autres créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nDéguisement {3}{G}", \'type\': \'Créature — limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650058&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b9b178f-19c1-4528-869f-5daec276d2e3\', \'multiverseId\': 650058}, \'multiverseid\': 650058}, {\'name\': \'Melma Rilevaimpronte\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta la Melma Rilevaimpronte o un\'altra creatura che controlli viene girata a faccia in su, crea una pedina creatura Melma 0/0 verde con travolgere. La pedina entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1, dove X è il numero di altre creature che controlli.\\nCamuffare {3}{G}", \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee0a294c-d183-4e0f-921b-c17d3b9472ef\', \'multiverseId\': 650098}, \'multiverseid\': 650098}, {\'name\': \'墨を取る軟泥\', \'text\': \'接死\\n墨を取る軟泥、またはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が表向きになるたび、トランプルを持つ緑の０/０のウーズ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。そのトークンは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしていてそれでないクリーチャーの数に等しい。\\n変装{3}{G}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63660186-13ab-461e-b204-4f850e0e4b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 650138}, \'multiverseid\': 650138}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fingerabdruck-Schlammwesen\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn das Fingerabdruck-Schlammwesen oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen Schlammwesen-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht. Der Spielstein kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an anderen Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nVerkleidung {3}{G}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3295ac5-88d6-4ca8-be3f-821096d02fab\', \'multiverseId\': 651551}, \'multiverseid\': 651551}, {\'name\': "Limon preneur d\'empreinte", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que le Limon preneur d\'empreinte ou qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez est retournée face visible, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte Limon avec le piétinement. Le jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant le nombre d\'autres créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nDéguisement {3}{G}", \'type\': \'Créature — limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651590&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1c6fc1f-4c39-43ba-9c42-d578ce4b3a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 651590}, \'multiverseid\': 651590}, {\'name\': \'墨を取る軟泥\', \'text\': \'接死\\n墨を取る軟泥、またはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が表向きになるたび、トランプルを持つ緑の０/０のウーズ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。そのトークンは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしていてそれでないクリーチャーの数に等しい。\\n変装{3}{G}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62157d15-e08d-41c6-9724-ebbddc9b08b6\', \'multiverseId\': 651629}, \'multiverseid\': 651629}, {\'name\': \'模印泥浆\', \'text\': \'死触\\n每当模印泥浆或另一个由你操控的生物翻回正面时，派出一个0/0，具践踏异能的绿色流浆衍生生物。该衍生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为由你操控的其他生物数量。\\n伪装{3}{G}\', \'type\': \'生物 — 流浆\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bef16780-d77a-4e29-abe9-3d49c9a81c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 651668}, \'multiverseid\': 651668}]', '[{\'name\': \'Finsterer Seestern\', \'text\': \'{T}: Überwachen 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Seestern\', \'flavor\': \'„Wirf ihn zurück ins Wasser. Ich mag es nicht, wie er mich anstarrt."\\n—Netos, meletischer Fischer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650493&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'599e2981-fbdd-4f33-baae-bc8c6041aee3\', \'multiverseId\': 650493}, \'multiverseid\': 650493}, {\'name\': \'Étoile de mer sinistre\', \'text\': \'{T} : Surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — étoile de mer\', \'flavor\': "« Jette celle-là. Je n\'aime pas la façon dont elle me regarde. »\\n—Netos, pêcheur mélétisien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650752&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11f808ba-d4a9-4230-bcaf-5d99489ad98e\', \'multiverseId\': 650752}, \'multiverseid\': 650752}, {\'name\': \'Stella Marina Sinistra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Sorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Stella Marina\', \'flavor\': \'"Ributtala in acqua. Non mi piace il suo sguardo."\\n—Netos, pescatore di Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1abf67cc-dbdc-4b5d-bae8-fbb33af11d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 651011}, \'multiverseid\': 651011}, {\'name\': \'悪意あるヒトデ\', \'text\': \'{T}：諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヒトデ\', \'flavor\': \'「そいつは戻せ。目つきが気に食わない。」\\n――メレティスの漁師、ネトス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01aace6d-f08d-49f6-92e5-7f2674136f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 651270}, \'multiverseid\': 651270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fliegender Erpresser\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Fliegende Erpresser ins Spiel kommt oder einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke bis zu ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wahl ins Exil. Solange die Karte im Exil bleibt, kann ihr Besitzer sie wirken.\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Spieler einen Zauberspruch von irgendwoher außer aus seiner Hand wirkt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650407&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f75f72-2ba2-42f6-8423-4500ef5e6d8d\', \'multiverseId\': 650407}, \'multiverseid\': 650407}, {\'name\': \'Extorqueur aérien\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Extorqueur aérien arrive sur le champ de bataille ou inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Tant que cette carte reste exilée, son propriétaire peut la lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre joueur lance un sort depuis autre part que sa main, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e9c0bc1-d7fc-43bb-932d-2afa647b7694\', \'multiverseId\': 650666}, \'multiverseid\': 650666}, {\'name\': \'Estorsore Aereo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Estorsore Aereo entra nel campo di battaglia o infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esilia fino a un permanente non terra bersaglio. Fintanto che quella carta rimane esiliata, il suo proprietario può lanciarla.\\nOgniqualvolta un altro giocatore lancia una magia da una zona diversa dalla sua mano, peschi una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18a01b65-e94d-4563-98b3-6704fe9544d8\', \'multiverseId\': 650925}, \'multiverseid\': 650925}, {\'name\': \'天駆ける恐喝者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n天駆ける恐喝者が戦場に出るかプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、土地でないパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。それを追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それのオーナーはそれを唱えてもよい。\\nあなたでないプレイヤーが自分の手札以外から呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4cb3b71-ebe8-490e-8434-20e03ca727fa\', \'multiverseId\': 651184}, \'multiverseid\': 651184}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des Reichtums\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler angegriffen wird, erzeuge einen Gold-Spielstein. Jeder Gegner, der den Spieler angreift, tut dasselbe. (Ein Gold-Spielstein ist ein Artefakt mit „Opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'Das Klingen von Münzen lockt so manch begierige Neider an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650503&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'674c3f94-0c31-4356-9fcc-99b981d5df3d\', \'multiverseId\': 650503}, \'multiverseid\': 650503}, {\'name\': "Malédiction d\'opulence", \'text\': \'Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté est attaqué, créez un jeton Or. Chaque adversaire attaquant ce joueur fait de même. (Un jeton Or est un artefact avec « Sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': \'Un tintement de pièces attire bon nombre de mains avides.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1adeacd-c3f7-4133-9822-30272b40aee1\', \'multiverseId\': 650762}, \'multiverseid\': 650762}, {\'name\': "Maledizione dell\'Opulenza", \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato viene attaccato, crei una pedina Oro. Ogni avversario che attacca quel giocatore fa lo stesso. (Una pedina Oro è un artefatto con "Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'Il tintinnio delle monete attira più di una mano smaniosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dab62c0-5466-46e2-94c4-7595400a93c0\', \'multiverseId\': 651021}, \'multiverseid\': 651021}, {\'name\': \'豪奢の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーが攻撃されるたび、金・トークン１つを生成する。そのプレイヤーを攻撃している各対戦相手はそれぞれ同じことを行う。（金・トークンは、「このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'金貨の音は無数の欲深い手を引き寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca44fd4f-b164-455f-9e8e-1eb1dbbebc05\', \'multiverseId\': 651280}, \'multiverseid\': 651280}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluss der Tränen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}. Falls du in diesem Zug ein Land gespielt hast, erzeuge stattdessen {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Westvolk weinte, und seine Tränen gruben tiefe Flüsse in die Wangen der Welt."\\n—Glem, der einsame Barde,„Die Ursprünge von Kholon"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650636&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79963d3a-fb53-4137-a965-e541c44839a6\', \'multiverseId\': 650636}, \'multiverseid\': 650636}, {\'name\': \'Rivière de larmes\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {U}. Si vous avez joué un terrain ce tour-ci, ajoutez {B} à la place.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Les Ouestriens pleurèrent, et leurs larmes creusèrent de longs fleuves sinueux dans la joue du monde. »\\n—Glem le Solibarde, « Les origines de Kholon »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650895&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f194428-a889-464c-85bc-967d96d7d84b\', \'multiverseId\': 650895}, \'multiverseid\': 650895}, {\'name\': \'Fiume di Lacrime\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U}. Se hai giocato una terra in questo turno, aggiungi invece {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Le Genti dell\\\'Ovest piansero e le loro lacrime tracciarono fiumi tortuosi sulle gote del mondo."\\n—Glem il Bardo Solitario, "Le Origini di Kholon"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f687b82b-bc8c-4c20-a7c4-28617b888886\', \'multiverseId\': 651154}, \'multiverseid\': 651154}, {\'name\': \'涙の川\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。あなたがこのターンに土地をプレイしていたなら、代わりに{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「西の民は嘆き、その涙はうねる川となって世界の頬へとそそいだ。」\\n――独り唄のグレム、「コロンの起源」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6aff125-c556-4ef8-921e-88f91b7db163\', \'multiverseId\': 651413}, \'multiverseid\': 651413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüsterholz-Elementar\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments manifestierst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\\nOpfere das Flüsterholz-Elementar: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten aufgedeckte Nichtspielsteinkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97312d29-1e96-4bec-a8a5-f0ec53ebcfcd\', \'multiverseId\': 650547}, \'multiverseid\': 650547}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de bois-murmure\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)\\nSacrifiez l\'Élémental de bois-murmure : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures non-jeton face visible que vous contrôlez acquièrent « Quand cette créature meurt, manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. »", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'368ff353-2b52-479b-998d-10c4c8bb75b9\', \'multiverseId\': 650806}, \'multiverseid\': 650806}, {\'name\': \'Elementale del Bosco dei Sussurri\', \'text\': \'All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\\nSacrifica l\\\'Elementale del Bosco dei Sussurri: Fino alla fine del turno, le creature non pedina a faccia in su che controlli hanno "Quando questa creatura muore, manifesta la prima carte del tuo grimorio".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22db2d27-ce2c-4e85-b594-cc98e82d947f\', \'multiverseId\': 651065}, \'multiverseid\': 651065}, {\'name\': \'囁きの森の精霊\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。（それを裏向きで２/２のクリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\n囁きの森の精霊を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでない表向きのすべてのクリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b06447c-3617-4104-abcf-45af893c17e5\', \'multiverseId\': 651324}, \'multiverseid\': 651324}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüsternder Spitzel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug Überwachen anwendest, fügt der Flüsternde Spitzel jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich kommen mir Dinge zu Ohren. Eine Menge Dinge. Aber wie soll ich sie mit meiner trockenen Kehle ausplaudern?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650497&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906ec79e-4ffc-4f00-a788-4c4f08509ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 650497}, \'multiverseid\': 650497}, {\'name\': \'Mouchard chuchotant\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous surveillez pour la première fois à chaque tour, le Mouchard chuchotant inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Bien sûr que j\'entends des choses. Beaucoup de choses, même. Je parlerais bien mais j\'ai la gorge tellement sèche... »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650756&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d98e4431-5b2a-4947-8fc2-5ca71d3b3ee4\', \'multiverseId\': 650756}, \'multiverseid\': 650756}, {\'name\': \'Spione Sussurrante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta sorvegli per la prima volta in ogni turno, lo Spione Sussurrante infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Certo, di cose ne sento dire parecchie. Ma come faccio a parlare con la gola così secca?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'226e67e1-1e66-4718-aec8-6b96a0f80c40\', \'multiverseId\': 651015}, \'multiverseid\': 651015}, {\'name\': \'囁く情報屋\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの１回目の諜報を行うたび、囁く情報屋は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与え、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「確かに知ってますよ。いろいろとね。でも、喉が渇いてると話しづらいですねぇ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'644192b4-2f9f-4995-9668-e1a8eb508fbe\', \'multiverseId\': 651274}, \'multiverseid\': 651274}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frecher Stichler\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nImmer wenn dem Frechen Stichler Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt er einem Gegner deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{2}{R}, {T}: Der Freche Stichler kämpft gegen eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum kommst du nicht ein bisschen näher und sagst das nochmal, du rückgratloser Speichellecker!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98842d99-2f30-40f6-904d-00d9984d5d11\', \'multiverseId\': 650501}, \'multiverseid\': 650501}, {\'name\': \'Taquineur effronté\', \'text\': \'Indestructible\\nÀ chaque fois que le Taquineur effronté subit des blessures, il inflige autant de blessures à un adversaire ciblé.\\n{2}{R}, {T} : Le Taquineur effronté se bat contre une autre créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin\', \'flavor\': \'« Approche-toi et répète un peu, sale crapaud baveux ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f87324d-30df-42a6-9258-3c9657fcbb91\', \'multiverseId\': 650760}, \'multiverseid\': 650760}, {\'name\': \'Istigatore Sfrontato\', \'text\': "Indistruttibile\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno all\'Istigatore Sfrontato, esso infligge altrettanti danni a un avversario bersaglio.\\n{2}{R}, {T}: L\'Istigatore Sfrontato lotta con un\'altra creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché non ti avvicini e ripeti quello che hai detto, leccasputi invertebrato!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceada2d1-e95d-4b52-bf40-26be9533124e\', \'multiverseId\': 651019}, \'multiverseid\': 651019}, {\'name\': \'無作法な挑発者\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\n無作法な挑発者がダメージを受けるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。これはそのプレイヤーに、その点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n{2}{R}, {T}：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。無作法な挑発者はそれと格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'「こっちにきてもう一度言ってみろ！このいくじなしの唾なめ野郎め！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c69125be-b152-48d2-b78a-fb8d2e36ac51\', \'multiverseId\': 651278}, \'multiverseid\': 651278}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkelnder Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0466365-1ba8-4216-8a54-bb4009bad6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 650514}, \'multiverseid\': 650514}, {\'name\': \'Impetus brillant\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, vous créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be3d37a-4ed6-47de-9500-6fb8f94dbe8b\', \'multiverseId\': 650773}, \'multiverseid\': 650773}, {\'name\': \'Impeto Lucente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, crei una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b4166c6-4708-4f83-ae18-1522aba134e3\', \'multiverseId\': 651032}, \'multiverseid\': 651032}, {\'name\': \'輝光の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋2/＋2の修整を受け、使嗾されている。（それは各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b59bd7-217d-4b6e-b748-ca68470eff83\', \'multiverseId\': 651291}, \'multiverseid\': 651291}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchteinflößendes Dampfschiff\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Furchteinflößende Dampfschiff ins Spiel kommt, bestimmt jeder Spieler zwei Kreaturen, die weder Spielsteine noch Fahrzeuge sind und die er kontrolliert. Schicke sie ins Exil, bis das Furchteinflößende Dampfschiff das Spiel verlässt.\\nImmer wenn das Furchteinflößende Dampfschiff angreift, lege eine von ihm ins Exil geschickte Karte auf den Friedhof ihres Besitzers. Falls du dies tust, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\nBemannen 2\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650006&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c88e51-7fe6-4c90-9997-cca8f558470d\', \'multiverseId\': 650006}, \'multiverseid\': 650006}, {\'name\': \'Bateau à vapeur angoissant\', \'text\': "Quand le Bateau à vapeur angoissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur choisit deux créatures non-jeton, non-Véhicule qu\'il contrôle. Exilez-les jusqu\'à ce que le Bateau à vapeur angoissant quitte le champ de bataille.\\nQuand le Bateau à vapeur angoissant attaque, mettez une carte exilée par lui dans le cimetière de son propriétaire. Si vous faites ainsi, enquêtez.\\nPilotage 2", \'type\': \'Artefact — véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'943a8730-506f-487f-8e44-9146941740d5\', \'multiverseId\': 650046}, \'multiverseid\': 650046}, {\'name\': \'Piroscafo del Presagio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Piroscafo del Presagio entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sceglie due creature non pedina, non Veicolo che controlla. Esiliale finché il Piroscafo del Presagio non lascia il campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta il Piroscafo del Presagio attacca, metti una carta esiliata con esso nel cimitero del suo proprietario. Se lo fai, indaga.\\nManovrare 2\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1031ae-b285-44b6-be36-e13e36ab2b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 650086}, \'multiverseid\': 650086}, {\'name\': \'凶兆の蒸気船\', \'text\': \'凶兆の蒸気船が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分がコントロールしていてトークンでも機体でもないクリーチャー２体を選ぶ。凶兆の蒸気船が戦場を離れるまで、それらを追放する。\\n凶兆の蒸気船が攻撃するたび、これにより追放されているカード１枚をオーナーの墓地に置く。そうしたなら、調査を行う。\\n搭乗２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13cacd37-369e-4ae2-a0a5-4559fb652682\', \'multiverseId\': 650126}, \'multiverseid\': 650126}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gastfreundliche Vampirin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere andere Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'Von dem Moment ihrer Ankunft an wurden die Hochzeitsgäste mit Reichtum und Überfluss empfangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650444&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e7dbda-eddb-45fa-9c66-14fc83ed0a12\', \'multiverseId\': 650444}, \'multiverseid\': 650444}, {\'name\': \'Vampire accueillante\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une autre créature avec une force inférieure ou égale à 2 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire\', \'flavor\': "Dès leur arrivée, les invités du mariage furent témoins d\'un défilé de richesse et d\'excès.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650703&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbf4a89-81c2-48c5-8804-0712af5fbc83\', \'multiverseId\': 650703}, \'multiverseid\': 650703}, {\'name\': \'Vampira Accogliente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una o più altre creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2 entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Dal momento del loro arrivo, gli invitati al matrimonio venivano accolti da uno sfoggio di opulenza ed eccesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45573795-128d-4dec-9770-a3e439ae18cf\', \'multiverseId\': 650962}, \'multiverseid\': 650962}, {\'name\': \'歓迎する吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nパワーが２以下でありこれでない１体以上のクリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'結婚式の参列者は、到着したそのときから、贅を尽くした見世物で迎えられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83ada71c-271b-4d0b-87b2-46bc35746824\', \'multiverseId\': 651221}, \'multiverseid\': 651221}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebäudedurchsuchung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Um diesen abscheulichen Praktiken Einhalt zu gebieten, muss Geralf gefunden und ein Exempel statuiert werden."\\n—Inquisitor Delmund\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650434&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b66448-17b9-430e-aa20-c7d9c1991226\', \'multiverseId\': 650434}, \'multiverseid\': 650434}, {\'name\': \'Fouiller les lieux\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour mettre un terme à ces pratiques sordides, nous devons retrouver Geralf et lui appliquer une peine exemplaire. »\\n—Inquisiteur Delmund\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650693&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b52314-1f62-43d5-86cf-e7499ea801cf\', \'multiverseId\': 650693}, \'multiverseid\': 650693}, {\'name\': \'Perlustrare il Locale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura attacca te o un planeswalker che controlli, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per porre fine a queste pratiche raccapriccianti, Geralf deve essere trovato e punito in modo esemplare."\\n—Inquisitore Delmund\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e159460-091e-4da6-8c7c-1cd0a9f58dd9\', \'multiverseId\': 650952}, \'multiverseid\': 650952}, {\'name\': \'家宅捜索\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体が、あなた、またはあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「こんな身の毛もよだつ行為は止めなければ。ゲラルフを見つけて厳しく罰する必要がある。」\\n――審問官デルムンド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f627dd9-ae65-4813-914f-ee033b513194\', \'multiverseId\': 651211}, \'multiverseid\': 651211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankengebundenes Trugbild\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nImmer wenn du Überwachen anwendest, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf das Gedankengebundene Trugbild.\\nSolange drei oder mehr +1/+1-Marken auf dem Gedankengebundenen Trugbild liegen, kann es angreifen, als ob es nicht Verteidiger hätte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650475&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90b5de9b-7c51-4c5a-a95c-1160ac35ee0c\', \'multiverseId\': 650475}, \'multiverseid\': 650475}, {\'name\': \'Phantasme esclave\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surveillez, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Phantasme esclave.\\nTant que le Phantasme esclave a au moins trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, il peut attaquer comme s\'il n\'avait pas le défenseur.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1df9efa-0ea3-4a96-a55f-c3cd65a0558d\', \'multiverseId\': 650734}, \'multiverseid\': 650734}, {\'name\': \'Fantasma Psicovincolato\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nOgniqualvolta sorvegli, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Fantasma Psicovincolato.\\nFintanto che il Fantasma Psicovincolato ha tre o più segnalini +1/+1, può attaccare come se non avesse difensore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b239d196-6504-4ee8-9452-3ee19e7c7b10\', \'multiverseId\': 650993}, \'multiverseid\': 650993}, {\'name\': \'思考繋ぎの幻\', \'text\': \'防衛\\nあなたが諜報を行うたび、思考繋ぎの幻の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n思考繋ぎの幻の上に＋１/＋１カウンターが３個以上あるかぎり、これは防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'532ee6ca-e680-4a62-ab77-bdf4448b8989\', \'multiverseId\': 651252}, \'multiverseid\': 651252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankengefäß\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Unendliche Möglichkeiten in einem endlichen Raum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff5f314-b235-4431-b9a6-37dc289ef165\', \'multiverseId\': 650598}, \'multiverseid\': 650598}, {\'name\': \'Urne de pensée\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Des possibilités infinies dans un espace réduit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650857&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f05cc78-2b85-4d87-aa88-1a4f7f028900\', \'multiverseId\': 650857}, \'multiverseid\': 650857}, {\'name\': \'Ricettacolo di Pensieri\', \'text\': \'Non hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Possibilità infinite contenute in uno spazio finito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7073de6a-0833-4da7-9a41-5f86aaac79f3\', \'multiverseId\': 651116}, \'multiverseid\': 651116}, {\'name\': \'思考の器\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'有限の空間に封じ込まれた無限の可能性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3064380c-8c52-4d91-8b3a-24a9173b5742\', \'multiverseId\': 651375}, \'multiverseid\': 651375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42758ff3-3ca7-453d-9feb-e78ffaa31f34\', \'multiverseId\': 650585}, \'multiverseid\': 650585}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f3a0773-769f-4adb-882e-ef7ff034925d\', \'multiverseId\': 650844}, \'multiverseid\': 650844}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è il mana se non una possibilità, un\\\'idea che ancora non ha preso forma?"\\n—Jhoira, maestra artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c0fb57-a084-4ad1-95a5-539993980b29\', \'multiverseId\': 651103}, \'multiverseid\': 651103}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2976d660-9640-422d-b63d-1dadf187fc3c\', \'multiverseId\': 651362}, \'multiverseid\': 651362}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenwirbel\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und lege dann zwei Karten aus deiner Hand in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Mizzium-Sphärenfeld trug ihren Geist tief in das Gedankenfeld, in dem man nur die seltensten Genius-Partikel — reifen Früchten gleich — pflücken konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650449&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd412f3b-f292-45c6-a49d-841cba2cd37b\', \'multiverseId\': 650449}, \'multiverseid\': 650449}, {\'name\': \'Remue-méninges\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes et mettez ensuite deux cartes de votre main au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La batterie de sphères de mizzium conduisit son esprit dans les profondeurs du champ mental, où attendent d\'être cueillis les rarissimes éclairs de génie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650708&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca23108f-3ce7-4f4e-96e6-6c41f0d53c48\', \'multiverseId\': 650708}, \'multiverseid\': 650708}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta Cerebrale\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi metti due carte dalla tua mano in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'arsenale delle sfere di Mizzium fece volare i suoi pensieri lontano, in un luogo dove solo i granelli più rari della ricchezza d\'ingegno possono essere estirpati.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18393454-02ec-49cc-8bec-c191ec3b5a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 650967}, \'multiverseid\': 650967}, {\'name\': \'渦まく知識\', \'text\': \'カード３枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札にあるカード２枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'あるかないかの光明を求め、彼女の精神はミジウム球配列によって思考場の深みへと誘われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c09e20e-85be-4cf8-b666-d7819b3e620c\', \'multiverseId\': 651226}, \'multiverseid\': 651226}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenüberwacher\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Artefakten\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Gedankenüberwacher ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Er durchstreift den Himmel über der Quecksilbersee, stets wachsam für jeden Hinweis auf fehlgeleitete Gedanken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650474&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10bb31e9-18c4-4b4b-8b3b-c605418a7d50\', \'multiverseId\': 650474}, \'multiverseid\': 650474}, {\'name\': \'Surveillant de pensées\', \'text\': \'Affinité pour les artefacts\\nVol\\nQuand le Surveillant de pensées arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — construction\', \'flavor\': "Il patrouille les cieux au-dessus de la mer de Vif-argent, à l\'affût de la moindre trace de pensée anormale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3931f364-f6b4-41ec-b6a9-84bcc94ae5dc\', \'multiverseId\': 650733}, \'multiverseid\': 650733}, {\'name\': \'Supervisore dei Pensieri\', \'text\': \'Affinità con gli artefatti\\nVolare\\nQuando il Supervisore dei Pensieri entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Solca i cieli sul Mare di Mercurio, attento a cogliere qualsiasi traccia di pensiero aberrante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d32a97-1c54-4744-9895-53aa3d76a699\', \'multiverseId\': 650992}, \'multiverseid\': 650992}, {\'name\': \'思考の監視者\', \'text\': \'親和（アーティファクト）\\n飛行\\n思考の監視者が戦場に出たとき、カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'水銀海の上空を巡回し、異常な思考の兆しを見張る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8a49fd3-67fe-484a-bb30-1f4498daf8cb\', \'multiverseId\': 651251}, \'multiverseid\': 651251}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefangenendilemma\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner bestimmt geheim Schweigen oder Verpfeifen, dann werden die Entscheidungen offenbart. Falls alle Gegner Schweigen bestimmt haben, fügt das Gefangenendilemma jedem von ihnen 4 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls alle Gegner Verpfeifen bestimmt haben, fügt das Gefangenendilemma jedem von ihnen 8 Schadenspunkte zu. Anderenfalls fügt das Gefangenendilemma jedem Gegner, der Schweigen bestimmt hat, 12 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nRückblende {5}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11eb8df7-bed0-4688-bdd7-6dd13c4504b8\', \'multiverseId\': 650012}, \'multiverseid\': 650012}, {\'name\': \'Dilemme du prisonnier\', \'text\': "Chaque adversaire choisit secrètement silence ou mouchardage, puis les choix sont révélés. Si chaque adversaire a choisi silence, le Dilemme du prisonnier inflige 4 blessures à chacun d\'eux. Si chaque adversaire a choisi mouchardage, le Dilemme du prisonnier inflige 8 blessures à chacun d\'eux. Sinon, le Dilemme du prisonnier inflige 12 blessures à chaque adversaire qui a choisi silence.\\nFlashback {5}{R}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650052&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892596c1-6186-4af6-8144-6a4c2f24f328\', \'multiverseId\': 650052}, \'multiverseid\': 650052}, {\'name\': \'Dilemma del Prigioniero\', \'text\': \'Ogni avversario sceglie segretamente silenzio o spia, poi le scelte vengono rivelate. Se tutti gli avversari hanno scelto silenzio, il Dilemma del Prigioniero infligge 4 danni a ognuno di loro. Se tutti gli avversari hanno scelto spia, il Dilemma del Prigioniero infligge 8 danni a ognuno di loro. Altrimenti, il Dilemma del Prigioniero infligge 12 danni a ogni avversario che ha scelto silenzio.\\nFlashback {5}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6bb6cc1-3754-464f-b815-f27b9f7841c3\', \'multiverseId\': 650092}, \'multiverseid\': 650092}, {\'name\': \'囚人のジレンマ\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ、「黙秘」か「密告」を秘密裏に選ぶ。その後、それらの選択を公開する。すべての対戦相手が「黙秘」を選んだなら、囚人のジレンマは各対戦相手にそれぞれ４点のダメージを与える。すべての対戦相手が「密告」を選んだなら、囚人のジレンマは各対戦相手にそれぞれ８点のダメージを与える。そうでないなら、囚人のジレンマは「黙秘」を選んだ各対戦相手にそれぞれ12点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'823cd139-dc72-466e-aa78-2ca8ed8f3151\', \'multiverseId\': 650132}, \'multiverseid\': 650132}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefangenendilemma\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner bestimmt geheim Schweigen oder Verpfeifen, dann werden die Entscheidungen offenbart. Falls alle Gegner Schweigen bestimmt haben, fügt das Gefangenendilemma jedem von ihnen 4 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls alle Gegner Verpfeifen bestimmt haben, fügt das Gefangenendilemma jedem von ihnen 8 Schadenspunkte zu. Anderenfalls fügt das Gefangenendilemma jedem Gegner, der Schweigen bestimmt hat, 12 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nRückblende {5}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'663ae573-f0e5-49aa-b3d1-e7bc9798beb0\', \'multiverseId\': 651545}, \'multiverseid\': 651545}, {\'name\': \'Dilemme du prisonnier\', \'text\': "Chaque adversaire choisit secrètement silence ou mouchardage, puis les choix sont révélés. Si chaque adversaire a choisi silence, le Dilemme du prisonnier inflige 4 blessures à chacun d\'eux. Si chaque adversaire a choisi mouchardage, le Dilemme du prisonnier inflige 8 blessures à chacun d\'eux. Sinon, le Dilemme du prisonnier inflige 12 blessures à chaque adversaire qui a choisi silence.\\nFlashback {5}{R}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651584&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cc0874c-8926-4d4b-b5c3-158ac2f9a4cb\', \'multiverseId\': 651584}, \'multiverseid\': 651584}, {\'name\': \'囚人のジレンマ\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ、「黙秘」か「密告」を秘密裏に選ぶ。その後、それらの選択を公開する。すべての対戦相手が「黙秘」を選んだなら、囚人のジレンマは各対戦相手にそれぞれ４点のダメージを与える。すべての対戦相手が「密告」を選んだなら、囚人のジレンマは各対戦相手にそれぞれ８点のダメージを与える。そうでないなら、囚人のジレンマは「黙秘」を選んだ各対戦相手にそれぞれ12点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3391be7a-8326-46a6-ab84-748668e44a19\', \'multiverseId\': 651623}, \'multiverseid\': 651623}, {\'name\': \'囚徒困境\', \'text\': \'每位对手各私下选择「缄默」或「告发」，然后展示选择结果。如果所有对手均选择「缄默」，则囚徒困境对其各造成4点伤害。如果所有对手均选择「告发」，则囚徒困境对其各造成8点伤害。若以上皆非，则囚徒困境向每位选择「缄默」的对手各造成12点伤害。\\n返照{5}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee129b5-701c-4722-8f2b-9f3669fcdbba\', \'multiverseId\': 651662}, \'multiverseid\': 651662}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gegenargument\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Du kannst einen Kreaturenzauber, einen Spontanzauber, eine Hexerei oder einen Planeswalkerzauber mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs aus deinem Friedhof wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nette Theorie, aber wie du gleich sehen wirst, hat sie Löcher."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a133aa-91bb-4c73-bef9-1c9dee9f1166\', \'multiverseId\': 650019}, \'multiverseid\': 650019}, {\'name\': \'Contrepoint\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Vous pouvez lancer un sort de créature, d\'éphémère, de rituel ou de planeswalker depuis votre cimetière avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à la valeur de mana de ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Jolie théorie, mais je vais devoir la démonter. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650059&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'609f0b86-4b4f-4d98-9ce4-d99a94803679\', \'multiverseId\': 650059}, \'multiverseid\': 650059}, {\'name\': \'Controbattere\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Puoi lanciare dal tuo cimitero una magia creatura, istantaneo, stregoneria o planeswalker con valore di mana pari o inferiore al valore di mana di quella magia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Bella teoria, ma temo faccia acqua da tutte le parti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e28a481-8a45-4618-9812-2dcf0053fabd\', \'multiverseId\': 650099}, \'multiverseid\': 650099}, {\'name\': \'異議あり\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。あなたの墓地から、クリーチャーやインスタントやソーサリーやプレインズウォーカーであり、マナ総量がその呪文以下である呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「筋は悪くないが、穴は突かせてもらおう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d6a6701-d240-4622-abfd-ea4e7276d888\', \'multiverseId\': 650139}, \'multiverseid\': 650139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gegenargument\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Du kannst einen Kreaturenzauber, einen Spontanzauber, eine Hexerei oder einen Planeswalkerzauber mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs aus deinem Friedhof wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nette Theorie, aber wie du gleich sehen wirst, hat sie Löcher."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b1d6164-ad5b-47ff-96f4-a06c434b92eb\', \'multiverseId\': 651552}, \'multiverseid\': 651552}, {\'name\': \'Contrepoint\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Vous pouvez lancer un sort de créature, d\'éphémère, de rituel ou de planeswalker depuis votre cimetière avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à la valeur de mana de ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Jolie théorie, mais je vais devoir l\'invalider. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7a1b34-8466-4ef6-aa80-c8fcd3949ac8\', \'multiverseId\': 651591}, \'multiverseid\': 651591}, {\'name\': \'異議あり\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。あなたの墓地から、クリーチャーやインスタントやソーサリーやプレインズウォーカーであり、マナ総量がその呪文以下である呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「筋は悪くないが、穴は突かせてもらおう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd050a7-94ee-4e5e-b6ba-c149254caec9\', \'multiverseId\': 651630}, \'multiverseid\': 651630}, {\'name\': \'对点反论\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。你可以从你的坟墓场中施放一个法术力值等于或小于该咒语的生物，瞬间，法术或鹏洛客咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「想法不错，但我得在上面戳几个洞。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14223a0b-2112-409a-b24d-fd87ae256049\', \'multiverseId\': 651669}, \'multiverseid\': 651669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geißel des Throns\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nEntthronen (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nImmer wenn die Geißel des Throns zum ersten Mal in einem Zug angreift und falls sie einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5807b771-4895-4311-891b-8d40cceb17fe\', \'multiverseId\': 650513}, \'multiverseid\': 650513}, {\'name\': \'Fléau du trône\', \'text\': "Vol\\nDétrônement (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque le joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Fléau du trône attaque pour la première fois à chaque tour, s\'il attaque le joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé, dégagez toutes les créatures attaquantes. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5a1c2a-49a5-40a2-84c4-16a632b182b2\', \'multiverseId\': 650772}, \'multiverseid\': 650772}, {\'name\': \'Flagello del Trono\', \'text\': "Volare\\nSpodestare (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca il giocatore con più punti vita o con più punti vita a pari merito con un altro giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Flagello del Trono attacca per la prima volta in ogni turno, se sta attaccando il giocatore con più punti vita o con più punti vita a pari merito con un altro giocatore, STAPpa tutte le creature attaccanti. Dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dae2827-bdd4-4d96-8b72-f8edf8334c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 651031}, \'multiverseid\': 651031}, {\'name\': \'玉座の災い魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n玉座の災い魔が各ターン内で１回目に攻撃するたび、これが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃している場合、すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93afefe1-c076-49fc-b538-3e440e03fd3c\', \'multiverseId\': 651290}, \'multiverseid\': 651290}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genaue Analyse\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht zwei Karten.\\nRückblende — {1}{U}, bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Exemplar ist anscheinend defekt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650453&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625aa370-448e-41c1-bb56-854cdbe4f970\', \'multiverseId\': 650453}, \'multiverseid\': 650453}, {\'name\': \'Analyse en profondeur\', \'text\': \'Un joueur ciblé pioche deux cartes.\\nFlashback — {1}{U}, payez 3 points de vie. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce spécimen semble cassé. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16edaa75-d36f-4bbb-a9f6-de7c94abb1c9\', \'multiverseId\': 650712}, \'multiverseid\': 650712}, {\'name\': \'Analisi Approfondita\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca due carte.\\nFlashback—{1}{U}, Paga 3 punti vita. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il campione sembra essere rotto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a9fa32-e1d8-4d7c-b0d5-0d10cd0fab07\', \'multiverseId\': 650971}, \'multiverseid\': 650971}, {\'name\': \'綿密な分析\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック―{1}{U}, ３点のライフを支払う。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この標本は壊れているようだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dacce6ea-5b2f-481e-af0f-31e4ececc705\', \'multiverseId\': 651230}, \'multiverseid\': 651230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerechte Strafe\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Schaden, der dir oder Planeswalkern, die du kontrollierst, in diesem Zug von Quellen, die du nicht kontrollierst, zugefügt würde. Falls auf diese Weise Schaden aus einer Quelle, die eine Kreatur ist, verhindert wurde, fügt die Gerechte Strafe jener Kreatur entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu. Falls auf diese Weise Schaden aus einer Quelle, die keine Kreatur ist, verhindert wurde, fügt die Gerechte Strafe dem Beherrscher der Quelle entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650411&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe842ea4-4d63-4a32-99c2-df3b72e3fd71\', \'multiverseId\': 650411}, \'multiverseid\': 650411}, {\'name\': \'Sort bien mérité\', \'text\': "Prévenez, ce tour-ci, toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à vous et aux planeswalkers que vous contrôlez par des sources que vous ne contrôlez pas. Si des blessures d\'une source créature sont prévenues de cette manière, le Sort bien mérité inflige autant de blessures à cette créature. Si des blessures d\'une source non-créature sont prévenues de cette manière, le Sort bien mérité inflige autant de blessures au contrôleur de cette source.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650670&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6b4517e-3a2c-4f27-be7c-68c02da88e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 650670}, \'multiverseid\': 650670}, {\'name\': \'Castigo Meritato\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno a te e ai planeswalker che controlli da fonti che non controlli. Se viene prevenuto in questo modo il danno da una fonte creatura, il Castigo Meritato infligge altrettanti danni a quella creatura. Se viene prevenuto in questo modo il danno da una fonte non creatura, il Castigo Meritato infligge altrettanti danni al controllore di quella fonte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'094c54fd-72db-4c24-8dfb-a9ba42299145\', \'multiverseId\': 650929}, \'multiverseid\': 650929}, {\'name\': \'誅罰\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたがコントロールしていない発生源が、あなた、またはあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーに与えるすべてのダメージを軽減する。クリーチャーである発生源からのダメージがこれにより軽減されたなら、誅罰はそのクリーチャーにそのダメージと同じ点数のダメージを与える。クリーチャーでない発生源からのダメージがこれにより軽減されたなら、誅罰はその発生源のコントローラーにそのダメージと同じ点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38e6e2e-1492-45ec-b825-3eb6dd964c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 651188}, \'multiverseid\': 651188}]', "[{'name': 'Geschütztes Gestrüpp', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.)\\nDas Geschützte Gestrüpp kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Gebirge, Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650644&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dad77892-b650-44ff-8592-704b317ebad8', 'multiverseId': 650644}, 'multiverseid': 650644}, {'name': 'Halliers protégés', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.)\\nLes Halliers protégés arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain — montagne et forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650903&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48cd0ab9-a470-472a-84cb-1bb09c25dc37', 'multiverseId': 650903}, 'multiverseid': 650903}, {'name': 'Boschetto Riparato', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.)\\nIl Boschetto Riparato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Montagna Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651162&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '151ffb8c-aa0a-4c16-8a42-04564e20d963', 'multiverseId': 651162}, 'multiverseid': 651162}, {'name': '隠れた茂み', 'text': '（{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。）\\n隠れた茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 山・森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651421&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e175b789-6818-40cf-973b-07ee14e7cb2c', 'multiverseId': 651421}, 'multiverseid': 651421}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gespenstisches Gefängnis\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die er kontrolliert und die dich angreift.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl die Körper der Geister ätherisch waren, lernte Agnur bald, dass ihre Klingen ziemlich hart und scharf wie Rasiermesser waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee725e8c-0fde-4921-af31-7339d3be44ab\', \'multiverseId\': 650420}, \'multiverseid\': 650420}, {\'name\': \'Prison fantomale\', \'text\': "Les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les esprits avaient beau avoir un corps éthéré, Agnur découvrit bien assez tôt que leurs lames étaient bien matérielles, et bien aiguisées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5857064-f692-4598-854d-ba8b937275ad\', \'multiverseId\': 650679}, \'multiverseid\': 650679}, {\'name\': \'Prigione Spettrale\', \'text\': \'Le creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Anche se i corpi degli spiriti erano eterei, Agnur scoprì presto che le loro lame erano piuttosto solide... e affilate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'366d1d0d-5829-42b6-b179-0d18e555dd8f\', \'multiverseId\': 650938}, \'multiverseid\': 650938}, {\'name\': \'亡霊の牢獄\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーは、自分がコントロールしていてあなたを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'その霊体は空気のようだったが、アグナーは程なくしてその剣が非常に硬く、そして非常に鋭いことを知った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d20d85d4-db1f-4206-bb7b-d208e403b443\', \'multiverseId\': 651197}, \'multiverseid\': 651197}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestion\', \'text\': "Surveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Aha ! Ce doit être une des anciennes clés du… Non, attendez. C\'est juste un casse-tête. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650711&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b009eb4-a521-4629-95e1-5cde089902ce\', \'multiverseId\': 650711}, \'multiverseid\': 650711}, {\'name\': \'Riordinare\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah! Questa dev\\\'essere una delle chiavi antiche per... No, un momento. È soltanto un altro rompicapo giocattolo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceeb256f-cc3c-4fa8-a489-5a191d3b7233\', \'multiverseId\': 650970}, \'multiverseid\': 650970}, {\'name\': \'情報収集\', \'text\': \'諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「おお！これぞまさしく太古の鍵のひとつ……待て、違うぞ。ただのおもちゃのパズルじゃないか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cacafac4-71aa-4bdc-9081-6a247511fdc9\', \'multiverseId\': 651229}, \'multiverseid\': 651229}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewittergelübde\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Erstschlag und kann weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Für alles, was ich verloren habe und für alle, die gefallen sind, werde ich dich zu Asche verwandeln."\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2c77106-371a-4322-bb57-662a8be5e3eb\', \'multiverseId\': 650517}, \'multiverseid\': 650517}, {\'name\': \'Vœu de foudre\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2, a l\'initiative et elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "« Au nom de tout ce que j\'ai perdu, de tous ceux qui sont tombés, je vais vous réduire en poussière. »\\n—Jared Carthalion", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f79e8cd6-6942-4d91-9499-597972f7f05f\', \'multiverseId\': 650776}, \'multiverseid\': 650776}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento del Fulmine\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2, ha attacco improvviso e non può attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Per tutto ciò che ho perduto, per tutti coloro che sono caduti, io ti ridurrò in polvere."\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061cab7f-12ea-41e2-8128-6872856125bd\', \'multiverseId\': 651035}, \'multiverseid\': 651035}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の誓約\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、先制攻撃を持ち、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「私が失ったすべてのために、死んでいったすべての者のために、お前を灰にしてやる。」\\n――ジャレッド・カルサリオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd07f320-96a0-4645-92fa-078acf890ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 651294}, \'multiverseid\': 651294}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideons Opfer\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst. Aller Schaden, der in diesem Zug dir und Permanenten, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde, wird stattdessen dem bestimmten Permanent zugefügt (falls es noch im Spiel ist).\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Zu Lilianas Überraschung war nicht sie es, die für ihren Verrat an Bolas bezahlen musste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'708bc921-66b3-4d61-98d3-78f3bdc2a1ed\', \'multiverseId\': 650421}, \'multiverseid\': 650421}, {\'name\': \'Sacrifice de Gideon\', \'text\': "Choisissez une créature ou un planeswalker que vous contrôlez. Toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci à vous et aux permanents que vous contrôlez sont infligées au permanent choisi à la place (s\'il est encore sur le champ de bataille).", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À la surprise de Liliana, ce fut quelqu\'un d\'autre qui paya le prix de sa trahison de Bolas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650680&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f8ad260-6e00-4750-9cd7-beb299880a83\', \'multiverseId\': 650680}, \'multiverseid\': 650680}, {\'name\': \'Sacrificio di Gideon\', \'text\': \'Scegli una creatura o un planeswalker che controlli. Tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno a te e ai permanenti che controlli viene invece inflitto al permanente scelto (se è ancora sul campo di battaglia).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Con sorpresa di Liliana, il prezzo per aver tradito Bolas non ricadde su di lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8962c1a7-f62c-4185-9e8b-325a6172b70d\', \'multiverseId\': 650939}, \'multiverseid\': 650939}, {\'name\': \'ギデオンの犠牲\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーでありあなたがコントロールしている１体を選ぶ。このターン、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントが受けるダメージは、（その選ばれたパーマネントがまだ戦場にあるなら）代わりにその選ばれたパーマネントが受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'リリアナは、ボーラスを裏切った代償が自分の身に降りかからなかったことに驚いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6da7f161-06c8-4221-87c4-a631e4d6ed2b\', \'multiverseId\': 651198}, \'multiverseid\': 651198}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabes-Titan\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn der Grabes-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, erzeuge zwei 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Tod in Form und Funktion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48910bb3-e3f7-4cd7-bfb8-f352064a2d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 650482}, \'multiverseid\': 650482}, {\'name\': \'Titan des tombes\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan des tombes arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature — géant\', \'flavor\': \'La mort par forme et par fonction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909b9f52-599f-46e6-88c0-6e1ad49033d4\', \'multiverseId\': 650741}, \'multiverseid\': 650741}, {\'name\': \'Titano Sepolcrale\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano Sepolcrale entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, crea due pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Morte di nome e di fatto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8db9be21-5f72-473d-8c24-8979b19f793b\', \'multiverseId\': 651000}, \'multiverseid\': 651000}, {\'name\': \'墓所のタイタン\', \'text\': \'接死\\n墓所のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'姿と機能を有した死。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8596b6e-58aa-4123-a51b-7274c95e8f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 651259}, \'multiverseid\': 651259}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabmaulwurf\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Hinweis opferst, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Maulwurf, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihr scharfer Geruchssinn führt sie zum Unnatürlichen. Einen von ihnen zu finden, ist ein Segen."\\n—Veka, Hinterland-Inspektorin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e53201-0f50-4d03-a660-99cfb6a4b5f3\', \'multiverseId\': 650523}, \'multiverseid\': 650523}, {\'name\': \'Taupe du graf\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un indice, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature — taupe et bête\', \'flavor\': "« Leur sens exceptionnel de l\'odorat les attire vers le surnaturel. En trouver une est une bénédiction. »\\n—Veka, inspectrice de l\'arrière-pays", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49ef4264-f13e-41d7-88f6-51eed7370ea5\', \'multiverseId\': 650782}, \'multiverseid\': 650782}, {\'name\': \'Talpa del Cimitero\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un Indizio, guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Talpa\', \'flavor\': \'"Il loro olfatto eccezionale le spinge verso l\\\'innaturale. Trovarne una è una benedizione."\\n—Veka, ispettrice dell\\\'entroterra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd4b3f6-3870-4da6-9e44-d62e7b34b788\', \'multiverseId\': 651041}, \'multiverseid\': 651041}, {\'name\': \'墓モグラ\', \'text\': \'あなたが手掛かり１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — モグラ・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「するどい嗅覚によって不自然なものを教えてくれる。一匹でも見つかれば最高だ。」\\n――内陸の検査官、ヴェカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e0baad-c832-4945-8c11-5dcb031f854f\', \'multiverseId\': 651300}, \'multiverseid\': 651300}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzland-Kriegstreiberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen einen deiner Gegner oder einen Planeswalker, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreifen, erhalten sie Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie kümmert sich nicht um Anführer oder Loyalitäten, solange der Kampf weiter tobt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3fd0e7b-954f-45ab-a294-63206e830c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 650507}, \'multiverseid\': 650507}, {\'name\': \'Belliciste des frontières\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque un de vos adversaires ou un planeswalker qu\'il contrôle, ces créatures acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Elle n\'a que faire des meneurs et de la loyauté, tant que la bataille fait rage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650766&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4fa93b-8823-4537-aed4-46d9003ec63f\', \'multiverseId\': 650766}, \'multiverseid\': 650766}, {\'name\': \'Guerrafondaia di Frontiera\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature attaccano uno dei tuoi avversari o un planeswalker controllato da un avversario, quelle creature hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Dimostra scarso interesse per i leader o i vincoli di fedeltà, fintanto che la battaglia infuria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72ad5916-321a-49ef-a32d-9a49804e6dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 651025}, \'multiverseid\': 651025}, {\'name\': \'開拓地の戦争屋\', \'text\': \'１体以上のクリーチャーが、対戦相手、または対戦相手がコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーである１つを攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは威迫を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'戦いの勢いが続きさえすれば、指導者とか忠誠心とかは彼女にとってどうでもいい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8228ce-3c52-46e9-9ac9-cfc2c3121a67\', \'multiverseId\': 651284}, \'multiverseid\': 651284}]', "[{'name': 'Gruulgrund', 'text': 'Der Gruulgrund kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Gruulgrund ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650618&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fdc355c-50ac-40ac-bd6a-4b3e1710237d', 'multiverseId': 650618}, 'multiverseid': 650618}, {'name': 'Territoire des Gruul', 'text': 'Le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650877&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43b6dbab-e854-4b1c-ac8b-f842aa1d4641', 'multiverseId': 650877}, 'multiverseid': 650877}, {'name': 'Torba Gruul', 'text': 'La Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651136&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a634b2a5-0ddf-4f0a-b852-00186ccc67a2', 'multiverseId': 651136}, 'multiverseid': 651136}, {'name': 'グルールの芝地', 'text': 'グルールの芝地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nグルールの芝地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651395&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ceee65db-aa12-4911-b490-39f57dc00276', 'multiverseId': 651395}, 'multiverseid': 651395}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grübelschlängler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Grübelschlängler ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nHerbeirufen {2}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650464&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99562480-080f-4da7-8538-d8b1c5db10eb\', \'multiverseId\': 650464}, \'multiverseid\': 650464}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond des pensées\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Vagabond des pensées arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes.\\nÉvocation {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650723&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e3c268a-0ccc-4d4b-a496-ec3fdce479fd\', \'multiverseId\': 650723}, \'multiverseid\': 650723}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondo Pensoso\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Vagabondo Pensoso entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte.\\nApparire {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5500b007-5376-4031-92db-7fe05025c5dd\', \'multiverseId\': 650982}, \'multiverseid\': 650982}, {\'name\': \'熟考漂い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n熟考漂いが戦場に出たとき、カード２枚を引く。\\n想起{2}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e657b4d-9ccc-4b51-b388-e8fe15bd91ee\', \'multiverseId\': 651241}, \'multiverseid\': 651241}]', "[{'name': 'Hafen von Karfell', 'text': 'Der Hafen von Karfell kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\n{3}{U}{B}{B}, {T}, opfere den Hafen von Karfell: Du millst vier Karten und bringst dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650633&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d288b14-c7cc-46ab-9946-6488c4405a80', 'multiverseId': 650633}, 'multiverseid': 650633}, {'name': 'Port de Karfell', 'text': 'Le Port de Karfell arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\n{3}{U}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez le Port de Karfell : Meulez quatre cartes, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650892&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ad82618-c303-4b86-87cb-f15676bceacd', 'multiverseId': 650892}, 'multiverseid': 650892}, {'name': 'Porto di Karfell', 'text': 'Il Porto di Karfell entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\n{3}{U}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica il Porto di Karfell: Macina quattro carte, poi fai tornare sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651151&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd210b957-d17b-42da-963f-bd5ed2e057a0', 'multiverseId': 651151}, 'multiverseid': 651151}, {'name': 'カーフェルの港', 'text': 'カーフェルの港はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\n{3}{U}{B}{B},{T},カーフェルの港を生け贄に捧げる：カード４枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に戻す。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651410&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2bfcf14-b969-458c-80e5-a2d50e988b8e', 'multiverseId': 651410}, 'multiverseid': 651410}]", "[{'name': 'Halliers tranquilles', 'text': 'Les Halliers tranquilles arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\nRecyclage {G} ({G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650921&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76b150c8-4685-4410-8806-ecab3b96ed86', 'multiverseId': 650921}, 'multiverseid': 650921}, {'name': 'Boschetto Tranquillo', 'text': 'Il Boschetto Tranquillo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\nCiclo {G} ({G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651180&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95419558-5fb3-46c0-93b9-878b776b4a53', 'multiverseId': 651180}, 'multiverseid': 651180}, {'name': '平穏な茂み', 'text': '平穏な茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\nサイクリング {G}（{G}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651439&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03972787-d3e8-462c-8bf3-1706fa276466', 'multiverseId': 651439}, 'multiverseid': 651439}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hartnäckiger Detektiv\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Hartnäckige Detektiv ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 2 an. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner seine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges zieht, kannst du den Hartnäckigen Detektiv aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650480&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f5db77-83d7-4064-b49b-2aae7887cae8\', \'multiverseId\': 650480}, \'multiverseid\': 650480}, {\'name\': \'Détective obstiné\', \'text\': "Quand le Détective obstiné arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche sa deuxième carte à chaque tour, vous pouvez renvoyer dans votre main le Détective obstiné depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efaf3a81-13a9-46dc-a2e8-d321a9d5c1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 650739}, \'multiverseid\': 650739}, {\'name\': \'Detective Ostinato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Detective Ostinato entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario pesca la sua seconda carta in ogni turno, puoi riprendere in mano il Detective Ostinato dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d3c53ff-41bc-441c-9f9d-34b212087bef\', \'multiverseId\': 650998}, \'multiverseid\': 650998}, {\'name\': \'根気強い探偵\', \'text\': \'根気強い探偵が戦場に出たとき、諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\\n対戦相手１人が各ターン内の自分の２枚目のカードを引くたび、あなたの墓地にある根気強い探偵をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a481a823-ead2-486b-9c78-9f5b0a957cde\', \'multiverseId\': 651257}, \'multiverseid\': 651257}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hedderwald-Seetang\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {2}\\nZu Beginn jedes Kampfes werden andere Hinweise, die du kontrollierst, zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen bis zum Ende des Zuges zu 6/6 Pflanze-Kreaturen.\\n{2}, opfere den Hedderwald-Seetang: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hinweis, Pflanze\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst erfahrene Detektive können durch fingierte Beweise in die Irre geführt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e981850-c840-4177-aefd-7e3e18574411\', \'multiverseId\': 650002}, \'multiverseid\': 650002}, {\'name\': \'Varech enchevêtreur de trésors\', \'text\': "Parade {2}\\nAu début de chaque combat, les autres indices que vous contrôlez deviennent des créatures 6/6 Plante en plus de leurs autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{2}, sacrifiez le Varech enchevêtreur de trésors : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — indice et plante\', \'flavor\': \'Même des détectives aguerris peuvent se faire mener en bateau par des fausses preuves.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650042&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7120320d-050b-4062-b892-99b0e376d912\', \'multiverseId\': 650042}, \'multiverseid\': 650042}, {\'name\': \'Alghe Imprigionatesori\', \'text\': "Egida {2}\\nAll\'inizio di ogni combattimento, gli altri Indizi che controlli diventano creature Pianta 6/6 in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi fino alla fine del turno.\\n{2}, Sacrifica le Alghe Imprigionatesori: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Pianta Indizio\', \'flavor\': \'Per quanto fosse affidato a detective esperti, inquinando le prove, il caso è stato affondato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2e5039-86fe-4572-8fd8-91929f307883\', \'multiverseId\': 650082}, \'multiverseid\': 650082}, {\'name\': \'絡み集めの海藻\', \'text\': \'護法{2}\\n各戦闘の開始時に、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての手掛かりは、他のタイプに加えて、６/６の植物・クリーチャーになる。\\n{2}, 絡み集めの海藻を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 手掛かり・植物\', \'flavor\': \'経験豊富な探偵ですら、でっち上げた証拠に釣られる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c42eda2f-c8eb-4b04-a107-ca0787a9c028\', \'multiverseId\': 650122}, \'multiverseid\': 650122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hedderwald-Seetang\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {2}\\nZu Beginn jedes Kampfes werden andere Hinweise, die du kontrollierst, zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen bis zum Ende des Zuges zu 6/6 Pflanze-Kreaturen.\\n{2}, opfere den Hedderwald-Seetang: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hinweis, Pflanze\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst erfahrene Detektive können durch fingierte Beweise in die Irre geführt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d156ba69-95a5-4ecf-bed0-b6a94c61ae24\', \'multiverseId\': 651535}, \'multiverseid\': 651535}, {\'name\': \'Varech enchevêtreur de trésors\', \'text\': "Parade {2}\\nAu début de chaque combat, les autres indices que vous contrôlez deviennent des créatures 6/6 Plante en plus de leurs autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{2}, sacrifiez le Varech enchevêtreur de trésors : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — indice et plante\', \'flavor\': \'Même des détectives aguerris peuvent se faire mener en bateau par des fausses preuves.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651574&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e20692a4-1077-4161-bab6-6e3dfd1452e8\', \'multiverseId\': 651574}, \'multiverseid\': 651574}, {\'name\': \'絡み集めの海藻\', \'text\': \'護法{2}\\n各戦闘の開始時に、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての手掛かりは、他のタイプに加えて、６/６の植物・クリーチャーになる。\\n{2}, 絡み集めの海藻を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 手掛かり・植物\', \'flavor\': \'経験豊富な探偵ですら、でっち上げた証拠に釣られる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09bdb354-97fd-4438-a3b8-4a78d35f12ed\', \'multiverseId\': 651613}, \'multiverseid\': 651613}, {\'name\': \'缠宝海藻\', \'text\': \'守护{2}\\n在每次战斗开始时，直到回合结束，由你操控的其他线索成为6/6植物生物，且仍具有原本类别。\\n{2}，牺牲缠宝海藻：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 线索／植物\', \'flavor\': \'就连最老道的侦探也会被植入证据牵着走。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cfd6d53-3200-43a4-96dd-234f68b1a713\', \'multiverseId\': 651652}, \'multiverseid\': 651652}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heilige Gipfel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.)\\nDie Heiligen Gipfel kommen getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Land — Gebirge, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'In den schwebenden Städten Serras sind alle willkommen, doch wenige außer den Treuesten versuchen den Aufstieg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650638&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fbc2a8-d54f-49be-9121-86336a3d2a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 650638}, \'multiverseid\': 650638}, {\'name\': \'Pics sacrés\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.)\\nLes Pics sacrés arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — montagne et plaine\', \'flavor\': "Tout le monde est le bienvenu dans les cités flottantes de Serra, mais seuls les plus croyants tentent l\'ascension.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05a118ef-d484-41c6-89f7-7cb40cc230d6\', \'multiverseId\': 650897}, \'multiverseid\': 650897}, {\'name\': \'Picchi Sacri\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.)\\nI Picchi Sacri entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Montagna Pianura\', \'flavor\': "Chiunque è il benvenuto nelle città fluttuanti di Serra, ma solo i più fedeli tentano l\'ascesa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c074f18b-6434-40ce-b8ad-c689a027c662\', \'multiverseId\': 651156}, \'multiverseid\': 651156}, {\'name\': \'聖なる峰\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。）\\n聖なる峰はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 山・平地\', \'flavor\': \'セラの浮遊都市は誰でも受け入れるが、そこに昇ろうと試みるのは最も信心深い者だけである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9247cfd9-431f-417c-8a4c-9e9bdff323c1\', \'multiverseId\': 651415}, \'multiverseid\': 651415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelswolken-Weite\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Horizont von Otaria glitzert, wenn die Sonne von oben und das Meer von unten zusammentreffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650647&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a883b9ec-e3a6-45d9-b31b-c7d00b9511bb\', \'multiverseId\': 650647}, \'multiverseid\': 650647}, {\'name\': \'Immensité de Cielcouvert\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Depuis Otaria, le soleil rejoint la mer dans l\'horizon scintillant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7ce09a-17b6-4dba-a242-2582c145d1d4\', \'multiverseId\': 650906}, \'multiverseid\': 650906}, {\'name\': \'Distesa di Cielonube\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Da Otaria, il sole incontra il mare in un orizzonte abbagliante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ffe9cf4-f140-4fe6-bc00-8f9444c99e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 651165}, \'multiverseid\': 651165}, {\'name\': \'広漠なるスカイクラウド\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアから見渡すと、頭上の太陽とその下の海が光輝く水平線でまじわっているのが見える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0d7716d-c21c-4e8b-8a11-0aa6f3fe84dd\', \'multiverseId\': 651424}, \'multiverseid\': 651424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hitzige Verfolgungsjagd\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Hitzige Verfolgungsjagd ins Spiel kommt, verdächtige eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Solange die Hitzige Verfolgungsjagd im Spiel bleibt, ist jene Kreatur zusätzlich angestachelt.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls zwei oder mehr Spieler die Partie verloren haben, übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über alle angestachelten und/oder verdächtigten Kreaturen. Enttappe sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650010&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a028bfdc-d654-4773-950e-69ff0581536c\', \'multiverseId\': 650010}, \'multiverseid\': 650010}, {\'name\': \'Talonnage\', \'text\': "Quand le Talonnage arrive sur le champ de bataille, suspectez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Tant que le Talonnage reste sur le champ de bataille, cette créature est aussi incitée.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, si au moins deux joueurs ont perdu la partie, acquérez le contrôle de toutes les créatures incitées et/ou suspectées jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez-les. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f06c08-29b5-4a02-800e-d4e7bbff9a08\', \'multiverseId\': 650050}, \'multiverseid\': 650050}, {\'name\': \'Inseguimento Accalorato\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Inseguimento Accalorato entra nel campo di battaglia, sospetta una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Fintanto che l\'Inseguimento Accalorato rimane sul campo di battaglia, quella creatura è anche spronata.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se due o più giocatori hanno perso la partita, prendi il controllo di tutte le creature spronate e/o sospettate fino alla fine del turno. STAPpale. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afdaef9e-ca9b-49cf-b9c0-525c2de4d947\', \'multiverseId\': 650090}, \'multiverseid\': 650090}, {\'name\': \'白熱する追跡\', \'text\': \'白熱する追跡が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それに容疑をかける。白熱する追跡が戦場にあるかぎり、そのクリーチャーは使嗾されてもいる。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、２人以上のプレイヤーがゲームに敗北していた場合、ターン終了時まで、使嗾されていたり容疑をかけられたりしているすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。それらをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e160048-660c-47f9-882a-84672edb81d3\', \'multiverseId\': 650130}, \'multiverseid\': 650130}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hitzige Verfolgungsjagd\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Hitzige Verfolgungsjagd ins Spiel kommt, verdächtige eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Solange die Hitzige Verfolgungsjagd im Spiel bleibt, ist jene Kreatur zusätzlich angestachelt.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls zwei oder mehr Spieler die Partie verloren haben, übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über alle angestachelten und/oder verdächtigten Kreaturen. Enttappe sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4cfeda-f5f7-4269-b4b1-535f3bcffdcc\', \'multiverseId\': 651543}, \'multiverseid\': 651543}, {\'name\': \'Talonnage\', \'text\': "Quand le Talonnage arrive sur le champ de bataille, suspectez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Tant que le Talonnage reste sur le champ de bataille, cette créature est aussi incitée.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, si au moins deux joueurs ont perdu la partie, acquérez le contrôle de toutes les créatures incitées et/ou suspectées jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez-les. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc3810c7-2c52-4dac-8cea-ae73288e6d39\', \'multiverseId\': 651582}, \'multiverseid\': 651582}, {\'name\': \'白熱する追跡\', \'text\': \'白熱する追跡が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それに容疑をかける。白熱する追跡が戦場にあるかぎり、そのクリーチャーは使嗾されてもいる。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、２人以上のプレイヤーがゲームに敗北していた場合、ターン終了時まで、使嗾されていたり容疑をかけられたりしているすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。それらをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71997583-a009-4af4-a7f9-a0e6bad6f82f\', \'multiverseId\': 651621}, \'multiverseid\': 651621}, {\'name\': \'穷追不舍\', \'text\': \'当穷追不舍进战场时，怀疑目标由对手操控的生物。只要穷追不舍仍在战场上，该生物也为已煽惑。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，若已有两位或更多牌手输掉这盘游戏，则获得所有已煽惑和／或遭疑生物的操控权直到回合结束。将它们重置。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a5357b8-aca9-42cf-a898-9ccb76b404d5\', \'multiverseId\': 651660}, \'multiverseid\': 651660}]', "[{'name': 'Hornissenkönigin', 'text': 'Fliegend, Todesberührung\\nWenn die Hornissenkönigin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 grüne Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit und Todesberührung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650525&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9f14d41-ff76-4e51-bedd-78de9d32e0be', 'multiverseId': 650525}, 'multiverseid': 650525}, {'name': 'Reine des frelons', 'text': 'Vol, contact mortel\\nQuand la Reine des frelons arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 verte Insecte avec le vol et le contact mortel.', 'type': 'Créature — insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650784&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d550d01-31f9-4c45-895f-c4f2475ea71c', 'multiverseId': 650784}, 'multiverseid': 650784}, {'name': 'Regina dei Calabroni', 'text': 'Volare, tocco letale\\nQuando la Regina dei Calabroni entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura Insetto 1/1 verdi con volare e tocco letale.', 'type': 'Creatura — Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651043&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53930469-1629-47d0-a102-8b07fb572bfa', 'multiverseId': 651043}, 'multiverseid': 651043}, {'name': '女王スズメバチ', 'text': '飛行、接死\\n女王スズメバチが戦場に出たとき、飛行と接死を持つ緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651302&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56d7eafe-f487-41cf-8d21-8b20aa33f50f', 'multiverseId': 651302}, 'multiverseid': 651302}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hydroid-Krasis\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhältst du X/2 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst X/2 Karten. Runde jeweils ab.\\nFliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDie Hydroid-Krasis kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Qualle, Hydra, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Chaos ist ein geringer Preis für neue Forschungsergebnisse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650565&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcf384e5-58ec-457b-b44f-34e7092b36c6\', \'multiverseId\': 650565}, \'multiverseid\': 650565}, {\'name\': \'Krasis hydroïde\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous gagnez la moitié de X points de vie et vous piochez la moitié de X cartes. Arrondissez à l\'unité inférieure à chaque fois.\\nVol, piétinement\\nLe Krasis hydroïde arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature — méduse et hydre et bête\', \'flavor\': \'Certaines informations valent bien un peu de chaos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650824&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55d79d2f-2917-4fc6-a6c0-999d88512623\', \'multiverseId\': 650824}, \'multiverseid\': 650824}, {\'name\': \'ハイドロイド混成体\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたはＸの半分の点数のライフを得て、Ｘの半分の枚数のカードを引く。それぞれの端数は切り捨てる。\\n飛行、トランプル\\nハイドロイド混成体は、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クラゲ・ハイドラ・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'大惨事もデータの対価としては安いものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a548d5-f356-47ec-83e3-4b3be6610f10\', \'multiverseId\': 651342}, \'multiverseid\': 651342}]', '[{\'name\': \'Händlerin der Wahrheit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\nHinweise, die du kontrollierst, haben Edelmut. (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält jene Kreatur für jedes Vorkommen von Edelmut auf Permanenten, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394df14f-67e4-4090-88af-617c7bb670d4\', \'multiverseId\': 649989}, \'multiverseid\': 649989}, {\'name\': \'Marchande de vérité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, enquêtez.\\nLes indices que vous contrôlez ont l\'exaltation. (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque occurrence d\'exaltation parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.)", \'type\': \'Créature — ange et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650029&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d1abbc-0272-4482-a49d-5639f3160f09\', \'multiverseId\': 650029}, \'multiverseid\': 650029}, {\'name\': \'Mercante di Verità\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina che controlli muore, indaga.\\nGli Indizi che controlli hanno esaltato. (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni istanza di esaltato tra i permanenti che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Detective Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4713f869-c134-4397-bbba-d144ca35d77a\', \'multiverseId\': 650069}, \'multiverseid\': 650069}, {\'name\': \'真実の商人\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、調査を行う。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての手掛かりは賛美を持つ。（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの賛美能力１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b643af29-544a-4722-b157-cc160c0dc9df\', \'multiverseId\': 650109}, \'multiverseid\': 650109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Händlerin der Wahrheit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\nHinweise, die du kontrollierst, haben Edelmut.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a09aac3-c58f-4c51-9059-135a14803735\', \'multiverseId\': 651523}, \'multiverseid\': 651523}, {\'name\': \'Marchande de vérité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, enquêtez.\\nLes indices que vous contrôlez ont l\'exaltation.", \'type\': \'Créature — ange et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651562&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96c51952-80f1-434f-952c-60aa7c478eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 651562}, \'multiverseid\': 651562}, {\'name\': \'真実の商人\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、調査を行う。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての手掛かりは賛美を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7292e9ec-98b9-4289-96a9-1b49614473a2\', \'multiverseId\': 651601}, \'multiverseid\': 651601}, {\'name\': \'真相商人\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，探查。\\n由你操控的线索具有颂威异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 天使／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94da594c-d66c-4f26-bcb6-bc491ba5b24e\', \'multiverseId\': 651640}, \'multiverseid\': 651640}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter des Einklangs\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Endsegments jedes Gegners und falls jener Spieler mehr Kreaturen kontrolliert als du, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nZu Beginn des Endsegments jedes Gegners und falls jener Spieler mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Standardlandkarte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650423&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6630c278-2f40-415b-a9a1-f52becb064c0\', \'multiverseId\': 650423}, \'multiverseid\': 650423}, {\'name\': "Gardien de l\'Accord", \'text\': "Au début de l\'étape de fin de chaque adversaire, si ce joueur contrôle plus de créatures que vous, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\\nAu début de l\'étape de fin de chaque adversaire, si ce joueur contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650682&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'844ee715-3e51-4ad4-b15f-cbcbec08d82c\', \'multiverseId\': 650682}, \'multiverseid\': 650682}, {\'name\': "Custode dell\'Accordo", \'text\': "All\'inizio della sottofase finale di ogni avversario, se quel giocatore controlla più creature di te, crei una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca.\\nAll\'inizio della sottofase finale di ogni avversario, se quel giocatore controlla più terre di te, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d0856bb-ce37-44bc-aec4-6965cb346755\', \'multiverseId\': 650941}, \'multiverseid\': 650941}, {\'name\': \'調和の守り手\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手の終了ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーがあなたよりも多くのクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたは白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n各対戦相手の終了ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーがあなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'138a1c2f-0365-4b79-bd5f-bd35f13bc48b\', \'multiverseId\': 651200}, \'multiverseid\': 651200}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immervoller Kelch\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {2} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {2} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDer Immervolle Kelch kommt mit X Ladungsmarken ins Spiel, wobei X die Anzahl ist, wie oft seine Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C} für jede Ladungsmarke auf dem Immervollen Kelch.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88edd6c5-ee32-485a-b281-1937adc59f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 650580}, \'multiverseid\': 650580}, {\'name\': \'Calice toujours ruisselant\', \'text\': "Multikick {2} (Vous pouvez payer {2} supplémentaires autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nLe Calice toujours ruisselant arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un marqueur « charge » pour chaque fois qu\'il a été kické.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur le Calice toujours ruisselant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'660b1f73-a1de-495a-a597-46ecb69a9eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 650839}, \'multiverseid\': 650839}, {\'name\': \'Calice Infinito\', \'text\': \'Multipotenziamento {2} (Puoi pagare {2} addizionale un qualsiasi numero di volte mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nIl Calice Infinito entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino carica per ogni volta che è stato potenziato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C} per ogni segnalino carica sul Calice Infinito.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f40b5bb-9b25-43cf-bc7e-fa6977a4e857\', \'multiverseId\': 651098}, \'multiverseid\': 651098}, {\'name\': \'永遠溢れの杯\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{2}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{2}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n永遠溢れの杯は、これがキッカーされた１回につき１個の蓄積カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：永遠溢れの杯の上にある蓄積カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8e1925-409a-43b3-b959-58505e00f26e\', \'multiverseId\': 651357}, \'multiverseid\': 651357}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierende Statuen\', \'text\': \'Nichtartefakt-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, haben Improvisieren. (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, jene Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapurs am meisten gefeierte Erfinder wurden als mechanische Konstrukte verewigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744e01f5-c641-468c-aacb-c6db5f390ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 650583}, \'multiverseid\': 650583}, {\'name\': \'Statuaire inspiratrice\', \'text\': "Les sorts non-artefact que vous lancez ont l\'improvisation. (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ces sorts. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les plus illustres inventeurs de Ghirapur ont été immortalisés sous forme mécanique.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a213fadb-69f3-4307-828e-36f8cf0eb0ad\', \'multiverseId\': 650842}, \'multiverseid\': 650842}, {\'name\': \'Statuaria Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'Le magie non artefatto che lanci hanno improvvisare. (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare quelle magie. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I più celebri inventori di Ghirapur sono stati immortalati in forma meccanica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee63bd22-af7b-4a55-97b3-99ae7618bcc0\', \'multiverseId\': 651101}, \'multiverseid\': 651101}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する彫像\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えてアーティファクトでないすべての呪文は即席を持つ。（あなたのアーティファクトが、それらの呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは{1}を支払う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプール最高の発明者は、機械仕掛けが後世まで讃える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eab9853-dc22-4701-8a91-84680fc6fed5\', \'multiverseId\': 651360}, \'multiverseid\': 651360}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jenseitiger Begleiter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn der Jenseitige Begleiter stirbt und falls er kein Geist ist, bringe ihn unter der Kontrolle seines Besitzers mit vier Ladungsmarken ins Spiel zurück. Er ist ein Geist-Detektiv. (Er ist kein Mensch mehr.)\\n{1}{W}, {T}, entferne eine Ladungsmarke vom Jenseitigen Begleiter: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dir in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aa7762f-c82b-4845-8434-4c8852a4e11b\', \'multiverseId\': 649990}, \'multiverseid\': 649990}, {\'name\': \'Escorte fantasmagorique\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Escorte fantasmagorique meurt, si ce n\'est pas un esprit, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec quatre marqueurs « charge » sur elle. C\'est un esprit et détective. (Ce n\'est plus un humain.)\\n{1}{W}, {T}, retirez un marqueur « charge » de l\'Escorte fantasmagorique : Détruisez une créature ciblée qui vous a infligé des blessures ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee25fb28-19b7-469e-8e6d-e905777dae6b\', \'multiverseId\': 650030}, \'multiverseid\': 650030}, {\'name\': \'Scorta Ultraterrena\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Scorta Ultraterrena muore, se non è uno Spirito, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con quattro segnalini carica. È un Detective Spirito. (Non è più un Umano.)\\n{1}{W}, {T}, Rimuovi un segnalino carica dalla Scorta Ultraterrena: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio che ti ha inflitto danno in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Detective Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ecdb810-2305-409e-877a-2bf91f106388\', \'multiverseId\': 650070}, \'multiverseid\': 650070}, {\'name\': \'異世界の随員\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n異世界の随員が死亡したとき、これがスピリットでない場合、これをオーナーのコントロール下で蓄積カウンター４個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。これはスピリット・探偵である。（これは人間ではない。）\\n{1}{W}, {T}, 異世界の随員の上から蓄積カウンター１個を取り除く：このターンにあなたにダメージを与えたクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'366536ef-7493-46a5-903b-a046b709fc01\', \'multiverseId\': 650110}, \'multiverseid\': 650110}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jenseitiger Begleiter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn der Jenseitige Begleiter stirbt und falls er kein Geist ist, bringe ihn unter der Kontrolle seines Besitzers mit vier Ladungsmarken ins Spiel zurück. Er ist ein Geist-Detektiv. (Er ist kein Mensch mehr.)\\n{1}{W}, {T}, entferne eine Ladungsmarke vom Jenseitigen Begleiter: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dir in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8168269-34cb-4f21-8d16-54ee0b2ea156\', \'multiverseId\': 651524}, \'multiverseid\': 651524}, {\'name\': \'Escorte fantasmagorique\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Escorte fantasmagorique meurt, si ce n\'est pas un esprit, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec quatre marqueurs « charge » sur elle. C\'est un esprit et détective. (Ce n\'est plus un humain.)\\n{1}{W}, {T}, retirez un marqueur « charge » de l\'Escorte fantasmagorique : Détruisez une créature ciblée qui vous a infligé des blessures ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651563&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8708865-acb7-4790-9aa5-f875aa8ecf51\', \'multiverseId\': 651563}, \'multiverseid\': 651563}, {\'name\': \'異世界の随員\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n異世界の随員が死亡したとき、これがスピリットでない場合、これをオーナーのコントロール下で蓄積カウンター４個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。これはスピリット・探偵である。（これは人間ではない。）\\n{1}{W}, {T}, 異世界の随員の上から蓄積カウンター１個を取り除く：このターンにあなたにダメージを与えたクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f781a86-f9c9-4a30-8a43-393d7f69cd88\', \'multiverseId\': 651602}, \'multiverseid\': 651602}, {\'name\': \'异界卫士\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当异界卫士死去时，若它不是精怪，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且上面有四个充电指示物。它是精怪／侦探。（它不再是人类。）\\n{1}{W}，{T}，从异界卫士上移去一个充电指示物：消灭目标本回合中对你造成过伤害的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2ab8d11-cff5-41fd-88be-0fb69c574f84\', \'multiverseId\': 651641}, \'multiverseid\': 651641}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jeskas Wille\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines. Falls du einen Commander kontrollierst, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du beides bestimmen.\\n• Erzeuge {R} für jede Karte auf der Hand eines Gegners deiner Wahl.\\n• Schicke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Sammle deine Kraft. Bereite dich vor."\\n—Jeska zu Radha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09a5efda-284c-4a91-ab2e-97d2ec3721dc\', \'multiverseId\': 650509}, \'multiverseid\': 650509}, {\'name\': \'Volonté de Jeska\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un. Si vous contrôlez un commandant au moment où vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez choisir les deux.\\n• Ajoutez {R} pour chaque carte dans la main d\'un adversaire ciblé.\\n• Exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les jouer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Rassemble tes forces. Prépare-toi. »\\n—Jeska, à Radha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650768&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fe7b3f6-2c5d-48dd-909a-3c223b085266\', \'multiverseId\': 650768}, \'multiverseid\': 650768}, {\'name\': \'Volontà di Jeska\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno. Se controlli un comandante mentre lanci questa magia, puoi scegliere entrambi.\\n• Aggiungi {R} per ogni carta nella mano di un avversario bersaglio.\\n• Esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarle in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Raccogli le tue forze. Preparati."\\n—Jeska a Radha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cbe5507-805c-411b-8e01-6044973bd780\', \'multiverseId\': 651027}, \'multiverseid\': 651027}, {\'name\': \'ジェスカの意志\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。この呪文を唱える際にあなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたは両方を選んでもよい。\\n・対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの手札にあるカード１枚につき{R}を加える。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそれらをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「力を集めて、準備をしておいて。」\\n――ジェスカからラーダへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7ee4fd-984c-4320-a2e1-b4d3e3916c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 651286}, \'multiverseid\': 651286}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jolrael, Mwonvuli-Einsiedlerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges haben Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft X/X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Menschen bringen nichts als Leid und Täuschung. Sie sind in meinem Wald nicht willkommen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aebb8cfb-21ea-4215-9eb6-103405b66a09\', \'multiverseId\': 650526}, \'multiverseid\': 650526}, {\'name\': \'Jolraël, recluse de la Mwônvouli\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Chat.\\n{4}{G}{G} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force et une endurance de base de X/X, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Les humains n\'apportent que souffrance et tromperie. Ils ne sont pas les bienvenus dans ma forêt. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93a75f4-ec53-49e3-81a9-b45e2f287bdf\', \'multiverseId\': 650785}, \'multiverseid\': 650785}, {\'name\': \'Jolrael, Eremita di Mwonvuli\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Felino 2/2 verde.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Fino alla fine del turno, le creature che controlli hanno forza e costituzione base X/X, dove X è il numero di carte nella tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli umani sono capaci di causare solo sofferenze e inganni. Non sono i benvenuti nella mia foresta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e051682-e401-45e7-8cc7-72695759f2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 651044}, \'multiverseid\': 651044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaiserlicher Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nMorph {6}{R}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Kaiserliche Höllendrache aufgedeckt wird, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Drache-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb16c598-a138-43ae-a86c-afbe8e3cf5cd\', \'multiverseId\': 650508}, \'multiverseid\': 650508}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer impérial\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMue {6}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand l\'Escouflenfer impérial est retourné face visible, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de dragon, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature — dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14b85c2-9e5b-4e5f-a06c-5305b9c2f0d9\', \'multiverseId\': 650767}, \'multiverseid\': 650767}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale Imperiale\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nMetamorfosi {6}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Nibbio Infernale Imperiale viene girato a faccia in su, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Drago, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37406cdf-d739-40ce-8c14-2ec1165a62b0\', \'multiverseId\': 651026}, \'multiverseid\': 651026}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kappa-Kanonier\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nAbwehr {4}\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Kappa-Kanonier. Er kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Schildkröte, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af31ea9f-f01f-49a7-8720-0c5c13a5a2de\', \'multiverseId\': 650461}, \'multiverseid\': 650461}, {\'name\': \'Canonnier kappa\', \'text\': "Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nParade {4}\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Canonnier kappa et il ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — tortue terrestre et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650720&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb20b581-9abe-4f6a-8c47-ec119516024b\', \'multiverseId\': 650720}, \'multiverseid\': 650720}, {\'name\': \'Kappa Cannoniere\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nEgida {4}\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Kappa Cannoniere. Il Kappa Cannoniere non può essere bloccato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Guerriero Tartaruga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8608e79-805c-4a41-9791-add2f333383b\', \'multiverseId\': 650979}, \'multiverseid\': 650979}, {\'name\': \'河童の砲手\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは、{1}を支払う。）\\n護法{4}\\nアーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、河童の砲手の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。このターン、これはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 海亀・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'844e45ac-70a0-43f4-91d6-7b564d20d171\', \'multiverseId\': 651238}, \'multiverseid\': 651238}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaust, Auge der Lichtung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und die in diesem Zug aufgedeckt wurde, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{T}: Decke eine verdeckte angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dryade, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du denkst, du wirst beobachtet, hast du wahrscheinlich recht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad3db0b-f9da-42bb-89ab-2bcdc41c38d3\', \'multiverseId\': 649911}, \'multiverseid\': 649911}, {\'name\': \'Kaust, les yeux de la clairière\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez qui a été retournée face visible ce tour-ci inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.\\n{T}: Retournez face visible une créature attaquante face cachée ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — dryade et détective\', \'flavor\': "Si vous avez l\'impression qu\'on vous observe, vous avez probablement raison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847f8023-69fa-4961-96bf-1099e09733df\', \'multiverseId\': 649915}, \'multiverseid\': 649915}, {\'name\': \'Kaust, Occhi della Radura\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli e che è stata girata a faccia in su in questo turno infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\\n{T}: Gira a faccia in su una creatura attaccante a faccia in giù bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Detective Driade\', \'flavor\': \'Se ti senti osservato, probabilmente è così.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a43c43-5a09-4599-a8ed-9db8f941a85b\', \'multiverseId\': 649919}, \'multiverseid\': 649919}, {\'name\': \'林間の眼、カウスト\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている、このターンに表向きになったクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしていて裏向きである攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを表向きにする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドライアド・探偵\', \'flavor\': \'誰かに見られている気がしたら、その勘はおそらく正しい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402d7411-eb99-40a0-bc72-60e3b0f846e9\', \'multiverseId\': 649923}, \'multiverseid\': 649923}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaust, Auge der Lichtung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und die in diesem Zug aufgedeckt wurde, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{T}: Decke eine verdeckte angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dryade, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du denkst, du wirst beobachtet, hast du wahrscheinlich recht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651452&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbdb31cb-19ae-49e7-b4c1-bfb63616ba54\', \'multiverseId\': 651452}, \'multiverseid\': 651452}, {\'name\': \'Kaust, les yeux de la clairière\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez qui a été retournée face visible ce tour-ci inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.\\n{T}: Retournez face visible une créature attaquante face cachée ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — dryade et détective\', \'flavor\': "Si vous avez l\'impression qu\'on vous observe, vous avez probablement raison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea28237e-fbdb-4835-860f-9b8e723d25a6\', \'multiverseId\': 651460}, \'multiverseid\': 651460}, {\'name\': \'林間の眼、カウスト\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている、このターンに表向きになったクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしていて裏向きである攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを表向きにする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドライアド・探偵\', \'flavor\': \'誰かに見られている気がしたら、その勘はおそらく正しい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4bc2285-257a-4ab6-a47b-ffef9c9ab88e\', \'multiverseId\': 651468}, \'multiverseid\': 651468}, {\'name\': \'林地之眼寇斯特\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控且为本回合中翻回正面的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\\n{T}：将目标由你操控、牌面朝下且正进行攻击的生物翻回正面。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 树灵／侦探\', \'flavor\': \'如果你觉得有眼睛盯着你，那大概不是错觉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2270143-fb3b-495e-8038-3c3e19d86073\', \'multiverseId\': 651476}, \'multiverseid\': 651476}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kazuul, der Tyrann der Klippen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreift und falls du der verteidigende Spieler bist, erzeuge einen 3/3 roten Oger-Kreaturenspielstein, es sei denn, der Beherrscher der angreifenden Kreatur bezahlt {3}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Oger, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Warnung an diejenigen, die durch die Klippen klettern wollen, ohne Tribut zu zahlen: Der Weg nach unten ist lang, dauert aber nur kurz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650510&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bddac092-b2df-4495-90ab-e645739cc412\', \'multiverseId\': 650510}, \'multiverseid\': 650510}, {\'name\': \'Kazuul, Tyran des Falaises\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle attaque, si vous êtes le joueur défenseur, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 rouge Ogre à moins que le contrôleur de cette créature ne paie {3}.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ogre et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Un avertissement à quiconque escaladerait les falaises sans payer son dû : la chute est longue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650769&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f958ba0f-f0da-4735-ad2c-b2b66d8afb89\', \'multiverseId\': 650769}, \'multiverseid\': 650769}, {\'name\': \'Kazuul, Tiranno dei Dirupi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario attacca, se sei il giocatore in difesa, crea una pedina creatura Ogre 3/3 rossa a meno che il controllore di quella creatura non paghi {3}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Ogre\', \'flavor\': \'State attenti a scalare i dirupi senza pagarne il pedaggio a chi di dovere: la discesa è lunga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0bc869b-910b-464d-b3a0-1fcd7e060317\', \'multiverseId\': 651028}, \'multiverseid\': 651028}, {\'name\': \'崖の暴君、カズール\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、あなたが防御プレイヤーである場合、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、あなたは赤の３/３のオーガ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — オーガ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'貢ぎ物なしに崖を登る者に警告：長い道のりを覚悟しろ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a54669-c0dc-466a-8ccf-112ed6724ea7\', \'multiverseId\': 651287}, \'multiverseid\': 651287}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kherburg\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 0/1 roten Kobold-Kreaturenspielstein namens Kobolde von Kherburg.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich schwöre, für jeden, den Prossh auffrisst, schlüpfen drei neue aus einem Loch heraus."\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650623&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a633a5f-ed0f-4d27-a1c0-0d712eaca804\', \'multiverseId\': 650623}, \'multiverseid\': 650623}, {\'name\': \'Castel Kher\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 0/1 rouge Kobold appelé Kobolds de Castel Kher.\', \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Franchement, à chaque fois que Prossh en dévore un, trois autres sortent d\'un trou. »\\n—Jaya Ballard", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b04139f2-d13f-4684-a165-a24f8c94148f\', \'multiverseId\': 650882}, \'multiverseid\': 650882}, {\'name\': \'Roccaforte di Kher\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Coboldo 0/1 rossa chiamata Coboldi della Roccaforte di Kher.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Giuro che ogni volta che Prossh ne divora uno, ne sbucano altri tre da chissà dove."\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62141039-f07a-45e4-ba76-1bcbf4f3925e\', \'multiverseId\': 651141}, \'multiverseid\': 651141}, {\'name\': \'カー砦\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}{R}, {T}：「カー砦のコボルド」という名前の赤の０/１のコボルド・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'「ほんとよ、プローシュが一匹喰うたびに、どこかの穴からもう三匹出てくるのよ。」\\n――ヤヤ・バラード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'632b323b-7297-4201-a9e8-b48e4e705525\', \'multiverseId\': 651400}, \'multiverseid\': 651400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenwüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Schicke alle Friedhöfe ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Erst wenn nur noch Knochen übrig sind, endet der Fluch des Umherirrens. und der ewige Schlaf beginnt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650640&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8613ff62-afd7-4886-836b-9b64f0ce084d\', \'multiverseId\': 650640}, \'multiverseid\': 650640}, {\'name\': \'Terrains des charognards\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Exilez tous les cimetières.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': "Quand le dernier lambeau de chair se détache, la Malédiction d\'errance est rompue. Le mort peut enfin reposer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8fbb123-1e2d-49d6-9391-3239d4c2ea06\', \'multiverseId\': 650899}, \'multiverseid\': 650899}, {\'name\': \'屍肉あさりの地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：すべての墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'肉の最後の一片がなくなると放浪の呪いが解け、死者は安眠を許される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'899ecff2-fca2-437f-b338-6769bcd6ee49\', \'multiverseId\': 651417}, \'multiverseid\': 651417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Koma die Kosmosschlange\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 3/3 blauen Schlange-Kreaturenspielstein namens Komas Windungen.\\nOpfere eine andere Schlange: Bestimme eines —\\n• Tappe ein Permanent deiner Wahl. Seine aktivierten Fähigkeiten können in diesem Zug nicht aktiviert werden.\\n• Koma die Kosmosschlange erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650566&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d7305d-eea8-4eb8-9774-19053ad4cc75\', \'multiverseId\': 650566}, \'multiverseid\': 650566}, {\'name\': \'Koma, le Serpent du Cosmos\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 bleue Grand serpent appelé Annelure de Koma.\\nSacrifiez un autre grand serpent : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Engagez un permanent ciblé. Ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées ce tour-ci.\\n• Koma, le Serpent du Cosmos acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — grand serpent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117b0cfe-f665-4620-b14b-96c383c9f045\', \'multiverseId\': 650825}, \'multiverseid\': 650825}, {\'name\': \'星界の大蛇、コーマ\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、「コーマの分体」という名前の青の３/３の海蛇・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nこれでない海蛇１体を生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・パーマネント１つを対象とする。それをタップする。このターン、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\\n・ターン終了時まで、星界の大蛇、コーマは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44fa74cb-20d8-49ab-ac9c-9ed6f35c8462\', \'multiverseId\': 651343}, \'multiverseid\': 651343}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kopienjägerinnen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du Überwachen anwendest, kannst du {1}{U} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der Kopienjägerinnen ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich weiß ehrlich gesagt nicht, ob sie uns sabotieren oder mir beim Sortieren helfen wollen."\\n—Kruno, Sachbearbeiter der Agentur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea52228e-8e91-439a-977b-7b886002028b\', \'multiverseId\': 649998}, \'multiverseid\': 649998}, {\'name\': \'Attrape-copies\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surveillez, vous pouvez payer {1}{U}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'Attrape-copies.", \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'arrive pas à savoir s\'ils sabotent nos archives ou s\'ils essaient de m\'aider à les trier. »\\n—Kruno, employé de l\'Agence", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650038&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63eb0b50-b89d-4742-8c64-1224af6e6a91\', \'multiverseId\': 650038}, \'multiverseid\': 650038}, {\'name\': \'Afferracopie\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta sorvegli, puoi pagare {1}{U}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina che è una copia delle Afferracopie.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Non saprei dire se stiano sabotando i documenti o cercando di aiutarmi a riordinarli."\\n—Kruno, impiegato dell\\\'Agenzia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0f30b12-aded-42d7-80ed-eab0de149e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 650078}, \'multiverseid\': 650078}, {\'name\': \'複製押さえ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが諜報を行うたび、{1}{U}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、複製押さえのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'「記録作業を邪魔してるのか、整理整頓を助けてくれているのかは正直のところわからない。」\\n――探偵社職員、クルーノ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7198484a-f581-4359-920c-df306d748cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 650118}, \'multiverseid\': 650118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kopienjägerinnen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du Überwachen anwendest, kannst du {1}{U} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der Kopienjägerinnen ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich weiß ehrlich gesagt nicht, ob sie uns sabotieren oder mir beim Sortieren helfen wollen."\\n—Kruno, Sachbearbeiter der Agentur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec82deab-2aea-4619-b802-53928ac1d46e\', \'multiverseId\': 651531}, \'multiverseid\': 651531}, {\'name\': \'Attrape-copies\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surveillez, vous pouvez payer {1}{U}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'Attrape-copies.", \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'arrive pas à savoir s\'ils sabotent nos archives ou s\'ils essaient de m\'aider à les trier. »\\n—Kruno, employé de l\'Agence", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651570&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2f24696-11cb-46d3-a3b7-439a4362810e\', \'multiverseId\': 651570}, \'multiverseid\': 651570}, {\'name\': \'複製押さえ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが諜報を行うたび、{1}{U}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、複製押さえのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'「記録作業を邪魔してるのか、整理整頓を助けてくれているのかは正直のところわからない。」\\n――探偵社職員、クルーノ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ab1ebc5-e95b-4b43-9c2d-c3c0a6ec8c9c\', \'multiverseId\': 651609}, \'multiverseid\': 651609}, {\'name\': \'复体捕捉灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你刺探时，你可以支付{1}{U}。若你如此作，则派出一个为复体捕捉灵之复制品的衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵\', \'flavor\': \'「说实话，我也不知道他们是在破坏档案还是想帮我整理。」\\n～魔调局文员克纶诺\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb743003-73e0-4778-ae67-0d9b283c57c9\', \'multiverseId\': 651648}, \'multiverseid\': 651648}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kreischmaul\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Furcht (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder schwarzen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.)\\nWenn das Kreischmaul ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl.\\nHerbeirufen {1}{B} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a4be4fc-908e-40f0-bdde-d7a1d09db086\', \'multiverseId\': 650492}, \'multiverseid\': 650492}, {\'name\': \'Hurlegueule\', \'text\': "Peur (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.)\\nQuand le Hurlegueule arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez une créature non-artefact, non-noire ciblée.\\nÉvocation {1}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650751&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b9b8c36-c43f-4470-913f-58ba54f27af1\', \'multiverseId\': 650751}, \'multiverseid\': 650751}, {\'name\': \'Fauce Urlante\', \'text\': \'Paura (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature nere.)\\nQuando la Fauce Urlante entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura non artefatto, non nera bersaglio.\\nApparire {1}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd2847de-ce85-47ef-bb7a-b740ad75ed57\', \'multiverseId\': 651010}, \'multiverseid\': 651010}, {\'name\': \'叫び大口\', \'text\': \'畏怖（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャーにはブロックされない。）\\n叫び大口が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n想起{1}{B}（あなたはこの呪文を想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d42453f-6d53-45e1-9d61-450cc135f888\', \'multiverseId\': 651269}, \'multiverseid\': 651269}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegerischer Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erhält jede andere Kreatur, die einen deiner Gegner angreift, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650425&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff674e89-506f-4cf4-b469-4ca97cf31d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 650425}, \'multiverseid\': 650425}, {\'name\': \'Impetus martial\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, chaque autre créature qui attaque un de vos adversaires gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650684&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0acfdc7-f7a6-4af8-83c7-bac4b7ba9802\', \'multiverseId\': 650684}, \'multiverseid\': 650684}, {\'name\': \'Impeto Marziale\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, ogni altra creatura che sta attaccando uno dei tuoi avversari prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba1ab2c5-4754-4547-b279-816b9681b19c\', \'multiverseId\': 650943}, \'multiverseid\': 650943}, {\'name\': \'軍部の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、使嗾されている。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたの対戦相手を攻撃していてそれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223a0ba2-1c68-43ee-ab74-be6c397875eb\', \'multiverseId\': 651202}, \'multiverseid\': 651202}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegskabinett\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, bezahle Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl an Farben in der Farbidentität deines Commanders: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Figur wird auf einer Karte bewegt, und der Lauf des Krieges ändert sich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650663&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'626025ba-343c-4224-bacd-ca319c52e1e2\', \'multiverseId\': 650663}, \'multiverseid\': 650663}, {\'name\': \'Salle de guerre\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, payez un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de couleurs dans l\'identité couleur de vos commandants : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Il suffit de déplacer une figurine sur une carte pour changer le cours de la guerre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650922&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a844fd1-5bee-4229-9505-f0d2073bb241\', \'multiverseId\': 650922}, \'multiverseid\': 650922}, {\'name\': \'作戦室\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}, あなたのすべての統率者の固有色の中の色の種類数に等しい点数のライフを支払う：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'地図の上で駒を動かすと、戦争の流れが変化する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf2c4ff7-34f6-45d0-8835-c049e85fa74e\', \'multiverseId\': 651440}, \'multiverseid\': 651440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegsschamane der Temur\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Kriegsschamane der Temur ins Spiel kommt, manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe die Karte als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\\nImmer wenn ein Permanent, das du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird und falls es eine Kreatur ist, kannst du es gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, kämpfen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3858846-1e77-4100-881d-bafdf109e790\', \'multiverseId\': 650540}, \'multiverseid\': 650540}, {\'name\': \'Shamane de guerre temurien\', \'text\': "Quand le Shamane de guerre temurien arrive sur le champ de bataille, manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, si c\'est une créature, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle se batte contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca48a6c7-26fb-4014-a2f2-fd2ed990112a\', \'multiverseId\': 650799}, \'multiverseid\': 650799}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano di Guerra Temur\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Sciamano di Guerra Temur entra nel campo di battaglia, manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\\nOgniqualvolta un permanente che controlli viene girato a faccia in su, se è una creatura, puoi farla lottare con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'072b6bea-fce6-4914-bbfd-9151d34dea0f\', \'multiverseId\': 651058}, \'multiverseid\': 651058}, {\'name\': \'ティムールの戦巫師\', \'text\': \'ティムールの戦巫師が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。（そのカードを裏向きで２/２のクリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つが表向きになるたび、それがクリーチャーである場合、あなたは「あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その表向きになったパーマネントはそれと格闘を行う。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961895e5-59af-49ae-8d62-a16da04f92ad\', \'multiverseId\': 651317}, \'multiverseid\': 651317}]', "[{'name': 'Krosanischer Koloss', 'text': 'Morph {6}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': 'Wenn er sich bewegt, ändert sich die Geographie. Wenn er hustet, ändert sich das Wetter.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650529&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4f2fe29-6362-45d1-9685-07e1a9719e29', 'multiverseId': 650529}, 'multiverseid': 650529}, {'name': 'Colosse krosian', 'text': 'Mue {6}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)', 'type': 'Créature — bête', 'flavor': 'Quand il marche, il modifie la géographie. Quand il crie, il modifie le climat.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650788&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c3c82a2-fc0c-4479-964a-3a55e4030a81', 'multiverseId': 650788}, 'multiverseid': 650788}, {'name': 'Colosso di Krosa', 'text': 'Metamorfosi {6}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'Quando camminava, cambiava la geografia. Quando ruggiva, cambiava il clima.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651047&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32b54248-d7d4-4279-97a8-abbf4e8d5c21', 'multiverseId': 651047}, 'multiverseid': 651047}, {'name': 'クローサの巨像', 'text': '変異{6}{G}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': 'こいつが歩けば地形が変わる。こいつが怒鳴れば天気が変わる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651306&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0109fb03-f03b-4400-b827-c5e78ea40528', 'multiverseId': 651306}, 'multiverseid': 651306}]", '[{\'name\': \'Krosanischer Wolkenkratzer\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments opferst du den Krosanischen Wolkenkratzer, es sei denn, du bezahlst {G}{G}.\\nMorph {7}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie, Mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fecc211c-b548-47c1-ac87-ddbde54a2ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 650528}, \'multiverseid\': 650528}, {\'name\': \'Écorche-nuage krosian\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, sacrifiez l\'Écorche-nuage krosian à moins que vous ne payiez {G}{G}.\\nMue {7}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)", \'type\': \'Créature — bête et mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbb754d4-4087-49ac-8e90-8b240fcfd161\', \'multiverseId\': 650787}, \'multiverseid\': 650787}, {\'name\': \'Grattanubi di Krosa\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica il Grattanubi di Krosa a meno che non paghi {G}{G}.\\nMetamorfosi {7}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52868174-e217-4637-9157-457f217809ab\', \'multiverseId\': 651046}, \'multiverseid\': 651046}, {\'name\': \'クローサの雲掻き獣\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが{G}{G}を支払わないかぎり、クローサの雲掻き獣を生け贄に捧げる。\\n変異{7}{G}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト・ミュータント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcd0a034-9e26-4612-b370-6007022042e8\', \'multiverseId\': 651305}, \'multiverseid\': 651305}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- und einer Ebene-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650624&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7e2123-6cb2-421f-be84-cddb81f8ce02\', \'multiverseId\': 650624}, \'multiverseid\': 650624}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6a409c5-6c04-4110-b29e-262c2ab0ace7\', \'multiverseId\': 650883}, \'multiverseid\': 650883}, {\'name\': \'Confine di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Il Confine di Krosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Confine di Krosa: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta e una carta Pianura, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b76d39-e428-488a-9a76-ae2393782623\', \'multiverseId\': 651142}, \'multiverseid\': 651142}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚と平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a8539d8-82fd-4442-89a9-a6f770f99353\', \'multiverseId\': 651401}, \'multiverseid\': 651401}]', '[{\'name\': \'Labyrinth von Skophos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Entferne eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl aus dem Kampf.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Jahrhundertelang war Skophos, die Polis der Minotauren, den Menschen unbekannt. Sie bleibt unerforscht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650625&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a08161d-51fb-406d-9d3b-79aef43b5775\', \'multiverseId\': 650625}, \'multiverseid\': 650625}, {\'name\': \'Labyrinthe de Skophos\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Retirez une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée du combat.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Durant des siècles, la polis minotaure de Skophos avait été inconnue des humains. Aujourd\'hui encore, elle reste inexplorée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d36a99f-4f52-4068-af74-a1ada171b94b\', \'multiverseId\': 650884}, \'multiverseid\': 650884}, {\'name\': \'Dedalo di Skofos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Rimuovi dal combattimento una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Per secoli, gli umani ignorarono l\'esistenza di Skofos, la polis dei minotauri. Tuttora rimane inesplorata.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bbcda47-ad2b-4754-ae75-89e233ef794d\', \'multiverseId\': 651143}, \'multiverseid\': 651143}, {\'name\': \'スコフォスの迷宮\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：攻撃クリーチャーやブロック・クリーチャーである１体を対象とする。それを戦闘から取り除く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'何世紀にもわたり、ミノタウルスの都市国家スコフォスは人間に知られていなかった。今でも調べられてはいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'069555ff-7ad0-4431-b15a-2d9be8d6e157\', \'multiverseId\': 651402}, \'multiverseid\': 651402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lauernde Leonidin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Lauernde Leonidin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme geheim einen Gegner.\\nOffenbare den bestimmten Spieler: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dich angreift, ins Exil, falls sie vom bestimmten Spieler kontrolliert wird. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650439&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da02558e-36d5-4701-b294-fcba394f1b8a\', \'multiverseId\': 650439}, \'multiverseid\': 650439}, {\'name\': \'Léonine en chasse\', \'text\': "Quand la Léonine en chasse arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez secrètement un adversaire.\\nRévélez le joueur choisi : Exilez une créature ciblée qui vous attaque si elle est contrôlée par le joueur choisi. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Créature — chat et archer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afd06bff-22d9-4eb6-9988-80583a4b964e\', \'multiverseId\': 650698}, \'multiverseid\': 650698}, {\'name\': \'Leonid in Agguato\', \'text\': \'Quando la Leonid in Agguato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli segretamente un avversario.\\nRivela quale giocatore hai scelto: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che ti sta attaccando se è controllata dal giocatore scelto. Attiva solo una volta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d6047d-f273-4dcd-bb77-1e0fbe5c59fb\', \'multiverseId\': 650957}, \'multiverseid\': 650957}, {\'name\': \'忍び寄るレオニン\', \'text\': \'忍び寄るレオニンが戦場に出たとき、秘密裏に対戦相手１人を選ぶ。\\nそのあなたが選んだプレイヤーを公開する：あなたを攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その選ばれたプレイヤーがそれをコントロールしているなら、それを追放する。１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・射手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'681b3148-4506-4693-b753-bd82c64b6273\', \'multiverseId\': 651216}, \'multiverseid\': 651216}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laufende Ermittlungen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\n{1}{G}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Stelle Nachforschungen an. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650467&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd392879-440b-4208-9e9f-1e6f6b6743ac\', \'multiverseId\': 650467}, \'multiverseid\': 650467}, {\'name\': \'Enquête en cours\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\n{1}{G}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Enquêtez. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b665ec54-f3f9-4215-838f-6fa1e94f971a\', \'multiverseId\': 650726}, \'multiverseid\': 650726}, {\'name\': \'Indagine in Corso\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\n{1}{G}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Indaga. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8801603e-563a-48ce-8619-3c1c520cf675\', \'multiverseId\': 650985}, \'multiverseid\': 650985}, {\'name\': \'継続する調査\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{1}{G}, あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：調査を行う。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892721cb-c53a-4961-a09b-24ef821ebdd3\', \'multiverseId\': 651244}, \'multiverseid\': 651244}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lazav der Vielgestaltige\', \'text\': \'Wenn Lazav der Vielgestaltige ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\\n{X}: Lazav der Vielgestaltige wird zu einer Kopie einer Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X in deinem Friedhof, außer dass sein Name Lazav der Vielgestaltige ist, er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen legendär ist und diese Fähigkeit hat.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b399d7f4-b0f6-457d-9a7d-06386aa77f12\', \'multiverseId\': 650567}, \'multiverseid\': 650567}, {\'name\': "Lazav, l\'Hétérogène", \'text\': "Quand Lazav, l\'Hétérogène arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière.)\\n{X} : Lazav, l\'Hétérogène devient une copie d\'une carte de créature ciblée dans votre cimetière ayant une valeur de mana de X, excepté que son nom est Lazav, l\'Hétérogène, qu\'elle est légendaire en plus de ses autres types et qu\'elle a cette capacité.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650826&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18215b3d-f214-4f5d-b57c-aae8c41bdf92\', \'multiverseId\': 650826}, \'multiverseid\': 650826}, {\'name\': \'Lazav, il Molteplice\', \'text\': \'Quando Lazav, il Molteplice entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)\\n{X}: Lazav, il Molteplice diventa una copia di una carta creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero con valore di mana X, tranne che il suo nome è Lazav, il Molteplice, è leggendario in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e ha questa abilità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80ccf96-5027-4e18-91bd-0167942fbfe8\', \'multiverseId\': 651085}, \'multiverseid\': 651085}, {\'name\': \'万面相、ラザーヴ\', \'text\': \'万面相、ラザーヴが戦場に出たとき、諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\\n{X}：あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がＸであるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。万面相、ラザーヴは、名前が「万面相、ラザーヴ」であり、他のタイプに加えて伝説であり、この能力を持つことを除き、それのコピーになる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c80bacf4-3d18-4bee-bafc-d484f6aa45b7\', \'multiverseId\': 651344}, \'multiverseid\': 651344}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lonis der Kryptozoologe\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\n{T}, opfere X Hinweise: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl deckt die obersten X Karten seiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Nichtland-Permanent-Karte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel bringen. Jener Spieler legt den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ophis, Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa1063a-bc53-48d9-b0f5-b4cf581da322\', \'multiverseId\': 650568}, \'multiverseid\': 650568}, {\'name\': \'Lonis, cryptozoologue\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, enquêtez.\\n{T}, sacrifiez X indices : Un adversaire ciblé révèle les X cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Parmi elles, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de permanent non-terrain de valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X. Ce joueur met le reste au-dessous de sa bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — serpent et elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'561f344d-fff2-43a5-a300-56a2bbcc2665\', \'multiverseId\': 650827}, \'multiverseid\': 650827}, {\'name\': \'Lonis, Criptozoologo\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, indaga.\\n{T}, Sacrifica X Indizi: Un avversario bersaglio rivela le prime X carte del suo grimorio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta permanente non terra con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X scelta tra esse. Quel giocatore mette le altre in fondo al suo grimorio in ordine casuale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Esploratore Elfo Serpente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ced322-894b-4335-9df1-7846e02d8b85\', \'multiverseId\': 651086}, \'multiverseid\': 651086}, {\'name\': \'暗号動物学者、ローニス\', \'text\': \'トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、調査を行う。\\n{T}, 手掛かりＸ個を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を公開する。あなたはその中から、マナ総量がＸ以下であり土地でないパーマネント・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出してもよい。そのプレイヤーは残りを自分のライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 蛇・エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dacb6ed-40f6-4a5f-996d-e575c1c229b0\', \'multiverseId\': 651345}, \'multiverseid\': 651345}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loran vom Dritten Pfad\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn Loran vom Dritten Pfad ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre bis zu ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n{T}: Du und ein Gegner deiner Wahl zieht je eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Als Gelehrte sah sie den Sylex nicht als Waffe, sondern als Schlüssel zur Vergangenheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650424&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb129c4d-14df-483f-afd7-9b0af0c82b55\', \'multiverseId\': 650424}, \'multiverseid\': 650424}, {\'name\': \'Loran de la Troisième Voie\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nQuand Loran de la Troisième Voie arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez jusqu\'à une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\\n{T} : Vous et un adversaire ciblé piochez chacun une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'Intellectuellement, elle voyait le Sylex non pas comme une arme, mais comme une clé ouvrant le passé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650683&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e0bcd4-39ee-4296-b733-d943b3449fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 650683}, \'multiverseid\': 650683}, {\'name\': \'Loran del Terzo Cammino\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nQuando Loran del Terzo Cammino entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi fino a un artefatto o incantesimo bersaglio.\\n{T}: Tu e un avversario bersaglio pescate una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': "Come studiosa, considerava il Sylex non come un\'arma, bensì come una chiave per aprire il passato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd4e8560-e354-4fe8-b766-9f6823eaf2bb\', \'multiverseId\': 650942}, \'multiverseid\': 650942}, {\'name\': \'第三の道のロラン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n第三の道のロランが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントである最大１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は学者として、酒杯を兵器としてではなく過去への鍵として捉えていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae239e0c-079b-46dc-a62a-9687ca71ac99\', \'multiverseId\': 651201}, \'multiverseid\': 651201}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lynchjustiz\', \'text\': \'Geheimes Konzil — Jeder Spieler stimmt geheim für einen anderen Spieler, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Für jede Stimme, die ein Gegner erhalten hat, fügt die Lynchjustiz jenem Spieler und jeder Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Für jede Stimme, die du erhalten hast, ziehst du eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Gericht der öffentlichen Meinung kennt keine Berufungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b5a078c-7f23-492b-aaa5-16746cad72b0\', \'multiverseId\': 650011}, \'multiverseid\': 650011}, {\'name\': \'Verdict de la foule\', \'text\': "Conseil secret — Chaque joueur vote secrètement pour un autre joueur, puis ces votes sont révélés. Pour chaque vote qu\'un adversaire a reçu, le Verdict de la foule inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur et à chaque créature que ce joueur contrôle. Pour chaque vote que vous avez reçu, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Le tribunal du verdict populaire rejette les appels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bc43089-952b-4e8c-8ba8-a78a05236802\', \'multiverseId\': 650051}, \'multiverseid\': 650051}, {\'name\': \'Verdetto della Folla\', \'text\': \'Consiglio segreto — Ogni giocatore vota segretamente per un altro giocatore, poi quei voti vengono rivelati. Per ogni voto che un avversario ha ricevuto, il Verdetto della Folla infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore e a ogni creatura controllata da quel giocatore. Per ogni voto che hai ricevuto, peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Al tribunale dell\'opinione pubblica non esiste il ricorso in appello.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4687776-8abd-45c1-b0f8-6839c4372a86\', \'multiverseId\': 650091}, \'multiverseid\': 650091}, {\'name\': \'群衆による判決\', \'text\': \'秘密会議 — 各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分でないプレイヤー１人に秘密裏に投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、群衆による判決はそのプレイヤーとそのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーが得た投票１票につき２点のダメージを与える。あなたは、あなたが得た投票１票につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'世間様が訴えに耳を貸すことなどない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a435a1-3e85-47fa-b023-5a72dd9c7632\', \'multiverseId\': 650131}, \'multiverseid\': 650131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lynchjustiz\', \'text\': \'Geheimes Konzil — Jeder Spieler stimmt geheim für einen anderen Spieler, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Für jede Stimme, die ein Gegner erhalten hat, fügt die Lynchjustiz jenem Spieler und jeder Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Für jede Stimme, die du erhalten hast, ziehst du eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Gericht der öffentlichen Meinung kennt keine Berufungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a790fead-4f29-4376-8098-9b49f0e0a92e\', \'multiverseId\': 651544}, \'multiverseid\': 651544}, {\'name\': \'Verdict de la foule\', \'text\': "Conseil secret — Chaque joueur vote secrètement pour un autre joueur, puis ces votes sont révélés. Pour chaque vote qu\'un adversaire a reçu, le Verdict de la foule inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur et à chaque créature que ce joueur contrôle. Pour chaque vote que vous avez reçu, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Le tribunal du verdict populaire rejette les appels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d54e2e1-2bd2-4b8e-827f-51bfa927ad4a\', \'multiverseId\': 651583}, \'multiverseid\': 651583}, {\'name\': \'群衆による判決\', \'text\': \'秘密会議 — 各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分でないプレイヤー１人に秘密裏に投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、群衆による判決はそのプレイヤーとそのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーが得た投票１票につき２点のダメージを与える。あなたは、あなたが得た投票１票につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'世間様が訴えに耳を貸すことなどない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac5a235d-4481-44bd-9de4-02f21426da8d\', \'multiverseId\': 651622}, \'multiverseid\': 651622}, {\'name\': \'暴民裁定\', \'text\': \'密议～每位牌手各私下投票选择另一位牌手，然后展示投票结果。对每位对手而言，其每得一票，暴民裁定便对该牌手和由该牌手操控的每个生物各造成2点伤害。你每得一票，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'舆论法庭不接受上诉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e8c6777-fdf3-4381-901e-662b5299cc15\', \'multiverseId\': 651661}, \'multiverseid\': 651661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4ea8431-cd4c-4529-9d86-bfffce404d65\', \'multiverseId\': 650629}, \'multiverseid\': 650629}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2004c4d-40ce-4e6a-aca4-94d5432b96dc\', \'multiverseId\': 650888}, \'multiverseid\': 650888}, {\'name\': \'Paesaggio delle Miriadi\', \'text\': \'Il Paesaggio delle Miriadi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio delle Miriadi: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base che condividono un tipo di terra, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bfb308e-6619-444f-ba14-c0e78115e9ae\', \'multiverseId\': 651147}, \'multiverseid\': 651147}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を共通の土地タイプ１つを持つように選んで探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab91c963-d5b6-4c76-8421-a1f6d76afd52\', \'multiverseId\': 651406}, \'multiverseid\': 651406}]', "[{'name': 'Marvo, tiefgründiger Agent', 'text': 'Immer wenn Marvo, tiefgründiger Agent, angreift, befehde dich mit dem verteidigenden Spieler. (Jeder Spieler in einer Fehde deckt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf und legt sie dann auf oder unter seine Bibliothek. Ein Spieler gewinnt die Fehde, falls seine Karte den höheren Manabetrag hat.)\\nImmer wenn du eine Fehde gewinnst, ziehe eine Karte. Dann kannst du einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag 8 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Oktopus, Räuber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649933&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1a6a72c-ab71-41fd-988d-9c1912253080', 'multiverseId': 649933}, 'multiverseid': 649933}, {'name': 'Marvo, agent des profondeurs', 'text': 'À chaque fois que Marvo, agent des profondeurs attaque, confrontez le joueur défenseur, (Chaque joueur impliqué dans la confrontation révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque, puis met cette carte au-dessus ou au-dessous de celle-ci. Un joueur gagne si sa carte avait une valeur de mana plus élevée.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez une confrontation, piochez une carte. Puis vous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 8 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — gredin et pieuvre', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649937&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd90f4df-a57e-48f2-a539-9c5096dfbd69', 'multiverseId': 649937}, 'multiverseid': 649937}, {'name': 'Marvo, Agente delle Profondità', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta Marvo, Agente delle Profondità attacca, scontrati con il giocatore in difesa. (Ogni giocatore che si scontra rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio, poi la mette in cima o in fondo.\\nUn giocatore vince se la sua carta aveva un valore di mana maggiore.)\\nOgniqualvolta vinci uno scontro, pesca una carta. Poi puoi lanciare una magia dalla tua mano con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 8 senza pagare il suo costo di mana.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Piovra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649941&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e63bcf3f-73ac-43f9-b462-80e5d0f625e5', 'multiverseId': 649941}, 'multiverseid': 649941}, {'name': '深海の調査員、モルヴォ', 'text': '深海の調査員、モルヴォが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーと激突を行う。（激突を行っている各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上のカード１枚を公開し、その後そのカードを一番上か一番下に置く。公開したカードのマナ総量が大きいプレイヤーが勝利する。）\\nあなたが激突に勝利するたび、カード１枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札から、マナ総量が８以下である呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — タコ・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649945&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b85a504a-5ecb-441e-9000-3a4f510f9cf1', 'multiverseId': 649945}, 'multiverseid': 649945}]", "[{'name': 'Marvo, tiefgründiger Agent', 'text': 'Immer wenn Marvo, tiefgründiger Agent, angreift, befehde dich mit dem verteidigenden Spieler.\\nImmer wenn du eine Fehde gewinnst, ziehe eine Karte. Dann kannst du einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag 8 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Oktopus, Räuber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651453&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97562fe9-9c47-441d-a26a-49d248904ef7', 'multiverseId': 651453}, 'multiverseid': 651453}, {'name': 'Marvo, agent des profondeurs', 'text': 'À chaque fois que Marvo, agent des profondeurs attaque, confrontez le joueur défenseur,\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez une confrontation, piochez une carte. Puis vous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 8 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — gredin et pieuvre', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651461&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27934bdf-41d1-45bd-af1f-099baf146928', 'multiverseId': 651461}, 'multiverseid': 651461}, {'name': '深海の調査員、モルヴォ', 'text': '深海の調査員、モルヴォが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーと激突を行う。\\nあなたが激突に勝利するたび、カード１枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札から、マナ総量が８以下である呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — タコ・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651469&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c5352b8-55f3-4387-9fd3-1ba2ba07de3e', 'multiverseId': 651469}, 'multiverseid': 651469}, {'name': '深洋密探玛沃', 'text': '每当深洋密探玛沃攻击时，与防御牌手比点。\\n每当你赢得比点时，抓一张牌。然后你可以从你手上施放一个法术力值等于或小于8的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '传奇生物 — 章鱼／浪客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651477&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '319b5aec-9b82-41c1-83a5-099170c891a6', 'multiverseId': 651477}, 'multiverseid': 651477}]", '[{\'name\': \'Massakerwurm\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Massakerwurm ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, verliert jener Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8beb658-594d-4ebd-a3e5-ec802b370cde\', \'multiverseId\': 650483}, \'multiverseid\': 650483}, {\'name\': \'Guivre du massacre\', \'text\': "Quand la Guivre du massacre arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, ce joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — phyrexian et guivre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b366aa-0ba3-4b8f-b34c-21dd2b14c573\', \'multiverseId\': 650742}, \'multiverseid\': 650742}, {\'name\': \'Wurm della Strage\', \'text\': \'Quando il Wurm della Strage entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ba0065b-b4f0-497e-8e86-21ab4327f8d6\', \'multiverseId\': 651001}, \'multiverseid\': 651001}, {\'name\': \'虐殺のワーム\', \'text\': \'虐殺のワームが戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\\n対戦相手１人がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ワーム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2968cbb8-b837-468d-a86b-7142da98ee22\', \'multiverseId\': 651260}, \'multiverseid\': 651260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mauer der Omen\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nWenn die Mauer der Omen ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich suche nach einer Vision für Zendikar, in der keine Eldrazi vorkommen."\\n—Aus einem Expeditionstagebuch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650443&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc4faf68-7a89-4c8b-adbf-64e7a32fcb50\', \'multiverseId\': 650443}, \'multiverseid\': 650443}, {\'name\': "Mur d\'augures", \'text\': "Défenseur\\nQuand le Mur d\'augures arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — mur\', \'flavor\': "« Je recherche une vision de Zendikar qui n\'inclut pas les Eldrazi. »\\n—Extrait de journal d\'expédition", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650702&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ed8632e-a698-48ae-8690-c6c539792cde\', \'multiverseId\': 650702}, \'multiverseid\': 650702}, {\'name\': \'Muro dei Presagi\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nQuando il Muro dei Presagi entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cerco una visione di Zendikar che non comprenda gli Eldrazi."\\n—Annotazione del diario di spedizione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00bf1d4b-dee2-4cc3-a09c-1585c86d6167\', \'multiverseId\': 650961}, \'multiverseid\': 650961}, {\'name\': \'前兆の壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n前兆の壁が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'「私が求めるのは、エルドラージのいないゼンディカーの風景だ。」\\n――探検日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45f6a3e0-52b7-48f9-bb05-6f8943220473\', \'multiverseId\': 651220}, \'multiverseid\': 651220}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mechanisierte Produktion\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des verzauberten Artefakts ist. Falls du dann acht oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, die untereinander denselben Namen haben, gewinnst du die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Gebt mir acht Schreiter und ich gebe euch die Stadt."\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ab7a1d-5f89-422c-9433-e328813b1769\', \'multiverseId\': 650462}, \'multiverseid\': 650462}, {\'name\': \'Production mécanisée\', \'text\': "Enchanter : un artefact que vous contrôlez\\nAu début de votre entretien, créez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'artefact enchanté. Puis, si vous contrôlez au moins huit artefacts ayant tous le même nom, vous gagnez la partie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Donnez-moi huit marcheurs, je vous livrerai la ville. »\\n—Dovin Baàn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650721&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'591d813d-2ba9-4c15-99ef-4eb488546287\', \'multiverseId\': 650721}, \'multiverseid\': 650721}, {\'name\': \'Produzione Meccanizzata\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto che controlli\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea una pedina che è una copia dell\'artefatto incantato. Poi, se controlli otto o più artefatti che condividono lo stesso nome, vinci la partita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Datemi otto camminatori e la città sarà vostra."\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469a05bb-de54-4a9f-a833-8eeddd7ff569\', \'multiverseId\': 650980}, \'multiverseid\': 650980}, {\'name\': \'機械化製法\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、エンチャントしているアーティファクトのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。その後、あなたが互いに同じ名前を持つ８つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているなら、あなたはこのゲームに勝利する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「歩行機械が八台あれば、市を手に入れて差し上げますよ。」\\n――ドビン・バーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2165c89a-4b3e-4b5c-8640-bee5f2dfc3d3\', \'multiverseId\': 651239}, \'multiverseid\': 651239}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meister der Perlen\', \'text\': \'Morph {3}{W}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Meister der Perlen aufgedeckt wird, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650426&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdae58b2-5b7e-46d3-9c26-7da14c0826ac\', \'multiverseId\': 650426}, \'multiverseid\': 650426}, {\'name\': \'Maître des perles\', \'text\': "Mue {3}{W}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Maître des perles est retourné face visible, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et moine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650685&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed420798-3af4-43bc-9975-942e078da4bb\', \'multiverseId\': 650685}, \'multiverseid\': 650685}, {\'name\': \'Maestro delle Perle\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosi {3}{W}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Maestro delle Perle viene girato a faccia in su, le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58543d9c-9386-4157-9798-101e5b2a3d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 650944}, \'multiverseid\': 650944}, {\'name\': \'真珠の達人\', \'text\': \'変異{3}{W}{W}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\\n真珠の達人が表向きになったとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a63def42-265d-4bda-a0c8-b1aff39cc499\', \'multiverseId\': 651203}, \'multiverseid\': 651203}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meister des Todes\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Meister des Todes ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 2 an. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls sich der Meister des Todes in deinem Friedhof befindet, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe ihn auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650569&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c448c0c3-06f9-45c6-94e1-07c3df1ede29\', \'multiverseId\': 650569}, \'multiverseid\': 650569}, {\'name\': \'Maître de la mort\', \'text\': "Quand le Maître de la mort arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)\\nAu début de votre entretien, si le Maître de la mort est dans votre cimetière, vous pouvez payer 1 point de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez-le dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature — zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650828&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4bc376-074f-49b4-bb3f-3ca8ead3efd3\', \'multiverseId\': 650828}, \'multiverseid\': 650828}, {\'name\': \'Maestro di Morte\', \'text\': "Quando il Maestro di Morte entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se il Maestro di Morte è nel tuo cimitero, puoi pagare 1 punto vita. Se lo fai, riprendilo in mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80c87178-7609-479f-be21-d010fb5379e6\', \'multiverseId\': 651087}, \'multiverseid\': 651087}, {\'name\': \'死の達人\', \'text\': \'死の達人が戦場に出たとき、諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、死の達人があなたの墓地にある場合、１点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、これをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c5fc98-b461-4cdd-973d-673e5598acf6\', \'multiverseId\': 651346}, \'multiverseid\': 651346}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mirko, obsessiver Theoretiker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn du Überwachen anwendest, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Mirko, obsessiver Theoretiker.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Stärke kleiner als Mirkos Stärke mit einer Endgültigkeitsmarke aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen. (Falls sie sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649912&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d369692d-c255-4990-b0ad-6633f867c523\', \'multiverseId\': 649912}, \'multiverseid\': 649912}, {\'name\': \'Mirko, théoriste obsessionnel\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surveillez, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Mirko, théoriste obsessionnel.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de créature ciblée de force inférieure à celle de Mirko avec un marqueur « fatalité » sur elle. (Si elle devait mourir, exilez-la à la place.)\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vampire et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e745da8-5796-4fe7-b6f5-545aea26f0fa\', \'multiverseId\': 649916}, \'multiverseid\': 649916}, {\'name\': \'Mirko, Teorico Ossessivo\', \'text\': "Volare, cautela\\nOgniqualvolta sorvegli, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Mirko, Teorico Ossessivo.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con forza inferiore a quella di Mirko dal tuo cimitero con un segnalino finale. (Se sta per morire, invece esiliala.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Detective Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7815ca5f-73bc-4a0c-b2dc-17dd1cc87d20\', \'multiverseId\': 649920}, \'multiverseid\': 649920}, {\'name\': \'偏執的な理論家、ミルコ\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\nあなたが諜報を行うたび、偏執的な理論家、ミルコの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたの墓地にありパワーがこれのパワーより小さいクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを最終カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻してもよい。（それが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a991ff-3735-4c67-8e28-46dfe3fbae4c\', \'multiverseId\': 649924}, \'multiverseid\': 649924}]', "[{'name': 'Mirko, obsessiver Theoretiker', 'text': 'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn du Überwachen anwendest, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Mirko, obsessiver Theoretiker.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Stärke kleiner als Mirkos Stärke mit einer Endgültigkeitsmarke aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Detektiv', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651454&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd258af42-acbf-4c62-b47c-32140eff2b5e', 'multiverseId': 651454}, 'multiverseid': 651454}, {'name': 'Mirko, théoriste obsessionnel', 'text': 'Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surveillez, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Mirko, théoriste obsessionnel.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de créature ciblée de force inférieure à celle de Mirko avec un marqueur « fatalité » sur elle.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — vampire et détective', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651462&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b067ec88-81a9-4a78-8439-df0ef586186a', 'multiverseId': 651462}, 'multiverseid': 651462}, {'name': '偏執的な理論家、ミルコ', 'text': '飛行、警戒\\nあなたが諜報を行うたび、偏執的な理論家、ミルコの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたの墓地にありパワーがこれのパワーより小さいクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを最終カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・探偵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651470&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e19ff656-085c-4c6b-88aa-3241b8383099', 'multiverseId': 651470}, 'multiverseid': 651470}, {'name': '偏执理论家米尔柯', 'text': '飞行，警戒\\n每当你刺探时，在偏执理论家米尔柯上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以将目标力量小于米尔柯的生物牌从你坟墓场移回战场，且上面有一个终命指示物。', 'type': '传奇生物 — 吸血鬼／侦探', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651478&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd805f30-e0a9-4a0c-b5ec-8143f8408d52', 'multiverseId': 651478}, 'multiverseid': 651478}]", '[{\'name\': \'Missionsbesprechung\', \'text\': \'Überwachen 2, bestimme dann eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte in deinem Friedhof. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug wirken. Falls der Zauberspruch auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil. (Um Überwachen 2 anzuwenden, schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0aadfe4-d659-4c55-ba4f-5aecb57096c2\', \'multiverseId\': 650463}, \'multiverseid\': 650463}, {\'name\': \'Réunion de mission\', \'text\': "Surveillez 2, puis choisissez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel de votre cimetière. Vous pouvez la lancer ce tour-ci. Si ce sort devait être mis dans votre cimetière, exilez-le à la place. (Pour surveiller 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650722&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855ae793-41e4-4d07-badd-7fa10688f12c\', \'multiverseId\': 650722}, \'multiverseid\': 650722}, {\'name\': \'Istruzioni della Missione\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 2, poi scegli una carta istantaneo o stregoneria nel tuo cimitero. Puoi lanciarla in questo turno. Se quella magia sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero, invece esiliala. (Per sorvegliare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58966fc5-bc8c-475d-8bfb-c7b3c7ccf3ed\', \'multiverseId\': 650981}, \'multiverseid\': 650981}, {\'name\': \'任務説明\', \'text\': \'諜報２を行う。その後、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を選ぶ。このターン、それを唱えてもよい。その呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。（諜報２を行うとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1bef3cd-abda-44c4-9da1-5dc9275eab2e\', \'multiverseId\': 651240}, \'multiverseid\': 651240}]', "[{'name': 'Moosfeuer-Tal', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Üppiges Wachstum breitet sich so rasch aus wie ein heftiges Feuer über die Hügel von Otaria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650627&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb1f5f51-6916-43e5-a178-d4912663e461', 'multiverseId': 650627}, 'multiverseid': 650627}, {'name': 'Vallée de Moussefeu', 'text': '{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Comme un feu ravageur, la luxuriance gagne une à une les collines.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650886&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fb65442-2b86-49bd-9bd0-2e6130ed27f7', 'multiverseId': 650886}, 'multiverseid': 650886}, {'name': 'Valle di Piromuschio', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'La vegetazione ha ricoperto le colline di Otaria con la velocità di un incendio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651145&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9df5d335-29c6-4f6d-9029-29b9da614f1f', 'multiverseId': 651145}, 'multiverseid': 651145}, {'name': 'モスファイアの谷', 'text': '{1}, {T}：{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'オタリアの丘陵地帯には、青々とした樹木がまるで猛火のような感じで広がっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651404&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd740f612-9a91-4f73-8c5f-ff11d80a96b5', 'multiverseId': 651404}, 'multiverseid': 651404}]", "[{'name': 'Mooswurz-Brücke', 'text': 'Refugium 4 (Wenn dieses Land ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nDie Mooswurz-Brücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Falls die Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, eine Gesamtstärke von 10 oder mehr haben, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650628&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a77d211a-09f6-465f-9c37-40d9a3ff678d', 'multiverseId': 650628}, 'multiverseid': 650628}, {'name': 'Pont de fangemousse', 'text': 'Cachette 4 (Quand ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nLe Pont de fangemousse arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{G}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force totale supérieure ou égale à 10.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650887&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5018bc63-7bd7-42ad-b174-3ef351c4250f', 'multiverseId': 650887}, 'multiverseid': 650887}, {'name': 'Ponte Muscoso', 'text': 'Nascondiglio 4 (Quando questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.)\\nIl Ponte Muscoso entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se le creature che controlli hanno una forza totale pari o superiore a 10.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651146&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41b096a5-e0ac-464b-b598-5896eda29c7a', 'multiverseId': 651146}, 'multiverseid': 651146}, {'name': '苔汁の橋', 'text': '秘匿４（この土地が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後、残りを一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\n苔汁の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{G}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのパワーの合計が10以上なら、その追放されているカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651405&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0150cce2-d97a-4b39-b6fd-f43804b0fe20', 'multiverseId': 651405}, 'multiverseid': 651405}]", '[{\'name\': \'Morska, Ermittlerin der Meere\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments stellst du Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf Morska, Ermittlerin der Meere.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vedalken, Fisch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b853349-1d11-4c56-8c3a-72769ceece30\', \'multiverseId\': 649913}, \'multiverseid\': 649913}, {\'name\': \'Morska, détective sous-marin\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nAu début de votre entretien, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur Morska, détective sous-marin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vedalken et poisson et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4db1210-e542-491d-abf3-0b12f65f887a\', \'multiverseId\': 649917}, \'multiverseid\': 649917}, {\'name\': \'Morska, Investigatrice Sottomarina\', \'text\': \'Non hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\nAll\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su Morska, Investigatrice Sottomarina.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Detective Pesce Vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27f745d1-eb73-4c6a-a147-1294d10c28fa\', \'multiverseId\': 649921}, \'multiverseid\': 649921}, {\'name\': \'地下海の探偵、モルスカ\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、地下海の探偵、モルスカの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・魚・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a54ecea-8019-4063-bc5f-2f3ed18ac09f\', \'multiverseId\': 649925}, \'multiverseid\': 649925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morska, Ermittlerin der Meere\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments stellst du Nachforschungen an.\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf Morska, Ermittlerin der Meere.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vedalken, Fisch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651455&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac75785-c8c9-4c31-8517-5c791923ad84\', \'multiverseId\': 651455}, \'multiverseid\': 651455}, {\'name\': \'Morska, détective sous-marin\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nAu début de votre entretien, enquêtez.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur Morska, détective sous-marin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vedalken et poisson et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e23c41bd-ff7d-4660-9003-fb58a6b57ad5\', \'multiverseId\': 651463}, \'multiverseid\': 651463}, {\'name\': \'地下海の探偵、モルスカ\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、調査を行う。\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、地下海の探偵、モルスカの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・魚・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd8483cf-ca1d-4ea2-a9e9-9019cc1937a4\', \'multiverseId\': 651471}, \'multiverseid\': 651471}, {\'name\': \'海底侦员莫思卡\', \'text\': \'你的手牌数量没有上限。\\n在你的维持开始时，探查。\\n每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，在海底侦员莫思卡上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 维多肯／鱼／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c9c2af-74fd-445f-8333-083a7ee276b5\', \'multiverseId\': 651479}, \'multiverseid\': 651479}]', '[{\'name\': \'Muse des Samenflugs\', \'text\': \'Enttappe während der Enttappsegmente aller anderen Spieler alle Permanente, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Stimme ist die der Wildnis, ungezähmt und rein."\\n—Kamahl, Druidennovize\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e4bf39-0003-4264-8396-f7e841ffc09d\', \'multiverseId\': 650539}, \'multiverseid\': 650539}, {\'name\': \'Muse née des graines\', \'text\': "Dégagez tous les permanents que vous contrôlez pendant l\'étape de dégagement de chaque autre joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Sa voix est celle de la forêt, sauvage et pure. »\\n—Kamahl, acolyte druide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1fd359e-5ccd-4cc4-b80c-4c40e7b9465a\', \'multiverseId\': 650798}, \'multiverseid\': 650798}, {\'name\': \'Musa Semigena\', \'text\': \'STAPpa tutti i permanenti che controlli durante lo STAP di ogni altro giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"La sua voce è selvaggia, indomita e pura."\\n—Kamahl, accolito druido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af6724e1-5fed-4e9e-a416-c5e8c7c35b32\', \'multiverseId\': 651057}, \'multiverseid\': 651057}, {\'name\': \'種子生まれの詩神\', \'text\': \'あなたでない各プレイヤーのアンタップ・ステップに、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女の声は、野生であり獰猛であり純真だ。」\\n――ドルイドの見習いカマール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc4ff9c9-d94d-43f0-ba58-c89b06046f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 651316}, \'multiverseid\': 651316}]', '[{\'name\': \'Muse des Windgeflüsters\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die er kontrolliert und die dich angreift.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Stimme ist die der Rache, kalt und unbarmherzig."\\n—Akroma, rächender Engel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650445&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddba535d-ff87-483f-ba19-54725149465e\', \'multiverseId\': 650445}, \'multiverseid\': 650445}, {\'name\': \'Muse née des vents\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Sa voix est celle de la justice, claire et implacable. »\\n—Akroma, vengeresse angélique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650704&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c720ec3-dc1a-48ed-b4e0-86cd0c653eec\', \'multiverseId\': 650704}, \'multiverseid\': 650704}, {\'name\': \'Musa Eologena\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLe creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"La sua voce è la giustizia, chiara e implacabile."\\n—Akroma, vendicatrice angelica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144e8a95-6250-45a5-9b37-60404451edfe\', \'multiverseId\': 650963}, \'multiverseid\': 650963}, {\'name\': \'風生まれの詩神\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプレイヤーは、自分がコントロールしていてあなたを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女の声は、正義であり純潔であり冷酷なのだ。」\\n――復讐の天使アクローマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a049f193-cca4-4bcb-8b22-217601211a18\', \'multiverseId\': 651222}, \'multiverseid\': 651222}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mysterien des Ulvenwalds\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nImmer wenn du einen Hinweis opferst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650546&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4616c561-a417-4411-98d1-9bf2a86f3071\', \'multiverseId\': 650546}, \'multiverseid\': 650546}, {\'name\': "Mystères d\'Ulvenwald", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un indice, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e96fbc15-4f1b-410b-9bbe-eea654ed5a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 650805}, \'multiverseid\': 650805}, {\'name\': \'Misteri di Ulvenwald\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura non pedina che controlli muore, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nOgniqualvolta sacrifichi un Indizio, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b8a6de2-dec8-4b55-a27a-789b6485203a\', \'multiverseId\': 651064}, \'multiverseid\': 651064}, {\'name\': \'ウルヴェンワルドの謎\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたが手掛かり１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9545c2-6b36-4eca-af8c-be1f8e17e531\', \'multiverseId\': 651323}, \'multiverseid\': 651323}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mystisches Heiligtum\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {U}.)\\nDas Mystische Heiligtum kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst drei oder mehr andere Inseln.\\nWenn das Mystische Heiligtum ungetappt ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Land — Insel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'206b3771-d65d-410b-a755-f3fdbaf80095\', \'multiverseId\': 650630}, \'multiverseid\': 650630}, {\'name\': \'Sanctuaire mystique\', \'text\': "({T} : Ajoutez {U}.)\\nLe Sanctuaire mystique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins trois autres îles.\\nQuand le Sanctuaire mystique arrive sur le champ de bataille dégagé, vous pouvez mettre une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain — île\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650889&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a602c343-c8a8-42e9-863a-0dc96f4a3af1\', \'multiverseId\': 650889}, \'multiverseid\': 650889}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Mistico\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {U}.)\\nIl Santuario Mistico entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli tre o più altre Isole.\\nQuando il Santuario Mistico entra nel campo di battaglia STAPpato, puoi mettere una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Isola\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f660fee-8c5b-464e-a091-38878fe7f99f\', \'multiverseId\': 651148}, \'multiverseid\': 651148}, {\'name\': \'神秘の聖域\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{U}を加える。）\\nあなたがこれでない３つ以上の島をコントロールしていないかぎり、神秘の聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n神秘の聖域がアンタップ状態で戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 島\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d098bcfb-51fa-442f-9e39-98e0c391ff51\', \'multiverseId\': 651407}, \'multiverseid\': 651407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Métamorphe phyrexian\', \'text\': "({U/P} peut être payé au choix avec {U} ou 2 points de vie.)\\nVous pouvez faire que le Métamorphe phyrexian arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quel artefact ou n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — phyrexian et changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650728&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5044e3fa-242d-4a60-a7d5-cc40a890dc73\', \'multiverseId\': 650728}, \'multiverseid\': 650728}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfosi Phyrexian\', \'text\': \'({U/P} può essere pagato con {U} o con 2 punti vita.)\\nPuoi far entrare la Metamorfosi Phyrexian nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi artefatto o creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che è un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Polimorfo Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6faf1b-31a9-41cc-83d6-6f9adbc0f5e1\', \'multiverseId\': 650987}, \'multiverseid\': 650987}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの変形者\', \'text\': \'（{U/P}は{U}でも２点のライフでも支払うことができる。）\\nあなたはファイレクシアの変形者を、これが他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトであることを除き、戦場にありアーティファクトやクリーチャーである１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a179b1-ec38-4fdf-bc6e-1c51fdb7e792\', \'multiverseId\': 651246}, \'multiverseid\': 651246}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtreten\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl. Überwachen 2. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650487&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25248977-eca0-4fec-ac53-25f27402d719\', \'multiverseId\': 650487}, \'multiverseid\': 650487}, {\'name\': \'Accumulation\', \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nDétruisez une cible, créature ou planeswalker. Surveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c90fc1fc-dfa8-4adf-aab1-4ad018a92da7\', \'multiverseId\': 650746}, \'multiverseid\': 650746}, {\'name\': \'Attacco Concertato\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nDistruggi una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio. Sorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39248d80-596e-4fa1-9542-114e2d12b49e\', \'multiverseId\': 651005}, \'multiverseid\': 651005}, {\'name\': \'全軍突撃\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーである１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c72fc7-d813-4729-8147-93527f748b08\', \'multiverseId\': 651264}, \'multiverseid\': 651264}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtschleiersylphide\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Nachtschleiersylphide angreift, wende Überwachen 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind hier im vierzigsten Stock mit einem Fenster und ohne Balkon. Niemand kann hier reinkommen."\\n—Minosz, Orzhov-Sicherheitshauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650466&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a215a50-426c-4939-b94a-6981cf4ea27b\', \'multiverseId\': 650466}, \'multiverseid\': 650466}, {\'name\': \'Farfadette voilenuit\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Farfadette voilenuit attaque, surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Nous sommes au quarantième étage, il n\'y a qu\'une seule fenêtre et pas de balcon. Personne ne peut entrer ici. »\\n—Minosz, chef de la sécurité d\'Orzhov", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650725&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a16165-1e36-4914-bc7f-68d437daf0fb\', \'multiverseId\': 650725}, \'multiverseid\': 650725}, {\'name\': \'Spiritella di Velo Notturno\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Spiritella di Velo Notturno attacca, sorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo al quarantesimo piano, con una sola finestra senza balcone. È impossibile che qualcuno riesca a entrare."\\n—Minosz, responsabile della sicurezza Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9806aed9-fcaa-4e0a-b301-8708874fd5b4\', \'multiverseId\': 650984}, \'multiverseid\': 650984}, {\'name\': \'夜帷のスプライト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n夜帷のスプライトが攻撃するたび、諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「ここは四十階で、窓は一つ、ベランダはない。誰かが侵入するなど、有り得ない。」\\n――オルゾフの警備責任者、ミーノシュ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'676e925e-6c35-4a29-a608-78fa957a5945\', \'multiverseId\': 651243}, \'multiverseid\': 651243}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nadelfels-Plateau\', \'text\': \'Das Nadelfels-Plateau kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Das Nadelfels-Plateau wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/1 roten und weißen Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Doppelschlag. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650631&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f28291e4-0732-425f-9414-4c153e3aed23\', \'multiverseId\': 650631}, \'multiverseid\': 650631}, {\'name\': \'Cimes aiguilles\', \'text\': "Les Cimes aiguilles arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W} : Les Cimes aiguilles deviennent une créature 2/1 rouge et blanche Élémental avec la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b461314-f1b6-4b4e-98b1-e4783e5b5bff\', \'multiverseId\': 650890}, \'multiverseid\': 650890}, {\'name\': \'Guglie a Spillo\', \'text\': \'Le Guglie a Spillo entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Le Guglie a Spillo diventano una creatura Elementale 2/1 rossa e bianca con doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno. Sono ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd1a9c4e-1567-4d8a-a081-0617a196560f\', \'multiverseId\': 651149}, \'multiverseid\': 651149}, {\'name\': \'鋭い突端\', \'text\': \'鋭い突端はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\\n{2}{R}{W}：ターン終了時まで、鋭い突端は二段攻撃を持る赤白の２/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'060e759d-fa6a-488f-a40e-1fed8ce23179\', \'multiverseId\': 651408}, \'multiverseid\': 651408}]', "[{'name': 'Nadir-Krake', 'text': 'Immer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Nadir-Kraken und erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Tentakel-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Krake', 'flavor': 'Einem zu begegnen, ist definitiv der Tiefpunkt deines Lebens.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650465&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3080c003-bed5-4e07-b5be-37ba5eb927cf', 'multiverseId': 650465}, 'multiverseid': 650465}, {'name': 'Kraken du nadir', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Kraken du nadir et créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Tentacule.', 'type': 'Créature — kraken', 'flavor': 'Si vous en rencontrez un, votre vie sera véritablement au plus bas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650724&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9255c4f-01cf-455d-bfad-18317da462c4', 'multiverseId': 650724}, 'multiverseid': 650724}, {'name': 'Kraken del Nadir', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta peschi una carta, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Kraken del Nadir e crea una pedina creatura Tentacolo 1/1 blu.', 'type': 'Creatura — Kraken', 'flavor': 'Questo incontro sarà di certo il peggiore della tua vita.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650983&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd499ca5-998b-465b-a131-4e7648005fe8', 'multiverseId': 650983}, 'multiverseid': 650983}, {'name': '水底のクラーケン', 'text': 'あなたがカード１枚を引くたび、{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、水底のクラーケンの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、青の１/１の触手・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — クラーケン', 'flavor': 'それに遭遇したことは確実に人生で最も後悔すべきことのひとつである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651242&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43cbd7f0-f761-4003-a75f-a74ea7fb12ce', 'multiverseId': 651242}, 'multiverseid': 651242}]", "[{'name': 'Naturgeheimnisse', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'In den Rissen im Stein liest sie Geschichten der Vergangenheit. In den sprießenden Reben sieht sie Visionen der Zukunft.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650531&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '328a369f-9967-4d4b-9660-8872cf257584', 'multiverseId': 650531}, 'multiverseid': 650531}, {'name': 'Sapience naturaliste', 'text': 'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Dans les fissures de la pierre, elle lit des histoires du passé. Dans le lierre emmêlé, elle perçoit des visions du futur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650790&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '165857d9-18c9-48be-8383-58a7ac813e1f', 'multiverseId': 650790}, 'multiverseid': 650790}, {'name': 'Sapere della Natura', 'text': 'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Dalle crepe nella pietra, legge storie del passato. Dalle viti arricciate, intravede visioni del futuro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651049&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c0f052d-fe29-4095-b2f5-d373f7d7b12f', 'multiverseId': 651049}, 'multiverseid': 651049}, {'name': '自然の知識', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '石の亀裂から、彼女は過去の物語を詠む。渦巻く蔦から、彼女は未来の光景を垣間見る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651308&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2239a281-3693-4199-82e1-0330942a8bc8', 'multiverseId': 651308}, 'multiverseid': 651308}]", '[{\'name\': \'Neheb der Verewigte\', \'text\': \'Pestilenz 3 (Immer wenn diese Kreatur geblockt wird, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 3 Lebenspunkte.)\\nZu Beginn deiner Hauptphase nach dem Kampf erzeugst du {R} für jeden Lebenspunkt, den deine Gegner in diesem Zug verloren haben.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„So sieht Perfektion aus."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2217194-24a2-4915-8030-14ec2e7c2df1\', \'multiverseId\': 650511}, \'multiverseid\': 650511}, {\'name\': "Neheb, l\'Éternel", \'text\': \'Affliction 3 (À chaque fois que cette créature devient bloquée, le joueur défenseur perd 3 points de vie.)\\nAu début de votre deuxième phase principale, ajoutez {R} pour chaque 1 point de vie que vos adversaires ont perdu ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — zombie et minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Voilà à quoi ressemble la gloire. »\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19a102f9-a9da-48e7-b69a-74f24ef42f86\', \'multiverseId\': 650770}, \'multiverseid\': 650770}, {\'name\': "Neheb, l\'Eterno", \'text\': "Affliggere 3 (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura viene bloccata, il giocatore in difesa perde 3 punti vita.)\\nAll\'inizio della tua fase principale post-combattimento, aggiungi {R} per ogni punto vita perso dai tuoi avversari in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Minotauro Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa è la forma della gloria."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cfe3b35-7528-42d4-93d5-00f636d4d859\', \'multiverseId\': 651029}, \'multiverseid\': 651029}, {\'name\': \'永遠衆、ネヘブ\', \'text\': \'加虐３（このクリーチャーがブロックされた状態になるたび、防御プレイヤーは３点のライフを失う。）\\nあなたの戦闘後メイン・フェイズの開始時に、このターンに対戦相手が失ったライフ１点につき{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「これが栄光だ。」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db99b4f-c5ce-4bfc-9651-679ac59b5268\', \'multiverseId\': 651288}, \'multiverseid\': 651288}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nelly Borca, impulsive Anklägerin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Nelly Borca, impulsive Anklägerin, angreift, verdächtige eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Stachle danach alle verdächtigten Kreaturen an. (Eine verdächtigte Kreatur hat Bedrohlichkeit und kann nicht blocken.)\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, einem oder mehreren deiner Gegner Kampfschaden zufügen, zieht du und der Beherrscher jener Kreaturen jeweils eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649914&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9878c825-9048-44e3-854c-0d33afe7c1f9\', \'multiverseId\': 649914}, \'multiverseid\': 649914}, {\'name\': \'Nelly Borca, accusatrice impulsive\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Nelly Borca, accusatrice impulsive attaque, suspectez une créature ciblée. Puis incitez toutes les créatures suspectées. (Une créature suspectée a la menace et ne peut pas bloquer.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle inflige des blessures de combat à au moins un de vos adversaires, vous et le contrôleur de ces créatures piochez chacun une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649918&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e360b8-f0d1-4044-99c6-62c46c733272\', \'multiverseId\': 649918}, \'multiverseid\': 649918}, {\'name\': \'Nelly Borca, Accusatrice Impulsiva\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta Nelly Borca, Accusatrice Impulsiva attacca, sospetta una creatura bersaglio. Poi sprona tutte le creature sospettate. (Una creatura sospettata ha minacciare e non può bloccare.)\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature controllate da un avversario infliggono danno da combattimento a uno o più dei tuoi avversari, tu e il controllore di quelle creature pescate una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Detective Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb9f455-4b40-437c-b8f3-1289e6b8aca6\', \'multiverseId\': 649922}, \'multiverseid\': 649922}, {\'name\': \'衝動的な告発人、ネリー・ボルカ\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n衝動的な告発人、ネリー・ボルカが攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それに容疑をかける。その後、すべての容疑クリーチャーを使嗾する。（容疑クリーチャーは威迫を持ち、それではブロックできない。）\\n対戦相手１人がコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが１人以上の対戦相手に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたとそれらのクリーチャーのコントローラーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d3e9af-e19d-4bc8-8166-5d7b02f7ab31\', \'multiverseId\': 649926}, \'multiverseid\': 649926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nelly Borca, impulsive Anklägerin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Nelly Borca, impulsive Anklägerin, angreift, verdächtige eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Stachle danach alle verdächtigten Kreaturen an.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, einem oder mehreren deiner Gegner Kampfschaden zufügen, zieht du und der Beherrscher jener Kreaturen jeweils eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651456&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'928fba02-da0b-4b6a-905a-76f405c51575\', \'multiverseId\': 651456}, \'multiverseid\': 651456}, {\'name\': \'Nelly Borca, accusatrice impulsive\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Nelly Borca, accusatrice impulsive attaque, suspectez une créature ciblée. Puis incitez toutes les créatures suspectées.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle inflige des blessures de combat à au moins un de vos adversaires, vous et le contrôleur de ces créatures piochez chacun une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c590928-50df-44fb-8126-236e7c8b1a63\', \'multiverseId\': 651464}, \'multiverseid\': 651464}, {\'name\': \'衝動的な告発人、ネリー・ボルカ\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n衝動的な告発人、ネリー・ボルカが攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それに容疑をかける。その後、すべての容疑クリーチャーを使嗾する。\\n対戦相手１人がコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが１人以上の対戦相手に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたとそれらのクリーチャーのコントローラーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a8b0ecf-dba8-4a67-8543-c5972186b40d\', \'multiverseId\': 651472}, \'multiverseid\': 651472}, {\'name\': \'冲动控官内莉博卡\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当冲动控官内莉博卡攻击时，怀疑目标生物。然后煽惑所有已遭疑的生物。\\n每当由对手操控的一个或数个生物向你的一位或多位对手造成战斗伤害时，你和这些生物的操控者各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6702447-d2ba-4cd7-8816-c4ec0a9a84f1\', \'multiverseId\': 651480}, \'multiverseid\': 651480}]', "[{'name': 'Nesselzyste', 'text': 'Lebende Waffe (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/0 schwarzen Phyrexianer-Keim-Kreaturenspielstein und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt und jede Verzauberung, das bzw. die du kontrollierst.\\nAusrüsten {2}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650586&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c0e46f4-35a7-47b2-933c-21d199d6613e', 'multiverseId': 650586}, 'multiverseid': 650586}, {'name': 'Urtikyste', 'text': 'Arme vivante (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Phyrexian et Germe, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact et/ou enchantement que vous contrôlez.\\nÉquipement {2}', 'type': 'Artefact — équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650845&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '468372dc-f31c-4d76-86f1-77a9aaaba69b', 'multiverseId': 650845}, 'multiverseid': 650845}, {'name': 'Ciste Urticante', 'text': 'Arma vivente (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Microbo Phyrexiano 0/0 nera, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1 per ogni artefatto e/o incantesimo che controlli.\\nEquipaggiare {2}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651104&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7f2eead-0c3f-4cd3-b0d3-b35e3b1a236e', 'multiverseId': 651104}, 'multiverseid': 651104}, {'name': 'イラクサ嚢胞', 'text': '生体武器（この装備品が戦場に出たとき、黒の０/０のファイレクシアン・細菌・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしていてアーティファクトやエンチャントである１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651363&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18ce96d6-d440-42b2-9052-7e70fda1c8a7', 'multiverseId': 651363}, 'multiverseid': 651363}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nüchterner Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Zerstöre alle Artefakte.\\n• Zerstöre alle Verzauberungen.\\n• Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger.\\n• Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Manabetrag 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650409&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636d652f-52e9-4c7b-9564-7f96bc2116f2\', \'multiverseId\': 650409}, \'multiverseid\': 650409}, {\'name\': "Commandement d\'austérité", \'text\': \'Choisissez deux —\\n• Détruisez tous les artefacts.\\n• Détruisez tous les enchantements.\\n• Détruisez toutes les créatures dont la valeur de mana est inférieure ou égale à 3.\\n• Détruisez toutes les créatures dont la valeur de mana est supérieure ou égale à 4.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650668&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5b07207-5594-4148-ac58-4aae437b8d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 650668}, \'multiverseid\': 650668}, {\'name\': \'Ordine Severo\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Distruggi tutti gli artefatti.\\n• Distruggi tutti gli incantesimi.\\n• Distruggi tutte le creature con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3.\\n• Distruggi tutte le creature con valore di mana pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9f070cf-c0e3-4012-9325-22e779ffbd61\', \'multiverseId\': 650927}, \'multiverseid\': 650927}, {\'name\': \'質素な命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・すべてのアーティファクトを破壊する。\\n・すべてのエンチャントを破壊する。\\n・マナ総量が３以下であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n・マナ総量が４以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab026a23-e792-406b-972e-1016c6092a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 651186}, \'multiverseid\': 651186}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ohran-Frostzahn\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Ophis\', \'flavor\': \'Leise wie eine Schneewehe. Unaufhaltsam wie eine Lawine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21cb9345-9f84-498f-aff2-d28843849391\', \'multiverseId\': 650533}, \'multiverseid\': 650533}, {\'name\': "Croc-de-givre d\'Ohran", \'text\': "Les créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse — serpent\', \'flavor\': "Silencieux comme la congère. Inéluctable comme l\'avalanche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650792&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b711c9-8bdb-4536-826c-b16148bbc32b\', \'multiverseId\': 650792}, \'multiverseid\': 650792}, {\'name\': \'Zannabrina di Ohran\', \'text\': \'Le creature attaccanti che controlli hanno tocco letale.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'Silenzioso come un fiocco di neve, inesorabile come una valanga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09d5e01-27e7-44a6-8e60-94b630942d39\', \'multiverseId\': 651051}, \'multiverseid\': 651051}, {\'name\': \'オーランの凍り牙\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての攻撃クリーチャーは接死を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 蛇\', \'flavor\': \'雪溜のように静かに。雪崩のように残酷に。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'212f2b9a-0a06-4850-bd27-bc072093fe2c\', \'multiverseId\': 651310}, \'multiverseid\': 651310}]', '[{\'name\': \'Organische Ausrottung\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nZerstöre alle Nichtartefaktkreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Technologie entwickelt sich schneller, als eine Klinge schwingen kann."\\n—Arima, Chef-Erfinder der Futuristen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650429&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37552a19-8638-413d-afcb-6d1f9a501a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 650429}, \'multiverseid\': 650429}, {\'name\': \'Extinction organique\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nDétruisez toutes les créatures non-artefact.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La technologie évolue plus vite qu\'une lame ne peut fendre l\'air. »\\n—Arima, inventeur en chef des Futuristes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650688&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'724c6f0d-8af1-49c2-bc52-c604bc20bd75\', \'multiverseId\': 650688}, \'multiverseid\': 650688}, {\'name\': \'Estinzione Organica\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nDistruggi tutte le creature non artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La tecnologia si evolve più velocemente del fendente di una lama."\\n—Arima, inventore capo dei Futuristi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb26cdaf-099b-43be-89be-a54a43db0f78\', \'multiverseId\': 650947}, \'multiverseid\': 650947}, {\'name\': \'有機体の絶滅\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは、{1}を支払う。）\\nアーティファクトでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「技術革新とは剣の一太刀よりも速く進んでゆくもの。」\\n――有馬、未来派の主任発明者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0874c761-46bb-4646-af20-c64c7b263668\', \'multiverseId\': 651206}, \'multiverseid\': 651206}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Advokistin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kann jeder Spieler zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur legen, die er kontrolliert. Falls ein Spieler dies tut, können Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert, bis zu deinem nächsten Zug weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'Die Orzhov sind nicht an Reue, sondern ausschließlich an Tilgung interessiert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650430&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54d60b4-ea5d-4df2-a96d-cb628d733a8a\', \'multiverseId\': 650430}, \'multiverseid\': 650430}, {\'name\': "Avoquiste d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, chaque joueur peut mettre deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature qu\'il contrôle. Si un joueur fait ainsi, les créatures que ce joueur contrôle ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "Les Orzhov se moquent du repentir, ils s\'intéressent seulement au remboursement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650689&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ee84e5-179c-4495-ae15-07a163c64732\', \'multiverseId\': 650689}, \'multiverseid\': 650689}, {\'name\': \'Fautrice Orzhov\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni giocatore può mettere due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura che controlla. Se un giocatore lo fa, le creature controllate da quel giocatore non possono attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli fino al tuo prossimo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Agli Orzhov non interessa il pentimento, solo il pagamento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcccedc6-d5a4-425a-92d0-eef4e9d08480\', \'multiverseId\': 650948}, \'multiverseid\': 650948}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの弁護士\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置いてもよい。プレイヤーがそうしたなら、次のあなたのーンまで、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャーではあなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'オルゾフは謝罪を求めず、返済を求める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b23cd6-6620-4f42-ac3c-fc905901e4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 651207}, \'multiverseid\': 651207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paarweise Probleme\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Gegner einen zusätzlichen Zug beginnen würde, überspringt er jenen Zug stattdessen.\\nImmer wenn dich ein Gegner mit zwei oder mehr Kreaturen angreift, oder innerhalb desselben Zuges die zweite Karte zieht oder den zweiten Zauberspruch wirkt, ziehst du eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Gemeinsam sind sie mehr als die Summe ihrer Vorstrafenregister.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5199f277-03b6-4a83-b9fb-c44396b65ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 649993}, \'multiverseid\': 649993}, {\'name\': \'Les problèmes viennent par deux\', \'text\': "Si un adversaire devait commencer un tour supplémentaire, ce joueur passe ce tour à la place.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire vous attaque avec au moins deux créatures, qu\'il pioche sa deuxième carte à chaque tour ou qu\'il lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Ensemble, ils sont bien supérieurs à la somme de leurs casiers judiciaires.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650033&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdd8ebcc-b92d-4ae2-8065-8886533221dd\', \'multiverseId\': 650033}, \'multiverseid\': 650033}, {\'name\': \'Pericolo in Coppia\', \'text\': \'Se un avversario sta per iniziare un turno extra, quel giocatore salta invece quel turno.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario ti attacca con due o più creature, pesca la sua seconda carta in ogni turno o lancia la sua seconda magia in ogni turno, peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Delle fedine così sporche sono senza precedenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3512c3c8-8652-4d7b-925a-7b6f8ada2e88\', \'multiverseId\': 650073}, \'multiverseid\': 650073}, {\'name\': \'つるむ面倒\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が追加のターンを始めるなら、代わりにそのプレイヤーはそのターンを飛ばす。\\n対戦相手１人が２体以上のクリーチャーであなたを攻撃するか、各ターン内の自分の２枚目のカードを引くか、各ターン内の自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'二人が手を組むと、調書以上に手に負えない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2552ee4e-3bfa-4394-bbfa-4f692bbccfc5\', \'multiverseId\': 650113}, \'multiverseid\': 650113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paarweise Probleme\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Gegner einen zusätzlichen Zug beginnen würde, überspringt er jenen Zug stattdessen.\\nImmer wenn dich ein Gegner mit zwei oder mehr Kreaturen angreift, oder innerhalb desselben Zuges die zweite Karte zieht oder den zweiten Zauberspruch wirkt, ziehst du eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Gemeinsam sind sie mehr als die Summe ihrer Vorstrafenregister.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8274356f-dd6c-48cd-89b4-1b418d398d1d\', \'multiverseId\': 651527}, \'multiverseid\': 651527}, {\'name\': \'Les problèmes viennent par deux\', \'text\': "Si un adversaire devait commencer un tour supplémentaire, ce joueur passe ce tour à la place.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire vous attaque avec au moins deux créatures, qu\'il pioche sa deuxième carte à chaque tour ou qu\'il lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Ensemble, ils sont bien supérieurs à la somme de leurs casiers judiciaires.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14604b26-89be-4c40-99f3-1d998db093e7\', \'multiverseId\': 651566}, \'multiverseid\': 651566}, {\'name\': \'つるむ面倒\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が追加のターンを始めるなら、代わりにそのプレイヤーはそのターンを飛ばす。\\n対戦相手１人が２体以上のクリーチャーであなたを攻撃するか、各ターン内の自分の２枚目のカードを引くか、各ターン内の自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'二人が手を組むと、調書以上に手に負えない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33c6aed8-4923-48cb-bd11-9028a9b77f71\', \'multiverseId\': 651605}, \'multiverseid\': 651605}, {\'name\': \'祸事成双\', \'text\': \'如果某对手将开始额外的一个回合，则改为该牌手略过该回合。\\n每当任一对手以两个或更多生物攻击你，抓每回合中其第二张牌或施放每回合中其第二个咒语时，你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'成双作恶更胜其累累前科。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ab40de2-47f5-4dfd-afea-c76f51f1df8a\', \'multiverseId\': 651644}, \'multiverseid\': 651644}]', '[{\'name\': \'Panoptischer Projecktor\', \'text\': \'{T}: Der nächste verdeckte Kreaturenzauber, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken {3} weniger.\\nFalls das Aufdecken eines verdeckten Permanents bei einem Permanent, das du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit ausgelöst, wird die Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Er zeigt alle Fakten, jeden Verdächtigen und jedes Beweisstück für jeden Fall, den die Agentur betreut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ed470d-287e-4e15-95eb-01aff1bc9e0c\', \'multiverseId\': 650022}, \'multiverseid\': 650022}, {\'name\': \'Projekteur panoptique\', \'text\': "{T} : Le prochain sort de créature face cachée que vous lancez ce tour-ci coûte {3} de moins à lancer.\\nSi retourner face visible un permanent face cachée provoque le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il affiche tous les faits, tous les suspects et les moindres preuves de toutes les affaires que chapeaute l\'Agence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650062&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb3e5928-2473-4ce4-9c0d-c36945af2c27\', \'multiverseId\': 650062}, \'multiverseid\': 650062}, {\'name\': \'Proiettore Panottico\', \'text\': "{T}: La prossima magia creatura a faccia in giù che lanci in questo turno costa {3} in meno per essere lanciata.\\nSe girare a faccia in su un permanente a faccia in giù fa innescare un\'abilità innescata di un permanente che controlli, quell\'abilità si innesca una volta in più.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Mostra ogni fatto, ogni sospettato e ogni minimo indizio di tutti i casi gestiti dall\'Agenzia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d44b2d-dd42-4e7a-8bbd-6b917b81d9a4\', \'multiverseId\': 650102}, \'multiverseid\': 650102}, {\'name\': \'一望の反射鏡\', \'text\': \'{T}：このターン、あなたが次に唱える裏向きのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\\n裏向きのパーマネント１つが表向きになることであなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発するなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'探偵社管轄の事件に関するものなら、事実や容疑者、さらには些細な証拠までも網羅している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bdacb0a-5ee7-4bc1-802c-7daf2fa5fc86\', \'multiverseId\': 650142}, \'multiverseid\': 650142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Panoptischer Projecktor\', \'text\': \'{T}: Der nächste verdeckte Kreaturenzauber, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken {3} weniger.\\nFalls das Aufdecken eines verdeckten Permanents bei einem Permanent, das du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit auslöst, wird die Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Er zeigt alle Fakten, jeden Verdächtigen und jedes Beweisstück für jeden Fall, den die Agentur betreut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651555&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37956955-a79b-47d3-8b79-4b6c25e6e4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 651555}, \'multiverseid\': 651555}, {\'name\': \'Projekteur panoptique\', \'text\': "{T} : Le prochain sort de créature face cachée que vous lancez ce tour-ci coûte {3} de moins à lancer.\\nSi retourner face visible un permanent face cachée provoque le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il affiche tous les faits, tous les suspects et les moindres preuves de toutes les affaires que chapeaute l\'Agence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79a055c5-6605-4207-8f2a-c773807d2839\', \'multiverseId\': 651594}, \'multiverseid\': 651594}, {\'name\': \'一望の反射鏡\', \'text\': \'{T}：このターン、あなたが次に唱える裏向きのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\\n裏向きのパーマネント１つが表向きになることであなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発するなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'探偵社管轄の事件に関するものなら、事実や容疑者、さらには些細な証拠までも網羅している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'747c6001-9639-458e-856b-2389d739b5d4\', \'multiverseId\': 651633}, \'multiverseid\': 651633}, {\'name\': \'全域映射镜\', \'text\': \'{T}：你本回合中施放之下一个牌面朝下的生物咒语减少{3}来施放。\\n如果由你操控之永久物具有的触发式异能因牌面朝下的永久物翻回正面而触发，则该异能额外触发一次。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'魔调局负责的每桩案子里的每处实情、每名嫌犯和每条证据都显现其上。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f3d990-40d4-4862-a379-9b407fdf9a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 651672}, \'multiverseid\': 651672}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Der Pfad der Ahnen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Commanders. Wenn dieses Mana ausgegeben wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, der einen Kreaturentyp mit deinem Commander gemeinsam hat, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333e7059-6394-426f-b410-e09a7e74a565\', \'multiverseId\': 650632}, \'multiverseid\': 650632}, {\'name\': "Voie de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "La Voie de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature qui partage un type de créature avec votre commandant, regard 1.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d7f7278-192a-4075-8893-1df1ecba9ff5\', \'multiverseId\': 650891}, \'multiverseid\': 650891}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Il Sentiero Ancestrale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante. Quando quel mana viene speso per lanciare una magia creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con il tuo comandante, profetizza 1.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0630a57-6798-4f4d-8473-5b588b5003a1\', \'multiverseId\': 651150}, \'multiverseid\': 651150}, {\'name\': \'祖先の道\', \'text\': \'祖先の道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。そのマナが、あなたの統率者と共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2f41bb-2d59-499c-b596-343555b5a4d9\', \'multiverseId\': 651409}, \'multiverseid\': 651409}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Erlösung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Unzerstörbarkeit und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\n{1}{W}: Schicke die verzauberte Kreatur ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Verbrechen zahlt sich nicht annähernd so gut aus wie die Arbeit für die Agentur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c3d71e-be33-4087-8b3e-b640ac91f1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 649991}, \'multiverseid\': 649991}, {\'name\': \'Arc de rédemption\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a l\'indestructible et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\n{1}{W} : Exilez la créature enchantée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "Le crime ne paie pas aussi bien que l\'Agence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650031&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83cad353-b1a9-46a9-a4aa-292a3bbaea43\', \'multiverseId\': 650031}, \'multiverseid\': 650031}, {\'name\': \'Arco di Redenzione\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha indistruttibile ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\n{1}{W}: Esilia la creatura incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Commettere crimini è molto meno redditizio che lavorare per l\'Agenzia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d98e50c-e138-48c4-b2a9-8549b32f0ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 650071}, \'multiverseid\': 650071}, {\'name\': \'贖罪への道\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは破壊不能を持ち、使嗾されている。（それは各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\n{1}{W}：エンチャントしているクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'犯罪より探偵社の方が給料がいい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80d3895f-7c50-4c53-90a6-9bc1cba8ca4a\', \'multiverseId\': 650111}, \'multiverseid\': 650111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Erlösung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Unzerstörbarkeit und ist angestachelt.\\n{1}{W}: Schicke die verzauberte Kreatur ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Verbrechen zahlt sich nicht annähernd so gut aus wie die Arbeit für die Agentur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd3aed94-0d9b-4ce1-804c-2b878e17b19e\', \'multiverseId\': 651525}, \'multiverseid\': 651525}, {\'name\': \'Arc de rédemption\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a l\'indestructible et est incitée.\\n{1}{W} : Exilez la créature enchantée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "Le crime ne paie pas aussi bien que l\'Agence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651564&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87a7e662-52bf-4c26-acc4-378a85f0a3af\', \'multiverseId\': 651564}, \'multiverseid\': 651564}, {\'name\': \'贖罪への道\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは破壊不能を持ち、使嗾されている。\\n{1}{W}：エンチャントしているクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'犯罪より探偵社の方が給料がいい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf0699e-58a7-402d-9924-1ec05b2e9e72\', \'multiverseId\': 651603}, \'multiverseid\': 651603}, {\'name\': \'救赎弧光\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有不灭异能且已煽惑。\\n{1}{W}：放逐所结附的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'犯罪的代价远没有魔调局的报酬来得丰厚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce1ad24-828e-407c-bd8a-fa7d3ce1bf77\', \'multiverseId\': 651642}, \'multiverseid\': 651642}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Geheimnisse\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine verdeckte Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\\nImmer wenn ein Permanent, das du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird und falls es eine Kreatur ist, erhält es +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb2fb3c-c9cd-49bb-803b-62cf2885db99\', \'multiverseId\': 650545}, \'multiverseid\': 650545}, {\'name\': \'Piste de mystère\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature face cachée arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, si c\'est une créature, elle gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc209bda-8c46-4c16-b431-52abe3f8a1e5\', \'multiverseId\': 650804}, \'multiverseid\': 650804}, {\'name\': \'Traccia del Mistero\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura a faccia in giù entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.\\nOgniqualvolta un permanente che controlli viene girato a faccia in su, se è una creatura, prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d67c7e62-48a2-4a40-9c9d-f460cbd73722\', \'multiverseId\': 651063}, \'multiverseid\': 651063}, {\'name\': \'神秘の痕跡\', \'text\': \'裏向きのクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つが表向きになるたび、それがクリーチャーである場合、ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afbb7d21-8c3f-4080-a96d-8ef26440616b\', \'multiverseId\': 651322}, \'multiverseid\': 651322}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pflichtgelübde\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Wachsamkeit und kann weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bevorzuge Loyalität aus Respekt und nicht aufgrund von Magie. Aber man tut, was nötig ist."\\n—Kaalia von der Weite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650442&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9caddf47-6027-4f05-9da6-2d9c3fdfecc0\', \'multiverseId\': 650442}, \'multiverseid\': 650442}, {\'name\': \'Vœu de devoir\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2, a la vigilance et elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "« Je préfère que la loyauté soit une question de respect, pas de magie. Mais parfois, il faut se plier aux exigences... »\\n—Kaalia de l\'Immensité", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650701&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c563d0a-4b31-49e6-ab75-33ad18afdaf2\', \'multiverseId\': 650701}, \'multiverseid\': 650701}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento del Dovere\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2, ha cautela e non può attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Preferisco che la lealtà sia una questione di rispetto, non di magia. Ma ognuno fa ciò che deve."\\n—Kaalia della Vastità\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89b6666a-1062-44da-9509-af86f8a7f852\', \'multiverseId\': 650960}, \'multiverseid\': 650960}, {\'name\': \'義務の誓約\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、警戒を持ち、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「忠誠ってのは尊敬から来るものである方がいいね。魔法じゃなくて。ただ、やらなきゃいけないことをやる奴は必要なんだよね。」\\n――巨大なるカーリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3398beb9-ebdf-44ed-ab5f-f9b101102ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 651219}, \'multiverseid\': 651219}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianische Arena\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Einen bittersüßen Moment lang glaubte Jace, dass er seine Geliebte noch retten könne. Ein Moment war alles, was Vraska brauchte. „Für Phyrexias Ruhm", flüsterte sie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d661fd5f-7ffa-416b-90d0-214957752c7d\', \'multiverseId\': 650486}, \'multiverseid\': 650486}, {\'name\': \'Arène phyrexiane\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "L\'espace d\'un instant, Jace crut qu\'il pouvait encore sauver son amour. Un instant qui suffit à Vraska. « Pour la gloire de Phyrexia », lui susurra-t-elle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c5e8fe0-679a-4171-9586-7c1a5a6f1d91\', \'multiverseId\': 650745}, \'multiverseid\': 650745}, {\'name\': \'Arena di Phyrexia\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Per un momento agrodolce, Jace credette di poter ancora salvare la sua amata. Un momento era tutto ciò di cui Vraska aveva bisogno. "Per la gloria di Phyrexia," sussurrò lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7a9c7e-77c5-43a6-b454-2a260f19ab6a\', \'multiverseId\': 651004}, \'multiverseid\': 651004}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの闘技場\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'甘くほろ苦い瞬間が訪れてもなお、ジェイスはまだ彼の愛するものを取り戻せると信じていた。そんな瞬間こそ、ヴラスカは必要としていたのだった。「ファイレクシアの栄光のために。」彼女は囁いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'235abcab-b6d3-41b0-a950-a70bdcfbb382\', \'multiverseId\': 651263}, \'multiverseid\': 651263}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preis der Berühmtheit\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls er eine legendäre Kreatur als Ziel hat.\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nÜberwachen 2. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650488&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d591df96-adcb-4e4a-aea2-57ab0dfeb94e\', \'multiverseId\': 650488}, \'multiverseid\': 650488}, {\'name\': \'Prix de la célébrité\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer s\'il cible une créature légendaire.\\nDétruisez une créature ciblée.\\nSurveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4a1d96-5540-4e70-87e3-1981a950e9a6\', \'multiverseId\': 650747}, \'multiverseid\': 650747}, {\'name\': \'Prezzo della Celebrità\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se bersaglia una creatura leggendaria.\\nDistruggi una creatura bersaglio.\\nSorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56bef4b-3345-49f5-84ec-a25adeb3d740\', \'multiverseId\': 651006}, \'multiverseid\': 651006}, {\'name\': \'名声の代価\', \'text\': \'この呪文が伝説のクリーチャーを対象とするなら、これを唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad2c01f2-667f-4e6d-9edf-4b059e9e6372\', \'multiverseId\': 651265}, \'multiverseid\': 651265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prophetin der Dämmerung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nAufstieg (Falls du zehn oder mehr Permanente kontrollierst, erhältst du für den Rest der Partie den Segen der Stadt.)\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du den Segen der Stadt hast, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Jeder Gegner verliert X Lebenspunkte und du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag der Karte ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'599d5ef9-f272-4528-a92f-4d0f2af753c7\', \'multiverseId\': 650496}, \'multiverseid\': 650496}, {\'name\': \'Prophétesse du crépuscule\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAscension (Si vous contrôlez au moins dix permanents, vous gagnez l\'agrément de la cité pour le reste de la partie.)\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous avez l\'agrément de la cité, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et mettez-la dans votre main. Chaque adversaire perd X points de vie et vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant la valeur de mana de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650755&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4102e82-588c-416a-b7ff-890c3a32c4d3\', \'multiverseId\': 650755}, \'multiverseid\': 650755}, {\'name\': \'Profetessa del Crepuscolo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAscesa (Se controlli dieci o più permanenti, ottieni la benedizione della città per il resto della partita.)\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se hai la benedizione della città, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio e aggiungila alla tua mano. Ogni avversario perde X punti vita e tu guadagni X punti vita, dove X è il valore di mana di quella carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81afb426-5700-48c9-ac72-3a0ac68bd45d\', \'multiverseId\': 651014}, \'multiverseid\': 651014}, {\'name\': \'黄昏の預言者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n昇殿（あなたが10個以上のパーマネントをコントロールしているなら、このゲームの間、あなたは都市の承認を得る。）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが都市の承認を持っている場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失い、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘは、そのカードのマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106211c2-0c1d-4076-a01d-dfcfa43fbf12\', \'multiverseId\': 651273}, \'multiverseid\': 651273}]', "[{'name': 'Präriefluss', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDer Präriefluss kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Ondu ist ein ausgedehntes Plateau, durchzogen von tiefen Furchen und Mäanderströmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650634&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e36b25b-617d-4c98-a101-8404980d95b6', 'multiverseId': 650634}, 'multiverseid': 650634}, {'name': 'Prairie ruisselante', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLa Prairie ruisselante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain — plaine et île', 'flavor': 'Le continent du Ondou est un vaste plateau traversé de fossés profonds et de rivières sinueuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650893&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'faeaa350-bc10-4182-990c-e0e452304788', 'multiverseId': 650893}, 'multiverseid': 650893}, {'name': 'Ruscello nella Prateria', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nIl Ruscello nella Prateria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Ondu è un vasto altopiano segnato da profondi fossati e fiumi sinuosi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651152&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5b425d4-63c8-49c3-9952-1841be691835', 'multiverseId': 651152}, 'multiverseid': 651152}, {'name': '大草原の川', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、大草原の川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': 'オンドゥ大陸は広大な平地である。そこを深い溝が縦横に走り、曲がりくねった川が流れている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651411&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c45f4f6-6ae9-4f6b-94c8-eebba0b72f58', 'multiverseId': 651411}, 'multiverseid': 651411}]", '[{\'name\': \'Psychosenkrabbler\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Psychosenkrabblers sind gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Phyrexianer, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls dieses Gehirn nicht das Geheimnis des Serums entschlüsseln kann, dann füge noch mehr Gehirn dazu."\\n—Rhmir, Hand des Augurs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'789147aa-0d9a-4bf9-89f0-1fce24791cef\', \'multiverseId\': 650587}, \'multiverseid\': 650587}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur psychotique\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Rampeur psychotique sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — phyrexian et horreur\', \'flavor\': "« Si ce cerveau est incapable de découvrir le secret du sérum, ajoutez-en quelques-uns de plus. »\\n—Rhmir, Main de l\'Augure", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce884eb-65a8-4372-969e-992c3f40dd27\', \'multiverseId\': 650846}, \'multiverseid\': 650846}, {\'name\': \'Psicosi Strisciante\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione della Psicosi Strisciante sono pari al numero di carte nella tua mano.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Orrore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se quel cervello non riesce a capire il segreto del siero, allora aggiungi altro cervello."\\n—Rhmir, Mano dell\\\'Augure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f377212c-d339-4d26-bae5-dc0d679ae8d1\', \'multiverseId\': 651105}, \'multiverseid\': 651105}, {\'name\': \'精神の病を這うもの\', \'text\': \'精神の病を這うもののパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\\nあなたがカード１枚を引くたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'「その脳で血清の秘密が探れぬなら、もっと脳を足してやれ。」\\n――卜占の手、ルミーア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8aed1c9-5265-47cc-b24c-d045950b8b61\', \'multiverseId\': 651364}, \'multiverseid\': 651364}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Vorfahr\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Rachsüchtige Vorfahr ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greift die Kreatur in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn eine angestachelte Kreatur angreift, fügt sie ihrem Beherrscher 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b501ca8e-c58f-4e4d-8ba1-dc24600a8172\', \'multiverseId\': 650516}, \'multiverseid\': 650516}, {\'name\': \'Ancêtre vengeur\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ancêtre vengeur arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, incitez une créature ciblée. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature incitée attaque, elle inflige 1 blessure à son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c99aea-c5b7-4945-b48c-a545ad8a1d67\', \'multiverseId\': 650775}, \'multiverseid\': 650775}, {\'name\': \'Antenato Vendicativo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Antenato Vendicativo entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, sprona una creatura bersaglio. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quella creatura attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura spronata attacca, infligge 1 danno al suo controllore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb95665b-82f2-45da-8e0c-c89bf2068c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 651034}, \'multiverseid\': 651034}, {\'name\': \'復讐の祖霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n復讐の祖霊が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。（次のあなたのターンまで、そのクリーチャーは、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\n使嗾されているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、それはそれのコントローラーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e450ff9e-a245-47f0-a0a8-4effc3ed8f86\', \'multiverseId\': 651293}, \'multiverseid\': 651293}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rathische Stürme\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die nicht verzaubert sind. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es wird einen enormen Schrei geben, und danach eine noch enormere Stille."\\n—Das Orakel en-Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650446&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af14d4e9-45c7-4809-b425-fe73a0ce70de\', \'multiverseId\': 650446}, \'multiverseid\': 650446}, {\'name\': \'Venti di Rath\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature che non sono incantate. Non possono essere rigenerate.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sarà un urlo lacerante e poi un silenzio ancor più grande."\\n—Oracolo en-Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a4a957a-e0bc-443e-8fad-9d5bac28ceb8\', \'multiverseId\': 650964}, \'multiverseid\': 650964}, {\'name\': \'ラースの風\', \'text\': \'オーラがついていないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。それらは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「大きな叫び声が上がり、その後もっと大きな静寂が訪れるだろう。」\\n――ヴェクの巫女\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ddadb9-8cdd-42f1-84ab-311b3d592deb\', \'multiverseId\': 651223}, \'multiverseid\': 651223}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reanimation\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hoffe, du bist es wert."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6418135c-d710-4fbe-8766-0dc79003b063\', \'multiverseId\': 650490}, \'multiverseid\': 650490}, {\'name\': \'Réanimation\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Espérons que tu en vailles la peine. »\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659eb339-a42e-4e0b-a137-ebd8856d13ae\', \'multiverseId\': 650749}, \'multiverseid\': 650749}, {\'name\': \'Rianimare\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Perdi punti vita pari al suo valore di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Spero per te che tu ne valga la pena."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89fc0f3c-e2f4-43f0-9718-aaac922c77a0\', \'multiverseId\': 651008}, \'multiverseid\': 651008}, {\'name\': \'再活性\', \'text\': \'墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。あなたはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これに見合う値打ちがあるといいわね。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a34489-4a44-4ddd-9a3c-de5067d87e77\', \'multiverseId\': 651267}, \'multiverseid\': 651267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Regen der Erkenntnis\', \'text\': \'Überwachen 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten. Der Regen der Erkenntnis fügt dir 2 Schadenspunkte zu. (Um Überwachen 2 anzuwenden, schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Stadtluft besteht aus einem konstanten Nieselregen privater Gedanken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea07d471-1693-40ac-81ae-0072cbb80ad5\', \'multiverseId\': 650570}, \'multiverseid\': 650570}, {\'name\': \'Pluie de notions\', \'text\': "Surveillez 2, puis piochez deux cartes. La Pluie de notions vous inflige 2 blessures. (Pour surveiller 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'air de la ville est une bruine constante de pensées secrètes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5481300a-80cb-4e54-8c6d-2df0879e7bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 650829}, \'multiverseid\': 650829}, {\'name\': \'Pioggia di Nozioni\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 2, poi pesca due carte. La Pioggia di Nozioni ti infligge 2 danni. (Per sorvegliare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'aria della città è permeata da una pioviggine costante di pensieri privati.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf67ac1-930f-40b6-9892-528ed3c712f3\', \'multiverseId\': 651088}, \'multiverseid\': 651088}, {\'name\': \'概念の雨\', \'text\': \'諜報２を行う。その後、カード２枚を引く。概念の雨はあなたに２点のダメージを与える。（諜報２を行うとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'都市の空気には個人の思考が降雨し続けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1d46054-34f7-49b0-8b31-f2054de67f59\', \'multiverseId\': 651347}, \'multiverseid\': 651347}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ritual des tosenden Sturms\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen namens Blitzwüterich können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\\nZu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers erzeugt der Spieler einen 5/1 roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein namens Blitzwüterich. Er verursacht Trampelschaden, hat Eile und „Zu Beginn des Endsegments opferst du diese Kreatur."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f0b9dd5-321f-42f3-a125-8a80efb6a430\', \'multiverseId\': 650512}, \'multiverseid\': 650512}, {\'name\': "Rituel de l\'orage en furie", \'text\': "Les créatures nommées Furie d\'éclairs ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\nAu début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur crée un jeton de créature 5/1 rouge Élémental appelé Furie d\'éclairs. Il a le piétinement, la célérité et « Au début de l\'étape de fin, sacrifiez cette créature. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650771&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60c5029-3de3-4b1c-80e4-88a88d25f4e8\', \'multiverseId\': 650771}, \'multiverseid\': 650771}, {\'name\': \'Rito della Furia Tempestosa\', \'text\': \'Le creature chiamate Furioso Fulminante non possono attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli.\\nAll\\\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore crea una pedina creatura Elementale 5/1 rossa chiamata Furioso Fulminante. Ha travolgere, rapidità e "All\\\'inizio della sottofase finale, sacrifica questa creatura".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2aa40ac-30e7-48bd-893b-804eb18f48c5\', \'multiverseId\': 651030}, \'multiverseid\': 651030}, {\'name\': \'荒れ狂う嵐の儀式\', \'text\': \'「稲妻の憤怒獣」という名前のクリーチャーでは、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\\n各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーは「稲妻の憤怒獣」という名前の赤の５/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それはトランプルと速攻と「終了ステップの開始時に、このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57365c63-fda9-438f-8b77-2fbff48ab960\', \'multiverseId\': 651289}, \'multiverseid\': 651289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückkehr des Wildsprechers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\n• Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Fluch ist gebrochen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d787dd06-07fc-4756-a5c8-b80b3529d375\', \'multiverseId\': 650534}, \'multiverseid\': 650534}, {\'name\': \'Retour du Languebestion\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez.\\n• Les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La malédiction est brisée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f997e77-564d-4752-a9b9-dc59310d81a3\', \'multiverseId\': 650793}, \'multiverseid\': 650793}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno di Lingua Selvaggia\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Pesca carte pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature non Umano che controlli.\\n• Le creature non Umano che controlli prendono +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La maledizione è stata spezzata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae1368f-c6cb-4112-afe7-7c061ff87345\', \'multiverseId\': 651052}, \'multiverseid\': 651052}, {\'name\': \'野生語りの帰還\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「呪いは解けた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723595ca-11bf-4909-8c5a-94de39474567\', \'multiverseId\': 651311}, \'multiverseid\': 651311}]', '[{\'name\': \'Salzstraßen-Überfallskommando\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderes Permanent, das du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird und falls es eine Kreatur ist, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken darauf.\\nMegamorph {3}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Megamorph-Kosten auf und lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae63f5f1-0c91-46b8-8beb-d6d5f3a5163d\', \'multiverseId\': 650537}, \'multiverseid\': 650537}, {\'name\': \'Embusqueurs de la Route du sel\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, si c\'est une créature, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nMégamue {3}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mégamue et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature — chien et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650796&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e23e2e9b-f5bd-4553-9bb8-5bbddf2de7fb\', \'multiverseId\': 650796}, \'multiverseid\': 650796}, {\'name\': \'Assalitori della Via del Sale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro permanente che controlli viene girato a faccia in su, se è una creatura, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di esso.\\nMegamorfosi {3}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di megamorfosi e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Canide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8132e0e-484a-4b5e-91fd-e945b6c7795c\', \'multiverseId\': 651055}, \'multiverseid\': 651055}, {\'name\': \'塩路の伏兵\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないパーマネント１つが表向きになるたび、それがクリーチャーである場合、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n大変異{3}{G}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの大変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。そうしたなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 犬・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28317cf6-e9b8-4de0-9a7f-653839a62e79\', \'multiverseId\': 651314}, \'multiverseid\': 651314}]', '[{\'name\': \'Saryth die Viper\', \'text\': \'Andere getappte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\\nAndere ungetappte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Fluchsicherheit.\\n{1}, {T}: Enttappe eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderes Land deiner Wahl, die bzw. das du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9526816-5c5a-41a3-97c7-0388f1fb176e\', \'multiverseId\': 650538}, \'multiverseid\': 650538}, {\'name\': \'Saryth, croc de la vipère\', \'text\': \'Les autres créatures engagées que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.\\nLes autres créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez ont la défense talismanique.\\n{1}, {T} : Dégagez une autre cible, créature ou terrain, que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'571a45f1-1e4a-4b0a-91bc-3f0fbc04b55e\', \'multiverseId\': 650797}, \'multiverseid\': 650797}, {\'name\': \'Saryth, la Zanna della Vipera\', \'text\': "Le altre creature TAPpate che controlli hanno tocco letale.\\nLe altre creature STAPpate che controlli hanno anti-malocchio.\\n{1}, {T}: STAPpa un\'altra creatura o terra bersaglio che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2df458-ae0a-4ee9-a399-e28db909d4d7\', \'multiverseId\': 651056}, \'multiverseid\': 651056}, {\'name\': \'バイパーの牙、サリス\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでなくタップ状態であるすべてのクリーチャーは接死を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでなくアンタップ状態であるすべてのクリーチャーは呪禁を持つ。\\n{1}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーや土地でありこれでない１つを対象とする。それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f370e6ab-dd52-49a8-bd23-c153cff7e25b\', \'multiverseId\': 651315}, \'multiverseid\': 651315}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schimmernder Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange du vier oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, hat der Schimmernde Drache Fluchsicherheit.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Der indigofarbene Drache tauschte gerne einen kleinen Teil seines Horts gegen ewiges Mondlicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650470&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fdf6334-dcbc-4004-88ea-99a38e17b686\', \'multiverseId\': 650470}, \'multiverseid\': 650470}, {\'name\': \'Dragon scintillant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nTant que vous contrôlez au moins quatre artefacts, le Dragon scintillant a la défense talismanique.\\nEngagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature — dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Le dragon indigo troqua volontiers une part de son trésor contre un éternel clair de lune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650729&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc274286-be93-46e6-8815-066d6f0104c5\', \'multiverseId\': 650729}, \'multiverseid\': 650729}, {\'name\': \'Drago Scintillante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nFintanto che controlli quattro o più artefatti, il Drago Scintillante ha anti-malocchio.\\nTAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': "Il drago indaco fu ben lieto di privarsi di un po\' del suo tesoro in cambio di luce lunare eterna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e6ada0-5192-4ece-9b0e-6da6abf1cfed\', \'multiverseId\': 650988}, \'multiverseid\': 650988}, {\'name\': \'煌めくドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが４つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、煌めくドラゴンは呪禁を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるアーティファクト２つをタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'この藍色のドラゴンは自分の財産の一部と引き換えに永遠の月明かりを手に入れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd045b44-335a-430a-b0da-38a6986768ca\', \'multiverseId\': 651247}, \'multiverseid\': 651247}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schirmhydra\', \'text\': \'Die Schirmhydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Schirmhydra stirbt, erzeuge für jede +1/+1-Marke auf ihr einen 1/1 grünen Ophis-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nMorph {3}{G}{G}\\nSowie die Schirmhydra aufgedeckt wird, lege fünf +1/+1-Marken auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e967af-4fb3-4992-b97e-c8476b1f8f21\', \'multiverseId\': 650524}, \'multiverseid\': 650524}, {\'name\': \'Hydre cagoularde\', \'text\': "L\'Hydre cagoularde arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nQuand l\'Hydre cagoularde meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Serpent pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\nMue {3}{G}{G}\\nAu moment où l\'Hydre cagoularde est retournée face visible, mettez cinq marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature — serpent et hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650783&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4959d37-f956-4353-93b1-8d6306932bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 650783}, \'multiverseid\': 650783}, {\'name\': \'Idra dal Cappuccio\', \'text\': "L\'Idra dal Cappuccio entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nQuando l\'Idra dal Cappuccio muore, crea una pedina creatura Serpente 1/1 verde per ogni segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\nMetamorfosi {3}{G}{G}\\nMentre l\'Idra dal Cappuccio viene girata a faccia in su, metti su di essa cinque segnalini +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra Serpente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'344ff1f6-482a-48a1-9317-3398a4f9df7c\', \'multiverseId\': 651042}, \'multiverseid\': 651042}, {\'name\': \'頭巾被りのハイドラ\', \'text\': \'頭巾被りのハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n頭巾被りのハイドラが死亡したとき、これの上にある＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき１体の、緑の１/１の蛇・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n変異{3}{G}{G}\\n頭巾被りのハイドラが表向きになるに際し、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター５個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d13d215b-b33c-4726-8e07-74cbf114516a\', \'multiverseId\': 651301}, \'multiverseid\': 651301}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlagkräftige Beweismittel\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schlagkräftigen Beweismittel ins Spiel kommen, stelle zweimal Nachforschungen an. (Um Nachforschungen anzustellen, erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nHinweise, die du kontrollierst, sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen Ausrüstungen und haben „Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0" und Ausrüsten {2}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'838216cc-ff58-4cf1-8693-0489ea769005\', \'multiverseId\': 649987}, \'multiverseid\': 649987}, {\'name\': \'Armé de preuves\', \'text\': "Quand Armé de preuves arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez deux fois. (Pour enquêter, créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nLes indices que vous contrôlez sont des équipements en plus de leurs autres types et ont « La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 » et équipement {2}.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e79d037-818e-4dea-ad28-cf40223f6f22\', \'multiverseId\': 650027}, \'multiverseid\': 650027}, {\'name\': \'Armato di Prove\', \'text\': \'Quando Armato di Prove entra nel campo di battaglia, indaga due volte. (Per indagare, crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nGli Indizi che controlli sono Equipaggiamenti in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi e hanno "La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0" ed equipaggiare {2}.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a20cec48-f4ed-4240-99f4-82a314b38b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 650067}, \'multiverseid\': 650067}, {\'name\': \'証拠固め\', \'text\': \'証拠固めが戦場に出たとき、２回調査を行う。（調査を行うとは、手掛かり・トークン１つを生成することである。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての手掛かりは、他のタイプに加えて装備品であり、「装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。」と装備{2}を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4e09f33-96b2-4a41-9e94-6a73adefe03a\', \'multiverseId\': 650107}, \'multiverseid\': 650107}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlagkräftige Beweismittel\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schlagkräftigen Beweismittel ins Spiel kommen, stelle zweimal Nachforschungen an.\\nHinweise, die du kontrollierst, sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen Ausrüstungen und haben „Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0" und Ausrüsten {2}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'503ce1c2-05a2-436c-bffe-8c2919e6a772\', \'multiverseId\': 651521}, \'multiverseid\': 651521}, {\'name\': \'Armé de preuves\', \'text\': \'Quand Armé de preuves arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez deux fois.\\nLes indices que vous contrôlez sont des équipements en plus de leurs autres types et ont « La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 » et équipement {2}.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dc2f27e-4bf7-4c9f-aa49-6f601c1bed9f\', \'multiverseId\': 651560}, \'multiverseid\': 651560}, {\'name\': \'証拠固め\', \'text\': \'証拠固めが戦場に出たとき、２回調査を行う。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての手掛かりは、他のタイプに加えて装備品であり、「装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。」と装備{2}を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe5cc956-3052-4dfa-a626-d26c6169b777\', \'multiverseId\': 651599}, \'multiverseid\': 651599}, {\'name\': \'证物防身\', \'text\': \'当证物防身进战场时，探查两次。\\n由你操控的线索额外具有武具此类别，且具有「佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0」与佩带{2}。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58feaa4b-43bd-4b05-ab2b-9ae454c8bb97\', \'multiverseId\': 651638}, \'multiverseid\': 651638}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleichweg der Diebe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Dieben verbreiteten sich rasch Gerüchte von einem Labyrinth ohne Mauern und einem Schatz von unermesslichem Wert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1caa9d4b-eb98-404f-b33b-c322bd6db24b\', \'multiverseId\': 650637}, \'multiverseid\': 650637}, {\'name\': \'Passage des malandrins\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La rumeur d\'un labyrinthe sans parois et d\'un trésor inestimable se répandit rapidement chez les malandrins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e361ee97-99cc-4d00-8fe7-dee8d1ecc043\', \'multiverseId\': 650896}, \'multiverseid\': 650896}, {\'name\': \'Passaggio dei Farabutti\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tra i ladri si diffusero rapidamente voci che parlavano di un labirinto senza muri e di un bottino oltre ogni immaginazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c83b836-bbb0-47f6-aa54-eeae5d6ee379\', \'multiverseId\': 651155}, \'multiverseid\': 651155}, {\'name\': \'ならず者の道\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'泥棒達の間では、想像を絶する宝が眠るという壁のない迷宮についての噂が瞬く間に広まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b516878-1d7c-4e0c-bec6-2cdabafb7ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 651414}, \'multiverseid\': 651414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schloss Ardenthal\', \'text\': \'Schloss Ardenthal kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Ebene.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne das Pflichtbewusstsein von Ardenthal würde sich das Reich gierig selbst verschlingen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'162555c7-2199-4776-bba2-7aed6dc050e7\', \'multiverseId\': 650606}, \'multiverseid\': 650606}, {\'name\': \'Château Ardenval\', \'text\': \'Le Château Ardenval arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une plaine.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sans la loyauté d\'Ardenval, le royaume se dévorerait lui-même avec avidité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2598e51c-cf4d-4b30-a586-1c6ade4f67c5\', \'multiverseId\': 650865}, \'multiverseid\': 650865}, {\'name\': \'Castello di Ardenvalle\', \'text\': \'Il Castello di Ardenvalle entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una Pianura.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Senza la lealtà di Ardenvalle, il reame divorerebbe se stesso voracemente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf83792-477a-41d9-8934-4e075cfc54b0\', \'multiverseId\': 651124}, \'multiverseid\': 651124}, {\'name\': \'アーデンベイル城\', \'text\': \'あなたが平地をコントロールしていないかぎり、アーデンベイル城はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}：白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'アーデンベイルの忠誠がなければ、王国は貪欲に自らを食い潰してしまうだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77500380-5f57-41b6-8553-e43409fd32a2\', \'multiverseId\': 651383}, \'multiverseid\': 651383}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlusswort-Phantom\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWährend des Endsegments jedes Gegners kannst du Zaubersprüche wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hätte da noch eine Frage …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d08175-5341-46a5-a47a-b7bc0f512875\', \'multiverseId\': 650000}, \'multiverseid\': 650000}, {\'name\': \'Fantôme au dernier mot\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nPendant l\'étape de fin de chaque adversaire, vous pouvez lancer des sorts comme s\'ils avaient le flash.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit et détective\', \'flavor\': \'« Une dernière chose... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650040&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2043a630-1f0f-47f0-9f94-b66c84f586be\', \'multiverseId\': 650040}, \'multiverseid\': 650040}, {\'name\': "Fantasma dell\'Ultima Parola", \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nDurante la sottofase finale di ogni avversario, puoi lanciare magie come se avessero lampo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Detective Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Un\\\'ultima cosa..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'493bb105-821c-466e-b8cb-72b161a67ce2\', \'multiverseId\': 650080}, \'multiverseid\': 650080}, {\'name\': \'断末魔の幻影\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n各対戦相手の終了ステップ中に、あなたは呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・探偵\', \'flavor\': \'「あとひとつだけ……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d48658-9a88-4379-b601-65e50ec379db\', \'multiverseId\': 650120}, \'multiverseid\': 650120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlusswort-Phantom\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWährend des Endsegments jedes Gegners kannst du Zaubersprüche wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hätte da noch eine Frage …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ca85d2-16fa-4d8c-a809-6b18be3b3407\', \'multiverseId\': 651533}, \'multiverseid\': 651533}, {\'name\': \'Fantôme au dernier mot\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nPendant l\'étape de fin de chaque adversaire, vous pouvez lancer des sorts comme s\'ils avaient le flash.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit et détective\', \'flavor\': \'« Une dernière chose... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651572&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba87ed9-4553-408d-a8f8-5e9ca0458808\', \'multiverseId\': 651572}, \'multiverseid\': 651572}, {\'name\': \'断末魔の幻影\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n各対戦相手の終了ステップ中に、あなたは呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・探偵\', \'flavor\': \'「あとひとつだけ……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a849702-bdab-410a-8bde-7b522d9da287\', \'multiverseId\': 651611}, \'multiverseid\': 651611}, {\'name\': \'终言幽魅\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n在每位对手的结束步骤中，你可以将咒语视同具有闪现异能地来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 精怪／侦探\', \'flavor\': \'「另外，最后还有一件事…」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38bf003e-f1a7-4d80-af08-5de742590a50\', \'multiverseId\': 651650}, \'multiverseid\': 651650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schrein der vergessenen Götter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um farblose Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du sieben oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Gottheiten, die dem Meervolk als Ula, Emeria und Cosi bekannt sind, waren nichts weiter als falsche Erinnerungen an die drei monströsen Eldrazi-Titanen Ulamog, Emrakul und Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650645&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd871fa9-0cc0-4661-88e1-eb32a025b545\', \'multiverseId\': 650645}, \'multiverseid\': 650645}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire des Dieux abandonnés\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts incolores. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins sept terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les dieux Ula, Éméria et Cosi des ondins n\'étaient en réalité que des souvenirs pervertis de la trinité monstrueuse des titans Eldrazi : Ulamog, Emrakul et Kozilek.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee3b863-94b9-4361-b386-94d7e19bff0e\', \'multiverseId\': 650904}, \'multiverseid\': 650904}, {\'name\': \'Santuario degli Dei Rinnegati\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie incolori. Attiva solo se controlli sette o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Gli dei noti ai tritoni come Ula, Emeria e Cosi non erano altro che falsi ricordi di una mostruosa trinità: i titani Eldrazi Ulamog, Emrakul e Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439e2444-b47a-4e1a-ae3d-5c8a302b9d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 651163}, \'multiverseid\': 651163}, {\'name\': \'見捨てられた神々の神殿\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは、無色の呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。あなたが７つ以上の土地をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'マーフォークがウーラ、エメリア、コーシと呼び崇めていた三神は、実際にはウラモグ、エムラクール、コジレックという三大エルドラージの誤った記憶でしかなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa4a46d3-c78f-4708-acf2-93cc09cef77e\', \'multiverseId\': 651422}, \'multiverseid\': 651422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schriftrolle des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'{T}: Manifestiere eine Karte aus deiner Hand. (Bringe die Karte als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Geschichten definieren unsere Realität."\\n—Ugin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38278ea0-3371-41fc-a2e2-72cbceff09b1\', \'multiverseId\': 650588}, \'multiverseid\': 650588}, {\'name\': \'Parchemin du destin\', \'text\': "{T} : Manifestez une carte de votre main. (Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Nos histoires définissent notre réalité. »\\n—Ugin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f21ae354-0435-47ba-a878-d3088cdda7ab\', \'multiverseId\': 650847}, \'multiverseid\': 650847}, {\'name\': \'Pergamena del Fato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Manifesta una carta dalla tua mano. (Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le nostre storie definiscono la nostra realtà."\\n—Ugin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bed6f37e-c1a2-474e-9419-8b364f7d532f\', \'multiverseId\': 651106}, \'multiverseid\': 651106}, {\'name\': \'運命の巻物\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの手札にあるカード１枚を予示する。（そのカードを裏向きで２/２のクリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの物語が我らの現実を定義する。」\\n――ウギン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae394026-f07d-4021-bf7d-554638e3342a\', \'multiverseId\': 651365}, \'multiverseid\': 651365}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schrottwinder\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Spielsteinen (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Spielstein, den du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nImmer wenn ein Spielstein unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, tappe ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wahl, das ein Gegner kontrolliert. Sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad026f94-2b29-4700-8e86-643842bf8f43\', \'multiverseId\': 650460}, \'multiverseid\': 650460}, {\'name\': \'Brasseur de déchets\', \'text\': "Affinité pour les jetons (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque jeton que vous contrôlez.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, engagez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Il ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature — grand serpent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc51bc2a-54ad-477a-94ba-a12ee8496dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 650719}, \'multiverseid\': 650719}, {\'name\': \'Serpeggiante degli Scarti\', \'text\': \'Affinità con le pedine (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni pedina che controlli.)\\nOgniqualvolta una pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, TAPpa un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario. Quel permanente non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c6a5191-9c39-47d7-bc98-f602e3d7639a\', \'multiverseId\': 650978}, \'multiverseid\': 650978}, {\'name\': \'ガラクタ這い\', \'text\': \'親和（トークン）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているトークン１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）\\nトークン１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをタップする。それはそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f48051a2-df20-43a9-8223-722362a8ae39\', \'multiverseId\': 651237}, \'multiverseid\': 651237}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarze Kunst\', \'text\': \'Du kannst die Schwarze Kunst wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätte. Falls du sie zu einem Zeitpunkt wirkst, zu dem du keine Hexerei wirken könntest, opfert sie der Beherrscher des Permanents, zu dem sie wird, zu Beginn des nächsten Aufräumsegments.\\nWenn die Schwarze Kunst ins Spiel kommt und falls sie im Spiel ist, wird sie zu einer Aura mit „Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die mit der Schwarzen Kunst ins Spiel gebracht wurde". Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel und lege die Schwarze Kunst an sie an. Wenn die Schwarze Kunst das Spiel verlässt, opfert der Beherrscher jener Kreatur sie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee83913b-0851-492e-866e-a1153c76c055\', \'multiverseId\': 650484}, \'multiverseid\': 650484}, {\'name\': \'Nécromancie\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez lancer la Nécromancie comme si elle avait le flash. Si vous la lancez à tout moment où un rituel n\'aurait pas pu être lancé, le contrôleur du permanent qu\'elle devient la sacrifie au début de la prochaine étape de nettoyage.\\nQuand la Nécromancie arrive sur le champ de bataille, si elle est sur le champ de bataille, elle devient une aura avec « Enchanter : créature mise sur le champ de bataille avec la Nécromancie ». Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière et attachez-lui la Nécromancie. Quand la Nécromancie quitte le champ de bataille, le contrôleur de cette créature la sacrifie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'654081f2-1744-4923-936f-a73e42d37470\', \'multiverseId\': 650743}, \'multiverseid\': 650743}, {\'name\': \'Necromanzia\', \'text\': \'Puoi lanciare la Necromanzia come se avesse lampo. Se l\\\'hai lanciata in un momento in cui non poteva essere lanciata una stregoneria, il controllore del permanente che diventa lo sacrifica all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase di cancellazione.\\nQuando la Necromanzia entra nel campo di battaglia, se è sul campo di battaglia, diventa un\\\'Aura con "incanta creatura messa sul campo di battaglia con la Necromanzia". Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero e assegnale la Necromanzia. Quando la Necromanzia lascia il campo di battaglia, il controllore di quella creatura la sacrifica.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8aeab46-a775-460c-9c00-704ddf5639bb\', \'multiverseId\': 651002}, \'multiverseid\': 651002}, {\'name\': \'ネクロマンシー\', \'text\': \'あなたはネクロマンシーを、これが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。あなたがソーサリーを唱えられないときにこれを唱えたなら、これがなったパーマネントのコントローラーは、次のクリンナップ・ステップの開始時にこれを生け贄に捧げる。\\nネクロマンシーが戦場に出たとき、これが戦場にある場合、墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。これは「エンチャント（これによって戦場に置かれたクリーチャー）」を持つオーラになる。対象にしたカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出し、これをそれにつける。ネクロマンシーが戦場を離れたとき、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーはそれを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bde87cbd-f03f-41b9-b7cb-68fca68dcda8\', \'multiverseId\': 651261}, \'multiverseid\': 651261}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwerter zu Pflugscharen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Klinge hat eine Schneise des Lichts geschlagen, ein Weg, auf dem der Frieden folgen wird."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650441&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed06d217-5e33-42a9-ae21-488bdecf78aa\', \'multiverseId\': 650441}, \'multiverseid\': 650441}, {\'name\': \'Retour au pays\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ma lame a tracé un arc de lumière annonçant la paix à venir. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650700&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25b833bf-7db8-4701-930b-7ec4837ccfb2\', \'multiverseId\': 650700}, \'multiverseid\': 650700}, {\'name\': \'Da Spade a Spighe!\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il fendente della mia lama ha aperto una via di luce per la pace del domani."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1694850d-e7d6-4b30-8774-0b3e7da50289\', \'multiverseId\': 650959}, \'multiverseid\': 650959}, {\'name\': \'剣を鍬に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我が剣が未来の平和への道を切り開いた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe07923-e0a4-4c2a-b87a-1c16d4502a66\', \'multiverseId\': 651218}, \'multiverseid\': 651218}]', '[{\'name\': \'Scruter\', \'text\': \'Surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière.)\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ivold poussa un cri de surprise. Ou alors un bien étrange insecte s\'était aventuré sur l\'une des lentilles, ou alors il voyait enfin des geists !", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650710&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6abf5196-09df-4d06-a8bb-cf71a64f32e4\', \'multiverseId\': 650710}, \'multiverseid\': 650710}, {\'name\': \'Considerare\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold rimase a bocca aperta. A meno che uno strano insetto non si fosse arrampicato sulle sue lenti, aveva finalmente visto un geist!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13990158-705f-40b2-ad7c-4727ac5ebd58\', \'multiverseId\': 650969}, \'multiverseid\': 650969}, {\'name\': \'考慮\', \'text\': \'諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'イヴォルドは驚愕のあまり息を呑んだ。とても奇妙な虫が視界をよぎったか、ついに霊を見ることが出来たかどっちかだ！\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'459d1cd5-9fdb-49b6-99d5-ee6ba9ba2e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 651228}, \'multiverseid\': 651228}]', "[{'name': 'Seeküstenzitadelle', 'text': 'Die Seeküstenzitadelle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}, {W} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Um der Weisheit willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um alles von oben sehen zu können. Um des Ruhmes willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um als Dokument der Macht zu dienen. Um der Stärke willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um alle Angriffe abzuwehren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650641&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be197041-25f8-4271-b1e6-260140b81ac7', 'multiverseId': 650641}, 'multiverseid': 650641}, {'name': 'Citadelle maritime', 'text': 'La Citadelle maritime arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}, {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Pour la sagesse, elle fut construite haute pour tout voir. Pour la gloire, elle fut construite haute en testament de la puissance. Pour la force, elle fut construite haute pour repousser toutes les attaques.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650900&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da02700f-41ca-4c36-9ba2-1d11449a7d72', 'multiverseId': 650900}, 'multiverseid': 650900}, {'name': 'Cittadella sul Mare', 'text': 'La Cittadella sul Mare entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}, {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Per la saggezza, è stata costruita in alto per contemplare ogni cosa. Per la gloria, è stata costruita in alto come testimonianza di potere. Per la potenza, è stata costruita in alto per respingere tutti gli attacchi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651159&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41b5ad98-875c-440c-ba81-06798054f552', 'multiverseId': 651159}, 'multiverseid': 651159}, {'name': '海辺の城塞', 'text': '海辺の城塞はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '智のために、それはあらゆる物を見下ろす高さとなった。名誉のために、それは力を示す高さとなった。力のために、それはすべての攻撃を跳ね返す高さとなった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651418&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92b8416e-f643-480e-928e-05579804fe3b', 'multiverseId': 651418}, 'multiverseid': 651418}]", '[{\'name\': \'Seelenschlinge\', \'text\': \'{W}, opfere die Seelenschlinge: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Körper und Geist sind einander Feind. Sie nutzen jede Gelegenheit, den anderen loszuwerden."\\n—Tariel, Abwäger der Seelen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650438&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86106a96-133d-4508-aef1-c45c97999d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 650438}, \'multiverseid\': 650438}, {\'name\': \'Collet spirituel\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrifiez le Collet spirituel : Exilez une créature ciblée qui vous attaque ou qui attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le corps et l\'esprit sont des ennemis jurés. Ils trouvent toutes les excuses pour se débarrasser l\'un de l\'autre. »\\n—Tariel, héliaste d\'âmes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650697&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be66b5c2-99c6-4f2a-8c20-071e91c5f292\', \'multiverseId\': 650697}, \'multiverseid\': 650697}, {\'name\': \'Intrappolare Anima\', \'text\': \'{W}, Sacrifica Intrappolare Anima: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che sta attaccando te o un planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Corpo e spirito sono nemici giurati. Sfrutteranno ogni scusa per sbarazzarsi l\\\'uno dell\\\'altro."\\n—Tariel, Censore di Anime\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd207f87-648e-45cf-9aae-787bf2484298\', \'multiverseId\': 650956}, \'multiverseid\': 650956}, {\'name\': \'魂の捕獲\', \'text\': \'{W}, 魂の捕獲を生け贄に捧げる：あなた、またはあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「肉体と精神は不倶戴天の敵だ。互いを排除するためならどんな手段でも受け入れる。」\\n――魂を数える者、タリエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db74f7b-09e0-4575-bcc8-6a229319672f\', \'multiverseId\': 651215}, \'multiverseid\': 651215}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sela Goldnachtschwert\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag\\nFalls eine Quelle einem Gegner oder einem Permanent, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie jenem Spieler oder jenem Permanent stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\nFalls eine Quelle dir oder einem Permanent, das du kontrollierst, Schaden zufügen würde, verhindere die Hälfte jener Schadenspunkte, aufgerundet.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeebb2df-915a-4818-bc67-ff272adf11d9\', \'multiverseId\': 650564}, \'multiverseid\': 650564}, {\'name\': "Gisela, lame d\'Ornuit", \'text\': "Vol, initiative\\nSi une source devait infliger des blessures à un adversaire ou à un permanent qu\'un adversaire contrôle, cette source inflige le double de ces blessures à ce joueur ou à ce permanent à la place.\\nSi une source devait infliger des blessures à vous ou à un permanent que vous contrôlez, prévenez la moitié de ces blessures, arrondie à l\'unité supérieure.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f22a2ef9-30af-4737-8a14-bad66cd95d23\', \'multiverseId\': 650823}, \'multiverseid\': 650823}, {\'name\': \'Gisela, Lama della Notte Dorata\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvviso\\nSe una fonte sta per infliggere danno a un avversario o a un permanente controllato da un avversario, quella fonte infligge invece il doppio di quel danno a quel giocatore o permanente.\\nSe una fonte sta per infliggere danno a te o a un permanente che controlli, previeni la metà di quel danno, arrotondata per eccesso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5d4e37-04cb-4586-8ccd-8a48f94ff0a2\', \'multiverseId\': 651082}, \'multiverseid\': 651082}, {\'name\': \'黄金夜の刃、ギセラ\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃\\n発生源１つが対戦相手や対戦相手がコントロールしているパーマネントである１つにダメージを与えるなら、代わりにその発生源はそのプレイヤーやパーマネントにその２倍の点数のダメージを与える。\\n発生源１つがあなたやあなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つにダメージを与えるなら、そのダメージの端数を切り上げた半分を軽減する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8b4aebf-e71c-4bd8-b5c7-44789b72f53c\', \'multiverseId\': 651341}, \'multiverseid\': 651341}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selbstlose Junkerin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Selbstlose Junkerin ins Spiel kommt, verhindere allen Schaden, der dir in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn Schaden, der dir zugefügt würde, verhindert wird, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Selbstlose Junkerin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650435&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850a8bd1-9c54-4c95-8051-295b983583f0\', \'multiverseId\': 650435}, \'multiverseid\': 650435}, {\'name\': \'Écuyère dévouée\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Écuyère dévouée arrive sur le champ de bataille, prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient vous être infligées ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que des blessures qui devaient vous être infligées sont prévenues, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Écuyère dévouée.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650694&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86423bb1-0026-4978-87f9-35455b1ff3f8\', \'multiverseId\': 650694}, \'multiverseid\': 650694}, {\'name\': \'Scudiera Altruista\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Scudiera Altruista entra nel campo di battaglia, previeni tutto il danno che ti verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta il danno che ti verrebbe inflitto viene prevenuto, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sulla Scudiera Altruista.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d416cc46-284e-4884-b900-0b548bd2c440\', \'multiverseId\': 650953}, \'multiverseid\': 650953}, {\'name\': \'無私の従者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n無私の従者が戦場に出たとき、このターン、あなたが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\nあなたが受けるダメージが軽減されるたび、無私の従者の上にその点数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e8abae-7989-4584-b1b5-3ca8171f8d89\', \'multiverseId\': 651212}, \'multiverseid\': 651212}]', "[{'name': 'Selesnija-Heiligtum', 'text': 'Das Selesnija-Heiligtum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Selesnija-Heiligtum ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650643&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed594ae3-2107-41a7-8fbd-7e61f2238a89', 'multiverseId': 650643}, 'multiverseid': 650643}, {'name': 'Sanctuaire de Selesnya', 'text': 'Le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650902&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e10bb114-2cc9-44e1-a3ba-667f5c54187b', 'multiverseId': 650902}, 'multiverseid': 650902}, {'name': 'Santuario di Selesnya', 'text': 'Il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651161&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcf7f1d6-cce8-4352-8fe0-f39366cc0e1b', 'multiverseId': 651161}, 'multiverseid': 651161}, {'name': 'セレズニアの聖域', 'text': 'セレズニアの聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nセレズニアの聖域が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651420&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c4e501f-bd35-4e03-9172-27d0201392ed', 'multiverseId': 651420}, 'multiverseid': 651420}]", '[{\'name\': \'Selvala, Heimgekehrte Forscherin\', \'text\': \'Verhandlungen — {T}: Jeder Spieler deckt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Für jede Nichtland-Karte, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurde, erzeugst du {G} und erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Dann zieht jeder Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Tiefland ist nicht bereit, unter den Launen der Oberstadt zu leiden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42538a06-5bc6-4125-b124-cc624b77441e\', \'multiverseId\': 650571}, \'multiverseid\': 650571}, {\'name\': \'Selvala, exploratrice sur le retour\', \'text\': \'Pourparler — {T} : Chaque joueur révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Pour chaque carte non-terrain révélée de cette manière, ajoutez {G} et gagnez 1 point de vie. Chaque joueur pioche ensuite une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'« Le peuple des Basses-terres refuse de souffrir les caprices de ceux de la Haute cité. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab3360fd-3486-437a-ba43-019ec98eba1d\', \'multiverseId\': 650830}, \'multiverseid\': 650830}, {\'name\': \'Selvala, Esploratrice Ritornata\', \'text\': \'Negoziato — {T}: Ogni giocatore rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio. Per ogni carta non terra rivelata in questo modo, aggiungi {G} e guadagni 1 punto vita. Poi ogni giocatore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Esploratore Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"I Bassopiani rifiutano di sottostare ai capricci della Città Alta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83879adc-811d-4eda-87e6-ab6daa9090df\', \'multiverseId\': 651089}, \'multiverseid\': 651089}, {\'name\': \'帰還した探検者、セルヴァラ\', \'text\': \'協議 ― {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。これにより公開されて土地でないカード１枚につき、 あなたは{G}を加え１点のライフを得る。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「高層都市の気まぐれによって苦しめられることを下層地は認めない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a8ca15-0142-4fb1-9bb1-56895549d64f\', \'multiverseId\': 651348}, \'multiverseid\': 651348}]', '[{\'name\': \'Serenade des Grauens\', \'text\': \'Überwachen 3, bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof mit einer Endgültigkeitsmarke ins Spiel zurück. Schicke die Serenade des Grauens mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil.\\nAussetzen 3 — {2}{B} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {2}{B} bezahlen und sie mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil schicken. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, kannst du sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe5f133-3fb1-4d37-97be-2823d240d4e9\', \'multiverseId\': 650004}, \'multiverseid\': 650004}, {\'name\': \'Sérénade de charnier\', \'text\': "Surveillez 3, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de créature avec un marqueur « fatalité » sur elle. Exilez la Sérénade de charnier avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur elle.\\nSuspension 3 — {2}{B} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {2}{B} et l\'exiler avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650044&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc54d18e-4111-461f-a1e5-daf8b8c4ccf7\', \'multiverseId\': 650044}, \'multiverseid\': 650044}, {\'name\': "Serenata dell\'Ossario", \'text\': "Sorveglia 3, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero con un segnalino finale. Esilia la Serenata dell\'Ossario con tre segnalini tempo su di essa.\\nSospendere 3—{2}{B} (Invece di lanciare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {2}{B} ed esiliarla con tre segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, puoi lanciare la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5467f8f-f048-4276-829b-8379d1d283e6\', \'multiverseId\': 650084}, \'multiverseid\': 650084}, {\'name\': \'納骨堂の小夜曲\', \'text\': \'諜報３を行い、その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を最終カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。納骨堂の小夜曲を時間カウンター３個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\n待機３―{2}{B}（これをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{2}{B}を支払って時間カウンターを３個置いた状態で追放してよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8048a528-4a72-47ee-8c08-52c64a905a28\', \'multiverseId\': 650124}, \'multiverseid\': 650124}]', "[{'name': 'Serenade des Grauens', 'text': 'Überwachen 3, bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof mit einer Endgültigkeitsmarke ins Spiel zurück. Schicke die Serenade des Grauens mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil.\\nAussetzen 3 — {2}{B}', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651537&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e2b210e-7ef8-41d6-9383-86037b47222c', 'multiverseId': 651537}, 'multiverseid': 651537}, {'name': 'Sérénade de charnier', 'text': 'Surveillez 3, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de créature avec un marqueur « fatalité » sur elle. Exilez la Sérénade de charnier avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur elle.\\nSuspension 3 — {2}{B}', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651576&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b50627a6-bea3-4ce4-8855-d6a36a5eca2e', 'multiverseId': 651576}, 'multiverseid': 651576}, {'name': '納骨堂の小夜曲', 'text': '諜報３を行い、その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を最終カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。納骨堂の小夜曲を時間カウンター３個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\n待機3―{2}{B}', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651615&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4473a940-34e3-485b-9d03-7a94d81ce11f', 'multiverseId': 651615}, 'multiverseid': 651615}, {'name': '唤尸夜曲', 'text': '刺探3，然后将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，且上面有一个终命指示物。放逐唤尸夜曲，且上面有三个计时指示物。\\n延缓3～{2}{B}', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651654&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4def3e8e-ffde-4ea1-b605-862e17185c29', 'multiverseId': 651654}, 'multiverseid': 651654}]", "[{'name': 'Sevinnes Rückgewinnung', 'text': 'Bringe eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch kopieren und für die Kopie ein neues Ziel bestimmen.\\nRückblende {4}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650436&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '906df5c9-eefc-4735-9c17-78c71801a522', 'multiverseId': 650436}, 'multiverseid': 650436}, {'name': 'Réappropriation de Sevinne', 'text': 'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 depuis votre cimetière. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, vous pouvez copier ce sort et choisir une nouvelle cible pour cette copie.\\nFlashback {4}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650695&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3db25e77-4689-4dbc-b1d4-75e9f9cf9b9f', 'multiverseId': 650695}, 'multiverseid': 650695}, {'name': 'Rivendicazione di Sevinne', 'text': 'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da un cimitero, puoi copiarla e puoi scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per la copia.\\nFlashback {4}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650954&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e214459-0439-4865-96ce-9f47b22e0822', 'multiverseId': 650954}, 'multiverseid': 650954}, {'name': 'セヴィンの再利用', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。この呪文が墓地から唱えられたなら、あなたはこの呪文をコピーしてもよく、そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651213&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1d421b8-4a38-45c5-aaf3-43d61c543cf5', 'multiverseId': 651213}, 'multiverseid': 651213}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sidar Kondo von Jamuraa\', \'text\': \'Flankenangriff (Immer wenn eine Kreatur ohne Flankenangriff diese Kreatur blockt, erhält die blockende Kreatur -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nKreaturen ohne Flugfähigkeit oder Reichweite, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, können Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht blocken.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Commander haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650572&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dec819d-24d3-4e36-b9e8-0a9557051fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 650572}, \'multiverseid\': 650572}, {\'name\': \'Sidar Kondo de Djamûraa\', \'text\': "Débordement (À chaque fois qu\'une créature sans le débordement bloque cette créature, la créature bloqueuse gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nLes créatures sans le vol ou la portée que vos adversaires contrôlent ne peuvent pas bloquer les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f80098e0-593d-4cbe-b3bc-bac18faa46f4\', \'multiverseId\': 650831}, \'multiverseid\': 650831}, {\'name\': \'Sidar Kondo di Jamuraa\', \'text\': \'Aggirare (Ogniqualvolta una creatura senza aggirare blocca questa creatura, la creatura bloccante prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nLe creature senza volare o raggiungere controllate dai tuoi avversari non possono bloccare creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nPartner (Puoi avere due comandanti se entrambi hanno partner.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17bf4147-9aa0-4e75-b0ec-72e0c7e8055d\', \'multiverseId\': 651090}, \'multiverseid\': 651090}, {\'name\': \'ジャムーラのシダー・コンド\', \'text\': \'側面攻撃（側面攻撃を持たないクリーチャー１体がこのクリーチャーをブロックするたび、ターン終了時まで、そのブロック・クリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。）\\n対戦相手がコントロールしていて飛行も到達も持たないクリーチャーでは、パワーが２以下であるクリーチャーをブロックできない。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909f8a81-1885-41f2-8716-56ca7341dbfd\', \'multiverseId\': 651349}, \'multiverseid\': 651349}]', '[{\'name\': \'Siegel der Reinheit\', \'text\': \'Opfere das Siegel der Reinheit: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin das Licht, das alle Schatten vertreibt."\\n—Siegelinschrift\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650433&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de6d3eaf-624c-4ed9-b90c-2864abb468f9\', \'multiverseId\': 650433}, \'multiverseid\': 650433}, {\'name\': \'Sceau de nettoiement\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez le Sceau de nettoiement : Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Je suis le purificateur, la lumière qui efface toutes les ombres. »\\n—Inscription du sceau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650692&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb31edab-e4b9-4604-b7ff-198cc2e095da\', \'multiverseId\': 650692}, \'multiverseid\': 650692}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo della Purezza\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica il Sigillo della Purezza: Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono il purificatore, la luce che spazza via le tenebre."\\n—Iscrizione del Sigillo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c35a97-547d-486d-8379-520847e72f7c\', \'multiverseId\': 650951}, \'multiverseid\': 650951}, {\'name\': \'浄化の印章\', \'text\': \'浄化の印章を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクトやエンチャントである１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「我は浄化するものなり。すべての影を一掃する光なり。」\\n――印章に刻まれた言葉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac2e14a3-7635-4919-8114-b4c0d0b6d91a\', \'multiverseId\': 651210}, \'multiverseid\': 651210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Simic-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Für das Simic-Kombinat ist ihr Siegel nicht nur ein Ehrenemblem, sondern auch ihr Markenzeichen. Wenn man es auf einem biologischen Erzeugnis sieht, steht es für überragende Handwerkskunst, geniale Innovation und noch höhere Kosten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f0aa6c4-6423-4af3-b109-5238330e6286\', \'multiverseId\': 650589}, \'multiverseid\': 650589}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Simic\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Pour le Cartel de Simic, ce cachet n\'est pas un emblème d\'honneur, mais une marque déposée. Son image reconnue qui apparaît sur tout produit biologique est synonyme de savoir-faire hors du commun, d\'innovation et de prix exorbitant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a34a7551-8a08-43cc-b134-c122462894ed\', \'multiverseId\': 650848}, \'multiverseid\': 650848}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Simic\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Per l\'Alleanza Simic, il sigillo non serve come un emblema ma come un marchio di proprietà. La sua immagine consueta su qualsiasi bene biologico ne attesta la superba fattura, l\'ingegnosa originalità e il costo elevato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c777c3a7-9024-491e-aae5-96266e4062d4\', \'multiverseId\': 651107}, \'multiverseid\': 651107}, {\'name\': \'シミックの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{G}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'シミック連合にとって、紋章は名誉を示すものではなく商標である。この見慣れたシンボルはあらゆる生物学的な消耗品につけられていて、卓絶した技術と独創的な革新と高額な値段を意味している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'960f6177-2fb9-4f7f-95fd-e8d0f6160524\', \'multiverseId\': 651366}, \'multiverseid\': 651366}]', "[{'name': 'Simic-Wachstumskammer', 'text': 'Die Simic-Wachstumskammer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Simic-Wachstumskammer ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650646&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f3998d8-987f-4904-a1e7-308ee41880ff', 'multiverseId': 650646}, 'multiverseid': 650646}, {'name': 'Chambre de croissance des Simic', 'text': 'La Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650905&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cb0e6b1-51c0-4ce1-b6b9-fcc12d27efdd', 'multiverseId': 650905}, 'multiverseid': 650905}, {'name': 'Camera di Coltura Simic', 'text': 'La Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651164&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee5396e9-5fd5-4b79-98e0-b6bd84a204e4', 'multiverseId': 651164}, 'multiverseid': 651164}, {'name': 'シミックの成長室', 'text': 'シミックの成長室はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nシミックの成長室が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651423&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c51d440-56ba-4a2e-b3e8-845a406cd128', 'multiverseId': 651423}, 'multiverseid': 651423}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sonnen-Titan\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Sonnen-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Eine brennende Sonne, die nie untergeht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650440&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd1f4925-0a09-4ffe-8636-307963bfb60b\', \'multiverseId\': 650440}, \'multiverseid\': 650440}, {\'name\': \'Titan solaire\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.", \'type\': \'Créature — géant\', \'flavor\': \'Un soleil brûlant qui ne se couche jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a699d46-aacb-49a0-80c7-9ab3470ddbde\', \'multiverseId\': 650699}, \'multiverseid\': 650699}, {\'name\': \'Titano Solare\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano Solare entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sole cocente che non tramonta mai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a939682-9f1c-4f27-85d7-56b557f8c285\', \'multiverseId\': 650958}, \'multiverseid\': 650958}, {\'name\': \'太陽のタイタン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n太陽のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'沈まない燃え盛る太陽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e7db26b-0a54-4085-a9d2-862d0cfecb76\', \'multiverseId\': 651217}, \'multiverseid\': 651217}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnengras-Prärie\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Auf dem Kontinent Otaria sind Frieden und Harmonie selten. Gegenden, in denen man beides findet, sind hochgeschätzt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650650&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'108ec75c-9883-469d-a0bd-70aba8b44a89\', \'multiverseId\': 650650}, \'multiverseid\': 650650}, {\'name\': \'Prairie de Solherbe\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ils sont bien rares et très secrets, en Otaria, les lieux où règnent encore la paix et l\'harmonie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ab05d1-8127-4939-ba89-b6d5a5438907\', \'multiverseId\': 650909}, \'multiverseid\': 650909}, {\'name\': \'Prateria di Solerba\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "A Otaria la pace e l\'armonia sono rare. E i luoghi in cui è possibile trovare entrambe sono custoditi scrupolosamente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'818b0e41-7ed4-424f-9b46-0208e2271820\', \'multiverseId\': 651168}, \'multiverseid\': 651168}, {\'name\': \'サングラスの大草原\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{G}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアでは、平和と調和はまれにしかない。その二つがある場所は大切にされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'050d3ee1-59bd-414f-a015-78cc6310f90c\', \'multiverseId\': 651427}, \'multiverseid\': 651427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenheim, Festung der Legion\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Sonnenheim — der robuste Schild, der alles überragende Wachposten, der Sitz der Gerechtigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f814116-46a5-42a4-b886-192fe8ac9c1a\', \'multiverseId\': 650651}, \'multiverseid\': 650651}, {\'name\': \'Solcastel, forteresse de la Légion\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T} : Une créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Solcastel — le bouclier invincible, la sentinelle dominante, le siège de la justice.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc902e17-7235-44d0-a649-f0cb81934dab\', \'multiverseId\': 650910}, \'multiverseid\': 650910}, {\'name\': \'Sol-Dimora, Rocca della Legione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Sol-Dimora. Lo scudo vigoroso, la sentinella torreggiante, la sede della giustizia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e46e4dd1-1321-4fce-94e7-33273ba40934\', \'multiverseId\': 651169}, \'multiverseid\': 651169}, {\'name\': \'軍の要塞、サンホーム\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'サンホーム――頑強な盾であり、そびえ立つ歩哨であり、正義の座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f95e81-ccb6-47ad-a2ee-e1173ce6b77e\', \'multiverseId\': 651428}, \'multiverseid\': 651428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd1a7a25-f95f-460a-a5b4-751e122d53cf\', \'multiverseId\': 650590}, \'multiverseid\': 650590}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77483e7-a51b-4df8-a0bb-1d44fa21b84e\', \'multiverseId\': 650849}, \'multiverseid\': 650849}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'669c4138-27a8-4251-af45-7683d8a960ac\', \'multiverseId\': 651108}, \'multiverseid\': 651108}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0412965b-5e67-4fb7-bd46-5860621ff961\', \'multiverseId\': 651367}, \'multiverseid\': 651367}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sophia, verbissene Detektivin\', \'text\': \'Wenn Sophia, verbissene Detektivin, ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge Fips, einen legendären 2/2 grünen Hund-Detektiv-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\\n{1}, opfere einen Artefaktspielstein: Lege auf jeden Hund, den du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\\nImmer wenn ein Hund, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein und stelle dann Nachforschungen an.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e60aee6-758e-4ef8-b0f8-2e0f96a7b2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 649934}, \'multiverseid\': 649934}, {\'name\': \'Sophia, détective cynophile\', \'text\': "Quand Sophia, détective cynophile arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez Minus, un jeton de créature légendaire 2/2 verte Chien et Détective avec le piétinement.\\n{1}, sacrifiez un jeton d\'artefact : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque chien que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un chien que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Nourriture, puis enquêtez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'940f4402-0c6e-4c82-9c7f-ea57702994e2\', \'multiverseId\': 649938}, \'multiverseid\': 649938}, {\'name\': \'Sofia, Detective Accanita\', \'text\': \'Quando Sofia, Detective Accanita entra nel campo di battaglia, crea Briciola, una pedina creatura leggendaria Detective Canide 2/2 verde con travolgere.\\n{1}, Sacrifica una pedina artefatto: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni Canide che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta un Canide che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina Cibo, poi indaga.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Detective Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117ecdcb-a54f-4620-964a-f22b433dd6a2\', \'multiverseId\': 649942}, \'multiverseid\': 649942}, {\'name\': \'嗅ぎ回る探偵、ソフィア\', \'text\': \'嗅ぎ回る探偵、ソフィアが戦場に出たとき、「タイニー」という名前でトランプルを持つ緑の２/２の伝説の犬・探偵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}, アーティファクト・トークン１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしている各犬の上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしている犬１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、食物・トークン１つを生成し、その後調査を行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4749b798-9ef8-4cbf-b663-f97820787e58\', \'multiverseId\': 649946}, \'multiverseid\': 649946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sophia, verbissene Detektivin\', \'text\': \'Wenn Sophia, verbissene Detektivin, ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge Fips, einen legendären 2/2 grünen Hund-Detektiv-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\\n{1}, opfere einen Artefaktspielstein: Lege auf jeden Hund, den du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\\nImmer wenn ein Hund, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein und stelle dann Nachforschungen an.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651457&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5802fc4d-7bdc-4858-9bec-1400998a3e43\', \'multiverseId\': 651457}, \'multiverseid\': 651457}, {\'name\': \'Sophia, détective cynophile\', \'text\': "Quand Sophia, détective cynophile arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez Minus, un jeton de créature légendaire 2/2 verte Chien et Détective avec le piétinement.\\n{1}, sacrifiez un jeton d\'artefact : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque chien que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un chien que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Nourriture, puis enquêtez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc357684-6a79-4a3e-a823-667a347345a2\', \'multiverseId\': 651465}, \'multiverseid\': 651465}, {\'name\': \'嗅ぎ回る探偵、ソフィア\', \'text\': \'嗅ぎ回る探偵、ソフィアが戦場に出たとき、「タイニー」という名前でトランプルを持つ緑の２/２の伝説の犬・探偵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}, アーティファクト・トークン１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしている各犬の上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしている犬１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、食物・トークン１つを生成し、その後調査を行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8a6ef4-d682-49df-88bf-9305e2fdc9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 651473}, \'multiverseid\': 651473}, {\'name\': \'携犬顽探索菲娅\', \'text\': \'当携犬顽探索菲娅进战场时，派出传奇衍生生物小小，其为2/2绿色，具践踏异能的狗／侦探。\\n{1}，牺牲一个衍生神器：在每个由你操控的狗上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当一个由你操控的狗对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个食品衍生物，然后探查。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'196bdb23-b17f-4d44-908f-e5f1dafce853\', \'multiverseId\': 651481}, \'multiverseid\': 651481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spektakuläre Überraschung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Decke sie auf, falls sie verdeckt ist. Dann fügt sie jeder anderen Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich ziehe Gejohle und Geschrei dem höflichen Beifall vor."\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'022cf097-ea53-46ea-8acf-b78ac8e816e7\', \'multiverseId\': 650013}, \'multiverseid\': 650013}, {\'name\': \'Surprise époustouflante\', \'text\': \'Choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Retournez-la face visible si elle est face cachée. Puis elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à chaque autre créature.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je préfère les cris de surprise et les cris tout court aux applaudissements polis. »\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650053&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26bb22a-0660-4c00-9282-14af05d2802f\', \'multiverseId\': 650053}, \'multiverseid\': 650053}, {\'name\': \'Sorpresa Spettacolare\', \'text\': \'Scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Se è a faccia in giù, girala a faccia in su. Poi infligge danno pari alla sua forza a ogni altra creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Preferisco rantoli e grida a un applauso di cortesia."\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86eb7774-7e1b-4a5a-8b1b-03e5a882daec\', \'multiverseId\': 650093}, \'multiverseid\': 650093}, {\'name\': \'衝撃的な展開\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それが裏向きなら、それを表向きにする。その後、それはそれでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、それのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お行儀のいい拍手よりも、息を吞む音や悲鳴の方が好きよ。」\\n――ジュディス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8bc56c-e418-4427-a5e0-23fa7ca699c9\', \'multiverseId\': 650133}, \'multiverseid\': 650133}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spektakuläre Überraschung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Decke sie auf, falls sie verdeckt ist. Dann fügt sie jeder anderen Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich ziehe Gejohle und Geschrei dem höflichen Beifall vor."\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651546&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95ab762-b654-453e-b866-990b571cd97b\', \'multiverseId\': 651546}, \'multiverseid\': 651546}, {\'name\': \'Surprise époustouflante\', \'text\': \'Choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Retournez-la face visible si elle est face cachée. Puis elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à chaque autre créature.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je préfère les cris de surprise et les cris tout court aux applaudissements polis. »\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651585&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f93cb4c-5b8e-4b38-82b0-a41ef90d21fd\', \'multiverseId\': 651585}, \'multiverseid\': 651585}, {\'name\': \'衝撃的な展開\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それが裏向きなら、それを表向きにする。その後、それはそれでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、それのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お行儀のいい拍手よりも、息を吞む音や悲鳴の方が好きよ。」\\n――ジュディス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa43b65a-4a31-4b04-a630-34a550b5f643\', \'multiverseId\': 651624}, \'multiverseid\': 651624}, {\'name\': \'镇场惊喜\', \'text\': \'选择目标由你操控的生物。如果它牌面朝下，则将它翻回正面。然后它对每个其他生物各造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「相比礼貌的掌声，我更喜欢惊呼与尖叫。」\\n～裘蒂丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eafcd24-f60d-465e-982d-9c90cba81c60\', \'multiverseId\': 651663}, \'multiverseid\': 651663}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spektakulärer Endkampf\', \'text\': \'Lege eine Doppelschlag-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und stachle dann jede Kreatur an, auf die auf diese Weise eine Doppelschlag-Marke gelegt wurde. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen jene Kreaturen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greifen einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nÜberlast {4}{R}{R}{R} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, ersetze im Text „eine … deiner Wahl" durch „jede …")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bcc61bf-6315-440b-8cbd-562c60ec7417\', \'multiverseId\': 650515}, \'multiverseid\': 650515}, {\'name\': \'Affrontement spectaculaire\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur « double initiative » sur une créature ciblée, puis incitez chaque créature qui a reçu au moins un marqueur « double initiative » de cette manière. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible et attaquent un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nSurcharge {4}{R}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, remplacez « ciblé(e) » par « chaque » dans son texte.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4544399f-dfe2-4e1a-bf28-d93416aa335b\', \'multiverseId\': 650774}, \'multiverseid\': 650774}, {\'name\': \'Resa dei Conti Spettacolare\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino doppio attacco su una creatura bersaglio, poi sprona ogni creatura sulla quale è stato messo un segnalino doppio attacco in questo modo. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature attaccano in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se possono farlo.)\\nSovraccarico {4}{R}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di sovraccarico. Se lo fai, cambiane il testo sostituendo "una creatura bersaglio" con "ogni creatura".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb07e9ca-ea4c-4e6f-b769-5eb15c9cfbb2\', \'multiverseId\': 651033}, \'multiverseid\': 651033}, {\'name\': \'壮大な決戦\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に二段攻撃カウンター１個を置く。その後、これにより二段攻撃カウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーを使嗾する。（次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーは、可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\n超過{4}{R}{R}{R}（あなたはこの呪文を超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、対象は取らず、各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ二段攻撃カウンター１個を置く。その後、これにより二段攻撃カウンターが置かれたすべてのクリーチャーを使嗾する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb28308-543f-4719-b1fd-9816a32819f5\', \'multiverseId\': 651292}, \'multiverseid\': 651292}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphinx der zweiten Sonne\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deiner Hauptphase nach dem Kampf gibt es nach dieser Phase eine weitere Startphase. (Zur Startphase gehören Enttapp-, Versorgungs- und Ziehsegment.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Er beobachtet schweigend, wie sich die Schatten verschieben und Amonkhet immer näher an die Stunde der Offenbarung heranbringen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650471&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3bc2b6f-5097-4201-926d-a097e3d70a48\', \'multiverseId\': 650471}, \'multiverseid\': 650471}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx du Second Soleil\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre deuxième phase principale, il y a une phase de début supplémentaire après cette phase. (La phase de début comprend les étapes de dégagement, d\'entretien et de pioche.)", \'type\': \'Créature — sphinx\', \'flavor\': "Il observe en silence le lent décalage des ombres, indiquant pour Amonkhet l\'approche inexorable de l\'Âge de la Révélation.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650730&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fdc3a9a-71e6-4e0f-a317-a64020dcb524\', \'multiverseId\': 650730}, \'multiverseid\': 650730}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge del Secondo Sole\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio della tua fase principale post-combattimento, c\'è una fase iniziale addizionale dopo questa fase. (La fase iniziale include le sottofasi di STAP, mantenimento e acquisizione.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': "Osserva in silenzio il mutamento delle ombre, che avvicina sempre più Amonkhet all\'Era della rivelazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d21eabf1-b43d-4dff-93d8-55c5a32845f0\', \'multiverseId\': 650989}, \'multiverseid\': 650989}, {\'name\': \'副陽のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの戦闘後メイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたはこのフェイズの後に追加の開始フェイズを得る。（開始フェイズは、アンタップとアップキープとドローの各ステップからなる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'影が動いていく様を静かに見つめている。アモンケットに啓示の刻が近づく様を。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d7c210-d4b3-4b5e-aed6-37563391d048\', \'multiverseId\': 651248}, \'multiverseid\': 651248}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphärenhafter Ermittler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Sphärenhafte Ermittler ins Spiel kommt, stelle X Mal Nachforschungen an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl deiner Gegner ist. (Um Nachforschungen anzustellen, erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650458&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'886d8599-bfd9-436c-9f9b-ef48b167690d\', \'multiverseId\': 650458}, \'multiverseid\': 650458}, {\'name\': \'Enquêteur éthéré\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Enquêteur éthéré arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez X fois, X étant le nombre d\'adversaires que vous avez. (Pour enquêter, créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2865dd1-9eec-4a7e-b323-3a6b3d549d73\', \'multiverseId\': 650717}, \'multiverseid\': 650717}, {\'name\': \'Investigatore Etereo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando l\\\'Investigatore Etereo entra nel campo di battaglia, indaga X volte, dove X è il numero di avversari che hai. (Per indagare, crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e889ee2-341f-4247-9ba1-ac1e53502dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 650976}, \'multiverseid\': 650976}, {\'name\': \'天上の調査員\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n天上の調査員が戦場に出たとき、Ｘ回調査を行う。Ｘはあなたの対戦相手の人数に等しい。（調査を行うとは、手掛かり・トークン１つを生成することである。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e2945c-3225-4c66-8134-9111fafbdde5\', \'multiverseId\': 651235}, \'multiverseid\': 651235}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spiegelwesen\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\n{X}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges haben Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft X/X und erhalten alle Kreaturentypen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist sich der Vielfalt an Arten in Lorwyn nicht bewusst und sieht immer nur sich, tausendfach widergespiegelt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650428&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd1e542-1bbb-4921-8ba9-2b6aecac38a8\', \'multiverseId\': 650428}, \'multiverseid\': 650428}, {\'name\': \'Entité miroir\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\n{X} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force et une endurance de base de X/X et acquièrent tous les types de créature.", \'type\': \'Créature — changeforme\', \'flavor\': "Ignorant la diversité de Lorwyn, il ne voit que son propre reflet démultiplié à l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650687&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df930524-3428-457a-b848-2b7baac0aa75\', \'multiverseId\': 650687}, \'multiverseid\': 650687}, {\'name\': \'Entità Riflettente\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\n{X}: Fino alla fine del turno, le creature che controlli hanno forza e costituzione base X/X e hanno tutti i tipi di creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Inconsapevole delle diversità di Lorwyn, riesce a vedere solo se stessa, riflessa migliaia e migliaia di volte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7fb857e-71fa-4313-82f5-ff9fce874c97\', \'multiverseId\': 650946}, \'multiverseid\': 650946}, {\'name\': \'鏡の精体\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n{X}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは、基本のパワーとタフネスがＸ/Ｘになり、すべてのクリーチャー・タイプを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'それはローウィンの多様さを気にもかけず、自分自身のみを見て、その反射を何千回も投げかける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01449467-a549-4b84-be45-e86b033f1055\', \'multiverseId\': 651205}, \'multiverseid\': 651205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spur aus Leichen\', \'text\': \'Gräbersturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jedes Permanent, das in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurde.)\\nStelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Täter macht sich nicht die geringste Mühe, seine Spuren zu verwischen. Hoffen wir, dass das nichts Schlechtes ist."\\n—Morska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a98f18a-31fc-46f6-851b-76af5ff1c842\', \'multiverseId\': 650001}, \'multiverseid\': 650001}, {\'name\': \'Suivre les cadavres\', \'text\': "Déluge de cimetière (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque permanent mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.)\\nEnquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le coupable ne semble pas se soucier d\'effacer ses traces. Espérons que ce soit une bonne chose pour nous. »\\n—Morska", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650041&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5385abd4-d688-42b2-80c6-c77b565dc41e\', \'multiverseId\': 650041}, \'multiverseid\': 650041}, {\'name\': \'Seguire i Corpi\', \'text\': \'Tempesta sepolcrale (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni permanente messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.)\\nIndaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sembra che al colpevole non interessi nascondere le proprie tracce. Speriamo sia un buon segno."\\n—Morska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca40216-d914-4b38-9877-75e8cf44b369\', \'multiverseId\': 650081}, \'multiverseid\': 650081}, {\'name\': \'遺体の追跡\', \'text\': \'墓地ストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンに戦場から墓地に置かれたパーマネント１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。）\\n調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「犯人は痕跡を消そうともしなかった。それが吉と出るといいのだが。」\\n――モルスカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa2991b5-a9fd-4d12-81ed-eb0cc8c866b4\', \'multiverseId\': 650121}, \'multiverseid\': 650121}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spur aus Leichen\', \'text\': \'Gräbersturm\\nStelle Nachforschungen an.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Täter macht sich nicht die geringste Mühe, seine Spuren zu verwischen. Hoffen wir, dass das nichts Schlechtes ist."\\n—Morska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51af443-f289-4e79-a581-72cb9e5b7d0e\', \'multiverseId\': 651534}, \'multiverseid\': 651534}, {\'name\': \'Suivre les cadavres\', \'text\': \'Déluge de cimetière\\nEnquêtez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le coupable ne semble pas se soucier d\'effacer ses traces. Espérons que ce soit une bonne chose pour nous. »\\n—Morska", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651573&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2919b49-6900-46d6-a152-5de09250830c\', \'multiverseId\': 651573}, \'multiverseid\': 651573}, {\'name\': \'遺体の追跡\', \'text\': \'墓地ストーム\\n調査を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「犯人は痕跡を消そうともしなかった。それが吉と出るといいのだが。」\\n――モルスカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2320026f-7b87-40ff-b77d-6c3642cd56bf\', \'multiverseId\': 651612}, \'multiverseid\': 651612}, {\'name\': \'循尸调查\', \'text\': \'坟场风暴\\n探查。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「犯事的人似乎不屑掩盖自己的踪迹。希望这算是好消息。」\\n～莫丝卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e10430-cf04-4c00-b209-19f789c73c84\', \'multiverseId\': 651651}, \'multiverseid\': 651651}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stählerner Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}: Der Stählerne Höllendrache erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{X}: Zerstöre jedes Nichtland-Permanent mit Manabetrag X, dessen Beherrscher in diesem Zug vom Stählernen Höllendrachen Kampfschaden zugefügt wurde. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3df9218-4f4d-4908-9d77-9df3f1d58f67\', \'multiverseId\': 650592}, \'multiverseid\': 650592}, {\'name\': "Escouflenfer d\'acier", \'text\': "Vol\\n{2} : L\'Escouflenfer d\'acier gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{X} : Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain avec une valeur de mana de X dont le contrôleur a subi des blessures de combat par l\'Escouflenfer d\'acier ce tour-ci. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5972127-2443-41b4-8af8-234f74b3d135\', \'multiverseId\': 650851}, \'multiverseid\': 650851}, {\'name\': "Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio", \'text\': "Volare\\n{2}: Il Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{X}: Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con valore di mana pari a X al cui controllore è stato inflitto danno da combattimento dal Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio in questo turno. Attiva solo una volta per turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'080095ae-2284-490a-8e9d-8301a5c281db\', \'multiverseId\': 651110}, \'multiverseid\': 651110}, {\'name\': \'鋼のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、鋼のヘルカイトは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{X}：このターンに鋼のヘルカイトから戦闘ダメージを受けたプレイヤーがコントロールしていてマナ総量がＸであり土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d14c91-7e58-4043-b20a-bc91838b446c\', \'multiverseId\': 651369}, \'multiverseid\': 651369}]', '[{\'name\': \'Syr Konrad der Grimmige\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt oder eine Kreaturenkarte von irgendwoher außer aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird oder eine Kreaturenkarte deinen Friedhof verlässt, fügt Syr Konrad der Grimmige jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{1}{B}: Jeder Spieler millt eine Karte. (Jeder Spieler legt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650494&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8bef331-f59e-4391-bb53-51243db0040b\', \'multiverseId\': 650494}, \'multiverseid\': 650494}, {\'name\': \'Syr Konrad, le Sinistre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, ou qu\'une carte de créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis autre part que le champ de bataille, ou qu\'une carte de créature quitte votre cimetière, Syr Konrad, le Sinistre inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\n{1}{B} : Chaque joueur meule une carte. (Il met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650753&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a66dbd94-9285-41b5-b8b7-dc59c4f0d81e\', \'multiverseId\': 650753}, \'multiverseid\': 650753}, {\'name\': \'Syr Konrad, il Lugubre\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, una carta creatura viene messa in un cimitero da una zona diversa dal campo di battaglia o una carta creatura lascia il tuo cimitero, Syr Konrad, il Lugubre infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\n{1}{B}: Ogni giocatore macina una carta. (Ognuno mette nel proprio cimitero la prima carta del proprio grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f63929-687d-41b1-a603-6f5292288fa1\', \'multiverseId\': 651012}, \'multiverseid\': 651012}, {\'name\': \'厳格な者、コンラッド卿\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するか、クリーチャー・カード１枚が戦場以外から墓地に置かれるか、クリーチャー・カード１枚があなたの墓地を離れるたび、厳格な者、コンラッド卿は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n{1}{B}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を切削する。（各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を自分の墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97325427-6892-4fb5-9746-50a5984ca9ed\', \'multiverseId\': 651271}, \'multiverseid\': 651271}]', "[{'name': 'Talisman der Dominanz', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}. Der Talisman der Dominanz fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650595&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a53e79b3-68e3-4cb0-a92a-8c2a3b36b0cb', 'multiverseId': 650595}, 'multiverseid': 650595}, {'name': 'Talisman de dominance', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}. Le Talisman de dominance vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650854&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b71f0bf6-2ce6-4a6b-864c-58b54cbebf9d', 'multiverseId': 650854}, 'multiverseid': 650854}, {'name': 'Talismano del Dominio', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}. Il Talismano del Dominio ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651113&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a6b6dea-3ec2-4032-bda6-b9f9975027cf', 'multiverseId': 651113}, 'multiverseid': 651113}, {'name': '威圧のタリスマン', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。威圧のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651372&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37de6c53-90e1-46fd-91d6-b386429dd2f6', 'multiverseId': 651372}, 'multiverseid': 651372}]", '[{\'name\': \'Talisman der Einigkeit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}. Der Talisman der Einigkeit fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650597&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d01038d9-8d1f-4782-ad91-8cfd29c98653\', \'multiverseId\': 650597}, \'multiverseid\': 650597}, {\'name\': "Talisman d\'unité", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}. Le Talisman d\'unité vous inflige 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650856&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293d512b-b221-4e4d-95bc-02db61a736b1\', \'multiverseId\': 650856}, \'multiverseid\': 650856}, {\'name\': "Talismano dell\'Unità", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}. Il Talismano dell\'Unità ti infligge 1 danno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a77e9aa-1d7c-4b74-bed8-1efd862bae5f\', \'multiverseId\': 651115}, \'multiverseid\': 651115}, {\'name\': \'団結のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。団結のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4aa21f1-b57a-43af-b657-dc7aab05c9e3\', \'multiverseId\': 651374}, \'multiverseid\': 651374}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talisman der Neugier\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}. Der Talisman der Neugier fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Mühen der Forschung sind leichter zu ertragen als das Gefühl, etwas nicht zu wissen."\\n—Tamiyo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2751188d-6287-4ccd-8322-889a9e32dd9a\', \'multiverseId\': 650594}, \'multiverseid\': 650594}, {\'name\': \'Talisman de curiosité\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}. Le Talisman de curiosité vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« La souffrance de l\'exploration est moins forte que la souffrance de l\'ignorance. »\\n—Tamiyo", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bfdd021-52b7-4f5a-9edd-cebccf3b1598\', \'multiverseId\': 650853}, \'multiverseid\': 650853}, {\'name\': \'Talismano della Curiosità\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}. Il Talismano della Curiosità ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Esplorare è meno doloroso che non sapere."\\n—Tamiyo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4b682b3-0f8f-40de-b198-70ad391e16d8\', \'multiverseId\': 651112}, \'multiverseid\': 651112}, {\'name\': \'好奇のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。好奇のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「探求の苦しみは知らないことの苦しみに比べれば何程でもありません。」\\n――タミヨウ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7194d1a8-4384-4663-a701-428dc0619a99\', \'multiverseId\': 651371}, \'multiverseid\': 651371}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talisman der Überzeugung\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Der Talisman der Überzeugung fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeden Morgen verbannt die Sonne die Dunkelheit. Ich werde mich mit der gleichen Selbstsicherheit erheben."\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0befdb80-b6e9-4d68-ac5e-b56463c13031\', \'multiverseId\': 650593}, \'multiverseid\': 650593}, {\'name\': \'Talisman de conviction\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. Le Talisman de conviction vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Le soleil bannit les ténèbres chaque matin. Je me lève aussi avec la même certitude. »\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a6088a2-cc57-45a5-bead-e5ea9cb5fe09\', \'multiverseId\': 650852}, \'multiverseid\': 650852}, {\'name\': \'Talismano della Convinzione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. Il Talismano della Convinzione ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il sole bandisce l\\\'oscurità ogni mattina. Anch\\\'io mi innalzerò con la stessa risolutezza."\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c8ed7ec-9b74-4ef6-af7a-76d4afe4fb62\', \'multiverseId\': 651111}, \'multiverseid\': 651111}, {\'name\': \'確信のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。確信のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「太陽は毎朝闇を追い払う。私もそれぐらい確実に立ち上がる。」\\n――ファートリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625a42a7-5b3c-422b-9f19-08ca2e5355ce\', \'multiverseId\': 651370}, \'multiverseid\': 651370}]', "[{'name': 'Talisman des Fortschritts', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}. Der Talisman des Fortschritts fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650596&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0af4d695-b645-480f-a45c-8ee404cbf01d', 'multiverseId': 650596}, 'multiverseid': 650596}, {'name': 'Talisman de progrès', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}. Le Talisman de progrès vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650855&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4107e453-f00e-446e-885a-a3efc9075b64', 'multiverseId': 650855}, 'multiverseid': 650855}, {'name': 'Talismano del Progresso', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}. Il Talismano del Progresso ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651114&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb34617b-b9f5-42c1-9ee4-d0f619b6bf3c', 'multiverseId': 651114}, 'multiverseid': 651114}, {'name': '発展のタリスマン', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。発展のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651373&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36501c53-4ede-481a-9914-7935ceaf22a0', 'multiverseId': 651373}, 'multiverseid': 651373}]", '[{\'name\': \'Teferis zeitlose Einsicht\', \'text\': \'Falls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, abgesehen von der ersten, die du in jedem deiner Ziehsegmente ziehst, ziehe stattdessen zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Schön, du weißt also mehr als ich. Aber musst du das so heraushängen lassen?"\\n—Chandra Nalaar, zu Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25980865-4d21-46a1-b7bb-e950aab0a20d\', \'multiverseId\': 650472}, \'multiverseid\': 650472}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité sans âge de Téfeiri\', \'text\': \'Si vous deviez piocher une carte, excepté la première que vous piochez pendant chacune de vos étapes de pioche, piochez deux cartes à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« D\'accord, tu en sais plus que moi. Mais est-ce une raison de jouer les prétentieux ? »\\n—Chandra Nalaàr, à Téfeiri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650731&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8339239f-bbb5-4564-a326-129c5f9bd6ca\', \'multiverseId\': 650731}, \'multiverseid\': 650731}, {\'name\': \'Intuizione Eterna di Teferi\', \'text\': \'Se stai per pescare una carta, tranne la prima che peschi in ognuna delle tue sottofasi di acquisizione, peschi invece due carte.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"E va bene, ne sai più di me... Ma devi per forza ostentarlo?"\\n—Chandra Nalaar a Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a48649c7-c12c-481a-84af-b8d174417a72\', \'multiverseId\': 650990}, \'multiverseid\': 650990}, {\'name\': \'テフェリーの永遠の洞察\', \'text\': \'あなたがあなたの各ドロー・ステップで引く１枚目のカードでないカード１枚を引くなら、代わりにカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「いいわ。あなたは私より良く知っている。でも、それを見せつけるようなやり方をする必要はあるの？」\\n――チャンドラ・ナラーからテフェリーへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c407847f-af4a-48e6-a00d-a8495d9f0ef2\', \'multiverseId\': 651249}, \'multiverseid\': 651249}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der Erleuchtung\', \'text\': \'Der Tempel der Erleuchtung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Erleuchtung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650655&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aadbeef-0980-4ec4-9f77-19f3acaa7196\', \'multiverseId\': 650655}, \'multiverseid\': 650655}, {\'name\': "Temple de l\'illumination", \'text\': "Le Temple de l\'illumination arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de l\'illumination arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec72351d-2e74-410d-9ec2-d0de4de4e664\', \'multiverseId\': 650914}, \'multiverseid\': 650914}, {\'name\': "Tempio dell\'Illuminazione", \'text\': "Il Tempio dell\'Illuminazione entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio dell\'Illuminazione entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6b105a-003a-48a9-97c7-3cb49da7e2cb\', \'multiverseId\': 651173}, \'multiverseid\': 651173}, {\'name\': \'啓蒙の神殿\', \'text\': \'啓蒙の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n啓蒙の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e9d356-69d6-4777-b945-3c33c8dd9511\', \'multiverseId\': 651432}, \'multiverseid\': 651432}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel der Geheimnisse', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Geheimnisse kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Geheimnisse ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650656&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0721d53-ca1e-4a99-8f87-402dc047daa8', 'multiverseId': 650656}, 'multiverseid': 650656}, {'name': 'Temple du mystère', 'text': 'Le Temple du mystère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du mystère arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650915&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '692e6e12-7329-42b4-b7d2-58444d0fec48', 'multiverseId': 650915}, 'multiverseid': 650915}, {'name': 'Tempio del Mistero', 'text': 'Il Tempio del Mistero entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio del Mistero entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651174&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a397e8c-8a17-4ca4-b3c0-95b21ace4a78', 'multiverseId': 651174}, 'multiverseid': 651174}, {'name': '神秘の神殿', 'text': '神秘の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n神秘の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651433&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a95ac254-db39-445f-81b4-25d02622ea6a', 'multiverseId': 651433}, 'multiverseid': 651433}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der Unbekümmertheit\', \'text\': \'Der Tempel der Unbekümmertheit kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Unbekümmertheit ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650654&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7d53593-f7da-4ca8-9aba-ea199bc9bfc8\', \'multiverseId\': 650654}, \'multiverseid\': 650654}, {\'name\': "Temple de l\'abandon", \'text\': "Le Temple de l\'abandon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de l\'abandon arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f66d398-c98c-48f5-b83c-4882b8d25f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 650913}, \'multiverseid\': 650913}, {\'name\': "Tempio dell\'Abbandono", \'text\': "Il Tempio dell\'Abbandono entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio dell\'Abbandono entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6119c00-972a-4902-a624-8c6fc74725f0\', \'multiverseId\': 651172}, \'multiverseid\': 651172}, {\'name\': \'奔放の神殿\', \'text\': \'奔放の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n奔放の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91817d11-6542-42e4-9ac6-9a6ddab9e5cd\', \'multiverseId\': 651431}, \'multiverseid\': 651431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der falschen Göttin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Götter teilnahmslos werden, beginnen die Leute jeden anzubeten, der sie erhört."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650658&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb987364-5700-4f5a-9d51-00974afbfa18\', \'multiverseId\': 650658}, \'multiverseid\': 650658}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la fausse divinité\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand les dieux deviennent indifférents, les gens vénèrent quiconque répond à leurs supplications. »\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'795d4777-e0f5-4b6d-a7d4-1523eb17e0eb\', \'multiverseId\': 650917}, \'multiverseid\': 650917}, {\'name\': \'Tempio della Dea Fasulla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Attiva solo se controlli cinque o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando gli dei sprofondano nell\\\'apatia, il popolo inizia a venerare chiunque risponda alle sue preghiere."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af12eb8-4427-4513-a177-8242eaa7dfc5\', \'multiverseId\': 651176}, \'multiverseid\': 651176}, {\'name\': \'邪神の寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。あなたが５つ以上の土地をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「神々が無関心となった時、人々は自分たちの嘆願を聞き入れてくれる者ならば何でも崇拝するようになるのね。」\\n――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d939d70-8f9e-4dfe-9d56-8055bb6c56bf\', \'multiverseId\': 651435}, \'multiverseid\': 651435}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel des Triumphes', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Triumphes kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Triumphes ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650659&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e85e0548-c280-42d1-ae7d-03ae3e424e1b', 'multiverseId': 650659}, 'multiverseid': 650659}, {'name': 'Temple du triomphe', 'text': 'Le Temple du triomphe arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du triomphe arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650918&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fa4ae85-9e52-4005-a49e-4aa092b9daea', 'multiverseId': 650918}, 'multiverseid': 650918}, {'name': 'Tempio del Trionfo', 'text': 'Il Tempio del Trionfo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio del Trionfo entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651177&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84322c0e-ba51-476b-80e9-3a563bf1b750', 'multiverseId': 651177}, 'multiverseid': 651177}, {'name': '凱旋の神殿', 'text': '凱旋の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n凱旋の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651436&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '811dbd0a-9e7e-4cfc-941b-49eb283baea9', 'multiverseId': 651436}, 'multiverseid': 651436}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel des Überflusses', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Überflusses kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Überflusses ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650657&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8846dec5-8c76-4af7-abc4-3de48b34d20e', 'multiverseId': 650657}, 'multiverseid': 650657}, {'name': 'Temple de la profusion', 'text': 'Le Temple de la profusion arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la profusion arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650916&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df00dd3f-88c5-4fe8-b994-b0cba0720a47', 'multiverseId': 650916}, 'multiverseid': 650916}, {'name': 'Tempio della Prosperità', 'text': 'Il Tempio della Prosperità entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio della Prosperità entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651175&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '823ae731-2524-4a47-90d7-a257639262ac', 'multiverseId': 651175}, 'multiverseid': 651175}, {'name': '豊潤の神殿', 'text': '豊潤の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n豊潤の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651434&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06e17d6c-532f-463a-bcf3-e68765fdcd43', 'multiverseId': 651434}, 'multiverseid': 651434}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tesak, Judiths Höllenhund\', \'text\': \'Entfesselt (Du kannst diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommen lassen. Sie kann nicht blocken, solange eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr liegt.)\\nAndere Hunde, die du kontrollierst, haben Entfesselt.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierstund auf denen Marken liegen, haben Eile.\\nImmer wenn Tesak, Judiths Höllenhund, angreift, erzeuge {R} für jede angreifende Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f521c3ed-394a-4a51-80dd-d2138e032ff8\', \'multiverseId\': 650014}, \'multiverseid\': 650014}, {\'name\': \'Tesak, cerbère de Judith\', \'text\': "Emportement (Vous pouvez faire arriver cette créature sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle ne peut pas bloquer tant qu\'elle a au moins un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nLes autres chiens que vous contrôlez ont l\'emportement.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez avec des marqueurs sur elles ont la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois que Tesak, cerbère de Judith attaque, ajoutez {R} pour chaque créature attaquante.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650054&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad212273-ba56-41eb-bccb-485d97b89219\', \'multiverseId\': 650054}, \'multiverseid\': 650054}, {\'name\': \'Tesak, Segugio Infernale di Judith\', \'text\': \'Scatenare (Puoi far entrare questa creatura nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1. Non può bloccare fintanto che ha un segnalino +1/+1.)\\nGli altri Canidi che controlli hanno scatenare.\\nLe creature con segnalini che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta Tesak, Segugio Infernale di Judith attacca, aggiungi {R} per ogni creatura attaccante.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Canide Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e128418-494b-405f-9806-2df07aa2f0c4\', \'multiverseId\': 650094}, \'multiverseid\': 650094}, {\'name\': \'ジュディスのヘルハウンド、テサック\', \'text\': \'解鎖（このクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出してもよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターがあるかぎり、これではブロックできない。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての犬は解鎖を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてカウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\nジュディスのヘルハウンド、テサックが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体につき{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62605db7-3d48-4d37-bf5f-6285d0c47d66\', \'multiverseId\': 650134}, \'multiverseid\': 650134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tesak, Judiths Höllenhund\', \'text\': \'Entfesselt\\nAndere Hunde, die du kontrollierst, haben Entfesselt.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst und auf denen Marken liegen, haben Eile.\\nImmer wenn Tesak, Judiths Höllenhund, angreift, erzeuge {R} für jede angreifende Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da3a895-8519-4db7-95d7-b074cdadd59b\', \'multiverseId\': 651547}, \'multiverseid\': 651547}, {\'name\': \'Tesak, cerbère de Judith\', \'text\': "Emportement\\nLes autres chiens que vous contrôlez ont l\'emportement.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez avec des marqueurs sur elles ont la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois que Tesak, cerbère de Judith attaque, ajoutez {R} pour chaque créature attaquante.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ed09231-20a1-4533-874d-5213dd9a56c3\', \'multiverseId\': 651586}, \'multiverseid\': 651586}, {\'name\': \'ジュディスのヘルハウンド、テサック\', \'text\': \'解鎖\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての犬は解鎖を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてカウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\nジュディスのヘルハウンド、テサックが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体につき{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12669141-5cf9-4a01-8405-916c0b4e3ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 651625}, \'multiverseid\': 651625}, {\'name\': \'裘蒂丝的地狱犬特煞\', \'text\': \'脱缰\\n由你操控的其他狗具有脱缰异能。\\n由你操控且其上有指示物的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n每当裘蒂丝的地狱犬特煞攻击时，每有一个进行攻击的生物，便加{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 元素／狗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'514ff3cd-a3a5-43ef-aed7-42dce480bdb6\', \'multiverseId\': 651664}, \'multiverseid\': 651664}]', "[{'name': 'Teuflisches Duo', 'text': 'Erstschlag\\nFalls eine Quelle einem Gegner Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie jenem Spieler stattdessen doppelt so viel Schaden zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Teufel', 'flavor': 'Halbe Größe, doppeltes Chaos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650506&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a0216af-02d6-4618-8f6d-5b4017be55a2', 'multiverseId': 650506}, 'multiverseid': 650506}, {'name': 'Duo fielleux', 'text': 'Initiative\\nSi une source devait infliger des blessures à un adversaire, elle inflige le double de ces blessures à ce joueur à la place.', 'type': 'Créature — diable', 'flavor': 'Ils sont peut-être petits, mais ils font le maximum.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650765&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2400f469-852a-4b98-865e-8cf5636a4f45', 'multiverseId': 650765}, 'multiverseid': 650765}, {'name': 'Duo Diabolico', 'text': 'Attacco improvviso\\nSe una fonte sta per infliggere danno a un avversario, infligge invece il doppio di quel danno a quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Diavolo', 'flavor': 'Dimensioni contenute, caos smisurato.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651024&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73058e1f-ca0a-4c6f-9766-f28694cfe9de', 'multiverseId': 651024}, 'multiverseid': 651024}, {'name': '極悪な二人組', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n発生源１つが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるなら、代わりにそれはそのプレイヤーにその２倍の点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': '背丈は半分、悪事は二倍。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651283&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1065e857-f491-495a-a2e5-5c0911ecc67e', 'multiverseId': 651283}, 'multiverseid': 651283}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tezzeret, Verräter des Fleisches\', \'text\': \'Die erste aktivierte Fähigkeit eines Artefakts, die du pro Zug aktivierst, kostet beim Aktivieren {2} weniger.\\n+1: Ziehe zwei Karten. Wirf dann zwei Karten ab, es sei denn, du wirfst eine Artefaktkarte ab.\\n−2: Ein Artefakt deiner Wahl wird zu einer Artefaktkreatur. Falls es kein Fahrzeug ist, hat es Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/4.\\n−6: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, getappt wird, ziehe eine Karte."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650473&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683e5f73-5c3c-4b3c-93b5-059fb17a2338\', \'multiverseId\': 650473}, \'multiverseid\': 650473}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, traître de la chair\', \'text\': "La première capacité activée d\'un artefact que vous activez à chaque tour coûte {2} de moins à activer.\\n+1: Piochez deux cartes. Défaussez-vous ensuite de deux cartes à moins que vous ne vous défaussiez d\'une carte d\'artefact.\\n-2: Un artefact ciblé devient une créature-artefact. Si ce n\'est pas un véhicule, il a une force et une endurance de base de 4/4.\\n-6: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'un artefact que vous contrôlez devient engagé, piochez une carte. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650732&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1998daae-50b4-4d10-b0f6-83dda3fc6786\', \'multiverseId\': 650732}, \'multiverseid\': 650732}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, Traditore della Carne\', \'text\': \'La prima abilità attivata di un artefatto che attivi in ogni turno costa {2} in meno per essere attivata.\\n+1: Pesca due carte. Poi scarta due carte a meno che non scarti una carta artefatto.\\n−2: Un artefatto bersaglio diventa una creatura artefatto. Se non è un Veicolo, ha forza e costituzione base 4/4.\\n−6: Ottieni un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta un artefatto che controlli viene TAPpato, pesca una carta".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f02d4550-ae56-48c2-abde-b162b40a0f34\', \'multiverseId\': 650991}, \'multiverseid\': 650991}, {\'name\': \'肉体の裏切者、テゼレット\', \'text\': \'各ターンであなたが１つ目に起動するアーティファクトの起動型能力を起動するためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\n+1：カード２枚を引く。その後、あなたがアーティファクト・カード１枚を捨てないかぎり、カード２枚を捨てる。\\n-2：アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それはアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。それが機体でないなら、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは４/４になる。\\n-6：あなたは「あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つがタップ状態になるたび、カード１枚を引く。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — テゼレット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'029eb294-8835-40aa-8939-6f5e0efa01c2\', \'multiverseId\': 651250}, \'multiverseid\': 651250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thelonischer Einsiedler\', \'text\': \'Alle Saprolinge erhalten +1/+1.\\nMorph {3}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Thelonische Einsiedler aufgedeckt wird, erzeuge vier 1/1 grüne Saproling-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c333c88-ffd6-4526-8b10-cf81606466cd\', \'multiverseId\': 650541}, \'multiverseid\': 650541}, {\'name\': \'Ermite thélonite\', \'text\': "Tous les saprobiontes gagnent +1/+1.\\nMue {3}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand l\'Ermite thélonite est retourné face visible, créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1596e5-318c-4a0a-96b0-887408e4fdaf\', \'multiverseId\': 650800}, \'multiverseid\': 650800}, {\'name\': \'Eremita Seguace di Thelon\', \'text\': "Tutti i Saprolingi prendono +1/+1.\\nMetamorfosi {3}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando l\'Eremita Seguace di Thelon viene girato a faccia in su, crea quattro pedine creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verdi.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8e80c62-9383-4ab7-b476-2d0e5c00639e\', \'multiverseId\': 651059}, \'multiverseid\': 651059}, {\'name\': \'セロン教の隠遁者\', \'text\': \'すべての苗木は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n変異{3}{G}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\\nセロン教の隠遁者が表向きになったとき、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1009f2c-80e3-4aee-8a3d-e38b3463961d\', \'multiverseId\': 651318}, \'multiverseid\': 651318}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thron der Oberstadt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, opfere den Thron der Oberstadt: Du wirst zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein leuchtendes Symbol für Palianos wahren Herrscher: Ehrgeiz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650660&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'254fed96-b9ab-417b-bf34-cd30a98c0bc2\', \'multiverseId\': 650660}, \'multiverseid\': 650660}, {\'name\': \'Trône de la Haute cité\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifiez le Trône de la Haute cité : Vous devenez le monarque.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Un symbole étincelant du véritable souverain de Paliano : l\'ambition.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'181c578c-1787-4306-bc8c-20ba95c53532\', \'multiverseId\': 650919}, \'multiverseid\': 650919}, {\'name\': \'Trono della Città Alta\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifica il Trono della Città Alta: Diventi il monarca.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Uno scintillante simbolo di chi sia a regnare veramente a Paliano: l\'ambizione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32a926c-f819-4b7d-9243-59de86f7536b\', \'multiverseId\': 651178}, \'multiverseid\': 651178}, {\'name\': \'高層都市の玉座\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}, 高層都市の玉座を生け贄に捧げる：あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'正統なるパリアノ統治者の輝ける象徴、すなわち野心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55dfe92b-820a-4c3d-9d43-884f33b6c8c1\', \'multiverseId\': 651437}, \'multiverseid\': 651437}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tocasias Ausgrabungsstätte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Überwachen 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre adligen Eltern schickten Urza und Mishra los, damit sie etwas über die Vergangenheit lernen würden. Stattdessen offenbarten sie Terisiares Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650661&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'338e101b-727f-4509-bbb4-f14683335413\', \'multiverseId\': 650661}, \'multiverseid\': 650661}, {\'name\': \'Site de fouilles de Tocasia\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T} : Surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Envoyés par leurs nobles parents pour leur forger le caractère et apprendre des leçons du passé, Urza et Mishra révélèrent plutôt l\'avenir de Terisiare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df2db35a-15e7-42a7-861b-862ec03f87f4\', \'multiverseId\': 650920}, \'multiverseid\': 650920}, {\'name\': \'トカシアの採掘場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'心身を鍛え、世界の過去を学ぶようにと高貴なる両親に送り出されたウルザとミシュラは、その代わりにテリシアの未来を明らかにした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d435b8c-6fab-4157-8250-8e42c7bbf92a\', \'multiverseId\': 651438}, \'multiverseid\': 651438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todesnebel-Raptor\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn ein Permanent, das du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, kannst du den Todesnebel-Raptor aus deinem Friedhof aufgedeckt oder verdeckt ins Spiel zurückbringen.\\nMegamorph {4}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Megamorph-Kosten auf und lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b792f329-9be6-4000-934d-d19fed385c95\', \'multiverseId\': 650521}, \'multiverseid\': 650521}, {\'name\': \'Raptor mortebrume\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, le Raptor mortebrume face visible ou face cachée.\\nMégamue {4}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mégamue et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature — dinosaure et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa93fb89-2f22-481f-b5c9-651758a658e6\', \'multiverseId\': 650780}, \'multiverseid\': 650780}, {\'name\': \'Raptor della Foschia Letale\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta un permanente che controlli viene girato a faccia in su, puoi rimettere il Raptor della Foschia Letale sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero a faccia in su o a faccia in giù.\\nMegamorfosi {4}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di megamorfosi e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ec8c795-f05b-4544-bdcf-2432fcd0ebea\', \'multiverseId\': 651039}, \'multiverseid\': 651039}, {\'name\': \'死霧の猛禽\', \'text\': \'接死\\nあなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つが表向きになるたび、あなたの墓地にある死霧の猛禽を表向きまたは裏向きで戦場に戻してもよい。\\n大変異{4}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの大変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。そうしたなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62fdb1dc-def1-4d10-a1a1-8348d4b5c2d5\', \'multiverseId\': 651298}, \'multiverseid\': 651298}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tolle Bedienung\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Tolle Bedienung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge so viele Speise-Spielsteine, wie du Gegner hast. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du {2} bezahlen und einen Spielstein opfern. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 4/4 grünen Nashorn-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df6ac7b-18fb-4069-b654-aaaee89101b9\', \'multiverseId\': 650527}, \'multiverseid\': 650527}, {\'name\': \'Service qui tue\', \'text\': "Quand le Service qui tue arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un nombre de jetons Nourriture égal au nombre d\'adversaires que vous avez. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez payer {2} et sacrifier un jeton. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Rhinocéros et Guerrier.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650786&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60752ebf-eb38-452c-8f63-d7583c058449\', \'multiverseId\': 650786}, \'multiverseid\': 650786}, {\'name\': \'Ben Servito\', \'text\': \'Quando Ben Servito entra nel campo di battaglia, crea un numero di pedine Cibo pari al numero di avversari che hai. (Sono artefatti con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\nAll\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi pagare {2} e sacrificare una pedina. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Rinoceronte 4/4 verde.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae6d97b-2e1f-4b26-b13d-1625aa6ef0aa\', \'multiverseId\': 651045}, \'multiverseid\': 651045}, {\'name\': \'殺しのサービス\', \'text\': \'殺しのサービスが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の人数に等しい数の食物・トークンを生成する。（それらは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたは「{2}を支払ってトークン１つを生け贄に捧げる。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、緑の４/４のサイ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e2bcd6-f0e2-4aa3-83c0-3aa9be180441\', \'multiverseId\': 651304}, \'multiverseid\': 651304}]', '[{\'name\': \'Toski, Träger der Geheimnisse\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nUnzerstörbar\\nToski, Träger der Geheimnisse, greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Eichhörnchen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5173af2d-4d1b-4518-93b0-01f3609821c7\', \'multiverseId\': 650544}, \'multiverseid\': 650544}, {\'name\': \'Toski, porteur de secrets\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nIndestructible\\nToski, porteur de secrets attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — écureuil\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650803&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d707503-e77e-45f3-bbb3-8a8e43654092\', \'multiverseId\': 650803}, \'multiverseid\': 650803}, {\'name\': \'Toski, Portatore di Segreti\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nIndistruttibile\\nToski, Portatore di Segreti attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Scoiattolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f5016a-eaef-4240-81cf-b53fb996e7be\', \'multiverseId\': 651062}, \'multiverseid\': 651062}, {\'name\': \'秘密を知るもの、トスキ\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\n破壊不能\\n各戦闘で、秘密を知るもの、トスキは可能なら攻撃する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — リス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34d906cb-1ae5-4e96-bb93-bdf55f186f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 651321}, \'multiverseid\': 651321}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tote Flussmündung\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Tote Flussmündung ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Insel- oder Sumpf-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt die Tote Flussmündung getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2267deee-e3b1-4ee4-984a-4880e2b2b3f0\', \'multiverseId\': 650607}, \'multiverseid\': 650607}, {\'name\': \'Estuaire asphyxié\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Estuaire asphyxié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'île ou de marais de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, l\'Estuaire asphyxié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb050c8f-7f54-4027-8ba0-77f087dabbe8\', \'multiverseId\': 650866}, \'multiverseid\': 650866}, {\'name\': \'Estuario Soffocato\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Estuario Soffocato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Isola o Palude dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Estuario Soffocato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5daebb-a4a5-44d0-a5b2-7b7a6693da17\', \'multiverseId\': 651125}, \'multiverseid\': 651125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Toxische Sintflut\', \'text\': \'Bezahle X Lebenspunkte als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nAlle Kreaturen erhalten -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist schwierig, eine Seuche einzudämmen, die mit den Wolken wandert."\\n—Esara, Meisterheilerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650495&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1368f679-f7d2-4870-ae61-92dad3d31080\', \'multiverseId\': 650495}, \'multiverseid\': 650495}, {\'name\': \'Déluge toxique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, payez X points de vie.\\nToutes les créatures gagnent -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Il est difficile de mettre en quarantaine un fléau qui se déplace avec les nuages. »\\n—Esara, guérisseuse experte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650754&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e06c775b-776d-47a7-8a2c-9ae79eca1709\', \'multiverseId\': 650754}, \'multiverseid\': 650754}, {\'name\': \'Diluvio Tossico\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, paga X punti vita.\\nTutte le creature prendono -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"È difficile mettere in quarantena una piaga che si sposta con le nuvole."\\n—Esara, esperta guaritrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581b1b18-2be8-4ae0-ac96-297d8c030b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 651013}, \'multiverseid\': 651013}, {\'name\': \'毒の濁流\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、Ｘ点のライフを支払う。\\nターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「雲と共に移動する疫病を検疫するのは難しいわ。」\\n――熟達の癒し手、エサラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb156e93-19ec-4786-b74e-00f118660587\', \'multiverseId\': 651272}, \'multiverseid\': 651272}]', '[{\'name\': \'Traumfresser\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Traumfresser ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 4 an. Wenn du dies tust, kannst du ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wahl, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurückbringen. (Um Überwachen 4 anzuwenden, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650454&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca04c6f-e8ae-4869-8d33-86bccbb3325e\', \'multiverseId\': 650454}, \'multiverseid\': 650454}, {\'name\': \'Dévoreur de rêves\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand le Dévoreur de rêves arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 4. Quand vous faites ainsi, vous pouvez renvoyer un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle dans la main de son propriétaire. (Pour surveiller 4, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Créature — cauchemar et sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650713&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c771d822-878c-4410-a621-55a25f247417\', \'multiverseId\': 650713}, \'multiverseid\': 650713}, {\'name\': \'Divorasogni\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando il Divorasogni entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 4. Quando lo fai, puoi far tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario in mano al suo proprietario. (Per sorvegliare 4, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge Incubo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9857ff92-53ba-42c1-ae49-4df0d0eb539b\', \'multiverseId\': 650972}, \'multiverseid\': 650972}, {\'name\': \'夢喰い\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n夢喰いが戦場に出たとき、諜報４を行う。そうしたとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。（諜報４を行うとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード４枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア・スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'999a4c64-393d-454d-b45c-1da406332c3e\', \'multiverseId\': 651231}, \'multiverseid\': 651231}]', '[{\'name\': \'Treueversprechen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler legt eine Schwurmarke auf eine Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, und opfert den Rest. Keine der Kreaturen kann dich oder Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, solange eine Schwurmarke auf ihr liegt.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir gegen die Welt. Auf ewig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650432&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63712469-5908-4e17-b3d6-32d25d1fd120\', \'multiverseId\': 650432}, \'multiverseid\': 650432}, {\'name\': \'Promesse de fidélité\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur met un marqueur « serment » sur une créature qu\'il contrôle et sacrifie le reste. Aucune de ces créatures ne peut vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez tant qu\'elle a un marqueur « serment » sur elle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est nous contre le reste du monde. Pour toujours. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650691&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1fa166-6e59-4fc0-a561-b8a089e2b57e\', \'multiverseId\': 650691}, \'multiverseid\': 650691}, {\'name\': \'Promessa di Lealtà\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore mette un segnalino giuramento su una creatura che controlla e sacrifica le altre. Ognuna di quelle creature non può attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli fintanto che ha un segnalino giuramento.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo noi contro il mondo. Per sempre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f189d068-d3a6-4059-9424-6608b5b32ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 650950}, \'multiverseid\': 650950}, {\'name\': \'忠誠の確約\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を選び、その上に誓約カウンター１個を置き、残りを生け贄に捧げる。それらの選ばれた各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それの上に誓約カウンターがあり続けているかぎり、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「何があっても私たちは仲間だ。永遠に。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c56bb2-dd26-4c30-aab8-ea4640671be9\', \'multiverseId\': 651209}, \'multiverseid\': 651209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Turm der Industrie\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du ein Artefakt kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Leuchtfeuer des Wohlstands für einige, ein Schatten der Unterdrückung für andere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650649&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'945985de-08fd-41d9-a4bd-7614df54eb7f\', \'multiverseId\': 650649}, \'multiverseid\': 650649}, {\'name\': "Tour de l\'industrie", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez un artefact.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Modèle de prospérité pour certains, ombre de la répression pour d\'autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad0c3fdc-8e2c-4133-9b96-d9e6b064b107\', \'multiverseId\': 650908}, \'multiverseid\': 650908}, {\'name\': "Spirale dell\'Industria", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Attiva solo se controlli un artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Un faro di prosperità per alcuni, un\'ombra di oppressione per altri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f27085-32da-4d15-8c11-eb7c28c61a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 651167}, \'multiverseid\': 651167}, {\'name\': \'産業の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ある者には繁栄の灯、他の者には抑圧の影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185db010-8681-4017-86b0-1bcec0610f87\', \'multiverseId\': 651426}, \'multiverseid\': 651426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Turm des Reliquienschreins\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der einst von den Rittern des Reliquienschreins bewachte Turm wird nun nur durch seine entfernte Lage geschützt. Seine staubigen Schätze stehen jedem Plünderer offen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650635&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f816a306-dd2b-43e5-a21f-0bcbf9331ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 650635}, \'multiverseid\': 650635}, {\'name\': \'Tour du Reliquaire\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Autrefois gardée par les Chevaliers du Reliquaire, la tour n\'est plus protégée que par son isolement et ses trésors poussiéreux sont à la merci du premier pillard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650894&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d296d4d6-36ad-4189-bf88-ae44ae8675f9\', \'multiverseId\': 650894}, \'multiverseid\': 650894}, {\'name\': \'Torre del Reliquiario\', \'text\': \'Non hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un tempo difesa dai Cavalieri del Reliquiario, la torre è adesso protetta unicamente dalla propria inaccessibilità; chiunque potrà saccheggiarne i polverosi tesori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b2d95f-499b-4ba8-8e76-fe65e8653a89\', \'multiverseId\': 651153}, \'multiverseid\': 651153}, {\'name\': \'聖遺の塔\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'昔は聖遺の騎士によって守られていたその塔だが、今は外界から隔絶しているという事実しか守るものはいない。埃をかぶった宝物の数々を誰でも我が物にできるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'508ae23e-d31f-4c9e-971a-80c43664a5ea\', \'multiverseId\': 651412}, \'multiverseid\': 651412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ugins Überlegenheit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen farblosen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\\nImmer wenn du mit Kreaturen mit Gesamtstärke 6 oder mehr angreifst, kannst du eine verdeckte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aufdecken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650406&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5893dbc4-27ed-4cac-84c6-5ff2f823b71c\', \'multiverseId\': 650406}, \'multiverseid\': 650406}, {\'name\': "Maîtrise d\'Ugin", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature incolore, manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec des créatures d\'une force totale supérieure ou égale à 6, vous pouvez retourner face visible une créature face cachée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650665&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683d9e3d-ab87-4bef-ad8d-804b38303a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 650665}, \'multiverseid\': 650665}, {\'name\': \'Maestria di Ugin\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura incolore, manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi con creature con forza totale pari o superiore a 6, puoi girare a faccia in su una creatura a faccia in giù che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efd4923d-5d23-402f-8321-be508d6705dd\', \'multiverseId\': 650924}, \'multiverseid\': 650924}, {\'name\': \'ウギンの支配\', \'text\': \'あなたが無色のクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。（それを裏向きで２/２のクリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\nあなたがパワーの合計が６以上であるクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしている裏向きのクリーチャー１体を表向きにしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d4a9af0-3e61-4def-b478-1adddfb6e590\', \'multiverseId\': 651183}, \'multiverseid\': 651183}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unabschüttelbarer Verfolger\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Unabschüttelbare Verfolger ins Spiel kommt und zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturenkarten von deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\n{2}, opfere einen Hinweis: Bringe den Unabschüttelbaren Verfolger aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54ce6fe1-c21c-49d1-aa67-927ad27a4859\', \'multiverseId\': 651540}, \'multiverseid\': 651540}, {\'name\': \'Privé inébranlable\', \'text\': "Quand le Privé inébranlable arrive sur le champ de bataille et au début de votre entretien, surveillez 1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de créature est mise dans votre cimetière depuis votre bibliothèque, enquêtez.\\n{2}, sacrifiez un indice : Renvoyez dans votre main le Privé inébranlable depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature — zombie et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeca8524-8637-48b0-91e2-80aff26bf479\', \'multiverseId\': 651579}, \'multiverseid\': 651579}, {\'name\': \'撒けない追っ手\', \'text\': \'撒けない追っ手が戦場に出たとき、および、あなたのアップキープの開始時に、諜報１を行う。\\nあなたのライブラリーから１枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、調査を行う。\\n{2}, 手掛かり１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にある撒けない追っ手をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'743a9af2-ccab-4a28-a232-f6b64a952406\', \'multiverseId\': 651618}, \'multiverseid\': 651618}, {\'name\': \'难甩盯梢客\', \'text\': \'当难甩盯梢客进战场和在你的维持开始时，刺探1。\\n每当一张或数张生物牌从你的牌库进入你的坟墓场时，探查。\\n{2}，牺牲一个线索：将难甩盯梢客从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 灵俑／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73fdf92-c82e-45b7-a3e6-720b4519d8b3\', \'multiverseId\': 651657}, \'multiverseid\': 651657}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unauffällige Ermittlerin\', \'text\': \'Verhandlungen — Immer wenn die Unauffällige Ermittlerin angreift, deckt jeder Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Stelle für jede auf diese Weise aufgedeckte Nichtland-Karte Nachforschungen an. Dann zieht jeder Spieler eine Karte.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du alle Länder, die du kontrollierst, enttappen. Falls du dies tust, kannst du bis zu deinem nächsten Zug keine Zaubersprüche wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'808241b3-3083-4e0c-95f5-28fa67ffb622\', \'multiverseId\': 651549}, \'multiverseid\': 651549}, {\'name\': \'Chercheur inoffensif\', \'text\': "Pourparler — À chaque fois que le Chercheur inoffensif attaque, chaque joueur révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Pour chaque carte non-terrain révélée de cette manière, vous enquêtez. Chaque joueur pioche ensuite une carte.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez dégager tous les terrains que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, vous ne pouvez pas lancer de sorts jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — centaure et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651588&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c283a9b-2886-4956-b3d2-6af0aeec24d9\', \'multiverseId\': 651588}, \'multiverseid\': 651588}, {\'name\': \'無害の研究者\', \'text\': \'協議 ― 無害の研究者が攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。あなたは、これにより公開されて土地でないカード１枚につき１回調査を行う。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地をアンタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、次のあなたのターンまで、あなたは呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e77f74-15e0-41b2-a102-6aeab1fa06d7\', \'multiverseId\': 651627}, \'multiverseid\': 651627}, {\'name\': \'无害研究员\', \'text\': \'论争～每当无害研究员攻击时，每位牌手各展示其牌库顶牌。每以此法展示出一张非地牌，你便探查一次。然后每位牌手各抓一张牌。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以重置所有由你操控的地。若你如此作，则直到你的下一个回合，你不能施放咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 半人马／侦探\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ed6d46-b5fd-4655-905c-181a17bce09b\', \'multiverseId\': 651666}, \'multiverseid\': 651666}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unbeirrbarer Verfolger\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Unbeirrbare Verfolger ins Spiel kommt und zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturenkarten von deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\n{2}, opfere einen Hinweis: Bringe den Unbeirrbaren Verfolger aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7370fc0-8079-4c4a-a56a-d76ab0cd05a5\', \'multiverseId\': 650007}, \'multiverseid\': 650007}, {\'name\': \'Privé inébranlable\', \'text\': "Quand le Privé inébranlable arrive sur le champ de bataille et au début de votre entretien, surveillez 1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de créature est mise dans votre cimetière depuis votre bibliothèque, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\n{2}, sacrifiez un indice : Renvoyez dans votre main le Privé inébranlable depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature — zombie et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b3cf95-cd6f-49e3-b1e6-ebc277a444d6\', \'multiverseId\': 650047}, \'multiverseid\': 650047}, {\'name\': \'Pedinatore Irremovibile\', \'text\': \'Quando il Pedinatore Irremovibile entra nel campo di battaglia e all\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sorveglia 1.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più carte creatura vengono messe nel tuo cimitero dal tuo grimorio, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\n{2}, Sacrifica un Indizio: Riprendi in mano il Pedinatore Irremovibile dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Detective Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01482a6e-cca5-4c7e-a7d8-d2513c6ce86b\', \'multiverseId\': 650087}, \'multiverseid\': 650087}, {\'name\': \'撒けない追っ手\', \'text\': \'撒けない追っ手が戦場に出たとき、および、あなたのアップキープの開始時に、諜報１を行う。\\nあなたのライブラリーから１枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{2}, 手掛かり１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にある撒けない追っ手をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'952d31ed-0355-4623-ab6f-6c253297902f\', \'multiverseId\': 650127}, \'multiverseid\': 650127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unerklärliche Abwesenheit\', \'text\': \'Schicke für jeden Spieler bis zu ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wahl, das jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil. Für jedes auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Permanent tarnt sein Beherrscher die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek. (Um eine Karte zu tarnen, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur mit Abwehr {2} verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9bcd0c-b9df-499b-ac69-084c47d8cb34\', \'multiverseId\': 649995}, \'multiverseid\': 649995}, {\'name\': \'Absence inexpliquée\', \'text\': "Pour chaque joueur, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle. Pour chaque permanent exilé de cette manière, son contrôleur voile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. (Pour voiler une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2 avec parade {2}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650035&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'542bd80a-cb19-418e-a283-2417a9474a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 650035}, \'multiverseid\': 650035}, {\'name\': \'Assenza Inesplicabile\', \'text\': \'Per ogni giocatore, esilia fino a un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore. Per ogni permanente esiliato in questo modo, il suo controllore cela la prima carta del proprio grimorio. (Per celare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 con egida {2}. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d8c9f6-92c8-4d06-b422-34d593dedc77\', \'multiverseId\': 650075}, \'multiverseid\': 650075}, {\'name\': \'存在不明\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。それらを追放する。これにより追放された各パーマネントにつきそれぞれ、それのコントローラーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。（カードを偽装するとは、それを護法{2}を持つ２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで戦場に出すことである。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bee3c05-ec63-4c96-a2ca-2f73d023121f\', \'multiverseId\': 650115}, \'multiverseid\': 650115}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unerklärliche Abwesenheit\', \'text\': \'Schicke für jeden Spieler bis zu ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wahl, das jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil. Für jedes auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Permanent tarnt sein Beherrscher die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b41998e-775f-4f60-8dea-56a475ace937\', \'multiverseId\': 651529}, \'multiverseid\': 651529}, {\'name\': \'Absence inexpliquée\', \'text\': "Pour chaque joueur, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle. Pour chaque permanent exilé de cette manière, son contrôleur voile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651568&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'596454eb-6e9d-480a-a7d0-1fe0c6e1964c\', \'multiverseId\': 651568}, \'multiverseid\': 651568}, {\'name\': \'存在不明\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。それらを追放する。これにより追放された各パーマネントにつきそれぞれ、それのコントローラーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'753f0c69-ba19-413a-9f4b-fefcb17c0513\', \'multiverseId\': 651607}, \'multiverseid\': 651607}, {\'name\': \'莫名失踪\', \'text\': \'为每位牌手各进行以下流程～放逐至多一个目标由该牌手操控的非地永久物。每以此法放逐一个永久物，其操控者便匿伏其牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea32847-6100-4893-b81d-250c82b3420f\', \'multiverseId\': 651646}, \'multiverseid\': 651646}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unermüdliche Spurensucherin\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nImmer wenn du einen Hinweis opferst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Unermüdliche Spurensucherin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a333b79f-f455-468f-8737-63a5a2a5d478\', \'multiverseId\': 650543}, \'multiverseid\': 650543}, {\'name\': \'Traqueuse infatigable\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un indice, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Traqueuse infatigable.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b51244f8-747e-4bec-81e4-538b9c768536\', \'multiverseId\': 650802}, \'multiverseid\': 650802}, {\'name\': \'Battipista Instancabile\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nOgniqualvolta sacrifichi un Indizio, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Battipista Instancabile.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'743313d9-3ae2-46c0-a4e6-02a0989ebaef\', \'multiverseId\': 651061}, \'multiverseid\': 651061}, {\'name\': \'不屈の追跡者\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたが手掛かり１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、不屈の追跡者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf8feab0-915c-4b8b-a693-54801b040cc7\', \'multiverseId\': 651320}, \'multiverseid\': 651320}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unheildrohendes Dampfschiff\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Unheildrohende Dampfschiff ins Spiel kommt, bestimmt jeder Spieler zwei Kreaturen, die weder Spielsteine noch Fahrzeuge sind und die er kontrolliert. Schicke sie ins Exil, bis das Unheildrohende Dampfschiff das Spiel verlässt.\\nImmer wenn das Unheildrohende Dampfschiff angreift, lege eine von ihm ins Exil geschickte Karte auf den Friedhof ihres Besitzers. Falls du dies tust, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\nBemannen 2\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5895c4d8-0ab3-4d5e-ae91-ea3dc1fd6619\', \'multiverseId\': 651539}, \'multiverseid\': 651539}, {\'name\': \'Bateau à vapeur angoissant\', \'text\': "Quand le Bateau à vapeur angoissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur choisit deux créatures non-jeton, non-Véhicule qu\'il contrôle. Exilez-les jusqu\'à ce que le Bateau à vapeur angoissant quitte le champ de bataille.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Bateau à vapeur angoissant attaque, mettez une carte exilée par lui dans le cimetière de son propriétaire. Si vous faites ainsi, enquêtez.\\nPilotage 2", \'type\': \'Artefact — véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befe6ecc-d271-4a80-8e98-722d80ea09e0\', \'multiverseId\': 651578}, \'multiverseid\': 651578}, {\'name\': \'凶兆の蒸気船\', \'text\': \'凶兆の蒸気船が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分がコントロールしていてトークンでも機体でもないクリーチャー２体を選ぶ。凶兆の蒸気船が戦場を離れるまで、それらを追放する。\\n凶兆の蒸気船が攻撃するたび、これにより追放されているカード１枚をオーナーの墓地に置く。そうしたなら、調査を行う。\\n搭乗２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92a7d35-9b4e-4481-85a8-bf44c028b074\', \'multiverseId\': 651617}, \'multiverseid\': 651617}, {\'name\': \'恶兆汽船\', \'text\': \'当恶兆汽船进战场时，每位牌手各选择两个由其操控且既非衍生物也非载具的生物。放逐它们，直到恶兆汽船离开战场为止。\\n每当恶兆汽船攻击时，将一张以其放逐的牌置入其拥有者的坟墓场。若你如此作，则探查。\\n搭载2\', \'type\': \'神器 — 载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8dc7fc7-3b73-4bdc-ad1f-39d0cb528d43\', \'multiverseId\': 651656}, \'multiverseid\': 651656}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unheilskauz\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Todesberührung\\nWenn der Unheilskauz ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Schnabel zerreißt Fleisch und Knochen, bis er das zarte Innere der Träume freilegt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b3884c-42b8-41ce-a9be-c7f83c9668fe\', \'multiverseId\': 650553}, \'multiverseid\': 650553}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre strix\', \'text\': \'Vol, contact mortel\\nQuand le Sinistre strix arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — oiseau\', \'flavor\': "Son bec déchire la chair et taille l\'os, exposant à l\'air libre la tendre moelle du rêve.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba77ef1-298e-4460-8798-e7e2d0db44b1\', \'multiverseId\': 650812}, \'multiverseid\': 650812}, {\'name\': \'Strige Funesto\', \'text\': \'Volare, tocco letale\\nQuando lo Strige Funesto entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo becco squarcia carne e ossa, mettendo allo scoperto la tenera essenza dei sogni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72798d0b-cf19-4682-a738-e367746efdec\', \'multiverseId\': 651071}, \'multiverseid\': 651071}, {\'name\': \'悪意の大梟\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死\\n悪意の大梟が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'その嘴は肉と骨を裂き、柔らかな夢の随を剥き出しにする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8676d60-e24e-4165-a425-7980bed0dbc9\', \'multiverseId\': 651330}, \'multiverseid\': 651330}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unruhe im Gerichtssaal\', \'text\': \'Schicke X Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil und stelle dann X Mal Nachforschungen an. Bringe die ins Exil geschickten Karten zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers getappt ins Spiel zurück. (Um Nachforschungen anzustellen, erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e058a8-343c-4679-a982-671309a957b5\', \'multiverseId\': 650562}, \'multiverseid\': 650562}, {\'name\': \'Désordre au tribunal\', \'text\': "Exilez X créatures ciblées, puis enquêtez X fois. Renvoyez les cartes exilées sur le champ de bataille engagées sous le contrôle de leur propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin. (Pour enquêter, créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bed2eb1-7d56-4479-aa70-ed412116e7d2\', \'multiverseId\': 650821}, \'multiverseid\': 650821}, {\'name\': \'Disordine nella Corte\', \'text\': \'Esilia X creature bersaglio, poi indaga X volte. Rimetti le carte esiliate sul campo di battaglia TAPpate sotto il controllo dei rispettivi proprietari all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale. (Per indagare, crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f3ac68-07ac-4ca5-8806-6adc1cc0f180\', \'multiverseId\': 651080}, \'multiverseid\': 651080}, {\'name\': \'法廷の騒乱\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーＸ体を対象とする。それらを追放する。その後、Ｘ回調査を行う。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらの追放されているカードをオーナーのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に戻す。（調査を行うとは、手掛かり・トークン１つを生成することである。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2213a65d-ab11-4680-9c71-d1398e4e637a\', \'multiverseId\': 651339}, \'multiverseid\': 651339}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unsterbliche Pflicht\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners unter dessen Kontrolle mit einer Verpflichtungsmarke ins Spiel zurück. Solange auf der Kreatur eine Verpflichtungsmarke liegt, ist sie angestachelt, sie kann dich und Permanente, die du kontrollierst, nicht angreifen, und kann Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Tod ist keine Ausflucht vor Schulden bei den Orzhov.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ef61e5-220f-41de-af16-fb7b582adb59\', \'multiverseId\': 649988}, \'multiverseid\': 649988}, {\'name\': \'Obligation perpétuelle\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous son contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire avec un marqueur « devoir » sur elle. Tant que cette créature a un marqueur « devoir » sur elle, elle est incitée, elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un permanent que vous contrôlez et ne peut pas bloquer les créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La mort n\'exempte pas des dettes envers les Orzhov.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650028&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed6e1d1-07d3-411f-bead-6d9041d5f9ca\', \'multiverseId\': 650028}, \'multiverseid\': 650028}, {\'name\': \'Obbligo Immortale\', \'text\': \'Rimetti una carta creatura bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario sul campo di battaglia sotto il suo controllo con un segnalino dovere. Fintanto che quella creatura ha un segnalino dovere, è spronata, non può attaccare te o un permanente che controlli e non può bloccare le creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La morte non è una scusa sufficiente per sottrarsi a un debito con gli Orzhov.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf827e7-39d5-4095-8a6d-920546ddcb23\', \'multiverseId\': 650068}, \'multiverseid\': 650068}, {\'name\': \'不死の債務\', \'text\': \'対戦相手の墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを債務カウンター１個が置かれた状態でそのプレイヤーのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーの上に債務カウンターがあり続けているかぎり、それは使嗾されており、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントを攻撃できず、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーをブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'オルゾフの借金は、死しても、一時の猶予も与えてくれない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a35a794-e087-45f6-9d0c-7e82a6749a61\', \'multiverseId\': 650108}, \'multiverseid\': 650108}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unsterbliche Pflicht\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners unter dessen Kontrolle mit einer Verpflichtungsmarke ins Spiel zurück. Solange auf der Kreatur eine Verpflichtungsmarke liegt, ist sie angestachelt, sie kann dich und Permanente, die du kontrollierst, nicht angreifen, und kann Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Tod ist keine Ausflucht vor Schulden bei den Orzhov.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651522&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9d1d33-0ef0-41a6-94a8-899414c80054\', \'multiverseId\': 651522}, \'multiverseid\': 651522}, {\'name\': \'Obligation perpétuelle\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous son contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire avec un marqueur « devoir » sur elle. Tant que cette créature a un marqueur « devoir » sur elle, elle est incitée, elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un permanent que vous contrôlez et ne peut pas bloquer les créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La mort n\'exempte pas des dettes envers les Orzhov.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651561&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36685633-71f0-483d-8176-caaac6d646ab\', \'multiverseId\': 651561}, \'multiverseid\': 651561}, {\'name\': \'不死の債務\', \'text\': \'対戦相手の墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを債務カウンター１個が置かれた状態でそのプレイヤーのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーの上に債務カウンターがあり続けているかぎり、それは使嗾されており、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントを攻撃できず、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーをブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'オルゾフの借金は、死しても、一時の猶予も与えてくれない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f90a14-8aa9-4afe-9a93-7953f2a87a98\', \'multiverseId\': 651600}, \'multiverseid\': 651600}, {\'name\': \'不朽职责\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌在任一对手的操控下从其坟墓场放进战场，且上面有一个职责指示物。于该生物上有职责指示物的时段内，它为已煽惑，不能攻击你或由你操控的永久物，且不能阻挡由你操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'死亡也免除不了欠欧佐夫的债。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1485eb83-a7e8-454d-a6bd-90b0e3ebaebf\', \'multiverseId\': 651639}, \'multiverseid\': 651639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterwassergrab-Tempel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}: Bringe den Unterwassergrab-Tempel aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist es! Alle Kryptolithen zeigen hierhin!"\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650612&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1bef21d-4dcf-41d4-a205-f00de8fb8fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 650612}, \'multiverseid\': 650612}, {\'name\': \'Temple du cimetière marin\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3} : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagé, le Temple du cimetière marin depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est ici ! C\'est le lieu qu\'indiquent les cryptolithes ! »\\n—Jace Beleren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9ee2e8-f914-4e2d-8db5-089be107dbe6\', \'multiverseId\': 650871}, \'multiverseid\': 650871}, {\'name\': \'Tempio della Relittopoli\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia il Tempio della Relittopoli TAPpato dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci siamo! Tutti i criptoliti puntano in questa direzione!"\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5bf2a8-3832-43c6-bb0b-e03ca9576f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 651130}, \'multiverseid\': 651130}, {\'name\': \'溺墓の寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}：あなたの墓地にある溺墓の寺院をタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「これだ！謎の石はすべてここを向いているんだ！」\\n――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'283f0c76-f2e4-4571-a316-449c26a31149\', \'multiverseId\': 651389}, \'multiverseid\': 651389}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unverdächtige Ermittlerin\', \'text\': \'Verhandlungen — Immer wenn die Unverdächtige Ermittlerin angreift, deckt jeder Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Stelle für jede auf diese Weise aufgedeckte Nichtland-Karte Nachforschungen an. Dann zieht jeder Spieler eine Karte.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du alle Länder, die du kontrollierst, enttappen. Falls du dies tust, kannst du bis zu deinem nächsten Zug keine Zaubersprüche wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Detektiv\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4673296-5675-4829-bc38-65129d416113\', \'multiverseId\': 650016}, \'multiverseid\': 650016}, {\'name\': \'Chercheur inoffensif\', \'text\': "Pourparler — À chaque fois que le Chercheur inoffensif attaque, chaque joueur révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Pour chaque carte non-terrain révélée de cette manière, vous enquêtez. Chaque joueur pioche ensuite une carte.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez dégager tous les terrains que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, vous ne pouvez pas lancer de sorts jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — centaure et détective\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ff02de-a729-4984-af40-71138f63cf51\', \'multiverseId\': 650056}, \'multiverseid\': 650056}, {\'name\': \'Ricercatore Innocuo\', \'text\': "Negoziato — Ogniqualvolta il Ricercatore Innocuo attacca, ogni giocatore rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio. Per ogni carta non terra rivelata in questo modo, indaghi. Poi ogni giocatore pesca una carta.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi STAPpare tutte le terre che controlli. Se lo fai, non puoi lanciare magie fino al tuo prossimo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Detective Centauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5522d00-ab90-42e4-a541-b0d9077c2386\', \'multiverseId\': 650096}, \'multiverseid\': 650096}, {\'name\': \'無害の研究者\', \'text\': \'協議 ― 無害の研究者が攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。あなたは、これにより公開されて土地でないカード１枚につき１回調査を行う。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地をアンタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、次のあなたのターンまで、あなたは呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・探偵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'133e56c0-a7a9-43fb-9801-4c6bc154f840\', \'multiverseId\': 650136}, \'multiverseid\': 650136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Uralter Steingötze\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nDieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede angreifende Kreatur {1} weniger.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Uralte Steingötze stirbt, erzeuge einen 6/12 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b389df-bcdd-4130-9155-c9102bd76474\', \'multiverseId\': 650575}, \'multiverseid\': 650575}, {\'name\': \'Ancienne idole de pierre\', \'text\': "Flash\\nCe sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature attaquante.\\nPiétinement\\nQuand l\'Ancienne idole de pierre meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 6/12 incolore Construction avec le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61985dad-b014-4252-8748-6df9a177553a\', \'multiverseId\': 650834}, \'multiverseid\': 650834}, {\'name\': \'Idolo di Pietra Antico\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuesta magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura attaccante.\\nTravolgere\\nQuando l\'Idolo di Pietra Antico muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 6/12 incolore con travolgere.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42559eca-cb97-4944-8136-4bfae0238836\', \'multiverseId\': 651093}, \'multiverseid\': 651093}, {\'name\': \'古き石の偶像\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nこの呪文を唱えるためのコストは、攻撃クリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\nトランプル\\n古き石の偶像が死亡したとき、トランプルを持つ無色の６/12の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'827cb10f-2704-4330-98ea-152101cc69a2\', \'multiverseId\': 651352}, \'multiverseid\': 651352}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verborgener Drachentöter\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nMegamorph {2}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Megamorph-Kosten auf und lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nWenn der Verborgene Drachentöter aufgedeckt wird, zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc33121c-b353-428b-89b8-986943252915\', \'multiverseId\': 650422}, \'multiverseid\': 650422}, {\'name\': \'Tueur de dragon caché\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nMégamue {2}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mégamue et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nQuand le Tueur de dragon caché est retourné face visible, détruisez une créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4 qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650681&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89efb3f6-e27c-4486-83c4-ca5b93f7ca3f\', \'multiverseId\': 650681}, \'multiverseid\': 650681}, {\'name\': \'Ammazzadraghi Nascosto\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nMegamorfosi {2}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di megamorfosi e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nQuando l\'Ammazzadraghi Nascosto viene girato a faccia in su, distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4 controllata da un avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8323e920-9f73-4d27-ab38-cd2d947f0c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 650940}, \'multiverseid\': 650940}, {\'name\': \'隠れたる龍殺し\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n大変異{2}{W}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの大変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。そうしたなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n隠れたる龍殺しが表向きになったとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていてパワーが４以上であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21af7fd-6a3a-4b8e-b2d9-40b12bae3a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 651199}, \'multiverseid\': 651199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verkünder des Untergangs\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nBezahle 2 Lebenspunkte: Überwachen 2. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Der Klang jedes einzelnen verdrehten Geheimnisses verleitet dich, mehr hören zu wollen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650481&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57e8b2c4-d61c-4889-a0cb-baf1c113f8be\', \'multiverseId\': 650481}, \'multiverseid\': 650481}, {\'name\': \'Chuchoteur de mort\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nPayez 2 points de vie : Surveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Créature — cauchemar et démon\', \'flavor\': "Le son de chaque secret retors vous donne envie d\'en entendre un autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63fae9cd-0489-47df-bdc5-6e6e55933821\', \'multiverseId\': 650740}, \'multiverseid\': 650740}, {\'name\': \'Sussurratore del Fato\', \'text\': \'Volare, travolgere\\nPaga 2 punti vita: Sorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone Incubo\', \'flavor\': \'Il suono di ogni torbido segreto ti tenta ad ascoltarne un altro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce224a87-1d23-48ae-814d-c1de46786179\', \'multiverseId\': 650999}, \'multiverseid\': 650999}, {\'name\': \'破滅を囁くもの\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\n２点のライフを支払う：諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア・デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'奇妙な秘密の音は、もっと聞きたいという気持ちを呼び起こす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9852cd1-6145-49e6-a409-67c2bc21dec0\', \'multiverseId\': 651258}, \'multiverseid\': 651258}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verschleiernder Äther\', \'text\': \'Verdeckte Kreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\n{1}{G}: Verdecke den Verschleiernden Äther. (Er wird zu einer 2/2 Kreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6692ac13-97aa-4cb5-a386-61667a8de183\', \'multiverseId\': 650532}, \'multiverseid\': 650532}, {\'name\': \'Éther obscurcissant\', \'text\': "Les sorts de créature face cachée que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\n{1}{G} : Retournez l\'Éther obscurcissant face cachée. (Il devient une créature 2/2.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650791&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60c1b61d-3689-4815-8113-8738945b2da9\', \'multiverseId\': 650791}, \'multiverseid\': 650791}, {\'name\': \'Etere Offuscante\', \'text\': "Le magie creatura a faccia in giù che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\n{1}{G}: Gira l\'Etere Offuscante a faccia in giù. (Diventa una creatura 2/2.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fd8b499-0cdb-4b98-bf54-ad81d92b1b33\', \'multiverseId\': 651050}, \'multiverseid\': 651050}, {\'name\': \'遮る霊気\', \'text\': \'あなたが裏向きのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n{1}{G}：遮る霊気を裏向きにする。（これは２/２のクリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2d14a5a-3b55-498e-870f-8accc4cd4fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 651309}, \'multiverseid\': 651309}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verschleierter Aufstieg\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Verschleierte Aufstieg ins Spiel kommt, lege auf jede verdeckte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine Fliegend-Marke.\\nVerdeckte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, kommen mit einer Fliegend-Marke ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek tarnen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fb9b4ff-5b84-4289-b5ef-7b353ba77e25\', \'multiverseId\': 649996}, \'multiverseid\': 649996}, {\'name\': \'Ascension voilée\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Ascension voilée arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur « vol » sur chaque créature face cachée que vous contrôlez.\\nLes créatures face cachée que vous contrôlez arrivent sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « vol » sur elles.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez voiler la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650036&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e09123-4198-476b-baab-37c3b0e633b5\', \'multiverseId\': 650036}, \'multiverseid\': 650036}, {\'name\': \'Ascensione Velata\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Ascensione Velata entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino volare su ogni creatura a faccia in giù che controlli.\\nLe creature a faccia in giù che controlli entrano nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino volare.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi celare la prima carta del tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6467232d-74d4-4f48-ad64-77359eea3c82\', \'multiverseId\': 650076}, \'multiverseid\': 650076}, {\'name\': \'仮装の昇天\', \'text\': \'仮装の昇天が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて裏向きである各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ飛行カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて裏向きであるすべてのクリーチャーは、飛行カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c870e39c-d748-4627-9484-cbcc7d0401f9\', \'multiverseId\': 650116}, \'multiverseid\': 650116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verschleierter Aufstieg\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Verschleierte Aufstieg ins Spiel kommt, lege auf jede verdeckte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine Fliegend-Marke.\\nVerdeckte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, kommen mit einer Fliegend-Marke ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek tarnen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4166341-8b01-4c80-b60e-c38f9855fcc8\', \'multiverseId\': 651530}, \'multiverseid\': 651530}, {\'name\': \'Ascension voilée\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Ascension voilée arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur « vol » sur chaque créature face cachée que vous contrôlez.\\nLes créatures face cachée que vous contrôlez arrivent sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « vol » sur elles.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez voiler la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651569&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'891f2afe-af5b-4af8-8795-78dfa0418a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 651569}, \'multiverseid\': 651569}, {\'name\': \'仮装の昇天\', \'text\': \'仮装の昇天が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて裏向きである各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ飛行カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて裏向きであるすべてのクリーチャーは、飛行カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を偽装してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0023888d-ee77-4482-95f1-6ac71cd8704a\', \'multiverseId\': 651608}, \'multiverseid\': 651608}, {\'name\': \'蒙纱飞升\', \'text\': \'当蒙纱飞升进战场时，在每个由你操控且牌面朝下的生物上各放置一个飞行指示物。\\n由你操控且牌面朝下的生物进战场时上面有一个飞行指示物。\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以匿伏你的牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40912b61-1701-47ae-bfee-573d7cb31ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 651647}, \'multiverseid\': 651647}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verseuchtes Eiland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du einen Sumpf kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650653&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d36d5234-8756-44f9-bd5d-761495fe3f91\', \'multiverseId\': 650653}, \'multiverseid\': 650653}, {\'name\': \'Île souillée\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez un marais.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a38da5c-cb21-4f50-8336-b56e524388e7\', \'multiverseId\': 650912}, \'multiverseid\': 650912}, {\'name\': \'Isola Contaminata\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}. Attiva solo se controlli una Palude.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52196817-af84-476b-982e-721089a687b9\', \'multiverseId\': 651171}, \'multiverseid\': 651171}, {\'name\': \'汚れた島\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。あなたが沼をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509acc30-60c7-4124-8fcc-552b9cc67258\', \'multiverseId\': 651430}, \'multiverseid\': 651430}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstoß gegen die Etikette\', \'text\': \'Stachle alle Kreaturen an, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen jene Kreaturen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greifen einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Und dabei hatte der Abend so gut angefangen …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acf8bb5c-f85a-4fe7-a9e5-85609b16ceb5\', \'multiverseId\': 650504}, \'multiverseid\': 650504}, {\'name\': \'Bouleversement des convenances\', \'text\': "Incitez toutes les créatures que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible et attaquent un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les banquets et la politique ne font pas bon ménage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650763&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd03250-1ea4-45aa-b37d-47791da1df7e\', \'multiverseId\': 650763}, \'multiverseid\': 650763}, {\'name\': \'Trasgredire al Galateo\', \'text\': \'Sprona tutte le creature che non controlli. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature attaccano in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se possono farlo.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Mai portare a tavola la politica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f599fc54-995c-490a-9907-ab57b9bd036b\', \'multiverseId\': 651022}, \'multiverseid\': 651022}, {\'name\': \'礼儀妨害\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないすべてのクリーチャーを使嗾する。（次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーは、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'食事に政治を持ち込むべからず。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c9ca158-602f-4d96-acf7-2259224aa683\', \'multiverseId\': 651281}, \'multiverseid\': 651281}]', "[{'name': 'Verstreute Haine', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDie Verstreuten Haine kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Wald, Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650639&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55877299-d776-4439-8844-349d9bb1f247', 'multiverseId': 650639}, 'multiverseid': 650639}, {'name': 'Bosquets épars', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLes Bosquets épars arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain — forêt et plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650898&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94b54bdd-377a-4e29-9174-2100e4f3b490', 'multiverseId': 650898}, 'multiverseid': 650898}, {'name': 'Selve Diradate', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.)\\nLe Selve Diradate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Foresta Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651157&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf401826-a8ea-4341-9158-6aec8ba50cf9', 'multiverseId': 651157}, 'multiverseid': 651157}, {'name': 'まばらな木立ち', 'text': '（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nまばらな木立ちはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング {2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 森・平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651416&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16d5c72a-45db-4153-b774-2a3cfd6d7056', 'multiverseId': 651416}, 'multiverseid': 651416}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verstärkte Überwachung\', \'text\': \'Bei jedem Anwenden von Überwachen kannst du dir zwei zusätzliche Karten ansehen.\\nSchicke die Verstärkte Überwachung ins Exil: Mische deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer sind die Agenten von Dimir? Niemand und jeder."\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650455&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce032570-e9b8-4e24-9ef6-044fd756c321\', \'multiverseId\': 650455}, \'multiverseid\': 650455}, {\'name\': \'Surveillance accrue\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez regarder deux cartes supplémentaires à chaque fois que vous surveillez.\\nExilez la Surveillance accrue : Mélangez votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Qui sont les agents de Dimir ? Personne et tout le monde. »\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650714&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a85c4875-f1d9-4643-8826-d77eaac72adc\', \'multiverseId\': 650714}, \'multiverseid\': 650714}, {\'name\': \'Sorveglianza Rafforzata\', \'text\': \'Puoi guardare due carte addizionali ogni volta che sorvegli.\\nEsilia la Sorveglianza Rafforzata: Rimescola il tuo cimitero nel tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi sono gli agenti dei Dimir? Tutti e nessuno."\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f39dda-1bab-49dc-84f4-cb36308d872d\', \'multiverseId\': 650973}, \'multiverseid\': 650973}, {\'name\': \'諜報強化\', \'text\': \'あなたが行う各諜報で、追加でカード２枚を見てもよい。\\n諜報強化を追放する：あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ディミーアの工作員は誰か。誰でもないし、誰でもある。」\\n――ラザーヴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e36ee0-c45f-413f-9829-7ca08a1f0853\', \'multiverseId\': 651232}, \'multiverseid\': 651232}]', "[{'name': 'Versunkener Talkessel', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.)\\nDer Versunkene Talkessel kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Sumpf', 'flavor': 'Auf dem Kontinent Tazeem stürzen rauschende Ströme enge Schluchten hinab, in nebelverhangene Seen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650652&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39be4202-67ef-4e14-987f-26e7beacca2b', 'multiverseId': 650652}, 'multiverseid': 650652}, {'name': 'Dépression engloutie', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.)\\nLa Dépression engloutie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain — île et marais', 'flavor': 'Sur le continent de Tazeem, les eaux tumultueuses passent dans des gorges étroites et se jettent dans des lacs embrumés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650911&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b33b990d-4f44-4947-83a2-1550e819962b', 'multiverseId': 650911}, 'multiverseid': 650911}, {'name': 'Conca Infossata', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Conca Infossata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Palude', 'flavor': 'Sul continente di Tazeem, acque impetuose si tuffano attraverso strette gole in laghi ammantati di nebbia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651170&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '483f59fa-5ef4-42a8-bef1-fd96a2f9cf03', 'multiverseId': 651170}, 'multiverseid': 651170}, {'name': '窪み渓谷', 'text': '（{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、窪み渓谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 島・沼', 'flavor': 'タジーム大陸の急流は、狭い渓谷を抜けると霧に覆われた湖へと流れ込む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651429&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10c98c7e-7d01-4599-b5cc-0b9ebbaeb7e2', 'multiverseId': 651429}, 'multiverseid': 651429}]", "[{'name': 'Verweste Tümpel', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.)\\nDie Verwesten Tümpel kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Sumpf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650614&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7ac896e-fdff-455e-b573-8b1906f59c33', 'multiverseId': 650614}, 'multiverseid': 650614}, {'name': 'Bassins fétides', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.)\\nLes Bassins fétides arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain — île et marais', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650873&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3e7520b-50f7-4963-817a-7bfaa7eb2cbb', 'multiverseId': 650873}, 'multiverseid': 650873}, {'name': 'Pozze Fetide', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.)\\nLe Pozze Fetide entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Palude', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651132&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f1fe663-c0e2-421e-9675-8fb984de5c97', 'multiverseId': 651132}, 'multiverseid': 651132}, {'name': '異臭の池', 'text': '（{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。）\\n異臭の池はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 島・沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651391&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50f04444-4d1e-46c0-96f2-e4006474144d', 'multiverseId': 651391}, 'multiverseid': 651391}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vitale Kaverne\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nMorph {2} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In ihr lebt nichts, aber trotzdem ist Leben da.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650664&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70cb405e-a38e-4775-a12b-7330078c7fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 650664}, \'multiverseid\': 650664}, {\'name\': \'Caverne zoécite\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nMue {2} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Rien ne vit en elle, et pourtant la vie l\'habite.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df36d8bf-fa65-4bce-8577-c1aa107d3b40\', \'multiverseId\': 650923}, \'multiverseid\': 650923}, {\'name\': \'Caverna Zootica\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\nMetamorfosi {2} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Nulla vive al suo interno, eppure c\'è vita.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96317065-a03f-43a7-b9b4-83338adae537\', \'multiverseId\': 651182}, \'multiverseid\': 651182}, {\'name\': \'生けるものの洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n変異{2}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'中には何もいないが、そこには生命がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0c463ea-2114-440a-b3f1-8a0bad31c22b\', \'multiverseId\': 651441}, \'multiverseid\': 651441}]', "[{'name': 'Wachsamer Nantuko', 'text': 'Morph {1}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Wachsame Nantuko aufgedeckt wird, zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt, Druide, Mutant', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650530&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66d7c67c-ab75-4264-b9d4-222927ec88f6', 'multiverseId': 650530}, 'multiverseid': 650530}, {'name': 'Vigilant nantuko', 'text': 'Mue {1}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Vigilant nantuko est retourné face visible, détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement.', 'type': 'Créature — insecte et druide et mutant', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650789&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40ee2948-6e30-4760-b0f9-d31bc0f2276c', 'multiverseId': 650789}, 'multiverseid': 650789}, {'name': 'Vigilante Nantuko', 'text': 'Metamorfosi {1}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Vigilante Nantuko viene girato a faccia in su, distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mutante Druido Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651048&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd2af64a-c039-41f4-84db-e7bcc28bda9c', 'multiverseId': 651048}, 'multiverseid': 651048}, {'name': 'ナントゥーコ自警団', 'text': '変異{1}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\\nナントゥーコ自警団が表向きになったとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントである１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ドルイド・ミュータント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651307&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d9bf043-d3c6-412b-88ee-4780c1254f8a', 'multiverseId': 651307}, 'multiverseid': 651307}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wahre Identität\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Wahre Identität oder ein anderes Permanent, das du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, wende Hellsicht 1 an und ziehe dann eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\nVerkleidung {W} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur mit Abwehr {2} wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Verkleidungskosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=649994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d75dbdc-399f-4eec-9daa-2d06085fb520\', \'multiverseId\': 649994}, \'multiverseid\': 649994}, {\'name\': \'Véritable identité\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Véritable identité ou qu\'un autre permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, regard 1, puis piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\nDéguisement {W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée pour {3} comme une créature 2/2 avec parade {2}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de déguisement.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650034&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca5cdb69-f5a0-4d06-9667-e684f06a21db\', \'multiverseId\': 650034}, \'multiverseid\': 650034}, {\'name\': \'Identità Reale\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Identità Reale o un altro permanente che controlli viene girato a faccia in su, profetizza 1, poi pesca una carta. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\\nCamuffare {W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 con egida {2} pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di camuffare.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e96141a-5df5-4079-9044-9f11b475691c\', \'multiverseId\': 650074}, \'multiverseid\': 650074}, {\'name\': \'真の姿\', \'text\': \'真の姿、またはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないパーマネント１つが表向きになるたび、占術１を行い、その後、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\n変装{W}（このカードを、{3}で護法{2}を持つ２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変装コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21235982-a413-4c77-8175-8faeca33293e\', \'multiverseId\': 650114}, \'multiverseid\': 650114}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wahre Identität\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Wahre Identität oder ein anderes Permanent, das du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, wende Hellsicht 1 an und ziehe dann eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\nVerkleidung {W}\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec29f742-6697-46d8-bf9a-4b9e436ac409\', \'multiverseId\': 651528}, \'multiverseid\': 651528}, {\'name\': \'Véritable identité\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Véritable identité ou qu\'un autre permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, regard 1, puis piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\nDéguisement {W}", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651567&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebe1785-b266-40f9-a7da-878d1f6c4dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 651567}, \'multiverseid\': 651567}, {\'name\': \'真の姿\', \'text\': \'真の姿、またはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないパーマネント１つが表向きになるたび、占術１を行い、その後、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\n変装{W}\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45a5817-0572-453b-9f79-68256d83455d\', \'multiverseId\': 651606}, \'multiverseid\': 651606}, {\'name\': \'真实身份\', \'text\': \'每当真实身份或另一个由你操控的永久物翻回正面时，占卜1，然后抓一张牌。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\\n伪装{W}\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72b06e16-024d-439d-8983-b95fd310a041\', \'multiverseId\': 651645}, \'multiverseid\': 651645}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weg ins Exil\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650431&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'641a8e0b-bb3a-4691-a777-53f37dfaf5bf\', \'multiverseId\': 650431}, \'multiverseid\': 650431}, {\'name\': "Chemin vers l\'exil", \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650690&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c07ccc1c-3983-48c3-ab4d-3eea044f4007\', \'multiverseId\': 650690}, \'multiverseid\': 650690}, {\'name\': "Sentiero dell\'Esilio", \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore può passare in rassegna il proprio grimorio per una carta terra base, mettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5642a23-483d-4786-8107-1a5dd5205f93\', \'multiverseId\': 650949}, \'multiverseid\': 650949}, {\'name\': \'流刑への道\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49a854db-f16b-470f-a449-6fee1beb0bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 651208}, \'multiverseid\': 651208}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wellenstöberer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Wellenstöberer ins Spiel kommt, stelle zweimal Nachforschungen an. (Um Nachforschungen anzustellen, erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nHerbeirufen {G}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64527df3-0c19-4892-9e2e-03271ec1f22a\', \'multiverseId\': 650573}, \'multiverseid\': 650573}, {\'name\': \'Tamiseur de vagues\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Tamiseur de vagues arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez deux fois. (Pour enquêter, créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nÉvocation {G}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc86a9e-c356-4e42-bb82-3677ad8eed4a\', \'multiverseId\': 650832}, \'multiverseid\': 650832}, {\'name\': \'Setacciaonde\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Setacciaonde entra nel campo di battaglia, indaga due volte. (Per indagare, crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nApparire {G}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f5f688-0ffb-44cc-8bf7-9988bdf46a1f\', \'multiverseId\': 651091}, \'multiverseid\': 651091}, {\'name\': \'波ふるい\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n波ふるいが戦場に出たとき、２回調査を行う。（調査を行うとは、手掛かり・トークン１つを生成することである。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n想起{G}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98cccde-239a-40de-9b01-4ec85aea4c46\', \'multiverseId\': 651350}, \'multiverseid\': 651350}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wesirin der vielen Gesichter\', \'text\': \'Du kannst die Wesirin der vielen Gesichter als eine Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass, falls sie einbalsamiert wurde, der Kreaturenspielstein keine Manakosten hat, weiß und zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Zombie ist.\\nEinbalsamieren {3}{U}{U}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0e9466-17ef-4e80-9156-840edc982180\', \'multiverseId\': 650476}, \'multiverseid\': 650476}, {\'name\': \'Vizir aux nombreux visages\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que le Vizir aux nombreux visages arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté que si le Vizir aux nombreux visages a été embaumé, le jeton n\'a pas de coût de mana, est blanc et c\'est un zombie en plus de ses autres types.\\nEmbaumement {3}{U}{U}", \'type\': \'Créature — changeforme et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'126895fe-5d38-454f-bfa5-bc7ec82950f0\', \'multiverseId\': 650735}, \'multiverseid\': 650735}, {\'name\': \'Visir dei Molti Volti\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare la Visir dei Molti Volti nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che, se la Visir dei Molti Volti è stata imbalsamata, la pedina non ha un costo di mana, è bianca ed è uno Zombie in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nImbalsamare {3}{U}{U}\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c2b0de5-ddc9-4557-bf52-b4e419af5ce6\', \'multiverseId\': 650994}, \'multiverseid\': 650994}, {\'name\': \'多面相の侍臣\', \'text\': \'多面相の侍臣が不朽を行われていたなら、このトークンを、マナ・コストを持たず、白であり、他のタイプに加えてゾンビであることを除き、戦場にありこれでないクリーチャー１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。そうでないなら、これを戦場にありこれでないクリーチャー１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\\n不朽{3}{U}{U}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d5467e9-51d5-4198-843e-dd918a2db1c8\', \'multiverseId\': 651253}, \'multiverseid\': 651253}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wilde Renaturierung\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments enttappst du alle Länder, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Mauern bersten. Gebäude stürzen ein. Die Wildnis kehrt immer zurück."\\n—Domri Rade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21968a23-f3ac-4a33-aa0f-f25c356d463e\', \'multiverseId\': 650549}, \'multiverseid\': 650549}, {\'name\': \'Reboisement des régions reculées\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, dégagez tous les terrains que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les murs se fendent. Les édifices s\'écroulent. La nature reprend toujours ses droits. »\\n—Domri Rade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39a4d257-6475-4505-bfcc-3744853e37e7\', \'multiverseId\': 650808}, \'multiverseid\': 650808}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicazione delle Terre Selvagge\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, STAPpa tutte le terre che controlli.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I muri si spezzano, gli edifici crollano, le terre selvagge riescono sempre a tornare."\\n—Domri Rade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b49acf58-757e-4dcb-a2c4-b025080b556d\', \'multiverseId\': 651067}, \'multiverseid\': 651067}, {\'name\': \'荒野の再生\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「壁は割れ、建物は崩れる。いつでも自然が帰ってくる。」\\n――ドムリ・ラーデ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c8c31ba-f7e9-4000-99d0-b28d06cf6c72\', \'multiverseId\': 651326}, \'multiverseid\': 651326}]', "[{'name': 'Wildpfad', 'text': 'Sowie der Wildpfad ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Gebirge- oder Wald-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Wildpfad getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650617&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1443eb5-f343-4f61-9a93-b1674c923826', 'multiverseId': 650617}, 'multiverseid': 650617}, {'name': 'Piste du gibier', 'text': 'Au moment où la Piste du gibier arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de montagne ou de forêt de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, la Piste du gibier arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650876&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b996a157-888e-469d-94ff-a7126f2de9c3', 'multiverseId': 650876}, 'multiverseid': 650876}, {'name': 'Pista della Preda', 'text': 'Mentre la Pista della Preda entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Montagna o Foresta dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, la Pista della Preda entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651135&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f0392e4-f713-4cfc-a6aa-894fe9dbdb43', 'multiverseId': 651135}, 'multiverseid': 651135}, {'name': '獲物道', 'text': '獲物道が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの手札にあり山や森であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、獲物道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651394&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'adcc94b3-1316-4b2d-a2cc-73fa449d4fc6', 'multiverseId': 651394}, 'multiverseid': 651394}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wildwuchs\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher zusätzlich {G}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du stehenbleibst, um zu lauschen, kannst du es wachsen hören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f8139f-77c9-42be-8917-6e53cd41d2c4\', \'multiverseId\': 650548}, \'multiverseid\': 650548}, {\'name\': \'Végétation luxuriante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute un {G} supplémentaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "Si vous vous arrêtez pour écouter, vous l\'entendrez grandir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3198faa-8aa4-437f-8a9e-48cd1ddeb617\', \'multiverseId\': 650807}, \'multiverseid\': 650807}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Rigogliosa\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge {G} addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Se ti fermi ad ascoltare, puoi sentirlo crescere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a45e4e7f-38ec-4a89-ab59-63dc66268a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 651066}, \'multiverseid\': 651066}, {\'name\': \'繁茂\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントしている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加で{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'耳をすましてよく聞けば、それが成長している音が聞こえるよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca78d17-4173-4edd-b1b5-86eafbe0544d\', \'multiverseId\': 651325}, \'multiverseid\': 651325}]', "[{'name': 'Wirbler-Räuberin', 'text': 'Wenn die Wirbler-Räuberin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650477&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46923322-ae51-47c7-bca6-4aaa48e8c5bd', 'multiverseId': 650477}, 'multiverseid': 650477}, {'name': 'Gredine à voltigeurs', 'text': 'Quand la Gredine à voltigeurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\nEngagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature — humain et gredin et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650736&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23c9df53-6279-4f76-a79c-fda3a99a3b44', 'multiverseId': 650736}, 'multiverseid': 650736}, {'name': 'Canaglia dei Turbinanti', 'text': 'Quando la Canaglia dei Turbinanti entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.\\nTAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Artefice Farabutto Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650995&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17772a91-b249-471c-9a8e-b399d96507ea', 'multiverseId': 650995}, 'multiverseid': 650995}, {'name': 'つむじ風のならず者', 'text': 'つむじ風のならず者が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるアーティファクト２つをタップする：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651254&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '070bed4b-393e-4a3f-967c-ddaa4ebfef6f', 'multiverseId': 651254}, 'multiverseid': 651254}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wissen ist Macht\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Erzittere, Verbrecher, vor der überwältigenden Macht der akribisch zusammengestellten Beweise!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'047e0661-c0f3-4246-ad11-ee4d5f204ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 650020}, \'multiverseid\': 650020}, {\'name\': "Savoir, c\'est pouvoir", \'text\': \'Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X, X étant le nombre de cartes que vous avez piochées ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Tremble, criminel, devant la puissance écrasante de preuves méticuleusement ordonnées ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650060&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d964f57-df57-43e4-9565-22ab10e9cb5b\', \'multiverseId\': 650060}, \'multiverseid\': 650060}, {\'name\': \'La Conoscenza è Potere\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +X/+X, dove X è il numero di carte che hai pescato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tremate, criminali, di fronte alla soverchiante potenza degli indizi organizzati con diligenza!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada125bc-c070-44be-9155-2c9c6a3cb314\', \'multiverseId\': 650100}, \'multiverseid\': 650100}, {\'name\': \'知識は力なり\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは、あなたがこのターンに引いたカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「罪人よ、用意周到に揃えた証拠を前に震えるがよい！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117f720a-cd2e-4879-bd47-a22549bfae6f\', \'multiverseId\': 650140}, \'multiverseid\': 650140}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wissen ist Macht\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Erzittere, Verbrecher, vor der überwältigenden Macht der akribisch zusammengestellten Beweise!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc3e209b-b40a-4a61-8e78-d0470dae9693\', \'multiverseId\': 651553}, \'multiverseid\': 651553}, {\'name\': "Savoir, c\'est pouvoir", \'text\': \'Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X, X étant le nombre de cartes que vous avez piochées ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Tremble, criminel, devant la puissance écrasante de preuves méticuleusement ordonnées ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba01e43e-c6b4-4a36-b7ab-603797b30345\', \'multiverseId\': 651592}, \'multiverseid\': 651592}, {\'name\': \'知識は力なり\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは、あなたがこのターンに引いたカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「罪人よ、用意周到に揃えた証拠を前に震えるがよい！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e44eb42-7bf5-4eae-8a1f-8c72e6c81499\', \'multiverseId\': 651631}, \'multiverseid\': 651631}, {\'name\': \'积识储力\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+X/+X，X为你本回合已抓的牌数量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「在事无巨细认真整理之充分证据带来的巨量震撼面前颤抖吧，罪犯！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16501851-b5af-428c-bd92-f34e2f3f5ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 651670}, \'multiverseid\': 651670}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wolfspfad in Kessig\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn ein Werwolf sich zum ersten Mal verwandelt, kann man sein erstes Heulen bis zum Monduntergang durch die Wildnis hören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650622&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01d34c4d-e244-43fa-baae-8654b9b5ea66\', \'multiverseId\': 650622}, \'multiverseid\': 650622}, {\'name\': \'Garenne au Loup de Kessig\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T} : Une créature ciblée gagne +X/+0 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Quand un loup-garou se transforme pour la première fois, on dit que son premier hurlement résonne dans la nature jusqu\'au coucher de la lune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650881&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4b8295a-3ad3-4ba5-bf72-24a41d580243\', \'multiverseId\': 650881}, \'multiverseid\': 650881}, {\'name\': \'Riserva dei Lupi di Kessig\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +X/+0 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Si narra che, quando un lupo mannaro si trasforma per la prima volta, il suo primo ululato riecheggi nei territori selvaggi fino al tramonto della luna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05296999-82c8-4a09-85a3-b99e6e73c322\', \'multiverseId\': 651140}, \'multiverseid\': 651140}, {\'name\': \'ケッシグの狼の地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'人狼が初めて変身した時、最初の遠吠えは月が沈むまで荒野に響き続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1689af3-b5f3-434b-92c3-400f4e82e4b4\', \'multiverseId\': 651399}, \'multiverseid\': 651399}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wurzelelementar\', \'text\': \'Morph {5}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn das Wurzelelementar aufgedeckt wird, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e19ee4b-184a-46f8-af78-67c2c8469e05\', \'multiverseId\': 650535}, \'multiverseid\': 650535}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de racines\', \'text\': "Mue {5}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand l\'Élémental de racines est retourné face visible, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650794&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a2e185-106c-4061-93de-29d734ebd724\', \'multiverseId\': 650794}, \'multiverseid\': 650794}, {\'name\': \'Elementale della Radice\', \'text\': "Metamorfosi {5}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando l\'Elementale della Radice viene girato a faccia in su, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dalla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a97c07a-c435-460f-a81e-65e198c61d04\', \'multiverseId\': 651053}, \'multiverseid\': 651053}, {\'name\': \'根の精霊\', \'text\': \'変異{5}{G}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２のクリーチャーとして裏向きで唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、いつでもこれを表向きにしてよい。）\\n根の精霊が表向きになったとき、あなたの手札にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e441148b-54fd-40c7-b20c-587b347d0bf0\', \'multiverseId\': 651312}, \'multiverseid\': 651312}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächter der Stunden\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Abwehr {3}\\nImmer wenn du eine Zeitmarke vom Wächter der Stunden entfernst, während er im Exil ist, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\nAussetzen 6 — {1}{U} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {1}{U} bezahlen und sie mit sechs Zeitmarken ins Exil schicken. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, kannst du sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Sie hat Eile.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2bfdc39-8f57-4f9e-b871-10afeaee0cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 650003}, \'multiverseid\': 650003}, {\'name\': \'Gardien des heures\', \'text\': "Vol, parade {3}\\nÀ chaque fois que vous retirez un marqueur « temps » du Gardien des heures pendant qu\'il est exilé, surveillez 1.\\nSuspension 6 — {1}{U} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {1}{U} et l\'exiler avec six marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Elle a la célérité.)", \'type\': \'Créature — sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650043&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a8773d-9eb1-45bb-91df-c523b3be0fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 650043}, \'multiverseid\': 650043}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano delle Ore\', \'text\': "Volare, egida {3}\\nOgniqualvolta rimuovi un segnalino tempo dal Guardiano delle Ore mentre è esiliato, sorveglia 1.\\nSospendere 6—{1}{U} (Invece di lanciare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {1}{U} ed esiliarla con sei segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, puoi lanciare la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Ha rapidità.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f0c7cad-5de8-48f1-9329-0af233429fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 650083}, \'multiverseid\': 650083}, {\'name\': \'時の見張り\', \'text\': \'飛行、護法{3}\\n時の見張りが追放されている間にあなたがこれの上から時間カウンター１個を取り除くたび、諜報１を行う。\\n待機６―{1}{U}（あなたの手札にあるこのカードを唱えるのではなく、{1}{U}を支払って時間カウンター６個を置いた状態で追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これは速攻を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0731d2f7-e40a-4362-a3f6-eab7dcfa9504\', \'multiverseId\': 650123}, \'multiverseid\': 650123}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächter der Stunden\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Abwehr {3}\\nImmer wenn du eine Zeitmarke vom Wächter der Stunden entfernst, während er im Exil ist, wende Überwachen 1 an.\\nAussetzen 6 — {1}{U}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f3018d-1f26-4a9a-8da6-d60aa825e0fb\', \'multiverseId\': 651536}, \'multiverseid\': 651536}, {\'name\': \'Gardien des heures\', \'text\': "Vol, parade {3}\\nÀ chaque fois que vous retirez un marqueur « temps » du Gardien des heures pendant qu\'il est exilé, surveillez 1.\\nSuspension 6 — {1}{U}", \'type\': \'Créature — sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae334fe8-ee78-4fcc-8220-c76053792936\', \'multiverseId\': 651575}, \'multiverseid\': 651575}, {\'name\': \'時の見張り\', \'text\': \'飛行、護法{3}\\n時の見張りが追放されている間にあなたがこれの上から時間カウンター１個を取り除くたび、諜報１を行う。\\n待機６―{1}{U}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df66d637-f8c5-4479-a9b6-5bbf3e155682\', \'multiverseId\': 651614}, \'multiverseid\': 651614}, {\'name\': \'护时史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飞行，守护{3}\\n每当你于护时史芬斯被放逐期间从其上移去一个计时指示物时，刺探1。\\n延缓6～{1}{U}\', \'type\': \'生物 — 史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c2d4d0-4b58-4913-a113-b40eb5e2a8ba\', \'multiverseId\': 651653}, \'multiverseid\': 651653}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yedora die Friedhofsgärtnerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du sie verdeckt unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurückbringen. Sie ist ein Wald-Land. (Sie hat keine anderen Typen oder Fähigkeiten.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Baumhirte, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst im Tod hören wir nie auf zu wachsen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7f8069-d2ea-48d0-9e7a-8d3a1519f15e\', \'multiverseId\': 650550}, \'multiverseid\': 650550}, {\'name\': \'Yedora, jardinière des tombes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez la renvoyer sur le champ de bataille face cachée sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. C\'est un terrain Forêt. (Il n\'a pas d\'autres types ou capacités.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — sylvin et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Même dans la mort, nous n\'arrêtons jamais de grandir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb1d3e01-1650-474f-a0d6-89591738782a\', \'multiverseId\': 650809}, \'multiverseid\': 650809}, {\'name\': \'Yedora, Giardiniera dei Sepolcri\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina che controlli muore, puoi rimetterla sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. È una terra Foresta. (Non ha altri tipi o abilità.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'"Persino nella morte, non smettiamo mai di crescere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfdde9b2-c8b5-431e-8970-e93b263c9b0d\', \'multiverseId\': 651068}, \'multiverseid\': 651068}, {\'name\': \'霊園の庭師、イェドラ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたはそれをオーナーのコントロール下で裏向きで戦場に戻してもよい。それは森・土地である。（それは他のタイプや能力を持たない。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「死んだ後も我々は成長を止めない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0a5ec2-79c0-4899-9182-ee6bc2f08fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 651327}, \'multiverseid\': 651327}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zenit der Schwarzen Sonne\', \'text\': \'Lege auf jede Kreatur X -1/-1-Marken. Mische den Zenit der Schwarzen Sonne in die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Unter den Sonnen geht Mirrodin in die Knie und bettelt uns nach Perfektion an."\\n—Geth, Fürst der Gruft\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650479&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e396e16b-b818-45f6-ae33-b5230bdc6b51\', \'multiverseId\': 650479}, \'multiverseid\': 650479}, {\'name\': \'Zénith de Noirsoleil\', \'text\': \'Mettez X marqueurs -1/-1 sur chaque créature. Mélangez le Zénith de Noirsoleil dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Sous les soleils, Mirrodin se prosterne et nous supplie de lui apporter la perfection. »\\n—Geth, seigneur du Caveau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc5aef17-0a5a-4b40-a762-f67f03c82775\', \'multiverseId\': 650738}, \'multiverseid\': 650738}, {\'name\': \'Zenit del Sole Nero\', \'text\': \'Metti X segnalini -1/-1 su ogni creatura. Rimescola lo Zenit del Sole Nero nel grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sotto i soli, Mirrodin si inginocchia e ci supplica di mostrargli la perfezione."\\n—Geth, Signore della Cripta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'767148a7-5f60-415f-8b09-2c22fcf6b9c0\', \'multiverseId\': 650997}, \'multiverseid\': 650997}, {\'name\': \'黒の太陽の頂点\', \'text\': \'各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、－１/－１カウンターＸ個を置く。黒の太陽の頂点をオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この太陽の下で、ミラディンはひざまずき完成を請うであろう。」\\n――大霊堂の王、ゲス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d0fa3f5-edaf-4b02-a021-def5c5bd6837\', \'multiverseId\': 651256}, \'multiverseid\': 651256}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zornesruh-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Zornesruh-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Gebirge- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Zornesruh-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein kochender Sammelpunkt ehrfürchtigen Zorns.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37adfae9-c155-410a-b1e4-a924c61ea21d\', \'multiverseId\': 650616}, \'multiverseid\': 650616}, {\'name\': \'Lacis calmerage\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Lacis calmerage arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de montagne ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis calmerage arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Un lacis calmant de rage révérende.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bac8e8f2-6395-4bc8-8406-87810241c485\', \'multiverseId\': 650875}, \'multiverseid\': 650875}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Furiacalma\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Furiacalma entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Montagna o Pianura dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Furiacalma entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un furioso fulcro di rabbia riverente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0adecdbf-f84b-438f-bc69-564904f719a6\', \'multiverseId\': 651134}, \'multiverseid\': 651134}, {\'name\': \'怒静の交錯\', \'text\': \'怒静の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの手札にあり山や平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、怒静の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'恭しき怒りが逆巻く座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'869b6720-de93-4e17-8742-dacac785df66\', \'multiverseId\': 651393}, \'multiverseid\': 651393}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zugangstunnel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder weniger kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Oriq-Agenten halten sich in den dunklen Winkeln von Arcavios auf, unerkannt und doch allgegenwärtig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650600&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f74eed58-ace3-4818-af3d-497de63e86a4\', \'multiverseId\': 650600}, \'multiverseid\': 650600}, {\'name\': "Tunnel d\'accès", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T} : Une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 3 ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les agents de l\'Oriq restent dans les recoins les plus sombres d\'Arcavios, invisibles, mais omniprésents.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b437715-3ec4-4009-b31f-868777ed3d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 650859}, \'multiverseid\': 650859}, {\'name\': "Tunnel d\'Accesso", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 3 non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Gli agenti Oriq si celano negli angoli bui di Arcavios, inosservati ma sempre presenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4dccfd-32e6-4b78-9f23-8202338ace67\', \'multiverseId\': 651118}, \'multiverseid\': 651118}, {\'name\': \'接続トンネル\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：パワーが３以下であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オリークの手先はアルケヴィオス中の暗い隅にいる。人目につかないが常に存在している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba6d612-cf55-4b7a-9f68-6198261046ee\', \'multiverseId\': 651377}, \'multiverseid\': 651377}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zunderwald-Lichtung\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.)\\nDie Zunderwald-Lichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Gebirge, Wald\', \'flavor\': \'Auf dem vulkanischen Kontinent Akoum ragen bizarre Gewächse, Gasschlote und zerklüftete Berggipfel hoch in die Lüfte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcbf2eab-ec79-4a21-a903-842854bd5963\', \'multiverseId\': 650608}, \'multiverseid\': 650608}, {\'name\': \'Clairière de scories\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.)\\nLa Clairière de scories arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — montagne et forêt\', \'flavor\': "Sur le continent volcanique d\'Akoum, d\'étranges végétaux s\'amassent autour des fissures de gaz et les pics irréguliers de la montagne se dressent haut dans le ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e9e46e4-407d-40b8-9e8b-48f3b9f55a20\', \'multiverseId\': 650867}, \'multiverseid\': 650867}, {\'name\': \'Radura delle Braci\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.)\\nLa Radura delle Braci entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Montagna Foresta\', \'flavor\': "Nel continente vulcanico di Akoum, la bizzarra vegetazione si ammassa attorno agli sfiatatoi di gas, mentre frastagliati picchi montuosi s\'innalzano verso il cielo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9662af1f-aa4e-499d-aa50-6c04b34f7b28\', \'multiverseId\': 651126}, \'multiverseid\': 651126}, {\'name\': \'燃えがらの林間地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燃えがらの林間地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 山・森\', \'flavor\': \'火山の大陸アクームでは、噴気孔の周囲に奇妙な植生が見られる。空高くギザギザの山頂もそびえている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9652b769-a225-43e1-af6a-47261e34b71d\', \'multiverseId\': 651385}, \'multiverseid\': 651385}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ältester des Sakura-Stamms\', \'text\': \'Opfere den Ältesten des Sakura-Stamms: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Er hatte eine sonnenbeschienene Lichtung mit offenem Himmel und einem plätschernden Bach gewählt. Jetzt musste er nur noch einen würdigen Setzling finden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f06aa50-6a5a-404d-994a-fd572034b396\', \'multiverseId\': 650536}, \'multiverseid\': 650536}, {\'name\': \'Ancêtre de la tribu Sakura\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez l\'Ancêtre de la tribu Sakura : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature — serpent et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Il avait choisi une clairière baignée par le soleil, à ciel ouvert et traversée par un généreux ruisseau. Il ne lui restait qu\'à trouver le bon arbrisseau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=650795&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80da7cec-770b-46ae-a688-4493cacc3df5\', \'multiverseId\': 650795}, \'multiverseid\': 650795}, {\'name\': \'Anziano della Tribù-Sakura\', \'text\': "Sacrifica l\'Anziano della Tribù-Sakura: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'Aveva scelto una radura baciata dal sole, con cielo terso e un fresco torrente. Non restava che trovare un germoglio degno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e9100f-76e7-484e-b233-2650009a1326\', \'multiverseId\': 651054}, \'multiverseid\': 651054}, {\'name\': \'桜族の長老\', \'text\': \'桜族の長老を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'彼は、潤沢な小川がそばを流れ、上には大空が広がる、陽当たりの良い開けた場所を選んだ。残るはふさわしい若木を見つけることであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=651313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ab07ea2-0ec9-4158-bad0-268a33ce33e4\', \'multiverseId\': 651313}, \'multiverseid\': 651313}]']
